  <para style="h">Edwɛndolɛ</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ayɛlɛyelɛ Edwɛne Ne Mɔ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Edwɛndolɛ</para>
  <para style="toc3">Edw.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ayɛlɛyelɛ Edwɛne Ne Mɔ</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PSA 1" />
  <para style="ms">Buluku Mɔɔ Lumua</para>
  <para style="mr">
    <ref loc="PSA 1-41">Edw. 1–41</ref></para>
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 1</para>
  <para style="s1">Ngoane baka ne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 1:1" />Nyilalɛ ɛha bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkpo kɛ bɛkɛva amumuyɛvoma folɛdulɛ; bɛkpo kɛ bɛ nee ɛtanevolɛma kɛdu; na eza bɛnva bɛ nwo bɛmbɔnlebɔnle bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛmbu Nana Nyamenle bie hweledede la anwo la. <verse eid="PSA 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 1:2" />Emomu, bɛlɛ anyelielɛ wɔ <char style="nd">Awulae</char> ye Mɛla ne mɔɔ bɛdi zo la anu; na alehyenlɛ nee aledwolɛ muala, bɛsie bɛ adwenle koonwu wɔ ye Mɛla ne anwo.<verse eid="PSA 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 1:3" />Bɛle kɛ mbaka mɔɔ fifi azundenle nloa, na bɛso ma kposekpose wɔ bɛ ɛlobɔ kpalɛ nu la. Bɛ nya ɛmkpolo ɛngua aze ɛlɛ. Bɛko bɛtɔ zo wɔ debie biala mɔɔ bɛyɛ la anu.<verse eid="PSA 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 1:4" />Noko akee ɔnle zɔ wɔ amumuyɛvoma afoa nu; bɛmɛ bɛle kɛ nyasoa mɔɔ ahumu ne bɔ bɛ gua la. <verse eid="PSA 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 1:5" />Ɛhye ati Nana Nyamenle babua ɛtanevolɛma ndɛne fɔlɛ; na bɛbaye amumuyɛvoma bɛavi Nana Nyamenle ɔdaye ye tenlenema ne avinli. <verse eid="PSA 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 1:6" />Ɔluakɛ Awulae wowa, na eza ɔsinza tenlenema; na atisesebɛvoma ɛdeɛ, bɛ ɛbɛlabɔlɛ twe bɛ kɔ munzule nu.<verse eid="PSA 1:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PSA 2" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 2</para>
  <para style="s1">Ngoanedievolɛ Belemgbunli ne Edwɛndolɛ ne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 2:1" />Duzu ati a maanle maanle fa akpame tia bɛ Arane a? Kɛmɔti a menli kɔ zo fa bɛ adwenlenzuzulɛ ɛtane ɛtane, mɔɔ nvasoɛ biala ɛnle zo la ɛ? <verse eid="PSA 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 2:2" />Aleɛabo arelemgbunli dwazo gyinla, na bɛ tumivolɛma fa adwenle ɛtane tia Nana Nyamenle, ɔ nee ɔdaye ye belemgbunli mɔɔ yeye ye la. <verse eid="PSA 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 2:3" />Bɛ amaneɛ a le kɛ: “Bɛmaa yɛlie yɛ nwo yɛvi bɛ maamulɛ bo; bɛmaa yɛye yɛ nwo yɛvi bɛ akɛlɛyɛlɛ ne abo.”<verse eid="PSA 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 2:4" />Na Awulae de ye belemgbunli ebia ne azo, wɔ anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anu ɔsele bɛ ala; na ɔsi bɛ amgbu wɔ bɛ adwenle ngyehyɛleɛ ɛtane ne mɔ anwo. <verse eid="PSA 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 2:5" />Akee ɔbɔ bɛ kɔkɔ ɛsesebɛ wɔ ɛyavalɛ nu; na ɔfa ɛzulolɛ totohyia ɔwula bɛ nu.<verse eid="PSA 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 2:6" />Ɔluakɛ Awulae mumua ne se: “Wɔ Zayɔn, me boka nwuanzanwuanza ne azo, yɛɛ mezie me Belemgbunli ne mɔɔ medame mumua ne meye ye la a.”<verse eid="PSA 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 2:7" />Akee belemgbunli ne noko ɛvua ɛha kɛ: “Mebala Nana Nyamenle ngyehyɛlɛ ne kpokpoti ali. Ɔluakɛ Awulae ɛze me kɛ: ‘Wɔmɔ a ɛle me Ra kotokokye ne a; ɛnɛ demua ye, meyɛ ɛ ze bɔkɔɔ. <verse eid="PSA 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 2:8" />Biza, na mebava maanle maanle kpokpoti meawula ɛ sa nu; na azɛlɛ ye kpokpoti bayɛ wɔ deɛ. <verse eid="PSA 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 2:9" />Ɛbazie bɛ kɛ ɛdawɔ ɛ kunlu mralɛ ala la; ɛbabubu bɛ dwɔkɔdwɔkɔ kɛ ɛbubu ɛyɛba ala la.’”<verse eid="PSA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 2:10" />Bɛyɛ ɛnzolɛ bɛdie kɔkɔbɔlɛ ɛhye, bɛmɛ aleɛabo arelemgbunli; bɛva ɛhye bɛyɛ ɛzukoalɛdeɛ, bɛmɛ ewiade tumivolɛma; <verse eid="PSA 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 2:11" />Bɛva ɛzulolɛ bɛzonle Nana Nyamenle. <verse eid="PSA 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 2:12" />Bɛmaa bɛ nwo ɛyɛ ndɛ, bɛva anwowozolɛ bɛrabɔ bɛ ti aze wɔ ɔ nyunlu; na anrɛɛ yemɔ ye ɛyavalɛ ne bayɛ kpole, na bɛ bo zo aminli bɔkɔɔ arɛlevilɛ nu ala. Nyilalɛ ɛha bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛfa bɛ rɛle bɛwula ye nu la; Awulae mumua ne bamaa bɛali fɛlɛko.<verse eid="PSA 2:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PSA 3" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 3</para>
  <para style="s1">Nana Nyamenle le Devidi ye Boavolɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 3:1" />Menli dɔɔnwo ne ala ko tia me, O Nana Nyamenle; dodo ne ala kakyi bɛ nzi si me! <verse eid="PSA 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 3:2" />Bɛkeha me nwo edwɛkɛ ɛtane ɛtane na bɛse kɛ, “Nana Nyamenle ɛnrɛhola ɛnrɛboa me.” <verse eid="PSA 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 3:3" />Noko akee O Nana Nyamenle, wɔmɔ a dahuu ɛsinza me ɛfi munzule nu a. Wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛmaa me konimlilɛ, na eza ɛmaa me akɛnrazilɛ a.<verse eid="PSA 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 3:4" />Mesu mefɛlɛ Nana Nyamenle kɛ ɔraboa me; na ɔtie me ɔfi ye boka nwuanzanwuanza Zayɔn azo. <verse eid="PSA 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 3:5" />Meto me nwo aze meda anzondwolɛ nu; na Nana Nyamenle sinza me aledwolɛ ne amuala. <verse eid="PSA 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 3:6" />Ɛhye ati saa kanzɛ bɔbɔ kpɔvolɛma apenle bulu bɔ me nwo mgbɔlɛka yia a, menzulo. <verse eid="PSA 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 3:7" />Bɛla ndɛndɛ, O Nana Nyamenle! Pepɛ die me, O me Nyamenle! Komo me kpɔvolɛma anwo zo bɔkɔbɔkɔ, na bubu atisesebɛvoma ne mɔ agye.<verse eid="PSA 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 3:8" />Ɔluakɛ konimlilɛ nee ngoanelielɛ vi Nana Nyamenle lɔ; yɛɛ eza ɔdaye a ɔmaa ye menli di fɛlɛko a.<verse eid="PSA 3:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PSA 4" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 4</para>
  <para style="s1">Aledwolɛ nu Edwɛndolɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 4:1" />O me pepɛdievolɛ, Nana Nyamenle, saa mebodo mesɛlɛ wɔ a tie me! Melɛ mɔɔ mengɔle ɛmianlɛ nu la, ɛboale me. Kile wɔ atiakunlukɛnlɛma ne wɔ me nwo zo, na tie me nzɛlɛlɛ.<verse eid="PSA 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 4:2" />Awulae Nyamenle ɛlɛbiza kɛ: Kenle nzu bɔbɔ yɛɛ bɛkɛwula me anyunlunyia, na bɛkɛgyakyi me nyunlu nyiane aze ɛguale a, O bɛmɛ aleɛabo amra? Kenle nzu yɛɛ bɛkɛgyakyi awozonle ɛzonlenlɛ mgbane mgbane ɛhye mɔ na bɛkɛli nɔhalɛ a?<verse eid="PSA 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 4:3" />Bɛnwu ye wienyi kɛ, Nana Nyamenle ɛkpa tenlenema ɛzie ɛkɛ ne ɛmaa ɔ nwo; ɔti ɔtie me wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ menwɔvɛlɛ ye la. <verse eid="PSA 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 4:4" />Bɛnyia Nyamezulolɛ wɔ bɛ nu, na bɛgyakyi ɛtaneyɛlɛ. Wɔ bɛ ɛyavalɛ mekɛ nu bɛla bɛ ɛsokpa zo koonwu, na bɛmaa bɛ ahonle ɛdɔ bɛ azule nu. <verse eid="PSA 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 4:5" />Bɛbɔ nɔhalɛ azu mɔɔ sɔ ɛnyelɛ la bɛmaa Nana Nyamenle; na bɛva bɛ rɛle bɛwula ye nu.<verse eid="PSA 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 4:6" />Dɔɔnwo ne ala sɛlɛ se kɛ: “Maa yɛ nyilalɛ dɔɔnwo, O Nana Nyamenle; fa atiakunlukpalɛyɛlɛ nea yɛ nwo zo!” <verse eid="PSA 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 4:7" />Nɔhalɛ nu, fɛlɛkolilɛ mɔɔ wɔva wɔmaa me la, le kpole tɛla anyelielɛ mɔɔ ɛyazonlɛnli nyia ye, wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɔkɛbu ye ɛya nu aleɛ la. <verse eid="PSA 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 4:8" />Mebala meala anzondwolɛ nu, O Nana Nyamenle; ɔluakɛ wɔmɔ Awulae ala a ɛmaa metɛnla anzondwolɛ nu a.<verse eid="PSA 4:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="PSA 5" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 5</para>
  <para style="s1">Nwonlomɔ Nzɛlɛlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 5:1" />Tie me nzɛlɛlɛ, O Nana Nyamenle; na yɛ ɛnzolɛ maa me modolɛ. <verse eid="PSA 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 5:2" />Tie me ɛzunlɛ, O me Nyamenle nee me Belemgbunli! Ɔluakɛ wɔmɔ ala yɛɛ mefa me nzɛlɛlɛ meto ɛ nyunlu a, O Nana Nyamenle. <verse eid="PSA 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 5:3" />Nwonlomɔ biala ɛte me ne, O Nana Nyamenle. Sɛnzɛne aduduleɛ biala mefa me nzɛlɛlɛ meto ɛ nyunlu, na meyɛ anwomoalɛ mekendɛ wɔ mualɛ.<verse eid="PSA 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 5:4" />Ɔboalekɛ wɔmɔ ɛnle Nyamenle mɔɔ ɛtaneyɛlɛ sɔ ɛ nye a; ɛmmaa amumuyɛ nyɛleɛ nwo adenle wɔ ɛ nyunlu. <verse eid="PSA 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 5:5" />Mgbavosɛmdivoma ɛngola ɛ nyunlu gyinla; ɔluakɛ wɔmɔ ɛkyi atisesebɛvoma kɔkɔkɔkɔ. <verse eid="PSA 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 5:6" />Ɛbɔ adalɛ nabalabama abo zo; ɛkyi mɛlɛbɛlavoma nee ahodiawu bɔkɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 5:7" />Na mame ɔlua wɔ ɛhulolɛ totohyia ne ati, mebahola meawolo wɔ aako ne anu. Mebahola meazonle wɔ wɔ Asɔne Sua Nwuanzanwuanza ne anu, na meabɔ me ti aze meamaa wɔ wɔ anwunvɔnezelɛ nu ala.<verse eid="PSA 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 5:8" />Di me nyunlu maa menyɛ wɔ ɛhulolɛdeɛ, O Nana Nyamenle; ɔlua me kpɔvolɛma dɔɔnwo ne ati, kile wɔ nɔhalɛ adenle ne maa menwu ye wienyi. <verse eid="PSA 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 5:9" />Nɔhalɛ kpɔkɛ ko bɔbɔ, ɛnle me kpɔvolɛma edwɛkɛhanlɛ biala anu; amumuyɛ ngome ɛyi bɛ ahonle ne mɔ tetɛkɛɛ. Bɛ nzuzulɛ kpokpoti le ɛtaneyɛlɛ nee ewule ngome; mɔɔ bɛka ye menlemenle, amaa bɛanyia bɛ ninyɛndane ne bɛayɛ la ala a bɛka a. <verse eid="PSA 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 5:10" />Sɛkye bɛ, O Nana Nyamenle; na maa bɛdabɛ bɛ munzule akpame mɔɔ bɛva la ɛbɔ bɛ ti zo. Ɔlua bɛ ɛtane dodo ne ati, foa bɛ fi ɛ nyunlu bɔkɔɔ; ɔluakɛ bɛhakyi bɛ nzi bɛzi wɔ.<verse eid="PSA 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 5:11" />Emomu maa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛfa bɛ rɛle bɛwula wɔ nu la anye ɛlie; maa dahuu bɛdo edwɛne bɛli fɛlɛko. Sinza bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛlɛ ɛ nwo ɛhulolɛ la; amaa ɔlua wɔ duma ti bɛanyia anyelielɛ dahuu. <verse eid="PSA 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 5:12" />Ɔluakɛ wɔmɔ ɛyila tenlenema, O Nana Nyamenle; na wɔ anwunvɔnezelɛ ne wowa bɛ kɛ konle nu sinzadeɛ la.<verse eid="PSA 5:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="PSA 6" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 6</para>
  <para style="s1">Anlubɛnwovo Nzɛlɛlɛ mɔɔ maa ɔnyia Ɛtanefakyɛ nee Anwozalɛ la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 6:1" />O Nana Nyamenle, mmafa ɛya na ɛtwi me nyunlu! Mmatwe me nzo wɔ wɔ ɛyavalɛ mekɛ nu! <verse eid="PSA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 6:2" />Nwu me anwunvɔne, O Nana Nyamenle, ɔluakɛ menlɛ anwosesebɛ biala. Yɛ me ayile, ɔluakɛ mende kpɔkɛ fee zɛ. <verse eid="PSA 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 6:3" />Me sonlabaka ne ɛlɛdi nyane somaa. Kenle nzu bieko a ɛkendɛ na wɔaraboa me a, O Nana Nyamenle?<verse eid="PSA 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 6:4" />Bɛla balie me ngoane, O Nana Nyamenle; dua wɔ anwunvɔnezelɛ ne azo, pepɛ die me fi ewule nu. <verse eid="PSA 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 6:5" />Ɔluakɛ saa mewu a, ɛnee nganvolɛ nee ayɛlɛyelɛ mɔɔ ɔwɔ kɛ mefa memaa wɔ, wɔ me gɔnwo mɔ anyunlu la ɛminli bɔkɔɔ. <verse eid="PSA 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 6:6" />Meli nyane mevɛ; nɔɔzo biala monle doa me esumi tɔfɔɔ zɛhae. Me ɛzunlɛ maa me ɛsokpa yɛ dɔdɔdɔdɔ. <verse eid="PSA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 6:7" />Me nye ɛyɛ monzomonzo wɔ nyanelilɛ nu; me anwubɛnyunlu ɛmaa me nye ɛbɔ me nwo tɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 6:8" />Bɛvi me nwo ɛke bɛhɔ nehane, bɛmɛ atiakunlutanevolɛma! Ɔluakɛ Nana Nyamenle ɛde me ɛzunlɛ. <verse eid="PSA 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 6:9" />Yede me ɛzunlɛ ne mɔɔ menzunle menvɛlɛle moalɛ la; me nzɛlɛlɛ ne ɛdwu Nana Nyamenle anyunlu. <verse eid="PSA 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 6:10" />Maa anyiemgba ɛha me kpɔvolɛma; kakyi bɛ adwenle, na maa bɛ nyunlu nyiane ɛgua aze arɛlevilɛ nu ala.<verse eid="PSA 6:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="PSA 7" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 7</para>
  <para style="s1">Nzɛlɛlɛ mɔɔ bɛfa bɛsɛlɛ Pepɛlilɛ la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 7:1" />O Awulae, me Nyamenle, wɔmɔ a ɛle me sinzavolɛ a; pepɛ die me, na die me ngoane fi bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛpepɛ me gyakɛ anzi la asa anu. <verse eid="PSA 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 7:2" />Mmamaa metɔ agye, na bɛanwulu bɛandɔ me kɔme zo kɛ awenade, bɛandwenle me aze bɛantete me nu nzokɛnzonka. <verse eid="PSA 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 7:3" />O Awulae, me Nyamenle, saa mevo awie, saa meye agɔnwolɛ bie memaa, anzɛɛ <verse eid="PSA 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 7:4" />meva ɛtane medua awie kpalɛ mɔɔ yeyɛ la kakɛ a, <verse eid="PSA 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 7:5" />yemɔ maa me kpɔvolɛma ɛkpo me gyakɛ abo zo na bɛhye me. Maa bɛtietia me nwo zo bɛhu me kpatalakpa bɛdo me lɔ, mɔɔ mendwazo bieko a.<verse eid="PSA 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 7:6" />Dwazo wɔ wɔ ɛyavalɛ nu, O Nana Nyamenle! Kɛha ɛ nwo na kotia me kpɔvolɛma bɛ ɛyavalɛ ne. Bɔzɔ ɛ nwo na baboa me, O me Nyamenle! Ɔluakɛ wɔmɔ ɛkulo kɛ pɛpɛlilɛ kɛyɛ ye gyima. <verse eid="PSA 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 7:7" />Maa aleɛabo amra kpokpoti ɛhuohua bɛ nloa wɔ ɛ nyunlu; na akee tɛnla wɔ tumililɛ ebia ne azo bua bɛ ndɛne. <verse eid="PSA 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 7:8" />Wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛle ewiade kpokpoti ndɛnebuavolɛ a. Nea me tenleneyɛlɛ nwo na bua me ndɛne, O Nana Nyamenle; ɔluakɛ ɛdawɔ mumua ne ɛze kɛ menze nwolɛ bie. <verse eid="PSA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 7:9" />Maa amumuyɛvoma bɛ atisesebɛyɛlɛ kpokpoti ɛrɛla awieleɛ; na yila bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛfa bɛ adwenle nee bɛ ahonle muala bɛsonle wɔmɔ tenlene Nyamenle ne la.<verse eid="PSA 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 7:10" />Nana Nyamenle a le me sinzavolɛ a; yemɔ yɛɛ ɔdie bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛ ahonle nu te la ngoane a.<verse eid="PSA 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 7:11" />Nana Nyamenle le tenlene ndɛnebuavolɛ; ɔle Nyamenle mɔɔ dahuu ɔbua amumuyɛvoma ndɛne wɔ ye ɛyavalɛ nu a. <verse eid="PSA 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 7:12" />Saa bɛangakyi bɛ sa anloa a, Nana Nyamenle bazi ye adabɛlaka ne. Yeva ye atwɛ ne na yeyɛ anwomoalɛ. <verse eid="PSA 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 7:13" />Yeva ye konlendeɛ ɛzulolɛ ɛzulolɛ ne mɔ, na yezua ye ɛda mbaka ne mɔ noko yewie.<verse eid="PSA 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 7:14" />Atiakunlutanevolɛma dwenle adwenle ɛtane; ɛtaneyelɛ nee adalɛbɔlɛ ɛyi bɛ tɛkɛɛ. <verse eid="PSA 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 7:15" />Bɛpɛ ahuma na bɛbobɔ adoba bɛgua nu; noko akee bɛdabɛ mumua ne a bɛtɔ bɛ ngane ne mɔ anu a. <verse eid="PSA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 7:16" />Bɛ munzudeɛ ne bɔ bɛdabɛ bɛ ti mgbandanlama ne mɔ azo; na mɔɔ bɛsuzu bɛmaa bɛ gɔnwo mɔ la kakyi ba bɛdabɛ bɛ nwo zo.<verse eid="PSA 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 7:17" />Mebava moyɛlɛ mɔɔ fɛta Nana Nyamenle tenleneyɛlɛ ne la meamaa ye; mebado ayɛlɛyelɛ edwɛne meamaa Awulae mɔɔ wɔ anwuma anwuma la.<verse eid="PSA 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="PSA 8" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 8</para>
  <para style="s1">Nana Nyamenle ye Anyunlunyia nee ye Abɔndeɛ nwo Kpoleyɛlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 8:1" />O Awulae, yɛ Nyamenle, wɔ tumi nee wɔ anyunlunyia kpokpoti da ali wienyi wɔ ewiade amuala! Wɔ nganvolɛ noko dwu anwuma anwuma. <verse eid="PSA 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 8:2" />Wɔhile ngakula ngyikyi ngyikyi ne mɔ kɛ bɛzi bɛdo wɔ nganvolɛ edwɛne ne la: Maa ɛhye bɔbɔ mɔɔ wɔyɛ la ɛha wɔ kpɔvolɛma aze. Komo bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛtendɛ bɛtia wɔ la anwo zo, na maa bɛ nyunlu nyiane ɛgua aze.<verse eid="PSA 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 8:3" />Saa menea anwomanyunlu, mɔɔ le ɛ sa anloa gyima, ɔ nee amungu nee nwɔlɛra ne mɔ mɔɔ wɔziezie bɛ la a, <verse eid="PSA 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 8:4" />ɛnee duzu bɔbɔ a le sonla, mɔɔ ɔwɔ kɛ ɛdwenle ɔ nwo a; sonla ala, mɔɔ ɔwɔ kɛ ɛnea ɔ nwo zo a? <verse eid="PSA 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 8:5" />Noko akee wɔkpogya ye zo ekyi bie ala wɔ anwumabɔvolɛma ne mɔ abo; na wɔdɔ alagye ala wɔhyehyɛ anyunlunyia kyɛlɛ wɔzoa ye, na wɔva enililɛ ngome wɔbɔ ye abotile.<verse eid="PSA 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 8:6" />Wɔva wɔ abɔdeɛ kpokpoti wɔwula ɔ sa; na wɔmaa ye tumi wɔ debie biala anwo zo; <verse eid="PSA 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 8:7" />mboane nee nlankɛ, ɔ nee ɛbɔ nu nane nane mɔ noko; <verse eid="PSA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 8:8" />nloma ne mɔ nee fɛlɛ, ɔ nee ninyɛne mɔɔ wɔ nyevile kunlu la amuala. <verse eid="PSA 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 8:9" />O Awulae, yɛ Nyamenle, wɔ tumi nee wɔ anyunlunyia kpokpoti da ali wienyi wɔ ewiade amuala!<verse eid="PSA 8:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="PSA 9" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 9</para>
  <para style="s1">Nana Nyamenle, Pepɛdievolɛ Kpole ne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 9:1" />Mebayeye me ahonle nu kpokpoti meahanvo wɔ, O Nana Nyamenle; mebabɔ nwanwanendeɛ mɔɔ wɔyɛ la kpokpoti anwo nolo meahile aleɛabo amra. <verse eid="PSA 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 9:2" />Mebava fɛlɛkolilɛ meado edwɛne meamaa wɔ duma, O Anwuma Nyamenle Bedevinli.<verse eid="PSA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 9:3" />Saa ɛye ɛ nyunlu a, me kpɔvolɛma tete gua; bɛpepɛ bɛfi na bɛwuwu. <verse eid="PSA 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 9:4" />Ɔluakɛ wɔmɔ ɛle fɔɔnwo, na ɛdi nɔhalɛ wɔ wɔ ndɛnebualɛ nu. Wɔdɛnla wɔ Belemgbunli ebia ne azo wɔli me gyima nwo daselɛ kɛ ɔle nɔhalɛ. <verse eid="PSA 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 9:5" />Wɔhwi awozosonvolɛma anyunlu, na wɔzɛkye amumuyɛvoma bɔkɔɔ. Wɔnunu bɛ anluma wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ; awie biala ɛnrɛhakye bɛ bieko ɛlɛ. <verse eid="PSA 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 9:6" />Yɛ kpɔvolɛma abo zo ɛminli minlimɛnla; wɔmaa bɛ azuamgbole ne mɔ ɛdɔ nzonle; na yɛ rɛle ɛvi bɛ bɔkɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 9:7" />Noko akee Nana Nyamenle di belemgbunli dahuu; na yeyɛ anwomoalɛ yemaa ndɛnebualɛ. <verse eid="PSA 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 9:8" />Ɔfa tenleneyɛlɛ adenle zo ɔsie ewiade ye; ɔfa pɛpɛlilɛ ɔbua maanle maanle ndɛne. <verse eid="PSA 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 9:9" />Nana Nyamenle le feabelɛ maa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛsisi bɛ la, feabelɛ kpalɛ wɔ ɛmianlɛ mekɛ nu. <verse eid="PSA 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 9:10" />Bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛze wɔ anwunvɔnezelɛ ne la, fa bɛ rɛle wula wɔ nu, O Nana Nyamenle; ɔluakɛ wɔmɔ ɛngyakyi awie biala mɔɔ kisa wɔ la adevinli.<verse eid="PSA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 9:11" />Bɛdo ayɛlɛyelɛ edwɛne bɛmaa Nana Nyamenle mɔɔ di belemgbunli wɔ Zayɔn bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛdi nyane la dahuu; ɔmmaa ɔ rɛle ɛnvi bɛ ɛzunlɛ. <verse eid="PSA 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 9:12" />Nana Nyamenle kakye bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛdi nyane la dahuu; ɔmmaa ɔ rɛle ɛnvi bɛ ɛzunlɛ. Na emomu ɔtwe bɛdabɛ mɔɔ gyegye menli ɛhye mɔ la anzo.<verse eid="PSA 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 9:13" />Se me anwunvɔne, O Nana Nyamenle! Ɛdawɔ nea amaneɛ mɔɔ menwu ye wɔ me kpɔvolɛma asa anu a! Pepɛ die me fi ewule gye nu, O Awulae, <verse eid="PSA 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 9:14" />amaa meahola meagyinla Gyɛlusalɛm amra anyunlu; na meaha ninyɛne mɔɔ wɔyɛ mɔɔ ɔlua zo a mekanvo wɔ la amuala meahile bɛ. Mebali fɛlɛko, ɔboalekɛ wɔlie me ngoane. Mebaye wɔ ayɛlɛ, O Awulae.<verse eid="PSA 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 9:15" />Maanle maanle ne mɔ ɛfolo kuma mɔɔ bɛdabɛ bɛpɛ la anu; bɛ sa anloa ɛhane ɛhye bɛdabɛ mumua ne. <verse eid="PSA 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 9:16" />Nana Nyamenle ɛlua ye tenlene ndɛnebualɛ zo ɛla ɔ nwo ali; na atiakunlutanevolɛma bɛ munzule ɛbɔ bɛ ti zo gɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 9:17" />Ewule a le amumuyɛvoma bɛ ɛkɛlade a, ɔ nee bɛdabɛ kpokpoti mɔɔ bɛkpo Nana Nyamenle la. <verse eid="PSA 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 9:18" />Tɛ kenle ne amuala yɛɛ bɛbakpo ehyiavolɛma a; yɛɛ bɛnrɛye koahweabanema noko bɛ rɛle bɛnrɛdo bɛ sa nu ɛlɛ.<verse eid="PSA 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 9:19" />Maa ɛ nwo ɛyɛ ndɛ bɛla, O Nana Nyamenle! Mmamaa menli adenle ɛmaa bɛbu wɔ mɛla zo. Mmamaa bɛfo ɛ kɔme zo! Bua maanle maanle kpokpoti ndɛne, na twe bɛ nzo kɛmɔ ɔfɛta la. <verse eid="PSA 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 9:20" />Maa ɛzulolɛ ɛha bɛ, O Nana Nyamenle! Bɛlɛ bɛ aze maa bɛnwu ye kɛ, amuanrɛɛ bɛle ewule ngɛkɛlɛ; bɛnlɛ tumi anzɛɛ anwosesebɛ biala wɔ ɛ nyunlu!<verse eid="PSA 9:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="PSA 10" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 10</para>
  <para style="s1">Awulae ne mɔɔ bua ɛtanevolɛma ndɛne la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 10:1" />Duzu ati a wɔde ɛ nwo wɔhɔ moamoa ɛ, O Nana Nyamenle? Duzu ati a ɛfea ɛ nwo wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ yɛwɔ ɛmianlɛ nu la ɛ?<verse eid="PSA 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 10:2" />Amumuyɛvoma anye sɔ bɛ nwo, na bɛteetee ehyiavolɛma; maa ngane mɔɔ bɛzuozua la ɛhye bɛdabɛ mumua ne. <verse eid="PSA 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 10:3" />Ɔluakɛ amumuyɛvonli di fɛlɛko wɔ ye ninyɛndane nwo; adidikpokuvo kpo Nana Nyamenle, na ɔfa Ye duma ɔka ndane mgbane mgbane.<verse eid="PSA 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 10:4" />Atisesebɛvolɛ ɛnva Awulae ɛnyɛ ɛhwee; ɔdwenle wɔ ye nu dahuu kɛ, “Nyamenle biala ɛnle ɛkɛ.” <verse eid="PSA 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 10:5" />Atiakunlutanevolɛ ko tɔ zo wɔ debie biala anu; ɔngola ɔnde Nana Nyamenle ndɛnebualɛ ne abo ɛlɛ; ye kpɔvolɛma ɛdeɛ, dahuu ɔsi bɛ amgbu. <verse eid="PSA 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 10:6" />Wɔ ye ninyɛndaneyɛlɛ nu ɔse ɔ nwo kɛ: “Debie biala ɛnrɛkputi me ahonle ɛlɛ; wɔ ɛbɛlabɔlɛ nu, menrɛhɔ ɛfonlanlɛ nu kenlebie.”<verse eid="PSA 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 10:7" />Ɔ nloa edwɛkɛ le amowalɛ, adalɛ ɔ nee ɛnwunlonwunlanlɛ ngome; dahuu ɔtendɛ ɛkpɔlɛ nee atisesebɛ nu ala. <verse eid="PSA 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 10:8" />Ɔdi bu-sa wɔ sua zo awozileka ne mɔ; na ɔyɛ anwomoalɛ kɛ ɔkɛhu bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛnze nwole bie na bɛpɛ nu la, na ɔnea bɛ tɔbelɛ. <verse eid="PSA 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 10:9" />Ɔdie ebia wɔ ye fealeka kɛ awenade la, na ɔsiezie ɔ nwo ɔkendɛ ehyiavolɛma. Ɔsua bɛ ngane ɔkye bɛ na ɔtwenle bɛ aze. <verse eid="PSA 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 10:10" />Ɛdawɔ mɔɔ ɛ nwo anyɛ moavolɛ, mɔɔ ɛkɛdɔ ye ɛhane ne anu la, ɛnee wɔ gyakɔ; ɔluakɛ ɔ nwo yɛ se tɛla awie biala. <verse eid="PSA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 10:11" />Atiakunlutanevolɛ dwenle wɔ ye ahonle nu kɛ: “Debie biala ɛnvale Nana Nyamenle anwo! Yemuomua ɔ nye amu nwiɔ, ɔti ɔnrɛnwu me ɛlɛ kenlebie maanle nu!”<verse eid="PSA 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 10:12" />Dwazo, O Awulae; bɛlɛ amumuyɛvoma ɛhye mɔ aze! O Nana Nyamenle, maa ɛ sa ɛnlomboɛ ne zo, na kakye bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛlɛdi nyane la! <verse eid="PSA 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 10:13" />Duzu ati a amumuyɛvonli kola kpo Nyamenle bɔkɔɔ, na ɔsi ye ɛbolɛ ɔka kɛ: “Ɔnrɛhola ɔnrɛdea me” ɛ? <verse eid="PSA 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 10:14" />O Awulae, ɛdawɔ ɛ nye dua ɛhye; ɛdawɔ ɛze nyane nee amaneɛ mɔɔ bɛtwe bɛba la amuala. Na dahuu noko ɛyɛ anwomoalɛ kɛ ɛkɛboa. Wɔmɔ ala yɛɛ ehyiavolɛma anye la ɛ nwo zo a. Wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛboa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛnlɛ boavolɛ biala la a. <verse eid="PSA 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 10:15" />Bubu amumuyɛvoma ɔ nee atiakunlutanevolɛma asa gua; tea bɛ wɔ bɛ ninyɛmunli mɔɔ bɛyɛ la anwo, kɔkpula kɛ bɛnrɛyɛ zɔ bieko a.<verse eid="PSA 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 10:16" />Nana Nyamenle di belemgbunli wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ; bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛsonle awozonle gyɛne la amuala, bɛbaye bɛ bɛavi azɛlɛ ye azo. <verse eid="PSA 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 10:17" />O Nana Nyamenle, tie bɛlɛvoma nzɛlɛlɛ; maa bɛ akɛnrazilɛ ɛgyinla ye kpundii. Gua ɛ nzo aze, <verse eid="PSA 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 10:18" />na tie bɛdabɛ mɔɔ menli sisi bɛ, ɔ nee nrisa bɛ ɛzunlɛ. Bua ndɛne kɔ bɛ afoa, amaa sonla dasanli mɔɔ le ɛva nee nzonle la angola anwunlonwunla bɛ bieko.<verse eid="PSA 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="PSA 11" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 11</para>
  <para style="s1">Awulae, yɛ Sinzavolɛ Nɔhavo ne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 11:1" />Nana Nyamenle a menriandi mekɔfea ye nu a; kɛ ɔyɛ mɔɔ akee ɛse me kɛ, “Tu kɛ anloma la kɔ awoka ne mɔ azo ɛ?<verse eid="PSA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 11:2" />“Ɔle nɔhalɛ, kɛ amumuyɛvoma ɛzua bɛ ɛda mbaka ne mɔ ɛwie, na bɛzi bɛ atwɛ ne mɔ dɛbadɛba. Bɛyɛ anwomoalɛ kɛ bɛbado bɛabɔ tenlenema wɔ awozinli nu. <verse eid="PSA 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 11:3" />Na saa bɛsɛkye bolɛ ne mɔɔ bɛwula ye aze la a, ɛnee akee duzu bɔbɔ, yɛɛ mɔɔ ahonle nu te la yemɔ ɔkɛyɛ a?”<verse eid="PSA 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 11:4" />Nana Nyamenle de ye Asɔne Sua Nwuanzanwuanza ne anu; ye belemgbunli ebia ne wɔ anwuma maanle ne anu. Ɔ nye dua mɔɔ kɔ zolɛ wɔ aleɛabo amuala la; ɔpɛ ɔ nye hɛlɛdɛdɛ ɔsɔ dasanli ɔnea. <verse eid="PSA 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 11:5" />Nana Nyamenle sɔ tenlenema ɔ nee amumuyɛvoma nea, na ye ɛkɛla kyi mɔɔ di ɛtane da la kɔkɔkɔkɔ. <verse eid="PSA 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 11:6" />Ɔbadɔ ɛsɛlɛmanye yeagua atiakunlutanevolɛma anwo zo; na yeava anwoma mɔɔ senle wɔ nu la yeayela bɛ dwɛɛ zɛhae.<verse eid="PSA 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 11:7" />Ɔluakɛ Nana Nyamenle le tenlene, ɔti noko ɔkulo tenlene ɛbɛlabɔlɛ; zɔhane ati ɔda ɔ nwo ali ɔkile nɔhalɛdivoma wɔ anwunvɔnezelɛ nee fɛlɛkolilɛ nu ala.<verse eid="PSA 11:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="PSA 12" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 12</para>
  <para style="s1">Tenlenema mɔɔ bɛ ngoane wɔ ɛtanevolɛma anu la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 12:1" />Maa ɛ nwo ɛyɛ ndɛ fa moale bɛla, O Nana Nyamenle, ɔluakɛ Nyamezulolɛma ɛwie. Nɔhalɛdivoma ɛminli minlimɛnla; bɛminli wɔ menli nu bɔkɔɔ. <verse eid="PSA 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 12:2" />Sonla holɛ ko biala bɔ adalɛ kile ɔ gɔnwo; bɛ ahonle ɛyɛ nwiɔ, na bɛ nloa edwɛkɛ le menlemenle ngome.<verse eid="PSA 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 12:3" />Nana Nyamenle noko ɛnrɛmaa menli mɔɔ yɛ ɛhye mɔ la ɛnrɛva bɛ nwo dwɔɔ; ɔbazɛkye ɛtafinlimalɛ ɛhye mɔ mɔɔ anye ɛnzɔ ɛhwee, <verse eid="PSA 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 12:4" />na bɛse kɛ: “Yɛbabɔ adalɛ biala mɔɔ yɛ kunlu dwo nwolɛ la; yɛ nloa mbabonle ne mɔ le yɛ deɛ; na nwane bɔbɔ a le yɛ menle a?” <verse eid="PSA 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 12:5" />Kɛ Nana Nyamenle se la ɛne: “Kɛmɔ bɛsisi ehyiavolɛma, kɛmɔ bɛmaa koahweabanema di nyane la ati, akee mebadwazo meaheha me nwo. Mebapepɛ mealie bɛ, kɛmɔ bɛ nye la kɛ menwɔyɛ la.” <verse eid="PSA 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 12:6" />Nana Nyamenle ɛwɔkɛ biala mɔɔ ɔbɔ la anwo te; yɛ edwɛkɛ nwo te saanwu kɛ dwɛtɛ fufule mɔɔ bɛholo ye senle zo fane nsuu la. <verse eid="PSA 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 12:7" />Ɛdawɔ mumua ne sinza yɛ, O Nana Nyamenle; bɔ ye nwo bane fi ɛtanevolɛma ɛlɔnwɔne ɛhye asa anu. <verse eid="PSA 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 12:8" />Ɔluakɛ saa kanzɛ bɛbɔ ye nwo mgbɔlɛka bɛyia bɔbɔ a, saa ɛye yɛ ɛfi munzuvoma ɛhye mɔ asa anu.<verse eid="PSA 12:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="PSA 13" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 13</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛkɛla ne mɔɔ ɛnlɛ anyelazo biala la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 13:1" />O Nana Nyamenle, ɛmaa ɛ rɛle avi me ahɔkpula kenle nzu? Anzɛɛ ɛnrɛhakye me bieko ɔ? Ɛbaye ɛ nyunlu wɔavea me kɔkpula kenle nzu? <verse eid="PSA 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 13:2" />Menli nyane wɔ me ahonle nu mengɔndwu kenle nzu? Fane nyɛ yɛɛ me kpɔvolɛma bahomo me nwo zo a? <verse eid="PSA 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 13:3" />Nea ɛhye na bua me, O me Awulae Nyamenle; maa wienyi ɛli me nyunlu wɔ awozinli ɛhye anu, yemɔ anrɛɛ mebawu. <verse eid="PSA 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 13:4" />Mmamaa me kpɔvolɛma se kɛ, “Ɛhɛe, yevo ɔ kɔme zo.” Anrɛɛ yemɔ bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkyi me la bali fɛlɛko wɔ me azedɔlɛ nwo.<verse eid="PSA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 13:5" />Na mame mɔ, dahuu mefa me rɛle mewula wɔ ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne anu; me ahonle bali fɛlɛko wɔ wɔ ngoanelielɛ ne anu dahuu. <verse eid="PSA 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 13:6" />Mebado edwɛne meaye Nana Nyamenle ayɛlɛ, ɔluakɛ yeyila me totohyia ne ala.<verse eid="PSA 13:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="PSA 14" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 14</para>
  <para style="s1">Ewiade Anyiabɛnwo molozo ne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 14:1" />Koasea se ɔ nwo kɛ, “Nyamenle biala ɛnle ɛkɛ.” Anyebolo ngome ɛhu bɛ kuu, ninyɛndane ala a bɛyɛ a; nuhua kokye bɔbɔ ɛnle ɛkɛ mɔɔ yemɔ ɔdi boɛ a.<verse eid="PSA 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 14:2" />Awulae wɔ anwuma maanle nu lɔ ɔ nye wɔ aleɛabo amra anwo zo; ɔlɛnea kɛ ɔkɛnwu kɛ nrɛlɛbɛvolɛ bie wɔ bɛ nu, mɔɔ ɔbayɛ Nana Nyamenle ye ɛhulolɛdeɛ a. <verse eid="PSA 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 14:3" />Noko akee bɛ muala bɛvo adenle ne, bɛ muala bɛkpɔlɔ bitaa zɛhae ala. Nuhua kokye bɔbɔ ɛnle ɛkɛ mɔɔ yemɔ ɔdi boɛ a. Kyɛkyɛ, kokye bɔbɔ ɛnle ɛkɛ. <verse eid="PSA 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 14:4" />Asoo amumuyɛvoma kpokpoti, mɔɔ di me nwonane kɛ asɛɛ bɛdi aleɛ, na bɛnzu bɛnvɛlɛ Nana Nyamenle la ɛnze deɛ ɔ?<verse eid="PSA 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 14:5" />Ɛzulolɛ kpole bamundu bɛ; ɔluakɛ Nana Nyamenle wɔ tenlenema afoa. <verse eid="PSA 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 14:6" />Ɛbahola wɔazɛkye ehyiavolɛma nee bɛlɛvoma ngyehyɛleɛ biala; noko akee Nana Nyamenle a le bɛ nriandifeabelɛ a. <verse eid="PSA 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 14:7" />O kɛkala angome a, anrɛɛ kpɔnevolɛ Awulae Nyamenle vi Zayɔn azo ɛra, kɛ ɔba yearalie Yizilayɛ! Saa Awulae sia fa ye menli agyapandeɛ maa bɛ a, Gyekɔbo bali fɛlɛko, Yizilayɛ anye balie.<verse eid="PSA 14:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="PSA 15" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 15</para>
  <para style="s1">Diedivoma Subane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 15:1" />O Nana Nyamenle, nwane a banriandi aravea wɔ belandane kɛnlɛma ne abo a? Nwane a badɛnla wɔ boka nwuanzanwuanza ne azo a?<verse eid="PSA 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 15:2" />Ahenle ne mɔɔ bɔ ɛbɛla mɔɔ anwo te bɔkɔɔ, na ɔdi nɔhalɛ wɔ ye ahonle nu, na ɔnze nwolɛ bie; <verse eid="PSA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 15:3" />awie mɔɔ ɛngeha edwɛkɛ mgbane mgbane, na ɔnyɛ ɔ gɔnwo mɔ ɛtane; anzɛɛ ɔngolo awie mɔ anwo; <verse eid="PSA 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 15:4" />awie mɔɔ tendɛ bagua nu, ɔtia ɛtaneyɛlɛ, na emomu ɔkanvo diedima mɔɔ doa Nana Nyamenle abo zo; awie mɔɔ di amonle na ɔngakyi ɔ nloa, na ɔdi nɔhalɛ ɔkɔ ewule nu bɔbɔ; <verse eid="PSA 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 15:5" />ahenle ne mɔɔ ɛnva mpaefoa mgbole ɛngugua ezukoa mɔɔ ɔfa ɔbɔ menli bosea la azo ɔmmaa bɛ nwo ɛngyele bɛ, na eza ɔnlie ndoloboa, ɔnli desewia ɔntia awie mɔɔ ɛnze nwolɛ bie, sonla mɔɔ yɛ ninyɛne ɛhye mɔ la, yɛɛ bagyinla ye kpundii wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ la a.<verse eid="PSA 15:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="PSA 16" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 16</para>
  <para style="s1">Ewudwazo ne: Ngoanelielɛ Edwɛndolɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 16:1" />Fa me sie kpalɛ, O Nana Nyamenle, ɔluakɛ wɔ wɔ nu yɛɛ menriandi mebafea a. <verse eid="PSA 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 16:2" />Mese Nana Nyamenle kɛ, “Wɔmɔ a le me Awulae a; menlɛ boavolɛ biala kɛ ɛ ngomekye.” <verse eid="PSA 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 16:3" />Anwodelɛma mɔɔ wɔ azɛlɛ ye azo la yɛɛ me nee bɛ badu a; ɔluakɛ bɛmɛ a bɛdi munli nɔhalɛ nu a. <verse eid="PSA 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 16:4" />Bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛsonle awozonle gyɛne gyɛne la dahuu di nyane molozo; menrɛbɔ bɛ mogya azu ne bie ɛlɛ; yɛɛ menrɛbɔ bɛ awozonle ne mɔ anluma mgbane bɔbɔ.<verse eid="PSA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 16:5" />Nana Nyamenle mumua ne le me agyapadeɛ, ɔle me ahyɛlɛdeɛ; ɔle me aleɛ, ɔle me nzule; ɔle me debie biala. Ɔsinza debie biala mɔɔ le me deɛ la. <verse eid="PSA 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 16:6" />Nyilalɛ ɛdɔ ɛgua me nwo zo ɛmaa menyia tɛnlabelɛ kpalɛ; amgba, menyia agyapadeɛ kpalɛ bɔkɔɔ. <verse eid="PSA 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 16:7" />Meye Nana Nyamenle ne mɔɔ tu me folɛ kpalɛ la ayɛlɛ; nɔɔzo biala ɔkile me nrɛlɛbɛ, na eza ɔkile me deɛ mɔɔ ɔwɔ kɛ meyɛ la.<verse eid="PSA 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 16:8" />Dahuu metwe Nana Nyamenle mebikye me nwo; kɛmɔ ɔde me sa fema zo la ati, debie biala ɛnrɛkputi me ahonle ɛlɛ. <verse eid="PSA 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 16:9" />Ɛhye ati fɛlɛko ngome ɛyi me ahonle, me ɛkɛla noko anye die dahuu; me sonlabaka ne noko gyi ye kpundii.<verse eid="PSA 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 16:10" />Ɔluakɛ ɛnye me ɛnwula Ɛbolɔ asa anu, anzɛɛ kɛ ɛkɛmaa wɔ diedinli ko ne kɛnwu Kuma kulongolo ne. <verse eid="PSA 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 16:11" />Ɛkile me ngoane adenle ne. Wɔmɔ, Ɛ nyunlu a anyelielɛ molozo wɔ a; Ɛ sa fema zo a damɛnlangoate anyelielɛ wɔ a.<verse eid="PSA 16:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="PSA 17" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 17</para>
  <para style="s1">Devidi wɔ Nana Nyamenle andɛba alubo ne abo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 17:1" />Mesɛlɛ wɔ moalɛ, O Awulae; ɔluakɛ medi nɔhalɛ memaa wɔ. Yɛ ɛnzolɛ tie me nzɛlɛlɛ, ɔluakɛ meyɛ mɔɔ sɔ ɛ nye a. <verse eid="PSA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 17:2" />Ye me fi bagua nu ɛtaneyɛlɛ nu; maa ɛ nye ɛrɛla kpalɛ ne mɔɔ meyɛ ye dahuu la azo. <verse eid="PSA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 17:3" />Saa ɛsɔ me ahonle ɛnea, saa ɛbakpɔla me nɔɔzo alevinli-mu-nwiɔ avinli, anzɛɛ saa ɛto me agyiba biala a, ɛnrɛnwu ɛtane biala wɔ me nwo; ɛdawɔ mumua ne ɛze kɛ medi nɔhalɛ. <verse eid="PSA 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 17:4" />Mɔɔ fale dasanli asa anloa gyima gyima nwo, meli wɔ mɛla ne mɔ azo; na mekpo kɛ me nee amumuyɛvoma kɛdu. <verse eid="PSA 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 17:5" />Dahuu mefa wɔ ndenle ne mɔ mɔɔ wɔhile me la azo; me gyakɛ ɛtɛkoatile nuhua ko bɔbɔ.<verse eid="PSA 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 17:6" />Wɔmɔ yɛɛ mesu mefɛlɛ wɔ a, O Nana Nyamenle; ɔluakɛ meze ye wienyi kɛ ɛbadie me; yɛ ɛnzolɛ maa me, na tie me modolɛ. <verse eid="PSA 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 17:7" />Kile wɔ ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne wɔ nwanwane nu ala, O Awulae; ɛle ngoanedievolɛ ɛmaa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛhyia wɔ moalɛ wɔ kpɔvolɛma asa anu la. <verse eid="PSA 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 17:8" />Sinza me kɛmɔ ɛsinza ɛ nye ma ne mɔ la; na fa me fea ɛ ndɛba bedevinli ne abo.<verse eid="PSA 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 17:9" />Bɔ me nwo bane fi amumuyɛvoma asa anu; ye me fi me agbɔvolɛ kodiawuma mɔɔ bɛbɔ me nwo mgbɔlɛka bɛyia la asa anu. <verse eid="PSA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 17:10" />Anwunvɔnezelɛ biala ɛnle bɛ ahonle nu; bɛmemaa bɛ nwo zo na bɛka mgbole. <verse eid="PSA 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 17:11" />Bɛbɔ me nwo mgbɔlɛka bɛyia; bɛyɛ anwomoalɛ kɛ bɛkɛzuhu me bɛkɛdo me aze; bɛdu bɛ nye bɛzie me nwo kɛ bɛku me. <verse eid="PSA 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 17:12" />Bɛzia kpɔɔnwo kɛ awenade mɔɔ ɛnwu nane na ɔkado yeahye ye la pɛ; bɛnyia me a anrɛɛ bɛtete me nu nzokɛnzoka zɛhae ala.<verse eid="PSA 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 17:13" />Dwazo, O Nana Nyamenle! Ko me ti maa me ɛ. Tu bɛ adwenle ngyehyɛleɛ ɛtane ne mɔ gua! Fa wɔ adabɛlaka ne die me ngoane fi amumuyɛvoma ɛhye mɔ asa anu. <verse eid="PSA 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 17:14" />Menli mɔɔ wɔmɔ wɔwula bɛ anwosesebɛ, O Nana Nyamenle, mɔɔ bɛmɛ ewiade anyiabɛnwo ala a bɛdwenle nwolɛ la. Maa ninyɛne mɔɔ ɛdawɔ wɔhyehyɛ wɔmaa bɛ la ɛyi bɛ ko ɛbulu zolɛ; maa bɛ mra nee bɛ nlɔnra ɛnyia agyapadeɛ dɔɔnwo ɛdɛla mɔɔ bɛkpondɛ la; maa bɛhakye na bɛgyakyi bie bɛ nzi bɛmaa bɛ mra ngyikyi.<verse eid="PSA 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 17:15" />Na mame ɛdeɛ, mebanwu ɛ nyunlu wɔ tenleneyɛlɛ nu; saa mevi nla nu medwazo noko a, me kunlu badwo fɔɔnwo kɛ menwu wɔ sonlabaka ne la.<verse eid="PSA 17:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="PSA 18" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 18</para>
  <para style="s1">Devidi ye Ɛpepɛlielɛ edwɛne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 18:1" />Mekulo wɔ somaa, O Nana Nyamenle! Ɔluakɛ wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛpepɛ ɛdie me a.<verse eid="PSA 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 18:2" />Nana Nyamenle le me sinzavolɛ; ɔle me nriandifeabelɛ. Me Nyamenle a sinza me a; me nee ye lua a, dahuu me nwo kɔlɔɔnwo. Ɔsinza me kɛ konle nu wowadeɛ; ɔle kɛ ɛnlankɛ nyinli mɔɔ ye mɛne ɛdwazo wɔ konle nu la. <verse eid="PSA 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 18:3" />Mesu mefɛlɛ Awulae, na ɔpepɛ ɔdie me ɔfi me kpɔvolɛma asa anu. Nana Nyamenle fɛta ayɛlɛyelɛ amgba!<verse eid="PSA 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 18:4" />Ewule nwɔnzɔnwɔnzɔ ne bɛngale me yiale; deɛsɛkyevolɛma azɛlɛkye noko vale me aze. <verse eid="PSA 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 18:5" />Bɔbɔ membɔle mɔdenle, kɛ menwɔlie me nwo menwɔvi ewule sa nu; noko akee ɛnee funli kuma ɛzua me ɛhane dɛbadɛba. <verse eid="PSA 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 18:6" />Wɔ me ɛmianlɛ nu, menzunle menvɛlɛle Nana Nyamenle; menvɛlɛle me Nyamenle kɛ ɔraboa me. Ɔdele me ne wɔ ye Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu; na ɔyɛle ɛnzolɛ ɔdiele me. <verse eid="PSA 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 18:7" />Akee azɛlɛ wozole, na awoka kpakyekpakyele; ɔluakɛ ɛnee Nana Nyamenle ɛva ɛya. <verse eid="PSA 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 18:8" />Esike vi ɔ bonyi nu vindele; na senle vile ɔ nloa anu zɛkyele ninyɛne dɔɔnwo, <verse eid="PSA 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 18:9" />Ɔwɔnenle anwuma maanle ne ati aze, na ɔ gyakɛ abo yɛle esike mungumungu. <verse eid="PSA 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 18:10" />Ɔvale anwumabɔvolɛ, mɔɔ le abɔdeɛ mɔɔ lɛ ndɛbalɛ la ko ɔyɛle ye ɛkpɔnwɔ na ɔdule; ɔvale anwoma ndɛbalɛ ɔdule. <verse eid="PSA 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 18:11" />Ɔvale awozinli ɔhedale ɔ nwo zo, na ɔvale amungu kabii ɔlile ɔ nyunlu. <verse eid="PSA 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 18:12" />Akee ɔmaanle wienyi ne mɔɔ wɔ ye nu la kpakyele wɔ awozinli kabii ne anu, kɛ ezule mɔɔ ɛlɛfedevede la.<verse eid="PSA 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 18:13" />Nana Nyamenle deanle nu wɔ anwuma maanle nu nehane; na bɛdele Nyamenle bedevinli ne ane amgba. <verse eid="PSA 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 18:14" />Ɔtotole ye ɛda mbaka ne mɔ, na ɔbɔle ye kpɔvolɛma ne mɔ asande; ɔkpakyele ɛsɛlɛmanye na ɔvale ɔdule bɛ bo. <verse eid="PSA 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 18:15" />Ɛdeanle nu kokye ala la, O Nana Nyamenle, nyevile hwenle guale aze gɔɔ; na azɛlɛ ye abo ninyɛne kpokpoti yele bɛ nwo relerele zɛhae ala. Ɛhwile wɔ kpɔvolɛma anyunlu, O Awulae, wɔ melɛ mɔɔ ɛhulule ɛguale bɛ nwo zo wɔ ɛyavalɛ nu la.<verse eid="PSA 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 18:16" />Awulae zoanle vile anwuma lɔ, ɔmaanle bɛravale me; ɔhwenle me ɔvile amaneɛnwunlɛ nu. <verse eid="PSA 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 18:17" />Ɔliele me ɔvile me kpɔvolɛ nee bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkyi me kɔkɔkɔkɔ la asa anu, ɔluakɛ bɛ anwosesebɛ ɛdeɛ ne bo me nwo zo.<verse eid="PSA 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 18:18" />Bɛvale me aze, wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɛnee menlɛ anwosesebɛ la, na Nana Nyamenle gyinlanle me nzi kpundii. <verse eid="PSA 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 18:19" />Ɔvale me ɔhɔle ɛleka mɔɔ munzule biala ɛnle ɛkɛ a; ɔliele me ngoane, ɔluakɛ ɔ nye die me nwo. <verse eid="PSA 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 18:20" />Nana Nyamenle nea me tenleneyɛlɛ nwo tua me kakɛ; ɔnea me nwuanzanwuanzayɛlɛ ne anwo ɔyila me. <verse eid="PSA 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 18:21" />Ɔluakɛ medi Nana Nyamenle mɛla ne mɔ azo; yɛɛ eza noko mengakyi me nzi menzi me Nyamenle. <verse eid="PSA 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 18:22" />Meze ye ngyehyɛlɛ ne mɔ amuala; yɛɛ medi ye mɛla ne mɔ noko amuala azo. <verse eid="PSA 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 18:23" />Mebɔ mɔdenle kɛ menwɔli bɛ muala azo, na menea ye boɛ kɛ amgba noko menrɛvo ye ndenle ne mɔ biala. <verse eid="PSA 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 18:24" />Ye zɔhane ati Nana Nyamenle yila me, ɔluakɛ meyɛ mɔɔ fɛta la; yɛɛ me ahonle nu noko te saanwu.<verse eid="PSA 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 18:25" />O Awulae, amgba ɛkile wɔ anwunvɔnezelɛ ne ɛmaa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛse anwunvɔne la! Yɛɛ eza noko ɛdi nɔhalɛ ɛmaa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛdi nɔhalɛ la. <verse eid="PSA 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 18:26" />Tenlenema nyia nyilalɛ fi wɔ lɔ; na emomu ɛtanevolɛma ɛdeɛ, ɛ nee bɛ ɛnli hweledede. <verse eid="PSA 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 18:27" />Ɛdie anwoazehanlɛma ngoane; na emomu, ɛbɛlɛ bɛdabɛ mɔɔ memaa bɛ nwo zo la aze. <verse eid="PSA 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 18:28" />Nana Nyamenle, ɛdawɔ mumua ne a ɛle me kɛnlaneɛ a; me Nyamenle mumua ne a ta wienyi maa me wɔ awozinli nu a. <verse eid="PSA 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 18:29" />Ɔlua wɔ moalɛ ti, ɛlɔne ɛngola ɛngo ɛnva me aze; ɔlua wɔ tumi zo metia ɛhane zo a ɔnvuandi.<verse eid="PSA 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 18:30" />Nɔhalɛ nu, Nyamenle ɛhye, Yemɔ ye adenle nu yɛ nwanwane amgba. Nana Nyamenle anloa edwɛkɛ ɛmbɔ aze ɛlɛ. Ɔwowa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛdie ye bɛdi la. <verse eid="PSA 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 18:31" />Nyamenle boni a tɛla Awulae kpole a? Anzɛɛ nwane bieko a le katakyie tɛla Nana Nyamenle a?<verse eid="PSA 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 18:32" />Nana Nyamenle a wula me anwosesebɛ, na ɔsinza me wɔ me ɛbɛlabɔlɛ nu a. <verse eid="PSA 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 18:33" />Yemɔ a saa melua bolɛ sinli nyunlu bɔbɔ a, ɔmmaa mengoati a; anzɛɛ saa melua boka nye anwo bɔbɔ a, ɔmmaa mentele mendɔ aze a. <verse eid="PSA 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 18:34" />Ɔdaye a ɔkilehile me konle nu agyibadolɛ a, na eza ɔmaa me anwosesebɛ wɔ mbulalɛ ɛda ɛdolɛ nu a.<verse eid="PSA 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 18:35" />O Awulae, wɔva wɔ ngoanelielɛ tumi ne wɔmaa me, na wɔva ɛ sa fema ne wɔzɔ me nu; wɔ ndetelɛ kpalɛ ne ɛmaa meyɛ kpole. <verse eid="PSA 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 18:36" />Wɔmaa me gyakɛ ɛhola aze, ɔlua zo metɛtelele metɛtɔle aze ɛlɛ. <verse eid="PSA 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 18:37" />Mekpo me kpɔvolɛma na meto bɛ; memmaa bɛnva bɛ nwo bɛnli; kɔkpula kɛ menwɔli bɛ nwo zo konim la. <verse eid="PSA 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 18:38" />Mebodɛboda bɛ mɔɔ bɛngola bɛndwazo bɛngyinla a; mekomo bɛ nwo zo wɔ me gyakɛ abo. <verse eid="PSA 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 18:39" />Ɛfa konle nu anwosesebɛ tɛladeɛ ɛwula me; ɛkye menli mɔɔ ko tia me la nuokɛ, na ɛfa bɛ ɛwula me gyakɛ abo. <verse eid="PSA 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 18:40" />Ɛmaa me kpɔvolɛma nriandi gua ɛ bɔ nu; ɛmaa medi menli mɔɔ ko tia me la anwo zo konim. <verse eid="PSA 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 18:41" />Bɛsu bɛfɛlɛ boavolɛ, noko akee bɛnnyia bie; bɛsu bɛfɛlɛ Awulae, na ɔmbua bɛ. <verse eid="PSA 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 18:42" />Meti bɛ motomoto kɛ sianlɛ; metietia bɛ nwo zo kɛ gua zo anwea la. <verse eid="PSA 18:42" /><verse number="43-44" style="v" sid="PSA 18:43-44" />Ɛlielɛ me ɛvile bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛhonle bɛtiale me la asa anu, na ɛvale me ɛziele maanle maanle bɛ belemgbunli. Ɔlua zo, menli mɔɔ menze bɛ bɔbɔ la, ɛnɛ akee sonle me. Maanle gyɛne nu amra bɔ bɛ ti aze maa me; metendɛ a bɛdi me mɛla zo. <verse eid="PSA 18:43-44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 18:45" />Bɛminli bɛ akɛnrazilɛ, na bɛfi bɛ fealeka mgbole mgbole ne mɔ anu, na bɛfa anwowozolɛ bɛba me nyunlu.<verse eid="PSA 18:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 18:46" />Awulae de aze dahuu! Bɛye me pepɛdievolɛ ne ayɛlɛ! Bɛbɔ Nana Nyamenle ye kpoleyɛlɛ ne anwo nolo, yemɔ mɔɔ ɔdie me ngoane a. <verse eid="PSA 18:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 18:47" />Ɔmaa meko metɔ zo wɔ me kpɔvolɛma anyunlu; ɔkomo maanle maanle mɔɔ wɔ me bo la kpokpoti anwo zo, <verse eid="PSA 18:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 18:48" />na ɔyɛ me ɔfi me atiakunlutanevolɛma asa anu. O Nana Nyamenle, ɛmaa me konimlilɛ wɔ me kpɔvolɛma anwo zo, na eza ɛsinza me ɛfi amumuyɛvoma ngane nu. <verse eid="PSA 18:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 18:49" />Ɛhye ati mekanvo wɔ wɔ maanle maanle avinli; meto edwɛne meyeyɛ wɔ dahuu. <verse eid="PSA 18:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 18:50" />Nana Nyamenle fa konimlilɛ mgbole maa ye belemgbunli ne; ɔda ye ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne ali ɔkile sonla holɛ ko ne mɔɔ yeye ye la. Devidi, ɔ nee ɔ bo zo amra, wɔ melɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ.<verse eid="PSA 18:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="PSA 19" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 19</para>
  <para style="s1">Nana Nyamenle mɔɔ bɔle sonla dasanli nee Ewiade la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 19:1" />Anwuma da Nana Nyamenle anyunlunyia bedevinli ne ali; anwomanyunlu kile ɔ sa anloa nwanwane gyima ne. <verse eid="PSA 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 19:2" />Alehyenlɛ di ye anyunlunyia ne nee ɔ sa anloa gyima ne anwo daselɛ; yɛɛ aledwolɛ noko kile ye deɛnwunlɛ kuloonwu ne. <verse eid="PSA 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 19:3" />Bɛndendɛ, yɛɛ bɛnyɛ alɛra biala, awie ɛnde bɛ nloa anu edwɛkɛ. <verse eid="PSA 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 19:4" />Noko akee bɛ ne pɛ nu maanle ti nee maanle bo; bɛ edwɛkɛ dwu aleɛabo ɛleka biala. Nyamenle ɛyɛ tɛnlabelɛ wɔ anwomanyunlu ɛmaa sɛnzɛne ne. <verse eid="PSA 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 19:5" />Aleɛ kye a ɔfinde kɛ atɔfolɛ kunli, mɔɔ wɔ anyelielɛ nu la. Ɔtudu ɔ gyakɛ kɛ anwosesebɛvolɛ mɔɔ ɛlɛsu wɔ ɛnriandile nu la. <verse eid="PSA 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 19:6" />Ɔbɔ ɔ bo sɛnzɛnduduleɛ, na ɔpɛ nu ɔkɔ sɛnzɛndɔleɛ. Na abɔdeɛ biala ɛnle ɛkɛ ne mɔɔ ye mgbukpuka ne ɛnga ye a.<verse eid="PSA 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 19:7" />Nana Nyamenle mɛla di munli, ɔmaa anwosesebɛ; Awulae mɛla ne mɔ le fɔɔnwo, ɔkakyi koasea ɔyɛ ye nrɛlɛbɛvolɛ. <verse eid="PSA 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 19:8" />Nana Nyamenle mɛla ne mɔ di munli bɔkɔɔ, na bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛdi zolɛ la nyia anwodɔlɛ. Awulae mɛla ne mɔ le nɔhalɛ bɔkɔɔ, ndelebɛbo wɔ nu maa awie biala. <verse eid="PSA 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 19:9" />Nana Nyamenle ɛzonlenlɛ le kpalɛ; ye ɛzonlenlɛ ɛnrɛbɔ aze ɛlɛ. Awulae ndɛnebualɛ tɛnrɛ bɔkɔɔ, nzisi ɛnle nuhua ɛlɛ. <verse eid="PSA 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 19:10" />Bɛsonle bolɛ bɛtɛla ezukoa nvutuke; dɔdɔ bɔbɔ ɛndo bɛ fɛlɛko. <verse eid="PSA 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 19:11" />Bɛle ngakyelɛ bɛmaa aleɛabo amra. Bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛdi zo la nyia nwole ahatualɛ kpalɛ.<verse eid="PSA 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 19:12" />Mɔɔ pɛ azia la ɛnze kɛ ɔ nzi ɛlɛkyea; yemɔti Awulae, pepɛ die me, na ye me fi nvonleɛ mɔɔ veɛvea me la amuala anu! <verse eid="PSA 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 19:13" />Bɔ me nwo bane fi anyefuu ɛtaneyɛlɛ nwo; mmamaa bɛdi me nwo zo konim; amaa meali munli, na eza meaho meadɔ zo wɔ ɛtaneyɛlɛ nu.<verse eid="PSA 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 19:14" />Maa me nzɛlɛlɛ mɔɔ meva medo ɛ nyunlu, ɔ nee mɔɔ melɛdwenledwenle nwolɛ wɔ me ahonle nu la ɛzɔ ɛ nye, O Nana Nyamenle, me Bodane nee me Dievolɛ!<verse eid="PSA 19:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="PSA 20" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 20</para>
  <para style="s1">Nzɛlɛlɛ mɔɔ bɛyɛ bɛmaa Ngoanedievolɛ Belemgbunli ne la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 20:1" />Nana Nyamenle ɛdie wɔ wɔ wɔ ɛmianlɛ mekɛ nu! Gyekɔbo Nyamenle ne ɛbɔ ɛ nwo bane! <verse eid="PSA 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 20:2" />Ɔmaa wɔ moalɛ ɔvi ye Asɔne Sua Nwuanzanwuanza ne anu, na ɔvi Zayɔn azo ɔrawula wɔ anwosesebɛ. <verse eid="PSA 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 20:3" />Ɔmaa ɔ nye ɛzɔ wɔ azubɔndeɛ kpokpoti; ɔmaa ɔ kunlu ɛdwo wɔ ahyɛlɛndeɛ muala anwo. <verse eid="PSA 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 20:4" />Ɔmaa ɛ sa ɛha wɔ ɛbizalɛndeɛ ne mɔ, na ɔmaa wɔ nzuzulɛ muala ɛli munli. <verse eid="PSA 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 20:5" />Maa yɛli fɛlɛko kpole wɔ wɔ ngoanelielɛ nu, na yɛzi yɛ konimlilɛ avɛlɛnra ne mɔ wɔ wɔ duma nu, O Nana Nyamenle. Awulae ɛmaa wɔ ɛbizalɛndeɛ muala ɛyɛ ɛkɛ. <verse eid="PSA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 20:6" />Akee menwu ye wienyi kɛ, Nana Nyamenle fa konimlilɛ tumi kpole wula ye akɛlɛ nu. Ɔtie ɔ ne ɔfi ye anwuma maanle nwuanzanwuanza ne anu; na ɔmaa ɔdi konim kpole wɔ ye tumi nu. <verse eid="PSA 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 20:7" />Menli ne bie mɔ fa bɛ agyapandeɛ tu bɛ nwo; yɛɛ bie mɔ noko fa bɛ mbazira; na yɛmɛ yɛfa yɛ rɛle yɛwula yɛ Awulae Nana Nyamenle tumi nu. <verse eid="PSA 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 20:8" />Menli ɛhye mɔ bakpulokpula bɛade bɛagua aze; na yɛmɛ yɛbadwazo yɛagyinla kpundii.<verse eid="PSA 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 20:9" />Maa belemgbunli ne ɛli konim, O Nana Nyamenle; yɛsu yɛfɛlɛ wɔ a tie yɛ.<verse eid="PSA 20:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="PSA 21" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 21</para>
  <para style="s1">Anwumahɔlɛ Kenle ne edwɛne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 21:1" />Belemgbunli ne ɛlɛdi fɛlɛko kpole, O Nana Nyamenle; ɔboalekɛ wɔwula ye anwosesebɛ. Ɔ nye die, ɔluakɛ wɔmaa yeli konim! <verse eid="PSA 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 21:2" />Wɔmaa yɛnyia mɔɔ yɛ ahonle kulo la; wɔyɛ ye ɛbizalɛdeɛ wɔmaa ye.<verse eid="PSA 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 21:3" />Wɔyeye ɛ kunlu wɔyileyila ye; na wɔva arelemgbunli ezukoa nvutuke kyɛlɛ wɔzoa ye. <verse eid="PSA 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 21:4" />Ɔbizale ngoane tendenle ɔvile wɔ lɔ, na ɛvale ɛmaanle ye; ɛmaanle ye damɛnlangoate ngoane bɔbɔ. <verse eid="PSA 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 21:5" />Wɔ moalɛ ɛmaa ye anyunlunyia ɛyɛ kpole; wɔmaa yenyia dibilɛ nee duma kpole. <verse eid="PSA 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 21:6" />Wɔ nyilalɛ ne doa ye dahuu dahuu; na wɔ sunsum ne ɛwula ye anyelielɛ tɛkɛɛ. <verse eid="PSA 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 21:7" />Nɔhalɛ nu, belemgbunli ne lɛ diedi kpole wɔ Nana Nyamenle Bedevinli ne nu; na ɔlua kɛ Awulae lɛ ɔ nwo ɛhulolɛ dahuu la ati, ɔ nwo ɛnrɛbu ɛbonle ɛlɛ.<verse eid="PSA 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 21:8" />Belemgbunli ne baho ahye ye kpɔvolɛma nuokɛ; ɔbali konim wɔ bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkyi ye kɔkɔkɔkɔ la anwo zo. <verse eid="PSA 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 21:9" />Wɔ wɔ ɛyavalɛ mekɛ ne anu, bɛbayela dwɛɛ: wɔ sendɔlɛra ne anu. Nana Nyamenle baminli bɛ bo zo bɔkɔɔ wɔ ye ɛyavalɛ mekɛ ne anu, na senle kpole ne bayela bɛ wee. <verse eid="PSA 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 21:10" />Ɛbaminli bɛ nzi amra abo zo bɔkɔɔ wɔavi azɛlɛ ye azo; belemgbunli ne babɔ bɛ bo zo bɔkɔɔ. <verse eid="PSA 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 21:11" />Ɔluakɛ bɛnlɛ ɔ nwo adwenle kpalɛ; na bɛfa ɔ nwo akpame dahuu; noko akee bɛnrɛnyia agyinlagyakɛ. <verse eid="PSA 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 21:12" />Ɔbado bɛ nwo etu, na bɛbahakyi bɛ nzi bɛanriandi bɛadɔ kpɔkɛ nu.<verse eid="PSA 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 21:13" />Nganvolɛ ɛha wɔ duma, O Nana Nyamenle, wɔ wɔ anwosesebɛ kpole ne ati! Dahuu yɛbahɔ zo yɛado edwɛne yɛaye wɔ ayɛlɛ, yɛahanvo wɔ tumi ne.<verse eid="PSA 21:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="PSA 22" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 22</para>
  <para style="s1">Meanubakanubɔlɛ ne anwo edwɛne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 22:1" />Me Nyamenle, me Nyamenle, duzu ati a wɔkpo me a? Duzu ati a mesu mefɛlɛ wɔ a ɛmbua me bie, na mebiza wɔ moalɛ a ɛmmaa me a? <verse eid="PSA 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 22:2" />Alehyenlɛ muala mesu mefɛlɛ wɔ, O me Nyamenle, noko akee ɛmbua me; aledwolɛ kpokpoti mebodo wɔ, noko akee ɔ muala le gyɛne. <verse eid="PSA 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 22:3" />Wɔmɔ noko a le Nwuanzanwuanza kotokokye ne a. Wɔmɔ yɛɛ Yizilayɛ amuala bɔ wɔ duma kpalɛ a. <verse eid="PSA 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 22:4" />Yɛ mgbanyima liele wɔ lile; bɛvale bɛ rɛle bɛwulale wɔ nu, na ɛlielɛ bɛ. <verse eid="PSA 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 22:5" />Bɛzunle bɛvɛlɛle wɔ, na ɛyele bɛ ɛvile munzule nu; bɛliele wɔ bɛlile, na wɔanye bɛ rɛle wɔando bɛ sa nu.<verse eid="PSA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 22:6" />Kɛkala mɔ menle sonla bieko; ngoane biala ɛnle me nu. Menli kyi me kɔkɔkɔkɔ, na eza bɛkpɔ me. <verse eid="PSA 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 22:7" />Menli nwu me a bɛsi me amgbu; bɛtu bɛ nloa bɛgua me nwo zo; na bɛkpusukpusu bɛ ti bɛse kɛ, <verse eid="PSA 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 22:8" />“Ɔvale ɔ rɛle ɔwulale Nana Nyamenle nu amaa yeanyia ngoane. Saa Awulae wɔ ye afoa ɛdeɛ a, ɛnee bɛmaa ɔlie ye ɛ.”<verse eid="PSA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 22:9" />Wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛbɔle me a; yɛɛ wɔmɔ a wɔnlea me nwo zo wɔvi me ngakula nu too wɔrakpula ɛnɛ a. <verse eid="PSA 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 22:10" />Sumunli kɛ bɛwole me la, metɛkoatile wɔ ɛlɛ; yɛɛ dahuu noko ɛle me Nyamenle. <verse eid="PSA 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 22:11" />Mmamaa yɛ mu nwiɔ yɛ avinli tete; ɔluakɛ munzule lua adenle nu; yɛɛ menlɛ boavolɛ biala boka ɛ nwo.<verse eid="PSA 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 22:12" />Kpɔvolɛma ɛbɔ me nwo mgbɔlɛka ɛyia; nlankɛ nyinli ɛbɔ me nwo mgbɔlɛka ɛyia. Bɛle kɛ Beeshyan nlankɛ anwo ɛzulolɛ ne mɔ la. <verse eid="PSA 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 22:13" />Bɛbukebuke bɛ nloa wanaanwo bɛdoa me; bɛyɛ kɛ awenade mɔɔ ɛhɔne ɛlɛku ye na ɔlɛkulu la. <verse eid="PSA 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 22:14" />Me anwosesebɛ muala ɛminli; yeminli kɛ nzule mɔɔ bɛwola bɛgua ye aze la. Me akpɔkɛ nu ɛtuto; me ahonle ɛde penyi kɛ wate la. <verse eid="PSA 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 22:15" />Me kominza ɛyɛ resee kɛ ɛsɛlɛ zo; me tafinlima ɛzɔ ɛbeta. Wɔmaa medɔ agye wɔ ewule sa nu. <verse eid="PSA 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 22:16" />Ahodiawu ɛbɔ me nwo mgbɔlɛka ɛyia; bɛyɛ kɛ ahwea kpolane bɛdoa me. Bɛtudu me nwo nane woli woli zɛhae ala. <verse eid="PSA 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 22:17" />Me mbowule muala ɛza ɛgua zo. Me kpɔvolɛma nea me dedee bɛ gyakɛ kpulokpula. <verse eid="PSA 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 22:18" />Bɛkye me ndanlɛ bɛfa, na bɛtwe me tɛladeɛ nwo adunyi.<verse eid="PSA 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 22:19" />O Nana Nyamenle, mmagyakyi me ɛkɔ moamoa! O me anwosesebɛmaavolɛ, bɛla baho die me ndɛndɛ! <verse eid="PSA 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 22:20" />Die me fi nrɛlande ewule sa nu; die me ɛkɛla ne ngoane fi ahodiawu ɛhye mɔ asa anu. <verse eid="PSA 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 22:21" />Die me fi awenade ɛhye mɔ anloa anu; me anwosesebɛ ɛwie wɔ ahodiawu ɛhye mɔ anyunlu. <verse eid="PSA 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 22:22" />Mebaye wɔ ayɛlɛ meahile maanle maanle; mebayeyɛ wɔ meahile bɛ wɔ bɛ ayialeka ne mɔ. <verse eid="PSA 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 22:23" />“Bɛye Nana Nyamenle ayɛlɛ, O bɛmɛ mɔɔ bɛsulo ye la! Bɛmɛ Gyekɔbo abo zo amra, bɛwula ye anyunlunyia! Bɛzonle ye, bɛmɛ Yizilayɛma! <verse eid="PSA 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 22:24" />Ɔluakɛ ɔmbu ɔ nye ɔngua ehyiavolɛma anwo zo; yɛɛ ɔmkpo menli mɔɔ wɔ nyanenwunlɛ nu la. Emomu nuhua biala mɔɔ kɛzu kɛvɛlɛ ye la, ɔtie ye.”<verse eid="PSA 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 22:25" />Mebahanvo wɔ wɔ ayiaku kpole ne anyunlu, wɔ mɔɔ wɔyɛ la ti. Wɔ wɔ sonlevolɛma ne anyunlu, yɛɛ mebava wɔ ɛwɔkɛdeɛ ne meamaa wɔ a. <verse eid="PSA 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 22:26" />Ehyiavolɛma bali amaa bɛ ko ayi; bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛwolo Nana Nyamenle la baye ye ayɛlɛ; bɛbanyia ngoane mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ! <verse eid="PSA 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 22:27" />Maanle maanle muala banwu Nana Nyamenle. Bɛvi aleɛabo ɛleka biala bɛbara Awulae ɛkɛ; aleɛabo abusua eku eku kpokpoti bazonle ye.<verse eid="PSA 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 22:28" />Nana Nyamenle le belemgbunli, na ɔsie maanle maanle kpokpoti. <verse eid="PSA 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 22:29" />Mgbanyizonleyɛvoma amuala bahoto ye; aleɛabo amra kpokpoti babɔ bɛ ti aze amaa ye. <verse eid="PSA 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 22:30" />Kenlebie-amra bazonle ye; menli bali Awulae anwo daselɛ ahile kenlebie-amra. <verse eid="PSA 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 22:31" />Bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛtɛnyianle bɛtɛwole bɛ bɔbɔ la bade kɛ: “Awulae liele ye menli amgba.”<verse eid="PSA 22:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="PSA 23" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 23</para>
  <para style="s1">Mboaneneavolɛ ne Edwɛndolɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 23:1" />Nana Nyamenle le me boaneneavolɛ; menrɛhyia debie biala anwo. <verse eid="PSA 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 23:2" />Ɔfa me ɔkɔ adidi wɔ ɛleka mɔɔ ndile wɔ la; ɔ nee me kɔ azundenle nwo. <verse eid="PSA 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 23:3" />Saa me ngoane tɔ sinli a, ɔmaa me anwosesebɛ. Ɔboa me wɔ tenleneyɛlɛ ndenle nu, wɔ ye duma ti.<verse eid="PSA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 23:4" />Saa bɔbɔ melua ewule bɔnza awozinli kabii ne anu a, menzulo ɛhwee, O Awulae; ɔluakɛ ɛ nee me lua. Wɔ kpɔma ne nee wɔ kokolobaka ne mɔ bɔ me nwo bane.<verse eid="PSA 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 23:5" />Ɛto me ɛkponle wɔ me kpɔvolɛma anyunlu. Ɛto me ɛkponle wɔ me kpɔvolɛma anyunlu; ɛwola wɔ nwole ɛgua me ti avinli, ɛmaa me kɔpo ne yi dedee ɔbulubulu zolɛ.<verse eid="PSA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 23:6" />Nɔhalɛ nu, atiakunlukpalɛyɛlɛ nee anwunvɔnezelɛ bali me nzi dahuu; na mebadɛnla Nana Nyamenle aako nu dahuu.<verse eid="PSA 23:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="PSA 24" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 24</para>
  <para style="s1">Anyunlunyia Belemgbunli ne Edwɛndolɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 24:1" />Aleɛabo nee ninyɛne mɔɔ wɔ nu la kpokpoti le Nana Nyamenle deɛ; ewiade ye nee nuhua menli kpokpoti le ye deɛ. <verse eid="PSA 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 24:2" />Yemɔ a bɔle anwomanyunlu, mɔɔ zinze azɛlɛ ye azo azumgbole ne mɔ anye, na ɔdole ɔ bo wɔ nyevile mgbole ne mɔ azo a.<verse eid="PSA 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 24:3" />Nwane a fɛta Nana Nyamenle anyunlu ɛhɔlɛ a? Nwane a lɛ adenle kɛ ɔkɛhɔ ye Asɔne Sua Kpole nwuanzanwuanza ne anu a? <verse eid="PSA 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 24:4" />Mɔɔ ye ahonle nu nee ye nyɛleɛ nwo te saanwu; na ɔ ti akunlu le fufule, mɔɔ ɛnzonle awozonle, anzɛɛ ɛnli amonle, na ɔnga ndane mgbane mgbane la, <verse eid="PSA 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 24:5" />yemɔ a banyia nyilalɛ yeavi Awulae ɛkɛ a; yemɔ a Nana Nyamenle Ngoanedievolɛ ne babua ye benle ndɛne a. <verse eid="PSA 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 24:6" />Zɛhae menli ye a lɛ adenle kɔ Awulae anyunlu a; zɛhae menli ye a ta Gyekɔbo Nyamenle ne anyunlu ɛhɔle a.<verse eid="PSA 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 24:7" />Bɛbukebuke, O nlenkɛ mgbole! Bɛbukebuke wowanaanwo, O bɛmɛ tete nlenkɛ! Na bɛmaa anyunlunyia Belemgbunli ne ɛrɛla nu. <verse eid="PSA 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 24:8" />Nwane a le anyunlunyia Belemgbunli ɛhye? Yemɔ a le Awulae bedevinli, anwosesebevolɛ ne, Nana Nyamenle, konle nu katakyie konimdivolɛ ne. <verse eid="PSA 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 24:9" />Bɛbukebuke, O nlenkɛ mgbole! Bɛbukebuke wowanaanwo, O bɛmɛ tete nlenkɛ! Na bɛmaa anyunlunyia Belemgbunli ne ɛrɛla nu.<verse eid="PSA 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 24:10" />Ɛnee nwane bɔbɔ a le anyunlunyia Belemgbunli ɛhye? Konimdivolɛ, Safohyenle Nana Nyamenle ne ɔ; yemɔ a le Anyunlunyia Belemgbunli ne a!<verse eid="PSA 24:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="PSA 25" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 25</para>
  <para style="s1">Bɛlɛvoma Nzɛlɛlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 25:1" />O Nana Nyamenle, wɔmɔ yɛɛ mefa me nzɛlɛlɛ meto ɛ nyunlu a. <verse eid="PSA 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 25:2" />O me Nyamenle, wɔmɔ yɛɛ mefa me rɛle mewula wɔ nu a. Mmamaa anyiemgba ka me; mmamaa me kpɔvolɛma di me nwo zo konim. <verse eid="PSA 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 25:3" />Nɔhalɛ nu bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkakyi bɛ nzi bɛsi wɔ la, yɛɛ anyiemgba ka bɛ a.<verse eid="PSA 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 25:4" />Kilehile me ɛ gyakɛ abo ndenle ne mɔ. O Nana Nyamenle kilehile me wɔ nɔhalɛ ndenle ne mɔ. <verse eid="PSA 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 25:5" />Kilehile me, na maa menlua wɔ nɔhalɛ ndenle ne mɔ anu; ɔluakɛ wɔmɔ a ɛle me ngoanedievolɛ Nyamenle a; wɔmɔ a me rɛle wɔ wɔ nu dahuu a. <verse eid="PSA 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 25:6" />Kakye wɔ anwunvɔnezelɛ ne, O Nana Nyamenle; kakye wɔ ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne, mɔɔ sumunli mɔlebɛbo ne wɔhile la. <verse eid="PSA 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 25:7" />Fa me mbɛda nu ɛtane mɔɔ menyɛle la, ɔ nee mɛla mɔɔ medo la amuala kyɛ me. Fa kyɛ me, O Nana Nyamenle, wɔ wɔ anwunvɔnezelɛ nee wɔ ɛhulolɛ molozo ne anu.<verse eid="PSA 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 25:8" />Nana Nyamenle le tenlene na ɔdi nɔhalɛ; zɔhane ati ɔkilehile ɛtanevolɛma adenle kpalɛ mɔɔ ɔwɔ kɛ bɛfa zo a. <verse eid="PSA 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 25:9" />Ɔwowa mɛlɛbɛnwoazema mɔɔ tenrɛ la, na ɔkilehile bɛ ye ɛhulolɛdeɛ ne. <verse eid="PSA 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 25:10" />Nana Nyamenle ndenle nu le ɛhulolɛ nee anwunvɔnezelɛ maa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛdi ye mɛla nee ye ngyehyɛlɛ zo la.<verse eid="PSA 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 25:11" />Di wɔ ɛwɔkɛ ne azo, O Nana Nyamenle, na fa me ɛtane kyɛ me. Ɔluakɛ me ɛtane ɛyɛ kpole.<verse eid="PSA 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 25:12" />Nwane mɔ a sulo Nana Nyamenle a? Bɛmɛ yɛɛ Awulae bahile bɛ adenle mɔɔ ɔwɔ kɛ bɛfa zo a.<verse eid="PSA 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 25:13" />Bɛbahɔ ye boɛ dahuu; na azɛlɛ ne bayɛ bɛ mra deɛ.<verse eid="PSA 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 25:14" />Nana Nyamenle fealera nu edwɛkɛ ɛnvea bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛdi ye mɛla zo la; bɛmɛ bɛze ye ngyehyɛlɛ ne mɔ.<verse eid="PSA 25:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 25:15" />Nana Nyamenle le me anyelazo dahuu; ɔ ngomekye ala yɛɛ ɔkola ɔdie me ɔfi munzule nu a. <verse eid="PSA 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 25:16" />Twe bikye me, O Awulae, na nwu me anwunvɔne; ɔluakɛ menlɛ agɔnwolɛ; meyɛ anwunvɔne: <verse eid="PSA 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 25:17" />Nyane kpole ɛyi me ahonle tɛkɛɛ; O ye me fi anwofofolɛ nu. <verse eid="PSA 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 25:18" />Nea me amaneɛnwunlɛ nee ateetee; na fa me ɛtane muala kyɛ me. <verse eid="PSA 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 25:19" />Nea kɛ me kpɔvolɛma ɛzo bie a; nea kɛ bɛsi bɛkyi me kɔkɔkɔkɔ a! <verse eid="PSA 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 25:20" />Sinza me na die me; mmamaa anyiemgba ka me. Ɔluakɛ wɔ nu a melɛ arɛlekyekyelɛ a.<verse eid="PSA 25:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 25:21" />Maa tenleneyɛlɛ nee nɔhalɛlilɛ ɛdoa me dahuu; ɔluakɛ wɔmɔ a me nye la ɛ nwo zo a. <verse eid="PSA 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 25:22" />Die Yizilayɛ ngoane, O Nana Nyamenle, fi ye ɛvɛlɛ kpokpoti anu.<verse eid="PSA 25:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="PSA 26" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 26</para>
  <para style="s1">Atiakunlunkɛnlɛmanli ye Nzɛlɛlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 26:1" />Bua me benle ndɛne, O Nana Nyamenle; ɔluakɛ mele nɔhavo. Medie Awulae medi, zɔhane ati dahuu megyi ye kpundii. <verse eid="PSA 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 26:2" />Sɔ me nea, O Nana Nyamenle; O sɔ me nea. Sɔ me ahonle nee me adwenle nea. <verse eid="PSA 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 26:3" />Ɔluakɛ wɔ atiakunlukɛnlɛma ne le me nzuzubaka; yɛɛ wɔ nɔhalɛlilɛ ne maa me ngɔzo. <verse eid="PSA 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 26:4" />Me nee kpamgbavolɛma ɛndu; me nee adalɛ nabalabama ɛnlɛ ɛhwee yɛ. <verse eid="PSA 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 26:5" />Mekyi ɛtanevolɛma agɔnwolɛvalɛ; yɛɛ mengulo bɔbɔ kɛ menwɔwolo bɛ. <verse eid="PSA 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 26:6" />O Nana Nyamenle, menrinzi me sa anwo medi daselɛ kɛ menze nwolɛ bie; na mesonle wɔ, mebɔ wɔ azukponle ne anwo mgbɔlɛka. <verse eid="PSA 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 26:7" />Meto edwɛne meyɛ wɔ mo mefa mekile wɔ nwanwane nyɛleɛ ne mɔ.<verse eid="PSA 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 26:8" />Mekulo wɔ aako ne mɔɔ ɛde nuhua la, O Nana Nyamenle; ɛleka ne mɔɔ wɔ anyunlunyia ne wɔ la.<verse eid="PSA 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 26:9" />Mmafa me ɛfonla ɛtanevolɛma anwo ɛsekye bɛ; mmamaa me nee ahodiawu <verse eid="PSA 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 26:10" />mɔɔ ninyɛndane ngome a bɛyɛ, na ndoloboalielɛ ɛnzea bɛ adenle la nyia ahatualɛ ko.<verse eid="PSA 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 26:11" />Mame mɔ, medi nɔhalɛ; nwu me anwunvɔne na pepɛ die me!<verse eid="PSA 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 26:12" />Me gyakɛ gyi nɔhalɛ adenle ne anu; wɔ ayiama ekpunli ekpunli ne avinli yɛɛ meye Nana Nyamenle ayɛlɛ a.<verse eid="PSA 26:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="PSA 27" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 27</para>
  <para style="s1">Edwɛndovo ne ye Arɛlekyekyelɛ ɔ nee ye Anyelazo wɔ Konimlilɛ nu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 27:1" />Nana Nyamenle le me kɛnlaneɛ ɔ nee me ngoanedievolɛ; nwane bieko bɔbɔ a ɔwɔ kɛ mesulo ye a? Awulae le me ɛkɛla ne anwosesebɛmaavo; nwane bɔbɔ a kɛhola kɛgyinla me nyunlu a? <verse eid="PSA 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 27:2" />Saa atiakunlutanevolɛma, bɔbɔ, me kpɔvolɛma, dwazo me kɔme zo kɛ bɛku me a, bɛ munzule bɔ bɛdabɛ bɛ ti zo. <verse eid="PSA 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 27:3" />Ɛlɔne ekpunli ekpunli babɔ me nwo mgbɔlɛka ayia ɛdeɛ; noko akee me ahonle ɛnrɛdu ɛlɛ. Me kpɔvolɛma badwazo me nwo zo wɔ konle nu ɛdeɛ, noko akee me diedi zo ɛnrɛde ɛlɛ.<verse eid="PSA 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 27:4" />Debie kokye a mebiza mefi Nana Nyamenle lɔ a; debie kokye a mekpondɛ a: Kɛ menwɔdɛnla Awulae aako nu dahuu, na menwɔnwu ye anyunlunyia kɛnlɛma ne, na menwɔzonle ye wɔ ye Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu. <verse eid="PSA 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 27:5" />Saa anwubɛnyunlu to me a ɔbabɔ me nwo bane; Ɔbava me yeavea Nwuanzanwuanzaleka ne wɔ ye Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu. Ɛkɛ ne yɛɛ nyanenwunlɛ biala ɛnrɛdo me a; <verse eid="PSA 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 27:6" />amaa meali konim wɔ me kpɔvolɛma anwo zo, na meava fɛlɛkolilɛ nee edwɛnedolɛ meabɔ azu meamaa Awulae wɔ ye Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu. Mebado edwɛne, mebahanvo Nana Nyamenle.<verse eid="PSA 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɛ nwo banebɔlɛ Nzɛlɛlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 27:7" />Saa mefɛlɛ wɔ a, tie me, O Nana Nyamenle! Nwu me anwunvɔne, na bua me! <verse eid="PSA 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 27:8" />Mekɛ mɔɔ ɛzele kɛ, “Bɛla bazonle me” la, membuale wɔ wɔ me ahonle nu menzele kɛ, “Mame ɛne, O Nana Nyamenle!”<verse eid="PSA 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 27:9" />Mmaye ɛ nyunlu ɛfea me; mmafa ɛya ɛye wɔ sonvolɛ ali. Ɛle me boavolɛ, mmaye me ali, yɛɛ eza noko mmagyakyi me adevinli, O Nana Nyamenle, me ngoanedievolɛ. <verse eid="PSA 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 27:10" />Egya nee ɔmɔ bɔbɔ kɛkpo me ɛdeɛ, noko akee Nana Nyamenle anye bawa me nwo zo.<verse eid="PSA 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 27:11" />Kilehile me mɔɔ ɔwɔ kɛ meyɛ a, O Nana Nyamenle; na fa me dua adenle kpalɛ zo. Ɔluakɛ me kpɔvolɛma ɛzo somaa. <verse eid="PSA 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 27:12" />Mmaye me ɛmaa me kpɔvolɛma; ɔluakɛ alasevolɛ adalɛma ɛdwazo me nwo zo ɛlɛdi dasewia atia me atisesebɛ nu ala. <verse eid="PSA 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 27:13" />Meze ye wienyi kɛ mebanwu Nana Nyamenle anyunlunyia ne wɔ teasema azɛlɛ zo.<verse eid="PSA 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 27:14" />Die Nana Nyamenle di, maa ɛ nwo ɛyɛ wɔ ɛsesebɛ; gyinla kpundii, na fa ɛ rɛle wula Awulae nu.<verse eid="PSA 27:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="PSA 28" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 28</para>
  <para style="s1">Devidi ye Nzɛlɛlɛ mɔɔ ɔvale ɔzɛlɛle ɛpepɛlielɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 28:1" />Wɔmɔ a mesu mefɛlɛ wɔ a, O Nana Nyamenle, me bodane! Tie me modolɛ; saa wɔambua me a, mebawu meaminli me ɛkɛla. <verse eid="PSA 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 28:2" />Saa mesu mefɛlɛ wɔ a, mekɛ mɔɔ menwɔmaa me sa zo menwɔhile wɔ nwuanzanwuanzaleka ne la, tie me ne.<verse eid="PSA 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 28:3" />Mmafa me ɛfonla atiakunlutanevolɛma nee amumuyɛvoma, mɔɔ anzondwolɛ nwo adwelielilɛ la bɛ nloa dahuu, noko akee ɛtane nee maanzonlehwenlɛ ɛyi bɛ ahonle nu tɛkɛɛ la anwo ɛtea bɛ. <verse eid="PSA 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 28:4" />Twe bɛ nzo! Twe bɛ nzo wɔ bɛ nyɛleɛ evinli evinli mɔɔ bɛyɛ la anwo. Tua bɛ nyɛleɛ nwo kakɛ; tua bɛ kakɛ kɛmɔ ɔfɛta la! <verse eid="PSA 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 28:5" />Ɔluakɛ bɛmbu Nana Nyamenle bie, na bɛabu ɔ sa anloa gyima la ati, ɔbadwulu bɛ yeagua, mɔɔ bɛnzi bɛ bieko a.<verse eid="PSA 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Devidi ye Konimlilɛ edwɛne wɔ Awulae moalɛ nwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 28:6" />Nyilalɛ ɛha Nana Nyamenle; ɔboalekɛ yedie me nzɛlɛlɛ. <verse eid="PSA 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 28:7" />Nana Nyamenle le me sinzavolɛ nee me wowavolɛ; melɛ diedi wɔ ye nu. Ɔboa me na ɔmaa me nye die. Ɛhye ati mebava fɛlɛkolilɛ meado edwɛne meahanvo ye. <verse eid="PSA 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 28:8" />Nana Nyamenle wula ye menli anwosesebɛ; ɔko ɔdie ye belemgbunli ne mɔɔ yezie ye la, na ɔdie ye ngoane.<verse eid="PSA 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 28:9" />Die wɔ menli ngoane, O Awulae, na yileyila wɔ agyapadeɛ. Yɛ bɛ mboaneneavolɛ, na nea bɛ nwo zo wɔ melɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ.<verse eid="PSA 28:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="PSA 29" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 29</para>
  <para style="s1">Awulae Ane ne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 29:1" />Bɛye Nana Nyamenle ayɛlɛ, bɛmɛ anwumabɔvolɛma; bɛwula ye anyunlunyia, na bɛhanvo ye tumi ne. <verse eid="PSA 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 29:2" />Bɛwula Nana Nyamenle anyunlunyia kɛmɔ ɔfɛta ye duma la; bɛzonle Awulae wɔ ye nwuanzanwuanzaleka ne.<verse eid="PSA 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 29:3" />Nana Nyamenle ane pɛ nu wɔ azumgbole zo. Anyunlunyia Nyamenle ne tendɛ; na ɔ ne dielie wɔ azumgbole ne mɔ azo. <verse eid="PSA 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 29:4" />Nana Nyamenle ane dwu ɛleka biala, wɔ ye tumililɛ nee ye belemgbunlililɛ nu. <verse eid="PSA 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 29:5" />Nana Nyamenle ane bubu ɛhoayelɛ nu mbaka; amgba Awulae ane bubu Lɛbanɔn ɛhoayelɛ nu mbaka gua. <verse eid="PSA 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 29:6" />Ɔkpusukpusu Lɛbanɔn nee Silɔn awoka kɛ nlankɛ mralɛ; ɔmaa bɛwuluwulu kɛ nlankɛ mralɛ mɔɔ bɛbɔ ɛlane la. <verse eid="PSA 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 29:7" />Nana Nyamenle dua ɛsɛlɛmanye zo a tendɛ a. <verse eid="PSA 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 29:8" />Nana Nyamenle ane kpusu ɛsɛlɛ; Awulae kpusu Keedɛhye ɛsɛlɛ ne. <verse eid="PSA 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 29:9" />Nana Nyamenle ane maa mboane ko ye, na ɔkpa ɛhoayelɛ bo; na wɔ ye Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu, bɛwula ye anyunlunyia.<verse eid="PSA 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 29:10" />Nana Nyamenle di belemgbunli wɔ nzuyilɛ zo; amgba, Awulae di belemgbunli dahuu. <verse eid="PSA 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 29:11" />Nana Nyamenle wula ye menli anwosesebɛ; na ɔfa anzondwolɛ ɔyila ye menli.<verse eid="PSA 29:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="PSA 30" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 30</para>
  <para style="s1">Bɛdie wɔ ngoane bɛfi anwodolɛ nu a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 30:1" />Meyeyɛ wɔ, O Nana Nyamenle; ɔboalekɛ wɔmɔ yɛɛ wɔlie me ngoane a. Wɔammaa me kpɔvolɛma anli me nwo zo konim. <verse eid="PSA 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 30:2" />O Nana Nyamenle, me Nyamenle, menzunle menvɛlɛle wɔ; na ɛdawɔ noko ɛmaanle me nwo zale. <verse eid="PSA 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 30:3" />O Nana Nyamenle, wɔmɔ a wɔva me ɛkɛla wɔvi Ɛbolɔ wɔra a; wɔmɔ yɛɛ wɔlie me ngoane, mɔɔ wɔammaa meangɔ ewule kuma nu a.<verse eid="PSA 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 30:4" />Bɛdo ayɛlɛyelɛ edwɛne bɛmaa Nana Nyamenle, O bɛmɛ mɔɔ bɛle ye anwodelɛma a! Bɛhakye mɔɔ Nwuanzanwuanza Kokye ne ɛyɛ la; na bɛva moyɛlɛ bɛmaa ye duma ne. <verse eid="PSA 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 30:5" />Ɔluakɛ ye ɛyavalɛ mekɛ le ezinra bie; ye atiakunlukpalɛ ne ɛnlɛ ye awieleɛ. Ɛzunlɛ wɔ aledwolɛ nu ɛdeɛ, noko akee fɛlɛkolile wɔ ɛkɛ alehyenlɛ nu.<verse eid="PSA 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 30:6" />Mekɛ mɔɔ mede ye boɛ la, menzele kɛ, “Ɛhwee ɛnrɛhola me.” <verse eid="PSA 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 30:7" />Nana Nyamenle, wɔ anwunvɔnezelɛ ɛmaa megyinla kpundii kɛ boka. Saa ɛye ɛ nyunlu ɛfea me a, ɛnee ɛzulolɛ kpole ɛha me. <verse eid="PSA 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 30:8" />Wɔmɔ a menzunle menvɛlɛle wɔ a, O Nana Nyamenle; wɔmɔ a membodole menzɛlɛle wɔ kɛ: <verse eid="PSA 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 30:9" />“Saa mewu a, duzu nvasoɛ yɛɛ ɛkɛnyia ye wɔ me mogya nwo a? Saa mekɔ ewule kuma nu a, duzu a ɛbanyia ye a? Asoo ndɛtɛlɛ bahola aye wɔ ayɛlɛ ɔ? Asoo bɛbahola bɛali wɔ nɔhalɛ ne anwo daselɛ bɛahile menli ɔ? <verse eid="PSA 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 30:10" />Tie me, O Nana Nyamenle, na nwu me anwunvɔne! Boa me, O Awulae!” <verse eid="PSA 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 30:11" />Wɔmaa me nyane ɛhakyi me fɛlɛkolilɛ; wɔye me amaneɛnwunlɛ wɔvi ɛkɛ, na wɔmaa anyelielɛ ɛyi me tɛkɛɛ. <verse eid="PSA 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 30:12" />Ɛhye ati menrɛmua me nloa ɛlɛ. Mebaye wɔ ayɛlɛ wɔ edwɛnedolɛ nu. O Nana Nyamenle, wɔmɔ a ɛle me Nyamenle a, mebayɛ wɔ mo dahuu.<verse eid="PSA 30:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="PSA 31" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 31</para>
  <para style="s1">Nyanenwunlɛ nee Anwunvɔnezelɛ Edwɛndolɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 31:1" />Wɔmɔ a mefa me rɛle mewula wɔ nu a, O Nana Nyamenle; mmamaa me nyunlu nyiane gua aze. Die me, ɔluakɛ wɔmɔ ɛle tenlene Nyamenle! <verse eid="PSA 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 31:2" />Saa mesu mefɛlɛ wɔ a, gua ɛ nzo aze tie me, na die me ndɛndɛ. Yɛ me Bodane kpole, na bɔ me nwo bane fi me kpɔvolɛma asa anu. <verse eid="PSA 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 31:3" />Ɔluakɛ wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛle me anyelazo dievolɛ nee me nriandifeabelɛ a; zɔhane ati di me nyunlu na wowa me, kɛmɔ ɛdawɔ wɔbɔ me ɛwɔkɛ la. <verse eid="PSA 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 31:4" />Ye me fi ɛhane ne mɔɔ me kpɔvolɛma ɛzua me la anu; ɔluakɛ wɔmɔ a ɛle me sinzavolɛ a. <verse eid="PSA 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 31:5" />Ɛ sa nu a mefa me sunsum mewula a.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PSA 31:5">Wɔmɔ a wɔlie me ngoane a, O Awulae Nyamenle nɔhalɛdivo. <verse eid="PSA 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 31:6" />Ɛkyi bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛsonle awozonle nee abɔdeɛ mgbane mgbane la; na mame ɛdeɛ, medie Nana Nyamenle medi. <verse eid="PSA 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 31:7" />Medi fɛlɛko, na me nye die wɔ wɔ anwunvɔnezelɛ nu; ɔluakɛ ɛze me nyanenwunlɛ kpokpoti; ɛze me sunsum nu anwubɛnyunlu muala. <verse eid="PSA 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 31:8" />Wɔanye me wɔammaa me kpɔvolɛma; wɔmaa menyia ndinli megyinla zo.<verse eid="PSA 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 31:9" />Nwu me anwunvɔne, O Nana Nyamenle, ɔluakɛ mewɔ anwongyelelɛ kpole nu; me nye ɛbɔ tɔɔ, O medɔ donvula. <verse eid="PSA 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 31:10" />Alɔbɔlɛ ɛyi me tɛkɛɛ; ɛzunlɛ ngome ɛmaa me ngoane zo ɛde. Nyanenwunlɛ ngome ɛmaa me nwo ɛgolo me; me agbɔkɛ nu ɛtuto bɔkɔɔ. <verse eid="PSA 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 31:11" />Meyɛ amgbuzilɛ baka memaa me kpɔvolɛma, bɔbɔ menli mɔɔ de bikye me la. Me gɔnwo mɔ ɛnriandi ɛgyakyi me; menli mɔɔ ze me la ɛnɛ sulo me. <verse eid="PSA 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 31:12" />Awie biala arɛle ɛvi me, kɛ asɛɛ mewu la; meyɛ kɛ ɛyɛba mɔɔ ɛdɔ aze ɛbɔ la. <verse eid="PSA 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 31:13" />Menli ɛlɛyɛ huhuhuhu wɔ me nwo; me nwo ɛha ɛzulolɛ ɛmaa bɛ. Bɛlɛfa me nwo akpame; bɛkpondɛ adenle bɛapɛ me ngoane zo.<verse eid="PSA 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 31:14" />Noko akee melɛ diedi wɔ wɔ nu, O Nana Nyamenle. Meka mesi zo kɛ, “Wɔmɔ a ɛle me Nyamenle a.” <verse eid="PSA 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 31:15" />Me ngoane wɔ ɛ sa nu dahuu: die me fi me kpɔvolɛma, nee bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkyi me kɔkɔkɔkɔ la asa anu. <verse eid="PSA 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 31:16" />Yeye ɛ ti akunlu na die wɔ akɛlɛ; die me wɔ wɔ anwunvɔnezelɛ ti. <verse eid="PSA 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 31:17" />Mebodo mɛsɛlɛ wɔ, O Nana Nyamenle; mmamaa nyiane ku me. Maa me kpɔvolɛma bɛ munzule ɛbɔ bɛ ti zo, na bɛwu foo. <verse eid="PSA 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 31:18" />Maa adalɛ nabalabama ɛdɔ mumule, bɛmɛ mɔɔ bɛdi tenlenema anwo dasewia a.<verse eid="PSA 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 31:19" />O Awulae, wɔ atiakunlukpalɛ ne mɔɔ ɛyɛ ɛmaa menli mɔɔ sonle wɔ la le kpole! Wɔ atiakunlukɛnlɛma ne mɔɔ ɛyɛ ɛmaa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ die wɔ di la le kpole!<verse eid="PSA 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 31:20" />Ɛdie wɔ diedima ɛfi bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛfa bɛ nwo adwenle ɛtane la asa anu; na ɛfa bɛ ɛfea ɛ ndɛba abo; ɛfa bɛ ɛfea, na ɛmmaa munzule ɛnloanlɛ ɛnga bɛ. <verse eid="PSA 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 31:21" />Nyilalɛ ɛha Nana Nyamenle! Ɔluakɛ yemaa menwu ye nwanwane atiakunlukpalɛ ne, wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ me kpɔvolɛma bɔle me nwo mgbɔlɛka yiale la! <verse eid="PSA 31:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 31:22" />Meandwenle meangɔ moa na meaha kɛ, “Awulae ɛye ɔ nye wɔ me nwo zo.” Noko akee ɛnee yede me ne; na ɔliele me ɔvile nyanenwunlɛ nu.<verse eid="PSA 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 31:23" />O, bɛhulo Nana Nyamenle, bɛmɛ anwodelɛma. Ɔluakɛ Awulae di nɔhalɛdivoma adane; na ɔtea amemaabɛnwozovoma kɛmɔ ɔfɛta la. <verse eid="PSA 31:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 31:24" />Bɛnyia akɛnrazilɛ, bɛmɛ mɔɔ bɛdie Nana Nyamenle bɛdi la; bɛgyinla kpundii.<verse eid="PSA 31:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="PSA 32" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 32</para>
  <para style="s1">Mɔɔ bɛva ye ɛtane bɛhyɛ ye la ye anyelielɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 32:1" />Nyilalɛ totohyia ɛha bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛnyia ɛtanefakyɛ la! Anyelielɛ kpole ɛha bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkyikyi bɛ ɛtane bɔkɔɔ la! <verse eid="PSA 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 32:2" />Nyilalɛ ɛha bɛdabɛ mɔɔ Nana Nyamenle ɛva bɛ ɛtane ɛhyɛ bɛ, na bɛhwe bɛ nwo bɛvi ɛtaneyɛlɛ nwo bɔkɔɔ la.<verse eid="PSA 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 32:3" />Mekɛ mɔɔ ɛnee metɛdale me ɛtane ali la, me ngoane zo dele yɛle ekyii bie. <verse eid="PSA 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 32:4" />Ɛnee wɔ ndeanlɛ ne wɔ me nwo zo, O Awulae, alehyenlɛ nee aledwolɛ muala. Na me nɔhalɛ mɔɔ menli la vale me hɔle ngyegyelɛ nu, na alɔbɔlɛ kpole hunle me. <verse eid="PSA 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 32:5" />Akee menganle me ɛtane mengilele wɔ; na meanva me ɛtane meanvea bieko. Menzele kɛ, “Meka me ɛtane kpokpoti meahile Awulae.” Na wɔmɔ wɔva me ɛtane wɔhyɛ me amgba; wɔnrinzi me ɛtane kpokpoti.<verse eid="PSA 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 32:6" />Ɛhye ati a bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛdie wɔ bɛdi la, ɔwɔ kɛ bodo sɛlɛ wɔ wɔ anwongyelelɛ mekɛ nu la: nɔhalɛ nu, saa azukpole bɔbɔ yi a, ɔnrɛhola yɛ fa.<verse eid="PSA 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 32:7" />Wɔmɔ a ɛle me feabelɛ a; ɛbɔ me nwo bane ɛfi munzule nu. Memaa me ne zo meyeyɛ wɔ, ɔluakɛ wɔmɔ a ɛdie me ngoane a. <verse eid="PSA 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 32:8" />“Mebahilehile wɔ,” Awulae a se a, “Na meamaa wɔanwu adenle mɔɔ ɔwɔ kɛ ɛfa zo la; mebava me nye meabɔ ɛ nwo mgbɔlɛka. <verse eid="PSA 32:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 32:9" />Bɛmmamaa bɛyɛ kɛ mgbɔnwɔ anzɛɛ nlankɛ mɔɔ bɛnze nrɛlɛbɛ, mɔɔ wɔando adabɛlaka nee ɔ nwo nyɛma bɛ kɔme nu a ɛtwe bɛ a bɛngɔ la.”<verse eid="PSA 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 32:10" />Alɔbɔlɛ somaa ne ala ku amumuyɛvoma; na emomu Nana Nyamenle fa ye anwunvɔnezelɛ ne bɔ bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛfa bɛ rɛle bɛwula ye nu la anwo bane. <verse eid="PSA 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 32:11" />Bɛli fɛlɛko wɔ Awulae nu, na bɛmaa bɛ nye ɛlie, O bɛmɛ tenlenema. Ɔlua mɔɔ Nana Nyamenle ɛyɛ la ati, bɛva anyelielɛ bɛdeɛdea nu, O bese mɔɔ bɛ ahonle nu te a!<verse eid="PSA 32:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="PSA 33" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 33</para>
  <para style="s1">Maanle ngazo Edwɛndolɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 33:1" />Bɛli fɛlɛko wɔ Nana Nyamenle nu, O tenlenema; bɛva anyelielɛ bɛdeɛdea nu bɛmaa ye wɔ mɔɔ yeyɛ yemaa bɛ la anwo. Bɛhanvo ye, bɛmɛ mɔɔ bɛsonle ye a. <verse eid="PSA 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 33:2" />Bɛva getae bɛye Nana Nyamenle ayɛlɛ; bɛva bɛ-sa-nu sanwunle mɔɔ zolɛ nyɛma bulu la bɛdo edwɛne bɛye ye ayɛlɛ. <verse eid="PSA 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 33:3" />Bɛdo edwɛne fofolɛ bɛmaa ye; bɛva anyelielɛ kpole bɛbɔ ye amodinli.<verse eid="PSA 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 33:4" />Ɔluakɛ Nana Nyamenle anloa edwɛkɛ le nɔhalɛ; yɛɛ ɔ sa anloa gyima noko di munli. <verse eid="PSA 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 33:5" />Nana Nyamenle kulo nyɛleɛ tenlene nee ndɛnebualɛ; ye ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne ɛyi azɛlɛ ye tɛkɛɛ. <verse eid="PSA 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 33:6" />Ɔlua Awulae anloa edwɛkɛ zo, yɛɛ bɛbɔle anwuma anwuma, nee mɔɔ wɔ nu la amuala a. <verse eid="PSA 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 33:7" />Ɔdaye a ɔbɔle nyevimgbole, na ɔpɛle mbula ɔziele bɛ nu a.<verse eid="PSA 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 33:8" />Bɛzulo Nana Nyamenle, bɛmɛ aleɛabo amra! Bɛbɔ bɛ ti aze bɛzonle ye, bɛmɛ ewiade amra! <verse eid="PSA 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 33:9" />Ɔluakɛ ɔlua ɔ nloa edwɛkɛ zo a bɛyɛle debie biala a; ye tumi nu a debie biala vi rale a. <verse eid="PSA 33:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 33:10" />Nana Nyamenle maa maanle maanlema akpamevalɛ yɛ gyɛne; ɔmmaa bɛngola bɛnva bɛ adwenle nzuzulɛ ɛtane ne bɛnli gyima. <verse eid="PSA 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 33:11" />Nana Nyamenle ngyehyɛlɛ ne mɔ wɔ ɛkɛ ne dahuu; ye adwenle nzuzulɛ ɛngakyi ɛlɛ.<verse eid="PSA 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 33:12" />Nyilalɛ ɛha maanle ne mɔɔ Nana Nyamenle le ye Awulae la; nyilalɛ ɛha menli ne mɔɔ yeva bɛ yeyɛ ye deɛ la! <verse eid="PSA 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 33:13" />Nana Nyamenle nwu awie biala vi ye anwuma anwuma lɔ. <verse eid="PSA 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 33:14" />Ɔde ye belemgbunli ebia ne azo, na ɔnwu awie biala mɔɔ wɔ azɛlɛ ye azo la. <verse eid="PSA 33:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 33:15" />Yemɔ a bɔle awie ko biala, na ɔze nuhua ko biala ye nyɛleɛ a.<verse eid="PSA 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 33:16" />Belemgbunli azogya ekpunli ekpunli mɔɔ ɔlɛ bɛ la, ɛngile ye konimlilɛ wɔ konle nu. Katakyie ɛnlua anwosesebɛ kpole mɔɔ ɔlɛ ye la azo ɛnlie ɔ nwo. <verse eid="PSA 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 33:17" />Adu nee ndumunli le mgbane wɔ konimlilɛ nu; ngoanelielɛ biala ɛnle bɛ nu.<verse eid="PSA 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 33:18" />Nana Nyamenle anye wɔ bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛdie ye bɛdi la anwo zo; ɔnea bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛva bɛ rɛle bɛwula ye anwunvɔnezelɛ nu la boɛ. <verse eid="PSA 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 33:19" />Ɔdie bɛ ɔfi ewule nu; ɔmmaa bɛnhwele bɛ ngoane wɔ ɛhɔne mekɛ nu. <verse eid="PSA 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 33:20" />Yɛfa yɛ rɛle yɛwula Nana Nyamenle nu; yemɔ yɛɛ ɔle yɛ sinzavolɛ nee yɛ boavolɛ a. <verse eid="PSA 33:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 33:21" />Yɛdi fɛlɛko wɔ Awulae nu; ɔluakɛ yeva yɛ rɛle nee yɛ ahonle yewula ye duma nwuanzanwuanza ne anu. <verse eid="PSA 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 33:22" />Maa wɔ anwunvɔnezelɛ ne ɛrɛla yɛ nwo zo, O Nana Nyamenle; kɛmɔ yɛ diedi ne mɔɔ wɔ wɔ nu la de la.<verse eid="PSA 33:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="PSA 34" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 34</para>
  <para style="s1">Ayɛlɛyelɛ Edwɛne mɔɔ bɛfa bɛsɛlɛ Ɛpepɛlielɛ la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 34:1" />Mebahanvo Nana Nyamenle dahuu; mebahanvo ye anyunlunyia nee ye ɛlolɛ ne dahuu biala. <verse eid="PSA 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 34:2" />Mebahanvo Nana Nyamenle wɔ mɔɔ yeyɛ yemaa me la anwo; amaa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛlɛdi nyane la ade bie, na bɛ rɛle akyekye. <verse eid="PSA 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 34:3" />Bɛmaa yɛbɔ nu yɛhanvo Nana Nyamenle ye bɛdevinliyɛlɛ ne; bɛmaa yɛyɛ ko yɛyeyɛ ye duma ne!<verse eid="PSA 34:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 34:4" />Ɔluakɛ menzunle menvɛlɛle Nana Nyamenle, na ɔdiele me; ɔliele me ɔvile me ɛzulolɛ muala anu. <verse eid="PSA 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 34:5" />Bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛwɔ akɛlɛyɛlɛ bo la kpondɛ ɔ nzi adenle, na bɛdi fɛlɛko. Ɔnye bɛ rɛle ɔndo bɛ sa nu ɛlɛ. <verse eid="PSA 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 34:6" />Ehyianli su fɛlɛ Nana Nyamenle, na ɔtie ye; ɔdie ye ɔfi ngyegyelɛ nu. <verse eid="PSA 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 34:7" />Ye anwumabɔvolɛma sinza bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛtie ɔ ne la; na ɔpepɛ ɔdie bɛ ɔfi munzule nu.<verse eid="PSA 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 34:8" />O, bɛzɔ Nana Nyamenle atiakunlukpalɛyɛlɛ ne bɛnlea! Nyilalɛ ɛha bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛdie ye bɛdi la. <verse eid="PSA 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 34:9" />O Nana Nyamenle anwodelɛma, bɛzulo Awulae; ɔluakɛ debie biala ɛngyia bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛsulo ye la. <verse eid="PSA 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 34:10" />Ehyia nee ɛhɔne tɔ awenade kunlu; noko bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛsonle Awulae la ɛdeɛ, debie biala ɛngyia bɛ ɛlɛ.<verse eid="PSA 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 34:11" />Bɛrɛla, me mra; bɛradie me! Na mebahile bɛ kɛ ɔwɔ bɛsi bɛdi Awulae eni, na bɛsulo ye la. <verse eid="PSA 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 34:12" />Bɛ nuhua ne boni yɛɛ ɛngulo ngoane tendenle a? Nwane a ɛngulo kɛ ɔkɛdɛnla aze ɔkɛhyɛ na ɔkɛli fɛlɛko a? <verse eid="PSA 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 34:13" />Ɛnee noko bɛli bɛ tafinlima eni, na bɛgyakyi adalɛbɔlɛ. <verse eid="PSA 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 34:14" />Bɛhwe bɛ nwo bɛvi ɛtaneyɛlɛ nwo, na bɛyɛ kpalɛ; bɛkpondɛ anzondwolɛ bo zo, na bɛli ɔ nzi.<verse eid="PSA 34:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 34:15" />Nana Nyamenle anye wɔ tenlenema anwo zo dahuu; ɔbuke ɔ nzo ɔtie bɛ ɛzunlɛ. <verse eid="PSA 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 34:16" />Emomu ɔ nye sa ɛtanevolɛma; ɔminli bɛ bo zo bɔkɔɔ mɔɔ bɛngakye bɛ ɛlɛ a. <verse eid="PSA 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 34:17" />Tenlenema su fɛlɛ Nana Nyamenle, na ɔdaye noko ɔtie bɛ; ɔpepɛ ɔdie bɛ wɔ bɛ ɛvɛlɛ muala anu.<verse eid="PSA 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 34:18" />Nana Nyamenle dahuu bikye bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛ rɛle ɛbɔ la; ɔdie bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛnlɛ anyelazo biala la ngoane. <verse eid="PSA 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 34:19" />Tenlenenli biala anwo ɛmkpa anwongyelelɛ nu ɛlɛ; noko akee Nana Nyamenle ye ye fi ɔ muala anu. <verse eid="PSA 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 34:20" />Ɔfa ye ɔsie kpalɛ, ammaa yeamkpɔlɔ; ɔmmaa ye mbowule ne mɔ anu ko bɔbɔ anwo ɛmbu ɛbonle.<verse eid="PSA 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 34:21" />Ɛtaneyɛlɛ bahu atiakunlunwonlema: na bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkyi tenlenema la bɛmɛ bɛbabua bɛ ndɛne fɔlɛ. <verse eid="PSA 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 34:22" />Nana Nyamenle balie ye menli ngoane; na bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛfa bɛ rɛle bɛwula ye nu la ɛdeɛ, bɛnrɛbua bɛ ndɛne fɔlɛ.<verse eid="PSA 34:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="PSA 35" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 35</para>
  <para style="s1">Anwoazehanlɛ modolɛ mɔɔ bɛfa bɛsɛlɛ Ɛpepɛlielɛ la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 35:1" />Ko me ti konle maa me, O Nana Nyamenle; ɛ nee bɛdabɛ mɔɔ nee me di apelepele la ɛli ye ɛnwonle nu. <verse eid="PSA 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 35:2" />Fa wɔ konle tɛladeɛ ne wula, fa wɔ etu ne ndɛndɛ; na ɛlɔne ɛlɛfa me aze. <verse eid="PSA 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 35:3" />Gua ndumunli nee etu awolɛ wɔ wɔ etu ne anu, na ko die me. Bɔ me ɛwɔkɛ se me kɛ, ɛle me ngoanedievolɛ. <verse eid="PSA 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 35:4" />Maa anyiemgba nee nyiane ɛha bɛdabɛ mɔɔ kpondɛ me azɛkye me la; maa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛva me ti akpame la bɛ adwenle ɛyɛ bɛ tindaanwu, na bɛhakyi bɛ adwenle. <verse eid="PSA 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 35:5" />Maa bɛyɛ kɛ ɛhonle mɔɔ anwoma ɛlɛbɔ bɛ la; na maa Nana Nyamenle anwumabɔvolɛma ɛsɛla bɛ nu. <verse eid="PSA 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 35:6" />Maa bɛ adenle nu ɛyɛ awozinli kabii, na nuhua noko ɛyɛ teteletetele; maa Nana Nyamenle anwumabɔvolɛ ɛdi bɛ aze. <verse eid="PSA 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 35:7" />Ɔluakɛ metɛyɛle bɛ ɛtane biala; noko akee bɛzua me gyakɛ abo ɛhane. Bɛpɛ kuma me gyakɛ abo; bɛkpondɛ bɛaha me bɛado nu. <verse eid="PSA 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 35:8" />Maa bɛnwu bɛ nyunlu kpole kpalɛ; na bɛdabɛ bɛ munzule ɛbɔ bɛ ti zo.<verse eid="PSA 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 35:9" />Maa menli fɛlɛko wɔ Nana Nyamenle nu; maa menyia anyelielɛ wɔ me ngoanedievolɛ ne nu. <verse eid="PSA 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 35:10" />Mefa me ahonle nu moyɛlɛ kpalɛ memaa wɔ. Awie biala ɛnle ɛkɛ, O Nana Nyamenle, mɔɔ ɔ nee wɔ dwudwu a ɔkɛhola wɔ a. Wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛdie mɔɔ ye anwosesebɛ ɛwie la ɛfi anwosesebɛvolɛ asa anu a; wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛdie ehyianli ɛfi akɛlɛyɛlɛ nu a.<verse eid="PSA 35:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 35:11" />Adalɛ nabalabama dwazo me ti zo; na bɛdi dasewia bɛtia me. <verse eid="PSA 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 35:12" />Meyɛ bɛ kpalɛ a, bɛfa ɛtane bɛtua me kakɛ; ɛhye maa me ɛkɛla di nyane kɔ ewule nu. <verse eid="PSA 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 35:13" />Na mame ɛdeɛ, saa anwonyane bɔ bɛ a, mekeda ɛzɛne ɛdanlɛ; mekye me nwo ɛhɔne, na mesɛlɛ memaa bɛ. <verse eid="PSA 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 35:14" />Meyɛ asɔne memaa bɛ kɛ asɛɛ bɛle me gɔnwo mɔ, anzɛɛ me mediema la. Mekye me nwo ɛhɔne meyɛ asɔne, kɛ asɛɛ sonla mɔɔ ɔ nli ɛwu la. <verse eid="PSA 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 35:15" />Noko akee saa edwɛkɛ to me a, bɛkuohua bɛ nloa ɛleka ko na bɛdi fɛlɛko. Nɔhalɛ nu, anzulo Nyamenlema ne mɔ di ahua; na bɛdwazo me nwo zo bɛsi me amgbu; bɛbo me na bɛyɛ me ayɛkayɛkadeɛ. <verse eid="PSA 35:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 35:16" />Adalɛ nabalabama ne mɔ dwazo si me ti zo agole; bɛdi me nane kɛ mgbɔtɛ ɛnyia deɛfunli bie ɛlɛdi la.<verse eid="PSA 35:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 35:17" />Ɛbadɛnla ɛkɛ wɔanlea ɛhye dahuu ɔ, O Awulae? Die me fi bɛ deɛzɛkyelɛ ɛsalɛ ne mɔ anu; die me ngoane fi ahodiawu ɛhye mɔ ngane ne mɔ anu; <verse eid="PSA 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 35:18" />amaa meaye wɔ ayɛlɛ wɔ wɔ diedima anyunlu; na meahanvo wɔ meahile maanle maanle.<verse eid="PSA 35:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 35:19" />Mmamaa metɔ aze, na me kpɔvolɛma adalɛ nabalabama di nwolɛ fɛlɛko. Eza noko mmamaa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkyi me la adenle maa bɛbubu me anyehoanlɛ mgbane mgbane. <verse eid="PSA 35:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 35:20" />Ɔluakɛ bɛnli anzondwolɛ nee koyɛlɛ nwo adwelie: Na emomu, bɛdwenle adwenle ɛtane ɛtane bɛtia bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkpondɛ anzondwolɛ, nee koyɛlɛ bo zo la. <verse eid="PSA 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 35:21" />Bɛtendɛ bɛtia me. Ɛhɛe, bɛtendɛ bɛtia me bɛse kɛ, “Yɛdayɛ yɛnwu ye yɛ nye amu nwiɔ.” <verse eid="PSA 35:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 35:22" />O Nana Nyamenle, wɔmɔ ɛze ninyɛne muala; mmayɛ ɛ nloa kpulu wɔ ɛhye mɔ anwo. Mmagyakyi me ɛkɔ moa, O Awulae!<verse eid="PSA 35:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 35:23" />Kɛha ɛ nwo, O Awulae, na pepɛ die me! Dwazo, na di me ti edwɛkɛ maa me, me Nyamenle nee me Awulae. <verse eid="PSA 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 35:24" />Bua me ndɛne benle, O Nana Nyamenle me Nyamenle, kɛmɔ wɔ tenlene ne de la; na mmamaa bɛdi me azedɔlɛ nwo fɛlɛko. <verse eid="PSA 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 35:25" />Mmamaa bɛka ye wɔ bɛ ahonle nu kɛ, “Yɛnyia bie yɛyɛ ye!” Mmamaa bɛse kɛ, “Mɔɔ yɛkpondɛ yɛayɛ ye la a yɛwie ye yɛ la!”<verse eid="PSA 35:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 35:26" />Tudu me kpɔvolɛma agye, na maa nyiane ɛhu bɛ; maa anyiemgba ɛha bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛmbu me bie la. <verse eid="PSA 35:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 35:27" />Maa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛ nye sɔ me tenleneyɛlɛ ne la ɛli fɛlɛko; ɛhɛe, maa bɛha ye dahuu kɛ, “Nyilalɛ ɛha Nana Nyamenle!” Yemɔ mɔɔ ɔ nye sɔ ye akɛlɛ tenlene gyima kpalɛ nwo a. <verse eid="PSA 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 35:28" />Na akee mebahanvo wɔ tenleneyɛlɛ ne dahuu; mebaye wɔ ayɛlɛ alehyenlɛ nee aledwolɛ muala.<verse eid="PSA 35:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="PSA 36" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 36</para>
  <para style="s1">Amumuyɛvoma bɛ ninyɛmunli ne mɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 36:1" />Ɛtane tendɛ kile ɛtanevolɛ wɔ ye ahonle nu: Ɔmaa ɔkpo Nana Nyamenle, na ɔmbu ye bie. <verse eid="PSA 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 36:2" />Ɔbu ɔ nwo somaa somaa; ɔdwenle ye ɔ ti anu kɛ, Nana Nyamenle ɛnrɛnwu yɛ ɛtane ne, na yeamaa yɛ nwolɛ ndeanlɛ. <verse eid="PSA 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 36:3" />Ɔ nloa nu edwɛkɛ le adalɛ nee nzisi ngome; ɔnli kpalɛyɛlɛsɛm; ɔnyɛ nrɛlɛbɛde. <verse eid="PSA 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 36:4" />Ɔla bɔbɔ a ɛtane nee amumuyɛ adwenle a ɔfa a; ɔnyɛ debie kpalɛ ɛlɛ, ɔmkpo ɛtane ɛlɛ.<verse eid="PSA 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 36:5" />Wɔ anwunvɔnezelɛ ne le totohyia molozo; wɔ nɔhalɛlilɛ ne le bedevinli bɔkɔɔ. <verse eid="PSA 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 36:6" />Wɔ pɛpɛlilɛ gyi ye kpundii kɛ boka la; wɔ ndɛnebualɛ le kɛ azule mɔɔ ɛdenrɛ la: Nana Nyamenle, wɔmɔ a ɛnea dasanli nee nyɛmoa kpokpoti anwo zo a. <verse eid="PSA 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 36:7" />O Nana Nyamenle, wɔ ɛhulolɛ sonle bolɛ amgba; ɛhye ati a aleɛabo amra nriandi bafea ɛ ndɛba kpole ne abo la. <verse eid="PSA 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 36:8" />Wɔ aako nu ɛkponledolɛ yi bɛ ko tetɛkɛɛ; ɛmaa bɛno wɔ azudenle ne mɔɔ maa ahonle dwo fɔɔnwo la bie.<verse eid="PSA 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 36:9" />Ɔluakɛ wɔmɔ a le ngoane baka ne a; na wɔ Kɛnlaneɛ ne a maa yɛ wienyi a. <verse eid="PSA 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 36:10" />O maa wɔ ahunlunyele ne ɛhɔ zo ɛmaa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛsonle wɔ dahuu la; na maa wɔ tenleneyɛlɛ ne ɛdɛnla bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛdie wɔ bɛdi la bɛ ahonle nu.<verse eid="PSA 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 36:11" />Mmamaa anwomemaazovoma adenle ɛmaa bɛbikye me; anzɛɛ mmamaa atiakunlutanevolɛma maa menriandi megyakyi wɔ. <verse eid="PSA 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 36:12" />Nea kɛ amumuyɛvoma ɛlɛtete agua aze bie a! Bɛtete bɛgua aze mɔɔ bɛnrɛhola dwazo bieko ɛlɛ a.<verse eid="PSA 36:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="PSA 37" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 37</para>
  <para style="s1">Anwodelɛnli akpanyima bie dasevolɛ nɔhavo nee nrɛlɛbɛvolɛ ne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 37:1" />Mmamaa atiakunlutanevolɛma maa wɔ adwenle yɛ wɔ kesee; mmamaa menli mɔɔ bɔ ɛbɛla ɛtane la anwonyia yɛ wɔ anyebolo. <verse eid="PSA 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 37:2" />Ɔluakɛ ɔngyɛ na bɛapepɛ bɛ bɛagua aze kɛ mbaka la. Ɔngyɛ na bɛayela wee kɛ ndile la. <verse eid="PSA 37:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 37:3" />Emomu, fa ɛ rɛle wula Nana Nyamenle nu, na yɛ kpalɛ; maa Awulae ɛyɛ wɔ debie biala, na ɛ nloa anu aleɛ ɛnrɛbɔ wɔ.<verse eid="PSA 37:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 37:4" />Maa ɛ nye ɛlie wɔ Nana Nyamenle anu; na ɔbava wɔ ahonle nu ɛbizalɛndeɛ yeamaa wɔ. <verse eid="PSA 37:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 37:5" />Tu ɛ nwo wula Nana Nyamenle asa; fa ɛ rɛle wula ye nu, na ɔbaboa wɔ. <verse eid="PSA 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 37:6" />Ɔbamaa wɔ tenleneyɛlɛ ne ala ali wɔ awie biala anyunlu. Ɔbade ɛ nwo saanwu kɛ sɛnzɛngyinla ewia mɔɔ ɛsɛnla la.<verse eid="PSA 37:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 37:7" />Si abotane kendɛ Nana Nyamenle maa ɔdaye ɔli ye gyima; mmamaa ɛ nye bolo bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛ ɛbɛla ɛhɔ bɛ boɛ, anzɛɛ menli mɔɔ ko tɔ zo wɔ ninyɛndane ɛyɛlɛ nu la.<verse eid="PSA 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 37:8" />Mmamaa ɛyavalɛ nee adwenledwenle komo ɛ nwo zo; bɛfa sonla bɛkɔ ɛfonlanlɛ nu. <verse eid="PSA 37:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 37:9" />Ɔluakɛ bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛsonle Nana Nyamenle la, banyia nyilalɛ kpole; na ɛtanevolɛma ɛdeɛ, bɛbaye bɛ bɛavi azɛlɛ ye azo bɔkɔɔ. <verse eid="PSA 37:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 37:10" />Ɔnrɛhyɛ biala, ɛnee atiakunlutanevolɛma ɛminli azɛlɛ ye azo; ɛnee ɛkpondɛ bɛ a ɛnnwu bɛ. <verse eid="PSA 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 37:11" />Azɛlɛ ye bayɛ mɛlɛbɛnwoazema deɛ; na bɛbanyia anyelielɛ nee anzondwolɛ kpole.<verse eid="PSA 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 37:12" />Amumuyɛvoma pepɛ tenlenema agyakɛ anzi; dahuu bɛtu bɛ nloa bɛgua bɛ nwo zo. <verse eid="PSA 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 37:13" />Noko akee Awulae yemɔ ɛzelekɛ ala a ɔsele bɛ a; ɔluakɛ ɔze kɛ bɛ mekɛ ɛha ekyi bie ala. <verse eid="PSA 37:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 37:14" />Atiakunlutanevolɛma twe bɛ adu nee nrɛlande wɔ ehyiavolɛma anwo zo; bɛdwazo tenlenema anwo zo kɛ bɛkɛhu bɛ. <verse eid="PSA 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 37:15" />Noko akee bɛ adu ne mɔ batoto ahu bɛdabɛ mumua ne, na bɛ nrɛlande ne mɔ abodɛboda bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 37:16" />Tenlenenli agyapadeɛ mɔɔ le ekyi bɔbɔ la, sonle bolɛ tɛla amumuyɛvoma dɔɔnwo ɛdeɛ mɔɔ bɛva bɛbɔ nu la. <verse eid="PSA 37:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 37:17" />Ɔboalekɛ, amumuyɛvoma anwosesebɛ ɛdeɛ ne babɔ aze; na bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛsonle Nana Nyamenle la lɛ anwosesebɛ dahuu.<verse eid="PSA 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 37:18" />Nana Nyamenle anye wɔ bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛdi ye mɛla zo la anwo zo; na bɛ nzi senle ɛnrɛnlu ɛlɛ. <verse eid="PSA 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 37:19" />Saa ɔdwu ye kpɔmgbɔse bɔbɔ a, bɛnrɛnwu bɛ nyunlu ɛlɛ; bɛ nloa anu aleɛ ɛnrɛbɔ bɛ ɛlɛ wɔ sane mekɛ nu. <verse eid="PSA 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 37:20" />Noko akee ɛtanevolɛma bahwele bɛ ngoane; Nana Nyamenle kpɔvolɛma bayela wee kɛ nya, na bɛ bo zo baminli kɛ esike la. <verse eid="PSA 37:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 37:21" />Atiakunlusesebɛvolɛ biza bosea a, ɔndua; na tenlenenli yemɔ ɔse anwunvɔne, na ɔgo ɔ sa. <verse eid="PSA 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 37:22" />Bɛdabɛ mɔɔ Awulae yila bɛ la, yɛɛ azɛlɛ ye bayɛ bɛ deɛ a; na bɛdabɛ mɔɔ ye ɛyavalɛ wɔ bɛ nwo zo la abo zo babɔ bɔkɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 37:23" />Nana Nyamenle kile sonla adenle mɔɔ ɔwɔ kɛ ɔfa zo a; na ɔwowa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛyɛ ye ɛhulolɛdeɛ la. <verse eid="PSA 37:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 37:24" />Saa bɛtɔ aze bɔbɔ a, bɛnrɛha ɛkɛ ne; ɔboalekɛ Nana Nyamenle badwazo bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 37:25" />Kɛkala mehɔ mgbanyifoa; na sumunli kɛ me gye vile la, metɛnwunle tenlenenli mɔɔ Awulae ɛkpo ye ɛlɛ; anzɛɛ ɔ bo zo amra bie mɔ ɛlɛsɛlɛzɛlɛ aleɛ a. <verse eid="PSA 37:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 37:26" />Ɔse anwunvɔne dahuu, na ɔgo ɔ sa; ɔ bo zo amra ati ɛyɛ boɛ.<verse eid="PSA 37:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 37:27" />Twe ɛ nwo fi ɛtane nwo, na yɛ kpalɛ; amaa wɔanyia ngoane tendenle. <verse eid="PSA 37:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 37:28" />Ɔluakɛ Nana Nyamenle kulo nyɛleɛ tenlene na ɔmkpo ye anwodelɛma amunli. Ɔfa bɛ ɔsie kpalɛ dahuu; na amumuyɛvoma ɛdeɛ, ɔbɔ bɛ bo zo bɔkɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 37:29" />Azɛlɛ ne bayɛ tenlenema deɛ; na bɛbadɛnla zo wɔ melɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ. <verse eid="PSA 37:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 37:30" />Nyamezulolɛnli biala tendɛ nrɛlɛbɛ nu; ɔnva ɔ nye ɔmbua ndɛne. <verse eid="PSA 37:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 37:31" />Ɔdi ye Nyamenle mɛla zo; na ɔngoati nuhua kokye bɔbɔ.<verse eid="PSA 37:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 37:32" />Ɛtanevolɛ tete tenlenenli, na ɔbɔ mɔdenle kɛ ɔkɛhu ye. <verse eid="PSA 37:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 37:33" />Noko akee Nana Nyamenle ɛmmaa ɔ sa ɛnga ye ɛlɛ; yɛɛ ye ndɛnebualɛ mekɛ dwu a, ɔnrɛbu ye fɛlɛ.<verse eid="PSA 37:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 37:34" />Fa ɛ rɛle wula Nana Nyamenle nu, na di ye mɛla zo; ɔbakpogya wɔ zo na yeayila wɔ kosoɛ, kosoɛ! Na ɛtanevolɛma ɛdeɛ, ɔbaminli bɛ bo zo bɔkɔɔ. <verse eid="PSA 37:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 37:35" />Menwu amumuyɛvolɛ tumivolɛ ɛlɛ; ɔhomonle ye menli nwo zo kɛmɔ bɛkomo tukpusi azo wɔ azule bo la. <verse eid="PSA 37:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 37:36" />Noko akee yeangyɛ biala na ye tumi abɔ aze; ɔdɔle aze ɔbɔle kɛ pɛlɛte la. <verse eid="PSA 37:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 37:37" />Tenlenenli yemɔ asolo ye. Anzondwolɛ sonla wu a, ɔ bo zo amra ɛmminli; <verse eid="PSA 37:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 37:38" />na ɛtanevolɛma ɛdeɛ, bɛyela wee ko pɛ. Atiakunlutanevolɛma abo zo bɔ bɔkɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 37:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 37:39" />Tenlenema ngoanelielɛ vi Nana Nyamenle lɔ; yemɔ a ɔpepɛ ɔdie bɛ wɔ ɛvɛlɛ nu a. <verse eid="PSA 37:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 37:40" />Nana Nyamenle boa bɛ, na ɔdie bɛ; ɔdie bɛ ɔfi ɛtanevolɛma asa anu. Ɔluakɛ bɛfa bɛ rɛle bɛwula ye nu.<verse eid="PSA 37:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="PSA 38" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 38</para>
  <para style="s1">Anlubɛnwonyianlɛ Edwɛndolɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 38:1" />O Nana Nyamenle, mmatea me wɔ wɔ ɛyavalɛ mekɛ nu; anzɛɛ mmatwi me nyunlu wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ wɔ ahonle ɛvo anwuma la. <verse eid="PSA 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 38:2" />Wɔ ɛda mbaka ne mɔ ɛbodɛboda me somaa; yɛɛ ɛ sa noko ɛhomo me nwo zo kpole kpalɛ. <verse eid="PSA 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 38:3" />Ɔluakɛ wɔ ɛyavalɛ ne ɛmaa me nwo ɛbubu me; eza me ɛtane dɔɔnwo ne ɛbɔ me anwonyane. <verse eid="PSA 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 38:4" />Me ɛtane somaa ne ɛme me; bɛyɛ adesoa kpole bɛmaa me. <verse eid="PSA 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 38:5" />Me koaseayɛlɛ ɛmaa me nganlɛ ɛkpɔlɔ wɔ me nwo. <verse eid="PSA 38:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 38:6" />Yebubu me yegua, medwazo a ɔnyɛ boɛ; me nye la monle nu alehyenlɛ muala. <verse eid="PSA 38:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 38:7" />Me nwo ɛgolo me; medie adenle meawu. <verse eid="PSA 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 38:8" />Me nwo ɛnyia, ɛvɛlɛ ɛbo me nza; me ɛbolɛ ɛlɛte, me anyelazo ɛwie.<verse eid="PSA 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 38:9" />O Awulae, ɛdawɔ ɛze me ngyianlɛndeɛ muala; ɛze me huutwa huutwa muala abo. <verse eid="PSA 38:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 38:10" />Me ahonle ɛye kpalikpali, yɛɛ me anwosesebɛ ɛwie; eza noko me nye ɛzi bɔkɔɔ. <verse eid="PSA 38:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 38:11" />Ɔlua me nganlɛ ne mɔ ati, me kulovolɛma nee me gɔnwo mɔ ɛmbikye me; me mbusuafo bɔbɔ ɛnɛ ɛnwolo me.<verse eid="PSA 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 38:12" />Me kpɔvolɛma ɛlɛfa me ɛhunlɛ nwo akpame; alehyenlɛ bulu nee ngɔnla, me ɛzekyelɛ nwo adwenle ala a bɛfa a. <verse eid="PSA 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 38:13" />Noko akee mame mɔ, meduodua me nzo; meyɛ kɛ menze mɔɔ ɛlɛkɔ zo a. Meyɛ koonwu kɛ mumule la wɔ bɛ nyunlu. <verse eid="PSA 38:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 38:14" />Meyɛ mumule; mende bie na meabua bie. <verse eid="PSA 38:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 38:15" />O Nana Nyamenle, wɔmɔ a me rɛle wɔ wɔ nu a; bɛla ndɛndɛ, O Awulae, me Nyamenle, na balie me. <verse eid="PSA 38:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 38:16" />Mmamaa me kpɔvolɛma di me azedɔlɛ nwo fɛlɛko; mmamaa bɛka bɛtu bɛ nwo kɛ bɛnyia bie bɛyɛ me.<verse eid="PSA 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 38:17" />Dahuu mewɔ nyanelilɛ nu; akee me azedɔlɛ mekɛ ɛdwu. <verse eid="PSA 38:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 38:18" />Menvea me ɛtane zo bieko; medi nyane wɔ me ahonle nu wɔ me nvonleɛ nwo. <verse eid="PSA 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 38:19" />Me kpɔvolɛma ɛzo, bɛlɛ anwosesebɛ wɔ bɛ nu; bɛgyi ye kpundii dahuu; bɛkpɔ me ɛkpɔlɛ gyɛne ala. Noko akee metɛsele bɛ bu, metɛsele bɛ bɛ. <verse eid="PSA 38:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 38:20" />Bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛfa ɛtane bɛtua kpalɛ kakɛ la le me kpɔvolɛma; ɔluakɛ mame medi kpalɛ nzi.<verse eid="PSA 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 38:21" />Mmaye me rɛle ɛto me sa nu, O Nana Nyamenle; O me Nyamenle, mmagyakyi me ɛkɔ moa! <verse eid="PSA 38:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 38:22" />Bɛla ndɛndɛ; ka ɛ nwo baboa me, O Awulae, me Ngoanedievolɛ.<verse eid="PSA 38:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="PSA 39" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 39</para>
  <para style="s1">Ahonle nu Nzɛlɛlɛ wɔ ɛbɛla ye sikalɛyɛlɛ nee nvasoɛ gyɛne nwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 39:1" />Menzele me nwo kɛ, “Mebanlea me nwo boɛ, ammaa me nloa andwe me angɔ ɛtane nu; mebado me nloa anlenkɛ nu, wɔ melɛ mɔɔ atiakunlutanevolɛma bikye me la.” <verse eid="PSA 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 39:2" />Mendɔle mumule, menyɛle koonwu; menyɛle me nloa kpulu: Meanga edwɛkɛ wɔ mɔɔ le kpalɛ bɔbɔ la anwo! Noko akee me nyanenwunlɛ ne yɛle kpole. <verse eid="PSA 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 39:3" />Me ahonle nyɛma dele wɔ me kunlu. Bɔbɔ mese menrɛdendɛ, noko akee ɛnee mesɔ me nwo a ɔnzɔ; na menzele kɛ: <verse eid="PSA 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 39:4" />“Nana Nyamenle, maa menwu me awieleɛ! Maa menwu me ewule kenle! Saa menrɛnyia ngoane bieko a, maa menwu ye.” <verse eid="PSA 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 39:5" />Wɔde me ngoane zo! Me ngoane tendenle ɛnyianlɛ ɛnle ɛ nye zo ɛhwee. Amgba noko sonla lua ye mgbane. <verse eid="PSA 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 39:6" />Ɔle kɛ ɛlawolɛ la; ye akɔneabalilɛ muala le mgbane. Ɔkpondɛ agyapadeɛ ɔsie, noko akee ɔnze mɔɔ bara arali a. <verse eid="PSA 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 39:7" />Ɛnee akee duzu bɔbɔ a memaa me nye ɛla ye ade a, O Awulae? Wɔmɔ a ɛle me anyelazo a.<verse eid="PSA 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 39:8" />Pepɛ die me fi me ɛtane muala anu; mmamaa ahoasea si me amgbu, na bɛsele me.<verse eid="PSA 39:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 39:9" />Meyɛ koonwu, mendɛ me nloa anu bieko; ɔluakɛ ɛdawɔ a wɔmaa menwu anwubɛnyunlu ɛhye a. <verse eid="PSA 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 39:10" />Mmatea me bieko! Ekyii ne mɔɔ wɔva wɔdea me la bɔbɔ ɛbubu me agbɔkɛ nu bɔkɔɔ. <verse eid="PSA 39:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 39:11" />Ɛnea sonla ye ɛtane nwo na wɔahwe ɔ nzo; yɛɛ ɛtwe mɔɔ ɔ nye die nwo la ɛfi ye nu, kɛmɔ ɛlɛtɛba di ɛdanlɛ sɛkye ye kɛnlɛma ala la. Nɔhalɛ nu, amgba sonla lua ye mgbane!<verse eid="PSA 39:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 39:12" />Tie me nzɛlɛlɛ, O Nana Nyamenle, na yɛ ɛnzolɛ maa me ɛzunlɛ; Mmabu ɛ nye ɛgua me nwo zo. Mele wɔ ɛyɛvolɛ, mele sokoɛvolɛ wɔ azɛlɛ ye azo, kɛmɔ ɛnee egya mɔ de ye la.<verse eid="PSA 39:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 39:13" />Nwu me anwunvɔne, O Awulae; maa menli me mekɛ ekyii kolaa na meavi ewiade ɛhye anu.<verse eid="PSA 39:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="PSA 40" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 40</para>
  <para style="s1">Nana Nyamenle ye ɛhulolɛdeɛyɛlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 40:1" />Menzile abotane mengendɛle Nana Nyamenle; na ɔguale ɔ nzo aze ɔdiele me ɛzunlɛ. <verse eid="PSA 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 40:2" />Ɔyele me ɔvile arɛlebɔlɛ kuma ne anu, na ɔmaanle menvile mɛtɛlɛmɛtɛlɛ ne anu. Ɔziele me azɛlɛ kpalɛ zo, na ɔmaanle me gyakɛ abo zɔle ndinli. <verse eid="PSA 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 40:3" />Yehile me edwɛne fofolɛ mɔɔ mendo a, Nana Nyamenle nganvolɛ edwɛne ne. Dɔɔnwo ne ala banwu ye na bɛazulo ye, na bɛava bɛ rɛle bɛawula Awulae nu. <verse eid="PSA 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 40:4" />Nyilalɛ ɛha bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛfa Nana Nyamenle bɛyɛ bɛ arɛlekyekyevolɛ; na eza bɛnva bɛ nwo bɛmbɔnlebɔnle awozosonvolɛma anwo la.<verse eid="PSA 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 40:5" />O Awulae, me Nyamenle, wɔyɛ nwanwane ninyɛne dɔɔnwo wɔmaa yɛ; awie biala ɛnle ɛkɛ ne mɔɔ tɛla wɔ a! Wɔyɛ damɛnlangoate ngyehyɛlɛ dɔɔnwo wɔmaa yɛ; menrɛhola ɔ muala anwo daselɛ di, ɔluakɛ ɔzonle kɛ ɛnweazo ɛnwea!<verse eid="PSA 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 40:6" />Tɛ azubɔlɛndeɛ nee ahyɛlɛndeɛ a ɛkpondɛ a; tɛ nyɛmoa ɛyelalɛ ahyɛlɛdeɛ, anzɛɛ azubɔlɛ mɔɔ bɛdua zo bɛava ɛtane bɛahyɛ la a sɔ ɛ nye a. Emomu, me nzo yɛɛ wɔbuke kɛ menva mendie wɔ a. <verse eid="PSA 40:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 40:7" />Ɛhye ati membuale kɛ, “Mame ɛne; kɛmɔ ngapezoma ne mɔ amuala hanle ye me nwo la. <verse eid="PSA 40:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 40:8" />O me Nyamenle, mekulo kɛ menwɔyɛ wɔ ɛhulolɛdeɛ! Ɔluakɛ wɔ mɛla ne de me nu dahuu.”<verse eid="PSA 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 40:9" />Wɔ wɔ diedima ne anyunlu, O Nana Nyamenle, mebɔ ye nolo kɛ wɔmɔ a le Ngoanedievolɛ ne a. Ɛdawɔ noko ɛze kɛ menrɛgyakyi ye nolobɔlɛ ɛlɛ. <verse eid="PSA 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 40:10" />Metɛfale ngoanelielɛ edwɛkɛ ne metɛfeale; dahuu mebɔ wɔ nɔhalɛlilɛ ne nee wɔ moalɛ ne anwo nolo. Metɛfale wɔ ɛhulolɛ ne nee wɔ nɔhalɛlilɛ kpundii ne metɛfeale wɔ Ayiaku Kpole ne.<verse eid="PSA 40:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 40:11" />Nana Nyamenle, meze kɛ ɛnrɛgyakyi kɛ ɛkɛze me anwunvɔne. Wɔ ɛhulolɛ ne nee wɔ nɔhalɛlilɛ ne bamaa dahuu meadɛnla ngoane nu. <verse eid="PSA 40:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 40:12" />Ngyegyelɛ ngome ɛbɔ me nwo mgbɔlɛka ɛyia; bɛzonle somaa mɔɔ mengola bɛ tia a! Me ɛtane ɛbo me nwo zo; mengola nwolɛ ɛhwee yɛ bieko. Bɛzonle bɛtɛla me ti enrinli bɔbɔ; ɛhye ati akee me akɛnrazilɛ ɛminli bɔkɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 40:13" />Die me, O Nana Nyamenle! Boa me kɛkala. <verse eid="PSA 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 40:14" />Maa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛbɔ mɔdenle kɛ bɛku me la bɛ munzule ɛbɔ bɛ ti zo; maa bɛ adwenle ɛha ɛbɔ nu. Maa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛlɛdi fɛlɛko wɔ me amaneɛnwunlɛ ne ati la, ɛho ɛhɔ bɛ nzi, na bɛ nyunlu nyiane ɛgua aze. <verse eid="PSA 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 40:15" />Maa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛsi me amgbu la, asa ɛha bɛ gye nu.<verse eid="PSA 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 40:16" />Maa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛba ɛ nwo la amuala ɛli fɛlɛko na bɛ nye ɛlie. Maa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛ nye sɔ wɔ ngoanelielɛ gyima ne la, dahuu ɛva moyɛlɛ ɛha ye kɛ, “Nana Nyamenle tumi le kpole amgba!”<verse eid="PSA 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 40:17" />Me tumi nee me anwosesebɛ ɛwie, O Awulae; noko akee wɔmɔ ɛ rɛle ɛtɛfile me. Wɔmɔ a le me ngoanedievolɛ nee me Nyamenle a; ka ɛ nwo baboa me!<verse eid="PSA 40:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="PSA 41" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 41</para>
  <para style="s1">Ehyiavolɛma bɛ Ngakyelɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 41:1" />Nyilalɛ ɛha bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛse ehyiavolɛma anwunvɔne la; Nana Nyamenle baboa bɛ wɔ bɛ ngyianlɛ nu. <verse eid="PSA 41:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 41:2" />Nana Nyamenle bazinza bɛ, na yeaye bɛ yeavi munzule nu. Ɔbamaa bɛanyia ahomeka wɔ azɛlɛ ne azo; ɔnrɛmaa bɛ kpɔvolɛma asa ɛnrɛha bɛ. <verse eid="PSA 41:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 41:3" />Nana Nyamenle baboa bɛ wɔ bɛ anwodolɛ nu; ɔbamaa bɛade kpɔkɛ.<verse eid="PSA 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 41:4" />Menzele kɛ, “Meyɛ ɛtane metia wɔ, O Nana Nyamenle; nwu me anwunvɔne, na yɛ me ayile.” <verse eid="PSA 41:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 41:5" />Me kpɔvolɛma ɛmbɔ me duma kpalɛ. Bɛ kunlu anu a anrɛɛ mewu, ɛmaa bɛ rɛle ɛvi me. <verse eid="PSA 41:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 41:6" />Bɛdabɛ mɔɔ ba bakpɔla me la ɛnle nɔhavoma; babatiedie me nwo edwɛkɛ ɛtane, na bɛahɔdo bɛakponde. <verse eid="PSA 41:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 41:7" />Me kpɔvolɛma yɛ me nwo huhuhuhu; bɛdwenle me nwo adwenle ɛtane. <verse eid="PSA 41:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 41:8" />Bɛka ye kɛ, “Ɔla Yalɛ Ɛkpa zo; ɔnrɛdwazo bieko ɛlɛ.”<verse eid="PSA 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 41:9" />Agɔnwolɛ kpalɛ bɔbɔ mɔɔ medie ye medi; mɔɔ me nee ye to ɛsalɛ wɔ ɛyɛba ko anu la ɛhakyi ɔ nzi ɛzi me. <verse eid="PSA 41:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 41:10" />Se me anwunvɔne, O Nana Nyamenle, na maa mende kpɔkɛ, amaa meahola ko tia me kpɔvolɛma. <verse eid="PSA 41:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 41:11" />Bɛnrɛhola me nwo zo konim di; ɛkɛ ne yɛɛ mebanwu ye kɛ ɛkulo me edwɛkɛ kpalɛ a. <verse eid="PSA 41:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 41:12" />Ɛbaboa me, ɔluakɛ meyɛ wɔ ɛhulolɛdeɛ; ɛbahwe me wɔabeta ɛ nwo dahuu.<verse eid="PSA 41:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 41:13" />Nyilalɛ ɛha Nana Nyamenle, Yizilayɛ Nyamenle! Anyunlunyia ɛha ye ɛnɛ ɔ nee melɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ la. Ɔyɛ ɛkɛ! Ɔyɛ ɛkɛ!<verse eid="PSA 41:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="PSA 42" />
  <para style="ms">Buluku Mɔɔ Tɔ Zo Nwiɔ</para>
  <para style="mr">
    <ref loc="PSA 42-72">Edw. 42–72</ref></para>
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 42</para>
  <para style="s1">Nana Nyamenle anwo Nzuhɔne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 42:1" />Kɛmɔ weɛlɛ kpɔsa fɛ a, ɔ ti akunlu ba nzule weɛlɛkɔkɔ zo la, zɔhane ala yɛɛ me ɛkɛla ne anwo dɔ wɔ a, O me Nyamenle. <verse eid="PSA 42:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 42:2" />Me ɛkɛla anwo ɛlɛdɔ Nana Nyamenle, Nyamenle ne mɔɔ de aze dahuu la. Kenle nzu bɔbɔ a menwɔhɔ menwɔhɔzonle wɔ Nana Nyamenle anyunlu a? <verse eid="PSA 42:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 42:3" />Alehyenlɛ nee aledwolɛ muala mesu; me aleɛ a le monle ala. Mekɛ ɛhye amuala anu, me kpɔvolɛma biza me kɛ, “Na wɔ Nyamenle ne wɔ nienwu?” <verse eid="PSA 42:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 42:4" />Mekakye dɛba ne mɔɔ medi menli ekpunli ne ati, yɛkɔ Nana Nyamenle sua nu la; ekpunli mɔɔ le fɛlɛkolilɛ, ayɛlɛyelɛ edwɛne nee anyelielɛ ɛlɛkanvo Nana Nyamenle la. <verse eid="PSA 42:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 42:5" />Duzu ati a alɔbɔlɛ kpole ku me a? Duzu ati a melɛnwu amaneɛ a? Mebava me anyelazo meawula Nana Nyamenle nu; na meahanvo ye bieko kɛ, ɔle me pepɛdievolɛ nee me Nyamenle. <verse eid="PSA 42:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 42:6" />O me Nyamenle, me ɛkɛla ɛlɛdi nyane wɔ me nu; ɛhye ati mebahakye wɔ meavi azɛlɛ kɛnlɛma ne mɔɔ Azule Dwɔdan lua zo, na Boka Hɛmɔn nee Boka Mezaa noko gyigyi zo la azo. <verse eid="PSA 42:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 42:7" />Awozinli ɛheda awozinli zo, na alɔbɔlɛ ɛva me aze kɛ azuyilɛ la.<verse eid="PSA 42:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 42:8" />Awulae ɛva ye ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne ɛwula me nu wɔ alehyenlɛ ye anu; ɛhye ati mebado ayɛlɛyelɛ edwɛne meahanvo ye nɔɔzo. Mebazɛlɛ Nana Nyamenle ngoane mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ a.<verse eid="PSA 42:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 42:9" />Mebaze me pepɛdievolɛ Nana Nyamenle kɛ, “Duzu ati a ɛ rɛle ɛvi me ɛ? Duzu ati a ɔwɔ kɛ mekɔ zo medi nyane wɔ me agbɔvolɛ amumuyɛvoma asa anu a?” <verse eid="PSA 42:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 42:10" />Medie bɛ aholoba mevɛ; alehyenlɛ biala bɛbiza me kɛ, “Wɔ Nyamenle ne wɔ nienwu?” <verse eid="PSA 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 42:11" />Duzu ati a alɔbɔlɛ kpole ku me a? Na duzu ati a melɛnwu amaneɛ ɛ? Mebava me anyelazo meawula Nana Nyamenle nu; na meahanvo ye bieko kɛ ɔle me pepɛdievolɛ nee me Nyamenle.<verse eid="PSA 42:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="PSA 43" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 43</para>
  <para style="s1">Edwɛndovolɛ ne ye Diedi Nzɛlɛlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 43:1" />O Nana Nyamenle, ko me ti maa me; die me fi adalɛma nee amiledivoma asa anu. <verse eid="PSA 43:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 43:2" />Wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛle me pepɛdievolɛ a; na duzu ati a wɔkpo me ɛ? Duzu ati a metɛkɔ zo metɛfɛ, wɔ me kpɔvolɛma asa anu a?<verse eid="PSA 43:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 43:3" />Soa wɔ kɛnlaneɛ ne nee wɔ nɔhalɛ ne maa bɛrɛla; maa ɛhye mɔ ɛzinza me. Maa bɛli me nyunlu bɛrɛla wɔ Boka Nwuanzanwuanza ne azo, na membɛla ɛ nwo ɛkɛ ne. <verse eid="PSA 43:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 43:4" />Akee mebahɔ wɔ azukponle ne anwo, O Nana Nyamenle; wɔmɔ mɔɔ me fɛlɛkolilɛ muala zo wɔ a. Mebabɔ sanwunle meado edwɛne meaye wɔ ayɛlɛ, Awulae, me Nyamenle. <verse eid="PSA 43:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 43:5" />Duzu ati a alɔbɔlɛ kpole ku me a? Na duzu ati a melɛnwu amaneɛ ɛ? Mebava me anyelazo meawula Nana Nyamenle nu; na meahanvo ye bieko kɛ ɔle me pepɛdievolɛ nee me Nyamenle.<verse eid="PSA 43:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="PSA 44" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 44</para>
  <para style="s1">Saa ɛkpondɛ Ɛpepɛlielɛ wɔavi Munzule nu a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 44:1" />O Nana Nyamenle, yɛde ye wɔ yɛdayɛ yɛ nzo nu, yɛ nlenyia mɔ noko ɛha ɛhile yɛ, mɔɔ fale ninyɛne mgbole mɔɔ ɛyɛle ye wɔ bɛ mekɛ zo mekɛ tendenle mɔɔ ɛraze ɛhɔ la. <verse eid="PSA 44:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 44:2" />Wɔmɔ ɛvoanle menli mɔɔ ɛnlie wɔ ɛnli la, na ɛzieziele ɛkɛ ne ɛmaanle wɔ diedima; wɔmɔ ɛdeanle maanle gyɛne gyɛne, na ɛmaanle ɛ sa zo ɛmaanle deɛ ne yɛle kpalɛ. <verse eid="PSA 44:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 44:3" />Ɛ sa zo amra ne mɔ anva konlendeɛ yɛɛ bɛhonle bɛliele bɛ maanle ne a. Tɛ bɛdabɛ bɛ tumi, yɛɛ bɛholale bɛvale bɛlile konim ne a; na emomu ɔlua wɔ tumi nee wɔ anwosesebɛ, ɔboka wɔ ɛwɔkɛ mɔɔ ɛbɔle bɛ la azo. Ɛhye yɛɛ akile kɛ ɛkulo bɛ a.<verse eid="PSA 44:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 44:4" />Ɛle me belemgbunli, O Nana Nyamenle; wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛmaa wɔ menli di konim a. <verse eid="PSA 44:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 44:5" />Ɔlua wɔ tumi zo, yɛka yɛ kpɔvolɛma aze fɛɛnye; ɔlua wɔ duma nu yɛɛ yɛkomo yɛ kpɔvolɛma anwo zo a. <verse eid="PSA 44:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 44:6" />Menva me rɛle menwula me ɛda mbaka nu; eza noko tɛ me nrɛlande a balie me ngoane a. <verse eid="PSA 44:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 44:7" />Wɔlie yɛ wɔvi yɛ kpɔvolɛma asa anu; na wɔli bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkpɔ yɛ la anwo zo konim.<verse eid="PSA 44:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 44:8" />Dahuu yɛbaye wɔ duma ayɛlɛ; yɛbayɛ wɔ mo wɔ melɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ. <verse eid="PSA 44:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 44:9" />Kɛkala wɔbu ɛ nye wɔgua yɛ nwo zo; wɔmaa yɛ kpɔvolɛma asa ɛha yɛ; ɛnɛ ɛngo ɛntia yɛ kpɔvolɛma. <verse eid="PSA 44:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 44:10" />Ɛmaanle yɛnriandinle yɛvile yɛ kpɔvolɛma asa anu; ɔlua zo bɛravenle yɛ nwo ninyɛne. <verse eid="PSA 44:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 44:11" />Ɛmaanle bɛhunle yɛ kɛ mboane; ɛbɔle yɛ asande wɔ maanle zo. <verse eid="PSA 44:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 44:12" />Ɛdɔnenle ɛdawɔ wɔ menli ɛlielɛ ezukoa ekyi bie, kɛ asɛɛ ɛdwenle kɛ bɛ nwo ɛnlɛ nvasoɛ kpole biala la. <verse eid="PSA 44:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 44:13" />Yɛ kpalɛzo amra nwu mɔɔ ɛyɛ ɛmaa yɛ la a, bɛsi yɛ amgbu na eza bɛsele yɛ. <verse eid="PSA 44:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 44:14" />Wɔmaa yɛdo ɛzelekɛ aleɛ wɔ maanle maanle nyunlu; bɛnea yɛ a bɛkɔsɔhɔsɔ bɛ ti bɛsele yɛ. <verse eid="PSA 44:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 44:15" />Alehyenlɛ dahuu anyiemgba ka me; nyiane ala a ku me a; <verse eid="PSA 44:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 44:16" />ɔlua aholoba nee ayɛkayɛkadeɛ mɔɔ kile ɛkpɔlɛ nee atiakunlutane la ati.<verse eid="PSA 44:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 44:17" />Ɛhye mɔ amuala ɛsisi wɔ yɛ nwo zo; noko akee yɛ rɛle ɛtɛfile wɔ. Eza noko yɛtɛbulule ngyehyɛlɛ mɔɔ yɛ nee wɔ ɛyɛ la biala azo. <verse eid="PSA 44:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 44:18" />Yɛtɛkpole kɛ yɛnrɛli nɔhalɛ yɛnrɛmaa wɔ; yɛtɛkpole kɛ yɛnrɛli wɔ mɛla zo. <verse eid="PSA 44:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 44:19" />Noko akee wɔgyakyi yɛ wɔmaa yɛdɔ agye wɔ nane anwo ɛzulolɛ sa nu; wɔgyakyi yɛ wɔ awozinli kabikabi nu. <verse eid="PSA 44:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 44:20" />Saa yɛgyakyile kɛ yɛnrɛzonle yɛ Awulae Nyamenle, na yɛzonlenle bozonle gyɛne biala a, <verse eid="PSA 44:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 44:21" />anrɛɛ kɛ ɔkɛyɛ biala la, ɛbanwu ye, ɔluakɛ ɛze yɛ fealera nu edwɛkɛ biala. <verse eid="PSA 44:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 44:22" />Ɔlua wɔmɔ ti yɛɛ dahuu bɛlɛku yɛ a; wɔmɔ ti yɛɛ bɛyɛ yɛ kɛ asɛɛ mboane mɔɔ bɛbahu yɛ la a.<verse eid="PSA 44:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 44:23" />O Awulae, dwazo ɛ! Duzu ati a wɔlafe a? Maa ɛ nwo zo; mmakpo yɛ wɔ melɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ ye awieleɛ la. <verse eid="PSA 44:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 44:24" />Duzu ati a ɛlɛfea ɛ nwo a? Mmamaa ɛ rɛle fi yɛ ɛvɛlɛ nee yɛ amaneɛnwunlɛ. <verse eid="PSA 44:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 44:25" />Yɛ nyunlu ɛbutu azeva nu; yɛ kpɔvolɛma ɛvo yɛ nwo zo. <verse eid="PSA 44:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 44:26" />O Awulae, bɛla baboa yɛ; fa wɔ ɛhulolɛ bedevinli ne die yɛ ngoane.<verse eid="PSA 44:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="PSA 45" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 45</para>
  <para style="s1">Belemgbunli ne Atɔfolɛlielɛ ne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 45:1" />Edwɛkɛ fɛlɛko bie ɛyi me ahonle tɛkɛɛ, mebaha me edwɛkɛ meahile belemgbunli ne; me anwomoalɛ ɛyɛ kɛ kɛlɛhɛlɛvolɛ mɔɔ ɛnyia nwo ɛlɛkɛlɛ la.<verse eid="PSA 45:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 45:2" />Wɔ menli ɛwolaa ne anu, wɔmɔ ala yɛɛ ɛ nwo yɛ fɛ totohyia kpalɛ a; ɛ nloa anu edwɛkɛ biala le ɛlolɛ ngome. Ɛhye ati Nyamenle ɛyila wɔ wɔ melɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ. <verse eid="PSA 45:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 45:3" />Fa wɔ konle dadeɛ ne sia ɛ nwo, belemgbunli katakyie; ɛle anyunlunyiavolɛ wɔ wɔ belemgbunlililɛ nu. <verse eid="PSA 45:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 45:4" />Wɔ wɔ belemgbunlililɛ nu, fa konimlilɛ ko kɔ ɛ nyunlu; maa nɔhalɛlilɛ ɔ nee tenleneyɛlɛ ɛrɛla; maa ɛ nwo ɛzulolɛ ɛla ali. <verse eid="PSA 45:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 45:5" />Wɔ ɛda mbaka ne mɔ yɛ nla kɛ wowole; bɛwowɔ belemgbunli kpɔvolɛma ne mɔ ahonle nu; bɛka maanle maanle bɛwula ɛ gyakɛ abo. <verse eid="PSA 45:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 45:6" />Wɔ belemgbunli ebia nwuanzawuanza ne le damɛnlangoate; yɛɛ wɔ belemgbunlililɛ sɛkɛlɛneɛ ne gyi ɛkɛ maa pɛpɛlilɛ. <verse eid="PSA 45:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 45:7" />Ɛkulo nyɛleɛ tenlene, na ɛkyi atisesebɛyɛlɛ; zɔhane ati a Nyamenle, mɔɔ le wɔ Nyamenle ne la ɛva fɛlɛkolilɛ nwole ɛbia wɔ wɔ menli ɛwolaa ne anu la.<verse eid="PSA 45:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 45:8" />Alufuanlɛ mukumuku ɛva wɔ belemgbunli tɛladeɛ ne amuala; na aweɛnema dahuu bɔ edwɛne wɔ wɔ aako nu maa ɛkɛ ne yɛ anyelielɛ. <verse eid="PSA 45:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 45:9" />Arelemgbunli amra mraalɛ boka mraalɛ mɔɔ sonle wɔ la; ɛ sa fema zo yɛɛ wɔ arelemgbunli mraalɛ ne mɔɔ ɛva Ɔfɛ nvutuke ɛziezie ɔ nwo la gyi a. <verse eid="PSA 45:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 45:10" />O ralɛ raalɛ, yɛ koonwu tie na dwenle ɛ nwo; maa ɛ rɛle ɛvi ɛ nwo amra nee ɛ ze aako nu. <verse eid="PSA 45:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 45:11" />Belemgbunli ne bahulo wɔ edwɛkɛ; ɔluakɛ yemɔ yɛɛ ɔle ɛ menle a; bɔ ɛ ti aze maa ye. <verse eid="PSA 45:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 45:12" />Tayama bava ahyɛlɛndeɛ ara arazɛlɛ moale avi wɔ ɛkɛ; azukoavolɛ mgbole mgbole bava ahyɛlɛndeɛ ngakyile ngakyile arɛlɛ wɔ.<verse eid="PSA 45:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 45:13" />Belemgbunli ara raalɛ ne ɛwula tɛladeɛ mɔɔ nvutuke betɛbeta nu la. <verse eid="PSA 45:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 45:14" />Adɛladeɛ mɔɔ ɔwula la anye le ngakyile ngakyile dɔɔnwo; na ɔ gɔnwo mɔ mbelamunli mraalɛ dedɛ ye, nee ye kɔ belemgbunli anyunlu. <verse eid="PSA 45:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 45:15" />Wɔ fɛlɛkolilɛ nee anyeliele nu yɛɛ bɛ nee ye wolo belemgbunli aako ne anu a. <verse eid="PSA 45:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 45:16" />Ɛ mra bali ɛ ze mɔ agya; bɛmɛ yɛɛ mebayɛ bɛ azɛlɛ ye azo amra anwo zo arelemgbunli a.<verse eid="PSA 45:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 45:17" />Mebamaa bɛahakye wɔ duma wɔ ɛlɔnwɔne kpokpoti anu; na ɔlua zo maanle maanle bahanvo wɔ wɔ melɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ.<verse eid="PSA 45:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="PSA 46" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 46</para>
  <para style="s1">Nana Nyamenle, yɛ Bodane ɔ nee yɛ Anwosesebɛmaavo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 46:1" />Nana Nyamenle le yɛ nriandifeabelɛ nee yɛ anwosesebɛmaavo, ɔle yɛ ndɛndɛ boavolɛ wɔ yɛ ngyianlɛ nu. <verse eid="PSA 46:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 46:2" />Zɔhane ati kanzɛ bɔbɔ azɛlɛ kpusu, awoka wozo wɔ nyevile kunlu, <verse eid="PSA 46:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 46:3" />na nyevile kpudwu, eza ɔbu azɛlɛkye mgbole ɔpɛ awubue a, yɛnrɛzulo.<verse eid="PSA 46:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 46:4" />Azudenle bie wɔ ɛkɛ ne mɔɔ ɔse ɔpɛ nu wɔ Nyamenle sua zo a. Nyamenle Bedevinli ne ye tɛnlabelɛ nwuanzanwuanza ne. <verse eid="PSA 46:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 46:5" />Nyamenle wɔ ye avinli, bɛnrɛhola ɔ bo tu, na Nyamenle baboa ye ndɛndɛ zo. <verse eid="PSA 46:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 46:6" />Maanle maanle fa ɛya dwazo, na bɛko bɛgua; ɔbɔ ɔ ne nu a, ɛnee maanle maanle ɛgua dii.<verse eid="PSA 46:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 46:7" />Ɛlɔne Nana Nyamenle ne nee yɛ a de a; Gyekɔbo Nyamenle ne yɛɛ ale yɛ nriandifeabelɛ a. <verse eid="PSA 46:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 46:8" />Bɛrɛla bɛranlea nwanwane gyima mɔɔ Nana Nyamenle ɛyɛ a; bɛnlea deɛzɛkyelɛ mɔɔ yemaa yera azɛlɛ ye azo a. <verse eid="PSA 46:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 46:9" />Ɔmaa konle konle bɔ aze wɔ aleɛabo ɛleka biala; ɔbubu ɛda mbaka nu dwɔkɔdwɔkɔ na ɔbɔ atwɛ asande; na ɔfa senle ɔyela konlendeɛ dwɛɛ. <verse eid="PSA 46:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 46:10" />“Bɛzie bɛ nwo nane dii, na bɛnwu ye kɛ mame a le Nyamenle a; bɛkpogya me zo wɔ maanle maanle nyunlu, eza bɛkpogya me zo wɔ ewiade amuala.”<verse eid="PSA 46:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 46:11" />Ɛlɔne Nyamenle ne nee yɛ a de a; Gyekɔbo Nyamenle ne a le yɛ nriandifeabelɛ a.<verse eid="PSA 46:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="PSA 47" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 47</para>
  <para style="s1">Belemgbunli ne mɔɔ ɛdu ɛhɔ anwuma la ye Edwɛndolɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 47:1" />Bɛ muala bɛbɔ bɛ sa nu! Bɛva fɛlɛkolilɛ bɛdeɛdea nu bɛdo edwɛne bɛmaa Nana Nyamenle! <verse eid="PSA 47:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 47:2" />Ɔluakɛ Nyamenle Bedevinli ne mɔɔ wɔ anwuma la anwo yɛ ɛzulolɛ, aleɛabo amuala bɛ belemgbunli ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 47:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 47:3" />Ɔbɛlɛ menli muala aze, na ɔfa maanle maanle muala ɔwula yɛ gyakɛ abo. <verse eid="PSA 47:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 47:4" />Yemɔ a ɔsie agya ɔmaa yɛ a; yemɔ mɔɔ ɔvale Gyekɔbo ɔdule ɔ nwo na eza ɔhulole ye la.<verse eid="PSA 47:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 47:5" />Nana Nyamenle ɛva anyelielɛ ɛvo ɛhɔ anwuma; bɛva aweɛne ɛnelɛ bɛ nee Awulae ɛhɔ. <verse eid="PSA 47:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 47:6" />Bɛdo ayɛlɛyelɛ edwɛne bɛmaa Nyamenle, bɛdo ayɛlɛyelɛ edwɛne! Bɛdo ayɛlɛyelɛ edwɛne bɛmaa yɛ Belemgbunli ne. Bɛdo ayɛlɛyelɛ edwɛne! <verse eid="PSA 47:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 47:7" />Ɔluakɛ Nana Nyamenle le ewiade amuala kpokpoti belemgbunli; bɛdo ayɛlɛyelɛ edwɛne bɛye ye ayɛlɛ! <verse eid="PSA 47:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 47:8" />Nana Nyamenle di aleɛabo amuala belemgbunli; Nana Nyamenle de ye belemgbunli ebia nwuanzanwuanza ne azo. <verse eid="PSA 47:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 47:9" />Arelemgbunli mra mrenyia ɛhuohua bɛ nloa kɛ Ebileham ye Nyamenle menli la. Ɔluakɛ ewiade anu konle wowandeɛ kpokpoti le Nana Nyamenle deɛ; yemɔ yɛɛ bɛkpogya ye zo anwuma anwuma a.<verse eid="PSA 47:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="PSA 48" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 48</para>
  <para style="s1">Zayɔn, Belemgbunli ne ye Tɛnlabelɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 48:1" />Nana Nyamenle le kpole, na ɔfɛta nganvolɛ bedevinli wɔ ye Nyamenle sua zo! <verse eid="PSA 48:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 48:2" />Nea kɛ ye boka nwuanzanwuanza ne la ye kɛnlɛma bie a; ɔle aleɛabo amra amuala bɛ anyelielɛ. Boka Zayɔn wɔ sɔlɔ moamoa nehane; belemgbunli kpole ne ye suakpole ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 48:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 48:3" />Sua ne ɛhyelɛ nu da Nyamenle Ɛpepɛlielɛ ne ali. <verse eid="PSA 48:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 48:4" />Ɔluakɛ arelemgbunli ne mɔ huohuanle bɛ nloa; bɛdule bɛ nwo kɛ bɛba sua ne anwo zo. <verse eid="PSA 48:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 48:5" />Na bɛnwunle ye ala la ɔzinle bɛ nwo; bɛ nwo wozole bɛ, bɛguale ɛbɔ nu. <verse eid="PSA 48:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 48:6" />Ɛzulolɛ kpole hanle bɛ wɔ ɛkɛ; na bɛyɛle kɛ mraalɛ mɔɔ ɛvo awolɛ zo la. <verse eid="PSA 48:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 48:7" />Ɔlua anwoma ne mɔɔ vi sɛnzɛne aduduleɛ la azo, ɔbubule meli ne mɔ mɔɔ vi Tahyehye la. <verse eid="PSA 48:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 48:8" />Kɛmɔ yɛdele la, zɔhane ala noko yɛɛ yɛnwunle ye, wɔ sua ne mɔɔ le Ɛlɔne Awulae deɛ la, wɔ sua ne mɔɔ le yɛ Nyamenle deɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ, mɔɔ Nyamenle ɛkyekye la azo a.<verse eid="PSA 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 48:9" />O Nana Nyamenle, wɔ ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne mɔɔ ɛmbɔ aze ɛlɛ la, yɛɛ yɛdwenledwenle nwolɛ wɔ wɔ asɔne sua ne anu a. <verse eid="PSA 48:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 48:10" />Kɛmɔ wɔ duma ne de la, O Nana Nyamenle, zɔhane ala noko yɛɛ wɔ ayɛlɛyelɛ ne de wɔ ewiade amuala a. Ɛ sa fema ne azo yɛɛ konimlilɛ wɔ a. <verse eid="PSA 48:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 48:11" />Bɛmaa Boka Zayɔn ɛli fɛlɛko; bɛmaa Dwuda mralɛ mraalɛ anye ɛlie, wɔ wɔ ndɛnebualɛ nwo. <verse eid="PSA 48:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 48:12" />Kpɔsa, bɔ Zayɔn anwo mgbɔlɛka; tiedia ye esianwu ne mɔ. <verse eid="PSA 48:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 48:13" />Bɛnlea ye mbane ne mɔ. Bɛhɔ ye ahodoka ne mɔ anu, na bɛahola bɛaha bɛahile bɛ mra:<verse eid="PSA 48:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 48:14" />Kɛ ɛhye a le Nyamenle, yɛ damɛnlangoate Nyamenle ne a. Ɔbayɛ yɛ sinzavolɛ wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ.<verse eid="PSA 48:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="PSA 49" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 49</para>
  <para style="s1">Agyapadeɛ mɔɔ nvasoɛ ɛnle zo la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 49:1" />Bɛ muala bɛdie! Aleɛabo amra amuala; bɛyɛ ɛnzolɛ. <verse eid="PSA 49:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 49:2" />Mgbanyinli nee ngakula, ehyiavolɛma nee sukoavolɛma, bɛ muala bɛbɔ nu. <verse eid="PSA 49:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 49:3" />Mebaha nrɛlɛbɛ edwɛkɛ; bɛbade me ahonle nu nzɛlɛlɛ ne abo.<verse eid="PSA 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 49:4" />Mebalua mrɛlɛbulɛ nu meadendɛ; na mealua getaebɔlɛ nee edwɛnedolɛ nu meahile ɔ bo. <verse eid="PSA 49:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 49:5" />Duzu ati a ɔwɔ kɛ mesulo wɔ anwubɛnyunlu mekɛ nu, wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ me kpɔvolɛma ɛbɔ me ɛyia la ɛ? <verse eid="PSA 49:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 49:6" />Menli mɔɔ fa bɛ rɛle wula bɛ anwonyia nu, na bɛfa bɛ agyapandeɛ molozo bɛtu bɛ nwo a? <verse eid="PSA 49:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 49:7" />Nɔhalɛ nu, awie biala ɛnle ɛkɛ mɔɔ ɔdaye ɔkɛhola ɔkɛpepɛ ɔkɛlie ɔ nwo, anzɛɛ ɔkɛhola ɔkɛdɔ ye ngoane ɔkɛvi Awulae asa anu a. <verse eid="PSA 49:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 49:8" />Ɔluakɛ ye ngoane bolɛ le kpole, na ɔnrɛhola ye tua; <verse eid="PSA 49:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 49:9" />amaa yɛahola yɛadɛnla aze wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ, mɔɔ ɔnrɛnwu Funli Kuma nu a.<verse eid="PSA 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 49:10" />Ɛhɛe! Ɔbanwu kɛ nrɛlɛbɛvolɛma wu, yɛɛ ahoasea nee ɛzɛlɛma bɛdabɛ bɛwu; na bɛgyakyi bɛ agyapandeɛ bɛamaa awie mɔ. <verse eid="PSA 49:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 49:11" />Bɛ azɛka ne mɔ a le bɛ tɛnlabelɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ a, bɛ damɛnlangoate tɛnlabelɛ mekɛ ɛne, saa bɛde aze la bɛlɛ azua ngakyile bɔbɔ a. <verse eid="PSA 49:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 49:12" />Sonla ɛnrɛdɛnla ye anwonyia nu dahuu; ɔle kɛ ayɛmoa mɔɔ ɔdaye noko ɔwu la. <verse eid="PSA 49:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 49:13" />Ɛhye a le ahoasea diedi, menli mɔɔ anye die bɛdabɛ bɛ nwo la bɛ awieleɛ a.<verse eid="PSA 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 49:14" />Bɛziezie bɛ bɛmaa amaneɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ; ewule bava bɛ ahɔ; ndɛndɛ ne ala, bɛbadwu ewule kuma ne anu; na bɛ sonlabaka ne bakpɔlɔ ndɛndɛ; na amaneɛnwunlɛ ɛleka ne bayɛ bɛ sua nu.<verse eid="PSA 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 49:15" />Noko akee Nana Nyamenle balie me ɛkɛla ne avi amaneɛnwunlɛ tumi sa nu; ɔluakɛ yemɔ ɔbalie me. <verse eid="PSA 49:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 49:16" />Saa awie nyia ɔ nwo a, mmamaa ɛ nye bolo ye; saa ye agyapadeɛ so maa ye anyunlunyia yɛ molozo bɔbɔ a zɔhane ala. <verse eid="PSA 49:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 49:17" />Ɔluakɛ saa ɔwu a ɔnrɛhola ɔnrɛva nuhua kotokokye bɔbɔ ɔnrɛhɔ ɛbolɔ; ye anyunlunyia ne bɔbɔ nee ye ɛnrɛhɔ. <verse eid="PSA 49:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 49:18" />Bɔbɔ wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɔde aze la, ɔfa ɔtu ɔ nwo kɛ, ɔle ahomeka; yɛɛ saa bɔbɔ ɔyɛ ahunlunyele a bɛye ye ayɛlɛ a, <verse eid="PSA 49:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 49:19" />ɔbadoa ɔ nlenyia mɔ mɔɔ ɛwu ɛhɔ, na bɛnrɛnwu alehyenlɛ bieko la.<verse eid="PSA 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 49:20" />Sonla ɛndɛnla ye anwonyia nu dahuu; ɔle kɛ ayɛmoa mɔɔ ɔdaye ɔ bo zo minli la.<verse eid="PSA 49:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="PSA 50" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 50</para>
  <para style="s1">Nɔhalɛ Nyamenle ɛzonlenlɛ ne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 50:1" />Nana Nyamenle, Awulae Nyamenle ne mɔɔ bo debie biala anwo zo la ɛlɛtendɛ ahile aleɛabo amuala, ɔbɔ ye sɛnzɛne aduduleɛ mɔɔ kɔ ye adɔleɛ la.<verse eid="PSA 50:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 50:2" />Nyamenle ɛlɛta avi Zayɔn, sua mɔɔ di munli na eza ɔle kɛnlɛma la azo. <verse eid="PSA 50:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 50:3" />Yɛ Nyamenle ne ɛlɛba, ɔnrɛyɛ koonwu bieko; sendɔlɛra kpole bie li ɔ nyunlu, na ahumu totohyia ɛbɔ ye mgbɔlɛka ɛyia. <verse eid="PSA 50:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 50:4" />Yedo ɛsalɛ yevɛlɛ anwuma nee aze kɛ bɛrɛla bɛranlea ye ndɛnebualɛ. <verse eid="PSA 50:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 50:5" />Bɛhuohua bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛdie me bɛdi la anloa; bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛlua azubɔlɛ zo bɛ nee me ɛyɛ ngyehyɛlɛ la. <verse eid="PSA 50:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 50:6" />Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne da Nyamenle ye tenleneyɛlɛ ne ali; ɔluakɛ Nyamenle ɔdaye mumua ne ɔle Ndɛnebuavolɛ.<verse eid="PSA 50:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 50:7" />Bɛdie, ebiamɔ, mebadendɛ. O Yizilayɛma, mebali daselɛ meatia bɛ. Mele Nyamenle, bɛ Nyamenle ne. <verse eid="PSA 50:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 50:8" />Membua bɛ ndɛne fɔlɛ wɔ bɛ azubɔlɛ nwo; ɔluakɛ bɛ deɛyelalɛ azubɔlɛ ne mɔ dwu me nyunlu dahuu. <verse eid="PSA 50:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 50:9" />Memkpondɛ ɛnlankɛ nyinli ko bɔbɔ menvi bɛ aako nu; anzɛɛ abɔnkye nyinli menvi bɛ tunli nu. <verse eid="PSA 50:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 50:10" />Ɔluakɛ ɛbɔ nu nyɛmoa kpokpoti le me deɛ; yɛɛ nlankɛ mɔɔ wɔ awoka ne mɔ noko azo la amuala. <verse eid="PSA 50:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 50:11" />Meze anwomanyunlu nloma muala, yɛɛ debie biala ɛnlua azɛlɛ ye azo mɔɔ ɔnle me deɛ a. <verse eid="PSA 50:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 50:12" />Saa ɛhɔne ku me a ɔnle kɛ meka mekile bɛ; ɔluakɛ ewiade anu ninyɛne kpokpoti le me deɛ. <verse eid="PSA 50:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 50:13" />Bɛde kɛ medi ɛnlankɛ nane, anzɛɛ meno mbɔnkye mogya ɔ? <verse eid="PSA 50:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 50:14" />Bɛva moyɛlɛ azubɔlɛ bɛmaa Nana Nyamenle, na bɛdua bɛ ɛwɔkɛ ne mɔɔ bɛbɔ bɛmaa Nyamenle mɔɔ wɔ anwuma moamoa lɔ la; <verse eid="PSA 50:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 50:15" />na bɛvɛlɛ me wɔ bɛ ɛmianlɛ mekɛ nu. Mebalie bɛ, na bɛdabɛ noko bɛawula me anyunlunyia.<verse eid="PSA 50:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 50:16" />Nyamenle tendɛ se amumuyɛvo ne kɛ: “Duzu tumi yɛɛ ɛlɛ ye mɔɔ ɛdawɔ ɛka me mɛla nwo edwɛkɛ; anzɛɛ kɛ ɛfa ɛ nloa bɔbɔ ɛbɔ me ngyehyɛlɛ zo a? <verse eid="PSA 50:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 50:17" />Ɔluakɛ ɛtia me ndeanlɛ, na ɛtu me nloa edwɛkɛ ɛgua. <verse eid="PSA 50:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 50:18" />Ɛ nee nwule yɛɛ atu a; yɛɛ ɛ nee awuvolɛvalɛma noko yɛɛ adua a. <verse eid="PSA 50:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 50:19" />Ɛtane ngome ala a vi ɛ nloa anu finde a; yɛɛ adalɛ ala a ɛbɔ a. <verse eid="PSA 50:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 50:20" />Ɛde ɛkɛ ne yɛɛ ɛtendɛ ɛtia ɛ diema a, ɛdawɔ ɛ nli akunlu ralɛ. <verse eid="PSA 50:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 50:21" />Zɛhae ninyɛne ne yɛɛ wɔyɛ a; medame noko meyɛ koonwu; ɔti ɛdwenle kɛ mele kɛ ɛdawɔ la. Na kɛkala, akee mebua wɔ ndɛne, na meaye wɔ ɛtane ne meado ɛ nyunlu. <verse eid="PSA 50:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 50:22" />Wɔmɔ mɔɔ ɛ rɛle ɛvi Nyamenle a, nea ɛhye boɛ! Ammaa meantete wɔ nu nzokɛnzoka, mɔɔ awie ɛnle ɛkɛ mɔɔ kɛhola kɛlie wɔ wɔ me sa nu a.<verse eid="PSA 50:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 50:23" />“Awie biala mɔɔ fa ye moyɛlɛ azubɔlɛ bɛlɛ me la di me eni; awie biala mɔɔ yɛ ye ninyɛne gyɛlɛɛnye la, mebahile ye kɛ Nana Nyamenle si kola die ngoane la!”<verse eid="PSA 50:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 50" />
  <chapter number="51" style="c" sid="PSA 51" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 51</para>
  <para style="s1">Devidi ye Anlubɛnwo Edwɛndolɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 51:1" />Nwu me anwunvɔne, O Nana Nyamenle, kɛmɔ wɔ ɛhulolɛ nwanwane ne de la; ɔlua wɔ anwunvɔnezelɛ kpole ne ati, kyikyi me ɛtane kpokpoti. <verse eid="PSA 51:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 51:2" />Bia me fi me ɛtane kpokpoti anu, na te me nwo saanwu fi ɛtane nu! <verse eid="PSA 51:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 51:3" />Ɔluakɛ meze me ɛtane kpokpoti, yɛɛ me ɛtane li me nyunlu dahuu. <verse eid="PSA 51:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 51:4" />Ɛhɛe, wɔmɔ ɛ ngomekye yɛɛ meyɛ ɛtane metia wɔ, anzɛɛ meyɛ mɔɔ ɛnle kpalɛ la wɔ ɛ nyunlu a. Zɔhane ati ɛbua me ndɛne a, ɔle fɔɔnwo; yɛɛ saa ɛtea me noko a, evinli biala ɛnle nwo. <verse eid="PSA 51:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 51:5" />Nea, ɛtane nu a bɛwole me bɛdole a; yɛɛ ɛtane nu a ɔmɔ nrenzɛle me a. <verse eid="PSA 51:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 51:6" />Wɔmɔ ɛkulo nɔhalɛ wɔ debie biala anu; ɛhye ati kilehile me fealera nu nrɛlɛbɛ ndenle ne mɔ.<verse eid="PSA 51:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 51:7" />Fa nyinlanyinla nua me, kɔkpula kɛ menwɔyɛ nwuanzanwuanza la. Bia me, kɔkpula mekɛ mɔɔ menwɔyɛ woyawoya kɛ asukɔntweaba la. <verse eid="PSA 51:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 51:8" />Fa fɛlɛko nee anyelielɛ wula me nu tɛkɛɛ; maa mbowule ne mɔ mɔɔ wɔbubu bɛ la anye ɛlie. <verse eid="PSA 51:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 51:9" />Ye ɛ nye fi me ɛtane nwo; na kyikyi me nvonleɛ kpokpoti. <verse eid="PSA 51:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 51:10" />O me Nyamenle, maa me ahonle fofolɛ; na fa sunsum fofolɛ mɔɔ ɛngakyi ɛlɛ la wula me nu. <verse eid="PSA 51:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 51:11" />Mmaye me ali ɛfi ɛ nyunlu; mmamaa wɔ Sunsum Nwuanzanwuanza ne bɔ me. <verse eid="PSA 51:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 51:12" />Sia fa wɔ ngoanelielɛ ne maa me, na maa me ahonle ɛgyinla kpundii ɛmaa wɔ ɛhulolɛdeɛ. <verse eid="PSA 51:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 51:13" />Mebahilehile ɛtanevolɛma ɛ nwo ndenle ne mɔ; na meamaa ɛtanevolɛma azia ara ɛ nwo ɛkɛ ne bieko. <verse eid="PSA 51:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 51:14" />O me Nyamenle, ye me fi menli mɔɔ ka mogya gua la asa anu; ɔluakɛ wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛle me ngoanedievolɛ Nyamenle a; na akee me tafinlima baye wɔ tenleneyɛlɛ ne ayɛlɛ. <verse eid="PSA 51:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 51:15" />O Awulae, te me nloa, na me nloa baye wɔ ayɛlɛ. <verse eid="PSA 51:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 51:16" />Ɛngulo azubɔlɛ, anrɛɛ mebabɔ: ɔluakɛ wɔmɔ ɛ nye ɛnlie azubɔlɛ nwo. <verse eid="PSA 51:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 51:17" />Nyamenle azubɔlɛ a le ahonle mɔɔ bɛlɛ ɔ nwo aze la; ahonle mɔɔ bɛlɛ ɔ nwo aze la wɔmɔ ɛmkpo.<verse eid="PSA 51:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 51:18" />Awulae, nwu Zayɔn anwunvɔne, na boa ye; sɔ nu maa bɛzi Gyɛlusalɛm mbane ne mɔ bieko.<verse eid="PSA 51:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 51:19" />Na akee ɛ nye bazɔ azubɔndeɛ mɔɔ di munli la; ɔ nee ye deɛyelalɛ azubɔndeɛ ne mɔ; na bɛbava nlankɛ mgbole mgbole mɔɔ bɛza bɛ la bɛara wɔ azubɔlɛ mokyea ne azo.<verse eid="PSA 51:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 51" />
  <chapter number="52" style="c" sid="PSA 52" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 52</para>
  <para style="s1">Menli mɔɔ fa ninyɛmunliyɛlɛ tu bɛ nwo la bɛ awieleɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 52:1" />Duzu ati a ɛtu ɛ nwo a, sonla kakanyinli, wɔ amumuyɛ mɔɔ wɔyɛ wɔtia Nyamenle mra la anwo ɛ? Alehyenlɛ ne amuala, ɛdwenle bɛ ɛzɛkyelɛ nwo. <verse eid="PSA 52:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 52:2" />Ɛ tafinlima pɛ kɛ dadeɛ dɛma, wɔmɔ deɛsɛkyevolɛ. <verse eid="PSA 52:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 52:3" />Ɛkulo ɛtaneyɛlɛ ɛtɛla kpalɛyɛlɛ; yɛɛ adalɛbɔlɛ ɛtɛla nɔhalɛlilɛ. <verse eid="PSA 52:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 52:4" />Adalɛ nabalabanli! Wɔmɔ azafule a dahuu ɛkulo kɛ ɛkɛwɔ menli a.<verse eid="PSA 52:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 52:5" />Zɔhane ati Nyamenle babubu wɔ nu dwɔkɔdwɔkɔ; ɔbayɛ wɔ ɛkɛ ne yeatete wɔ nu yeavi wɔ aako nu; ɔbadu ɛ bo twi kɛ bɛtu ndile la yeavi azɛlɛ ye azo. <verse eid="PSA 52:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 52:6" />Tenlenema banwu ye, na bɛazulo ye; bɛbazɛlɛ ye bɛaha kɛ, <verse eid="PSA 52:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 52:7" />“Bɛnlea sonla ne mɔɔ ɔnva Nyamenle ɔnyɛ ɛhwee, na emomu ɔvale ɔ rɛle ɔwulale ye agyapandeɛ molozo ne anu, na ɔvale ye anwonyia ne ɔbɔle ɔ nwo bane la!”<verse eid="PSA 52:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 52:8" />Na mame, mele kɛ ɔlivi baka dokodoko mɔɔ ɛlɛnyi wɔ Nyamenle aako nu la. Mefa me rɛle mewula Nana Nyamenle ye ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ la anu. <verse eid="PSA 52:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 52:9" />Mebayɛ wɔ mo dahuu, kɛmɔ dahuu ɛyɛ ɛmaa me la. Mebava me anyelazo meawula wɔ duma ne anu, duma ne mɔɔ kpalɛyɛlɛ ngome ɛyi ye tɛkɛɛ wɔ wɔ kulovolɛma anyunlu la.<verse eid="PSA 52:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 52" />
  <chapter number="53" style="c" sid="PSA 53" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 53</para>
  <para style="s1">Amumuyɛvoma bɛ Ɛtane ɔ nee bɛ Awieleɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 53:1" />Koasea yɛɛ aka ye wɔ ye ahonle nu kɛ, “Nyamenle ɛnle ɛkɛ a.” Bɛle adalɛ nabalabama, amumuyɛvoma; bɛ nuhua ko bɔbɔ ɛnle ɛkɛ mɔɔ yemɔ ɔyɛ kpalɛ a.<verse eid="PSA 53:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 53:2" />Nyamenle wɔ anwuma nehane, na ɔ nye wɔ ɔ mra anwo zo; ɔlɛnea kɛ bɛ nuhua bie wɔ nu mɔɔ ze nrɛlɛbɛ na ɔlɛkpondɛ Nyamenle abo zo a. <verse eid="PSA 53:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 53:3" />Bɛ kpokpoti bɛhakyi bɛ nye bɛzi Nana Nyamenle; bɛ muala, kpalɛ biala ɛnle nu. Kyɛkyɛ, biala ɛnle bɛ nu mɔɔ ɔle kpalɛ a, ɛdwoba ko bɔbɔ ɛnle bɛ nu. <verse eid="PSA 53:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 53:4" />Asoo menli mɔɔ yɛ ɛtane tia bɛ gɔnwo mɔ la ɛnlɛ ndelebɛbo ɔ, bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkposa bɛ gɔnwo mɔ kɛ bɛdi aleɛ, na bɛnzu bɛnvɛlɛ Nyamenle la? <verse eid="PSA 53:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 53:5" />Bɛwɔ ɛzulolɛ totohyia nu, ɛzulolɛ mɔɔ bie ɛtɛsile ɛlɛ la; ɔluakɛ Nyamenle bavuandi ye kpɔvolɛma mbowule ne mɔ agua bɛ lɔ; na anyiemgba aha bɛ, ɔluakɛ Nyamenle ɛkpo bɛ bɔkɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 53:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 53:6" />O kɛkala angome a, anrɛɛ awie vi Zayɔn ɛralie Yizilayɛma! Mekɛ ne mɔɔ Awulae kɛva Yizilayɛma bɛ anzondwolɛ ne ɔkɛmaa bɛ bieko la. Anrɛɛ duzu fɛlɛko a Gyekɔbo kɛli a, yɛɛ duzu anyelielɛ noko yɛɛ kɛha Yizilayɛ a!<verse eid="PSA 53:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 53" />
  <chapter number="54" style="c" sid="PSA 54" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 54</para>
  <para style="s1">Nyamenle ne mɔɔ boa Nyanenwuvolɛma la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 54:1" />Dua wɔ duma ne anu die me, O Nana Nyamenle; na fa wɔ tumi ne di me edwɛkɛ maa me. <verse eid="PSA 54:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 54:2" />Tie me nzɛlɛlɛ, O Nana Nyamenle, na yɛ ɛnzolɛ maa me. <verse eid="PSA 54:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 54:3" />Ɔluakɛ mgbanyizonleyɛvoma ɛdwazo ɛtia me, bɛkpondɛ bɛazɛkye me; bɛmbu Nana Nyamenle bie hweledede.<verse eid="PSA 54:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 54:4" />Nea, Nana Nyamenle a le me Boavolɛ a; Awulae yɛɛ me ngoane wɔ ɔ sa nu a. <verse eid="PSA 54:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 54:5" />Ɔbamaa me kpɔvolɛma bɛ munzule abɔ bɛ ti zo; wɔ wɔ nɔhalɛlilɛ ne anu, minli me kpɔvolɛma abo zo bɔkɔɔ. <verse eid="PSA 54:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 54:6" />Mebayeye me ahonle nu wienyi meabɔ azu meamaa wɔ. Mebava moyɛlɛ meaye wɔ duma ayɛlɛ, O Nana Nyamenle, ɔluakɛ ɔfɛta.<verse eid="PSA 54:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 54:7" />Wɔye me wɔvi ngyegyelɛ muala anu, na wɔmaa menwu me konimlilɛ wɔ me kpɔvolɛma anwo zo.<verse eid="PSA 54:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 54" />
  <chapter number="55" style="c" sid="PSA 55" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 55</para>
  <para style="s1">Bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛ Gɔnwo mɔ ɛye bɛ ɛmaa la bɛ Edwɛndolɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 55:1" />O Nana Nyamenle, tie me nzɛlɛlɛ; mmaye ɛ nzo ɛfi me ɛbizalɛndeɛ zo! <verse eid="PSA 55:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 55:2" />Tie me, na bua me; ɔluakɛ me amaneɛnwunlɛ ɛbo me nwo zo.<verse eid="PSA 55:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 55:3" />Me kpɔvolɛ ne ɛnwunlonwunlanlɛ ne mɔ ɛdu me ahonle; ɔlua bɛ nzisi ne ati. Bɛfa ngyegyelɛ dɔɔnwo bɛbɛlɛ me; na wɔ bɛ ɛyavalɛ nu, dahuu bɛtwehwe ɛkpɔlɛ bɛmaa me. <verse eid="PSA 55:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 55:4" />Me ahonle ɛlɛdi nyane wɔ me nu, na ewule nwo ɛzulolɛ ɛde ɛdɔ me nwo zo. <verse eid="PSA 55:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 55:5" />Anwowozolɛ nee ɛzulolɛ ɛva me aze; me nwo mɔra ɛdu bɔkɔɔ. <verse eid="PSA 55:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 55:6" />Me kunlu anu a anrɛɛ melɛ ndɛbalɛ kɛ abubule la! Anrɛɛ medu mehɔ hwehwe mehɔkpondɛ ɛlɛka bie melie me ɛnwomenle. <verse eid="PSA 55:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 55:7" />Ɛhɛe, anrɛɛ menwɔkpɔsa menwɔdwu moamoa, na meahɔdɛnla fiemgbole bie azo. <verse eid="PSA 55:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 55:8" />Mebakpondɛ feabelɛ ndɛndɛ zo, meavi ahumu totohyia ye mɔɔ ɛlɛtu la anu.<verse eid="PSA 55:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 55:9" />O Awulae, sɛkye bɛ atiakunlutane ngyehyɛleɛ mɔɔ, bɛlɛyɛ la amuala; ɔluakɛ menwu basabasayɛlɛ nee konle wɔ sua ne azo. <verse eid="PSA 55:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 55:10" />Alehyenlɛ nee aledwolɛ muala, bɛbɔ ye mbane ne mɔ anwo mgbɔlɛka; na mgbondedolɛ nee begyebegyeyɛlɛ wɔ sua ne azo. <verse eid="PSA 55:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 55:11" />Deɛzekyelɛ ɛra sua ne azo; yɛɛ akee noko nzisi nee amumuyɛ nyɛleɛ ɛnvi ye gua nu ɛlɛ.<verse eid="PSA 55:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 55:12" />Tɛ me kpɔvolɛma yɛɛ yelɛyela me nwo a, yɛɛ tɛ bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛko bɛtia me, anzɛɛ bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛ nye ɛnzɔ debie la yɛɛ nee me di apelepele a, yemɔ anrɛɛ menwɔhola menwɔzɔ nuhua na akee meahwe me nwo meavi bɛ nwo. <verse eid="PSA 55:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 55:13" />Noko akee ɛhye yemɔ ɔle me gɔnwo, ɔle me ti pɛne, ɔle me gɔnwo kpalɛ kpalɛ. <verse eid="PSA 55:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 55:14" />Anrɛɛ yɛ muala yɛɛ yɛbɔ nu yɛdi adwelie a; yɛɛ yɛ muala noko a yɛdua nwo yɛkɔ asɔne a.<verse eid="PSA 55:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 55:15" />O Awulae, maa ewule ɛde ɛdɔ bɛ nwo zo; maa bɛhɔ ɛbolɔ kuma ne abo anyewɔzo nu; maa bɛva ɛzulolɛ bɛwu bɛhɔ bɛ ewule kuma ne mɔ anu. <verse eid="PSA 55:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 55:16" />Noko akee mesu mefɛlɛ Nyamenle; na Nana Nyamenle tie me. <verse eid="PSA 55:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 55:17" />Nɔsolɛ, nwonlomɔ ɔ nee ewiazo amuala, mekponle, meteɛdea nu mefa me edwɛkɛ meto me Nyamenle anyunlu, na ɔtie me ɛzunlɛ noko. <verse eid="PSA 55:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 55:18" />Ɔbalie me ɛkɛla ne yeavi konle ne mɔɔ bɛ nee me ɛlɛko la anu; ɔluakɛ me kpɔvolɛma ne mɔ zonle somaa. <verse eid="PSA 55:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 55:19" />Awulae badie me edwɛkɛ, na yeabɛlɛ bɛ aze; yemɔ yɛɛ sumunli mɔlebɛbo ne, yezie ewiade dedee yerakpula ɛnɛ a; ɔluakɛ bɛnli ye mɛla zo, na eza bɛnzulo ye.<verse eid="PSA 55:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 55:20" />Me gɔnwo ne honle tiale ɔ gɔnwo mɔ, na ɔbule ye ɛwɔkɛ ne azo. <verse eid="PSA 55:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 55:21" />Ɔ nloa anu edwɛkɛ, yemɔ ɔle menlemenle zɛhae; noko akee ye ahonle nu, yemɔ ɛkpɔlɛ ngome. Ye ɛdendɛlɛ le bɛtɛɛ kɛ ɔnze nwolɛ bie la; noko akee bɛpɛ kɛ dadeɛ dɛma la.<verse eid="PSA 55:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 55:22" />Fa wɔ adesoa muala to Nana Nyamenle anwo zo, na ɔbaho yealie wɔ; ɔnrɛmaa bɛnrɛli nɔhavoma anwo zo konim ɛlɛ. <verse eid="PSA 55:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 55:23" />Na wɔmɔ Nana Nyamenle, ɛbavuandi bɛ wɔagua kuma ne abo nehane; ahodiawu ɔ nee adalɛma ɛhye mɔ. Bɛnrɛli bɛ mekɛ ne foa ko bɔbɔ wɔ azɛlɛ ɛhye azo. Na mame mɔ, mebava me rɛle meawula wɔ nu.<verse eid="PSA 55:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 55" />
  <chapter number="56" style="c" sid="PSA 56" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 56</para>
  <para style="s1">Aluoluanuvolɛ ne mɔɔ bɛkpo ye la ye Edwɛndolɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 56:1" />Nwu me anwunvɔne, O Nana Nyamenle, ɔluakɛ bɛlɛtietia me nwo zo; alehyenlɛ kpokpoti, me kpɔvolɛma sisi me. <verse eid="PSA 56:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 56:2" />Alehyenlɛ dahuu, me kpɔvolɛma ko tia me; bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛdwazo bɛtia me la anwo zonle dɔɔnwo.<verse eid="PSA 56:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 56:3" />O Awulae Bedevinli, saa ɛzulolɛ ka me a, wɔ nu a mefa me rɛle mewula a. <verse eid="PSA 56:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 56:4" />Medie Nyamenle medi, ɛhye ati menzulo. Me rɛle wɔ Nyamenle nu, ɛhye ati meye ye ayɛlɛ. Duzu bɔbɔ a sonla dasanli kɛhola kɛyɛ me a? <verse eid="PSA 56:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 56:5" />Alehyenlɛ muala, me kpɔvolɛma kpondɛ kɛ bɛsɛkye me; bɛ adwenlenzuzulɛ ɛtane muala tia me. <verse eid="PSA 56:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 56:6" />Bɛkye bɛ nwo file, bɛbu bɛsia, na bɛnea me nyɛleɛ. <verse eid="PSA 56:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 56:7" />Kɛmɔ alehyenlɛ biala bɛ nye la kɛ bɛ sa kɛha me la, zɔhane ala a wɔ wɔ ɛyavalɛ nu, ɛ nee bɛ ɛli ye ɛnwonle a, na ka bɛ aze fɛɛnye, O Nana Nyamenle!<verse eid="PSA 56:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 56:8" />Ɛze ɛvɛlɛ mɔɔ mevɛ a; ɛze monle dodo mɔɔ mehwi a. Asoo bɛtɛkɛlɛle ɛhye wɔ wɔ buluku ne anu ɔ? <verse eid="PSA 56:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 56:9" />Mekɛ biala mɔɔ menwɔvɛlɛ wɔ la, me kpɔvolɛma bagua ɛbɔ nu. Meze ɛhye mesie kɛ Awulae Nyamenle wɔ me afoa. <verse eid="PSA 56:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 56:10" />Wɔ Nana Nyamenle ne mɔɔ mekanvo ye la duma nu, wɔ Awulae ne mɔɔ meye ye ayɛlɛ la duma nu; <verse eid="PSA 56:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 56:11" />Nyamenle nu a me diedi wɔ a, ɔti menwɔzulo ɛhwee. Duzu bɔbɔ a sonla dasanli kɛhola kɛyɛ me a? <verse eid="PSA 56:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 56:12" />Me ɛwɔkɛ mɔɔ mebɔ wɔ la, ɔwɔ kɛ medi zolɛ, O Nana Nyamenle. Mebava moyɛlɛ azubɔlɛ meamaa wɔ. <verse eid="PSA 56:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 56:13" />Ɔluakɛ wɔmɔ wɔye me ɛkɛla wɔvi ewule nu. Nɔhalɛ nu, wɔammaa bɛanli me nwo zo konim; ɛhye ati mebava wienyi mealua Nana Nyamenle duma nu, wɔ me ɛbɛlabɔlɛ nu.<verse eid="PSA 56:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 56" />
  <chapter number="57" style="c" sid="PSA 57" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 57</para>
  <para style="s1">Nana Nyamenle ɛye Devidi ɛvi Belemgbunli Sɔɔlo asa anu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 57:1" />Nwu me anwunvɔne, O Nana Nyamenle, nwu me anwunvɔne; ɔluakɛ wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛle me ɛkɛla ne ye nriandifeabelɛ a. Ɛ ndɛba abo yɛɛ menriandi mefea kɔkpula mekɛ mɔɔ ahumu totohyia ne kɛdu kɛpɛ nu la a. <verse eid="PSA 57:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 57:2" />Mesu mefɛlɛ Nyamenle Bedevinli ne mɔɔ wɔ anwuma la, Nyamenle ne mɔɔ maa me sa ka me ngyianlɛndeɛ muala la. <verse eid="PSA 57:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 57:3" />Ɔbazoa yeavi anwuma maanle ne anu yeamaa bɛaralie me; ɔbamaa me kpɔvolɛma mɔɔ tietia me nwo zo la anyunlu nyiane agua aze. Nana Nyamenle bamaa meanwu ye ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne nee ye nɔhalɛ ne. <verse eid="PSA 57:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 57:4" />Mela awenadema avinli, menli mɔɔ di menli, mɔɔ bɛ gye yɛ nla kɛ atwe nee ɛda mbaka la; bɛ tafinlima yɛ nla kɛ wowole. <verse eid="PSA 57:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 57:5" />Nana Nyamenle, kɛha ɛ nwo wɔ wɔ anwuma maanle ne anu! Maa wɔ anyunlunyia ɛheda azɛlɛ ye azo! <verse eid="PSA 57:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 57:6" />Me kpɔvolɛma ɛzua me ɛhane; alɔbɔlɛ ɛmundu me nwo zo. Bɛpɛle kuma kulongulo wɔ me adenle nu, na bɛdabɛ mumua ne bɛde bɛgua nuhua gɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 57:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 57:7" />Melɛ diedi kpundii, O Nana Nyamenle, melɛ diedi kpundii wɔ Nana Nyamenle nu! Mebado edwɛne meaye wɔ ayɛlɛ. <verse eid="PSA 57:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 57:8" />Me ɛkɛla, dwazo! Dwazo na fa sanwunle nee edwɛnedolɛ ye Awulae ayɛlɛ! Dwazo aleɛbahye! <verse eid="PSA 57:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 57:9" />Mebava moyɛlɛ meamaa Awulae wɔ menli kpokpoti anu; mebado ayɛlɛyelɛ edwɛne meamaa wɔ, wɔ maanle maanle kpokpoti anyunlu. <verse eid="PSA 57:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 57:10" />Ɔluakɛ wɔ ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne dwu maanɔne, yɛɛ wɔ nɔhalɛlilɛ ne noko pɛ nu wɔ anwomanyunlu ɛleka biala.<verse eid="PSA 57:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 57:11" />Kɛha ɛ nwo wɔ wɔ anwuma maanle ne anu, O Nana Nyamenle! Maa wɔ anyunlunyia ne ɛheda azɛlɛ ye azo!<verse eid="PSA 57:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 57" />
  <chapter number="58" style="c" sid="PSA 58" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 58</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛtanevolɛma bɛ Aliyelɛ nee bɛ Ndeanlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 58:1" />Bɛmɛ tumivolɛma, asoo amgba ala bɛbua nɔhalɛ ndɛne ɔ? Asoo bɛbua menli ne amuala edwɛkɛ nɔhalɛ nu ɔ? <verse eid="PSA 58:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 58:2" />Kyɛkyɛ, wɔ bɛ ahonle nu, ɛtane ala a bɛdwenle nwo a; bɛ sa anloa gyima biala le munzule ngome wɔ azɛlɛ ye azo. <verse eid="PSA 58:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 58:3" />Amumuyɛvoma bɛ nyɛleɛ, bɛfa bɛwo bɛ; bɛbɔ ɔ bo bɛvi bɛ awolɛ nu bɛbɔ adalɛ na bɛyɛ ɛtane. <verse eid="PSA 58:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 58:4" />Bɛ gye ati yɛ nyane kɛ nwɔlɛ la; yɛɛ bɛduodua bɛ nzo kɛ bɔna la; <verse eid="PSA 58:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 58:5" />ammaa bɛande ɛwɔlɛ ngonyiayevoma edwɛne ne nee bɛ ɛdendɛlɛ.<verse eid="PSA 58:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 58:6" />O Nana Nyamenle, bubu bɛ gye fi bɛ nloa anu; tudu bɛ gye mgbole ne mɔ mɔɔ le kɛ awenade ɛdeɛ ne la gua, O Awulae! <verse eid="PSA 58:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 58:7" />Maa bɛ bo zo ɛminli kɛ sɛlɛkye mɔɔ to gua aze la; maa bɛyela wee kɛ adenle nu ndile mɔɔ bɛtietia zo la. <verse eid="PSA 58:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 58:8" />Maa bɛyɛ kɛ nlonkoɛ mɔɔ bɛ nloa nyɛlɛ sa bɛ kpokpa, anzɛɛ kɛ adɔma mɔɔ wu wɔ mogya nu la. <verse eid="PSA 58:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 58:9" />Bɛ nye zo katete bɛ la, ɛnee bɛzo bɛ begua kɛ ɛya la, anzɛɛ ɛnee bɛlɛyela bɛ bɔkɔɔ!<verse eid="PSA 58:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 58:10" />Tenlenema bali fɛlɛko, wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ bɛkɛnwu kɛ bɛdua ɛtanevolɛma kakɛ la; na bɛbatietia amumuyɛvoma ne mɔ mogya ne anu. <verse eid="PSA 58:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 58:11" />Menli baha kɛ, “Amgba tenleneyɛlɛ nwo lɛ nvasoɛ; nɔhalɛ nu, Nyamenle bie wɔ ɛkɛ ne, mɔɔ bua aleɛabo amra ndɛne a.”<verse eid="PSA 58:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 58" />
  <chapter number="59" style="c" sid="PSA 59" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 59</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛtane ahatualɛ mɔɔ fɛta la anwo Edwɛndolɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 59:1" />Die me fi me kpɔvolɛma asa anu, O me Nyamenle; bɔ me nwo bane fi bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛdwazo me kɔme zo la asa anu! <verse eid="PSA 59:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 59:2" />Die me fi amumuyɛvoma ɛhye mɔ asa anu; ye me fi ahodiawu ɛhye mɔ anloa anu. <verse eid="PSA 59:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 59:3" />Me kpɔvolɛma ɛzia kpoonwu kpondɛ me ahu me; amumuyɛvoma ɛhye bɛ nwo file ɛdwazo ɛtia me. Tɛ kɛ asɛɛ meyɛ ɛtane metia bɛ la ati ɔ, <verse eid="PSA 59:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 59:4" />yɛɛ tɛ ɛvonlɛ mɔɔ mevo bɛ la ati a ɛmaa bɛlɛtu me ako a, O Awulae. <verse eid="PSA 59:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 59:5" />Kɛha ɛ nwo! Bagyinla me nzi, na boa me! Ɛdawɔ nea, Yizilayɛ Nyamenle! Wɔmɔ Awulae Ɛlɔne Nyamenle! Dwazo na tea menli mɔɔ ɛnzonle wɔ la kpokpoti; mmase bɛ nuhua kotokokye bɔbɔ anwunvɔne. <verse eid="PSA 59:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 59:6" />Aledwolɛ biala bɛsia bɛba, bɛbakpo wowo wowo kɛ ahwea la; na bɛbɔ sua ne anwo mgbɔlɛka bɛyia. <verse eid="PSA 59:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 59:7" />Bɛmɛ a bɛgua nehane la; nea kɛ bɛlɛtwi bɛ gye bie a. Noko akee bɛdwenle kɛ awie ɛnde bɛ nganeɛ. <verse eid="PSA 59:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 59:8" />Na wɔmɔ Nana Nyamenle, ɛzelekɛ ala a ɛsele bɛ a; ɛnva bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛnzonle wɔ la ɛnye ɛhwee.<verse eid="PSA 59:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 59:9" />O me Nyamenle, mɔmɔ mɔɔ ɛle me anwosesebɛ a, mebado ayɛlɛyelɛ edwɛne meamaa wɔ; ɔluakɛ wɔmɔ, O Nana Nyamenle, yɛɛ ɛle me nriandifeabelɛ a. <verse eid="PSA 59:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 59:10" />Me Nyamenle kulo me, ɔti ɔbaralie me; me Nyamenle bamaa meali me kpɔvolɛma anwo zo konim. <verse eid="PSA 59:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 59:11" />Mmaku bɛ, anrɛɛ yemɔ bɛ rɛle kɛvi. Maa wɔ tumi ne ɛdinda bɛ bɔkɔɔ, na ɔha bɛ aze fɛɛnye, O me Nyamenle nee me Sinzavolɛ! <verse eid="PSA 59:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 59:12" />Ɔlua bɛ nloa nee bɛ tafinlima edwɛkɛ ɛtane ti, maa bɛ munzule ɛbɔ bɛ ti zo; ɔluakɛ bɛbɔ adalɛ na eza bɛwa amonle. <verse eid="PSA 59:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 59:13" />Yela bɛ wɔ ɛyavalɛ nu ala; yela bɛ maa bɛdɔ nzonle; amaa menli anwu kɛ Nyamenle di belemgbunli wɔ Gyekɔbo anwo zo, na ye belemgbunlililɛ dwu maanle ti nee maanle bo. <verse eid="PSA 59:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 59:14" />Aledwolɛ biala bɛsia bɛba, bɛbakpo wowo wowo kɛ ahwea la; na bɛbɔ sua ne anwo mgbɔlɛka bɛyia. <verse eid="PSA 59:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 59:15" />Bɛle kɛ ahwea mɔɔ luolua nu kpondɛ aleɛ ali, na saa bɛannyia bie dɔɔnwo a, bɛsu bɛ kunlu la.<verse eid="PSA 59:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 59:16" />Na mame mebado wɔ tumi ne anwo edwɛne; mebado wɔ anwunvɔnezelɛ ne anwo edwɛne nwonlomɔ biala. Ɔluakɛ wɔmɔ wɔyɛ me feabelɛ, me nriandifeabelɛ wɔ me amaneɛnwunlɛ mekɛ nu. <verse eid="PSA 59:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 59:17" />O me Nyamenle wɔmɔ mɔɔ ɛle me anwosesebɛ a, mebado edwɛne meaye wɔ ayɛlɛ; ɔluakɛ wɔmɔ Nyamenle yɛɛ ɛle me nriandifeabelɛ a. Nyamenle ne mɔɔ maa menwu ye ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne la.<verse eid="PSA 59:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 59" />
  <chapter number="60" style="c" sid="PSA 60" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 60</para>
  <para style="s1">Yizilayɛ ye Ɛpepɛlielɛ Nzɛlɛlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 60:1" />O Awulae Nana Nyamenle, wɔkpo yɛ, wɔbubu yɛ bɔkɔbɔkɔ; wɔva yɛ nwo ɛya. O akee kakyi ɛ nye nea yɛ. <verse eid="PSA 60:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 60:2" />Wɔmaa azɛlɛ ɛwozo, na wɔmaa yegyigya; siezie bɛ fofolɛ, ɔluakɛ bɛhyeɛhyea. <verse eid="PSA 60:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 60:3" />Wɔmaa wɔ menli ɛnwu bɛ nyunlu somaa; wɔmaa yɛnlo nza ɛmaa yedinda yɛ.<verse eid="PSA 60:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 60:4" />Wɔbɔ bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛsulo wɔ la kɔkɔ ɛsesebɛ ɛsesebɛ; amaa bɛanriandi bɛavi ndɛnebualɛ ne anu. <verse eid="PSA 60:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 60:5" />Tie yɛ nzɛlɛlɛ, na fa wɔ tumi ne die yɛ; die wɔ kulovolɛma. <verse eid="PSA 60:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 60:6" />Nyamenle ɛdendɛ ɛvi ye tɛnlabelɛ nwuanzanwuanza ne anu kɛ: “Wɔ anyelielɛ nu yɛɛ mebahye Hyikɛm azɛlɛ ne, ɔ nee Sɛko Bɔnza ne anu meamaa me menli a. <verse eid="PSA 60:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 60:7" />Geleade le me deɛ; Manasɛ le me deɛ; Yifelaem le me ti dansɛne kyɛlɛ; yɛɛ Dwuda le me belemgbunlililɛ kpɔma. <verse eid="PSA 60:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 60:8" />Mebava Mowabe meayɛ kyɛnze mɔɔ menrinzi me sa wɔ nu a; na meavuandi me mgbɔlaboa meagua Yidɔm anwo zo, meava meahile kɛ medame a melɛ ye a. Wɔ konimlilɛ nu, yɛɛ mebadea nu meagua Filisitiama anwo zo a.”<verse eid="PSA 60:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 60:9" />Nwane a kɛhola kɛva me kɛhɔ sua ne mɔɔ bɛlie nwolɛ bane la azo a? Nwane a kɛli me nyunlu kɛhɔ Yidɔm sua zo a? <verse eid="PSA 60:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 60:10" />O Nana Nyamenle, amgba ala ɛtɛkpole yɛ ɔ? Ɛnrɛli yɛ nyunlu ɛ nee yɛ ɛnrɛhɔ ɛnrɛhɔho ɛnrɛtia yɛ kpɔvolɛma ɔ, O Nana Nyamenle? <verse eid="PSA 60:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 60:11" />O maa yɛ moalɛ maa yɛho yɛtia yɛ kpɔvolɛma; ɔluakɛ sonla dasanli ye moalɛ le gyɛne!<verse eid="PSA 60:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 60:12" />Sumunli kenle ala mɔɔ Nyamenle wɔ yɛ afoa la, yɛbaho kɛ mrenyia; na yemɔ Nyamenle, yɛɛ ɔbatietia yɛ kpɔvolɛma anwo zo a.<verse eid="PSA 60:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 60" />
  <chapter number="61" style="c" sid="PSA 61" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 61</para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔ Nana Nyamenle Feabelɛ ne abo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 61:1" />Tie me ɛzunlɛ, O Nana Nyamenle; yɛ ɛnzolɛ tie me nzɛlɛlɛ. <verse eid="PSA 61:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 61:2" />Mevi moamoa nehane yɛɛ mefɛlɛ wɔ a. Melɛ mɔɔ me nwo kɛgolo me la, fa me kɔ bolɛ totohyia ne mɔɔ tɛla me la ati zo, ɛleka ne mɔɔ le me nriandifeabelɛ la. <verse eid="PSA 61:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 61:3" />Wɔmɔ a ɛle me nriandifeabelɛ a; ɛle me esianwu mɔɔ ɛwowa me ɛfi me kpɔvolɛma asa anu a. <verse eid="PSA 61:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 61:4" />Maa mendɛnla wɔ aako nu wɔ melɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ. Maa menyia anzondwolɛ wɔ ɛ ndɛba abo! <verse eid="PSA 61:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 61:5" />Ɔluakɛ wɔmɔ Nana Nyamenle wɔdie me ɛwɔkɛ ne mɔ; na wɔva agyapadeɛ mɔɔ le bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛsulo wɔ la ɛdeɛ la wɔmaa me.<verse eid="PSA 61:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 61:6" />Maa belemgbunli ne ngoane tendenle; maa ɔ nyi ɔhyɛ! <verse eid="PSA 61:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 61:7" />O Nana Nyamenle, maa ɔli belemgbunli dahuu wɔ ɛ nyunlu; fa wɔ ɛhulolɛ nwanwane ne nee wɔ nɔhalɛlilɛ ne bɔ ɔ nwo bane; <verse eid="PSA 61:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 61:8" />amaa dahuu meado ayɛlɛyelɛ edwɛne meahanvo wɔ duma, wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ alehyenlɛ biala melɛdi me ɛwɔkɛbɔlɛ ne azo la.<verse eid="PSA 61:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 61" />
  <chapter number="62" style="c" sid="PSA 62" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 62</para>
  <para style="s1">Diedi kpundii wɔ ɛkɛ maa Nyamenle Bedevinli ne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 62:1" />Me ɛkɛla ɛyɛ koonwu butu Nyamenle anyunlu; ɔ ngomekye ala a me ngoane wɔ ɔ sa nu a. <verse eid="PSA 62:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 62:2" />Ɔ ngomekye ala yɛɛ ɔko ɔmaa me na ɔdie me ngoane a. Ɔle me sinzavolɛ, ɔti awie biala ɛnrɛhola ɛnrɛli me nwo zo konim.<verse eid="PSA 62:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 62:3" />Fane nyɛ yɛɛ bɛ muala bɛkɛdu bɛkɛgua sonla mɔɔ ɛwu yeha ɔ nye la anwo zo ɛ? <verse eid="PSA 62:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 62:4" />Bɛ ngyehyɛleɛ a le kɛ, bɛkɛdu ye bɛkɛvi ye enililɛ tɛnlabelɛ ne bɛkɛdo ye aze. Bɛ nye die adalɛbɔlɛ nwo. Bɛfa bɛ nloa bɛyileyila, na wɔ bɛ ahonle nu ɛdeɛ, yemɔ amowalɛ ngome. <verse eid="PSA 62:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 62:5" />Me ɛkɛla ɛyɛ koonwu butu Nyamenle anyunlu; ɔluakɛ me anyelazo muala vi ye lɔ. <verse eid="PSA 62:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 62:6" />Ɔ ngomekye ala a ɔko ɔmaa me, na ɔdie me ngoane a. Ɔle me feabelɛ; ɔti awie biala ɛnrɛhola ɛnrɛli me nwo zo konim.<verse eid="PSA 62:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 62:7" />Me ngoanelielɛ nee me anyunlunyia kpokpoti gyi Nana Nyamenle anwo zo. Me bodane totohyia ɔ nee me feabelɛ, yemɔ a le Nana Nyamenle. <verse eid="PSA 62:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 62:8" />Ebiamɔ, bɛva bɛ rɛle bɛwula Nana Nyamenle anu mekɛ biala; bɛva bɛ adesoa muala bɛgua ɔ nwo zo, ɔluakɛ Nyamenle le feabele maa yɛ. <verse eid="PSA 62:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 62:9" />Menli kpokpoti le kɛ sonla bonyi nu anwoma; mgbanyinli nee ngakula kpokpoti anwo ɛnlɛ nvasoɛ. Bɛndo ɛhwee wɔ tone nu, bɛle fefɛlafefɛla bɛtɛla bɛ bonyi nu anwoma.<verse eid="PSA 62:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 62:10" />Mmafa ɛ rɛle ɛwula basabasayɛlɛ nu; mmamaa ɛ nye da kɛ ɛkɛnyia debie kpalɛ bie ɛkɛvi awuleyɛlɛ nu. Saa bɔbɔ wɔ anwonyia so kɛ duzu ala a, mmafa ɛ nye ɛto zo. <verse eid="PSA 62:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 62:11" />Kokye yɛɛ Nana Nyamenle ɛdendɛ a; yɛɛ mɔɔ tia ye nwiɔ mɔɔ mede la ɛne: Kɛ tumi vi Nana Nyamenle lɔ; <verse eid="PSA 62:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 62:12" />kɛ wɔ lɔ yɛɛ ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne wɔ a: na wɔmɔ Awulae yɛɛ ɛtua awie biala kakɛ kɛmɔ ɔfɛta ye gyimayɛlɛ la a.<verse eid="PSA 62:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 62" />
  <chapter number="63" style="c" sid="PSA 63" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 63</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛkɛla ne mɔɔ Nzuhɔne ku ye la ye Nzɛlɛlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 63:1" />O Nana Nyamenle, wɔmɔ mɔɔ ɛle me Nyamenle a, mekpondɛ wɔ; me ɛkɛla ɛlɛsu avɛlɛ wɔ; me sonlabaka mumua ne ɛhete kɛ azɛlɛ mɔɔ ɛyɛ ketekete ɛlɛkpondɛ nzule la. <verse eid="PSA 63:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 63:2" />Zɔhane ati memkpondɛle wɔ, wɔ asɔne sua ne anu nwuanzanwuanzaleka ne; na menwunle wɔ tumi ɔ nee wɔ anyunlunyia ne. <verse eid="PSA 63:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 63:3" />Ɔluakɛ wɔ ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne sonle bolɛ tɛla ngoane la ati, mebaye wɔ ayɛlɛ. <verse eid="PSA 63:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 63:4" />Sumunli kenle ala mɔɔ mede aze la, mebayɛ wɔ mo dahuu; mebakpogya me sa zo anwuma na meabɔ wɔ duma. <verse eid="PSA 63:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 63:5" />Me ɛkɛla bali ɔ ko ayi, na me nloa ado fɛlɛko nee ayɛlɛyelɛ edwɛne amaa wɔ.<verse eid="PSA 63:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 63:6" />Saa mekakye wɔ wɔ me nla nu a, medwenle ɛ nwo wɔ aledwolɛ ne amuala. <verse eid="PSA 63:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 63:7" />Ɔluakɛ wɔmɔ yɛɛ dahuu ɛyɛ me boavolɛ a; na wɔ ɛ ndɛba alubo ne abo yɛɛ meto anyelielɛ edwɛne a. <verse eid="PSA 63:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 63:8" />Me ɛkɛla kisa wɔ; na ɛ sa fema ne sɔ me nu dwaa. <verse eid="PSA 63:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 63:9" />Bɛdabɛ mɔɔ kpondɛ me azɛkye me la bahɔ ɛbolɔ sua zo. <verse eid="PSA 63:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 63:10" />Bɛbawu wɔ konle nu, na mbedi ali bɛ avunli ne mɔ. <verse eid="PSA 63:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 63:11" />Akee belemgbunli ne anye balie wɔ Nana Nyamenle anu; na bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛka belemgbunli ne ndane ne la ɛdeɛ, bɛbaye ye ayɛlɛ; na adalɛma anloa anu edwɛkɛ bawie.<verse eid="PSA 63:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 63" />
  <chapter number="64" style="c" sid="PSA 64" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 64</para>
  <para style="s1">Nzɛlɛlɛ mɔɔ bɛfa bɛsɛlɛ amaa bɛavi dumasɛkyevoma asa anu la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 64:1" />O Nana Nyamenle, tie me ne wɔ me ngyianlɛ nu; bɔ me ngoane nwo bane fi me kpɔvolɛma asa anu. <verse eid="PSA 64:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 64:2" />Ye me fi amumuyɛ akpame mɔɔ me kpɔvolɛma ɛlɛfa ye wɔ me nwo la anu, ɔ nee ngyehyɛleɛ mɔɔ ɛtanevolɛma ɛlɛyɛ la. <verse eid="PSA 64:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 64:3" />Bɛsi bɛ nloa kɛ adabɛlaka, na bɛka edwɛkɛ mɔɔ wowɔ kɛ ɛda mbaka la. <verse eid="PSA 64:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 64:4" />Bɛtoto ɛda mbaka bɛgua menli mɔɔ ɛnze nwolɛ bie la anwo; bɛtoto bɛ arɛlevilɛ nu ala mɔɔ bɛmbɔ bɛ kɔkɔ biala a. <verse eid="PSA 64:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 64:5" />Bɛgyi ye kpundii wɔ bɛ amumuyɛ akpamevalɛ ne anu; bɛdwenle adenle mɔɔ bɛdua zo a bɛkɛzuozua bɛ ngane ne mɔ la, na bɛka kɛ: “Nwane a kɛhola kɛnwu ye a? <verse eid="PSA 64:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 64:6" />Nwane a kɛhola kɛnwu ye ninyɛmunli ne mɔ abo zo a? Yɛzua nrɛlɛbɛ ɛhane.” Ɔluakɛ sonla ye adwenle nu nee ye ahonle nu ngyehyɛleɛ le awozinli.<verse eid="PSA 64:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 64:7" />Nana Nyamenle bado ye ɛda mbaka ne mɔ agua bɛ nwo zo; bɛbabodɛboda wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ bɛ nye ɛnla la. <verse eid="PSA 64:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 64:8" />Bɛ nloa edwɛkɛ bava bɛ ahɔ ngyegyelɛ nu; na menli mɔɔ kɛnwu bɛ la bazi bɛ amgbu. <verse eid="PSA 64:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 64:9" />Akee menli muala bazulo; bɛbaha nwanwanendeɛ mɔɔ Nyamenle ɛyɛ la; na bɛadwenle nwolɛ wɔ bɛ ahonle nu. <verse eid="PSA 64:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 64:10" />Bɛmaa tenlenema anye ɛlie wɔ Nana Nyamenle anu, na bɛnriandi bɛhɔvea ye nu! Bɛmaa menli mɔɔ le fɔɔnwo la ɛnyia anyunlunyia!<verse eid="PSA 64:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 64" />
  <chapter number="65" style="c" sid="PSA 65" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 65</para>
  <para style="s1">Nana Nyamenle ye Tumi nee ye Atiakunlukɛnlɛmayɛlɛ ne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 65:1" />O Zayɔn Nyamenle, wɔmɔ yɛɛ ayɛlɛyelɛ le wɔ deɛ a; wɔmɔ yɛɛ bɛbɔ wɔ ɛwɔkɛ a, ɔwɔ kɛ bɛdi zo a. <verse eid="PSA 65:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 65:2" />O wɔmɔ mɔɔ ɛtie nzɛlɛlɛ a! Ewiade amra kpokpoti bara wɔ ɛkɛ. <verse eid="PSA 65:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 65:3" />Ɔlua ɛtaneyɛlɛ ti, saa yɛ ɛtane bo yɛ nwo zo a, wɔmɔ ɛfa ɛkyɛ yɛ. <verse eid="PSA 65:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 65:4" />Nyilalɛ ɛha ahenle ne mɔɔ wɔmɔ wɔye ye kɛ ɔrɛla ɛ nwo, na ɔradɛnla wɔ belemgbunli aako ne anu la! Yɛ kunlu badwo wɔ kpalɛyɛlɛ nwo wɔ wɔ aako, wɔ Asɔne Sua Kpole nwuanzanwuanza ne anu! <verse eid="PSA 65:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 65:5" />Wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛlua nwanwanendeɛ zo ɛdie yɛ ngoane a, O yɛ pepɛdievolɛ Nyamenle. Wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛle azɛlɛ ye azo ɔ nee nyevile nzi moamoa nehane amra bɛ anyelazo a.<verse eid="PSA 65:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 65:6" />Wɔmɔ ɛlua wɔ anwosesebɛ zo wɔsisi awoka, na wɔva tumi wɔhye ɛ bo. <verse eid="PSA 65:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 65:7" />Wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛmaa nyevile da dii, na ɛmaa ye azɛlɛkye yɛ ngungoonwu, na ɛka menli begyebegyeyɛlɛ aze a. <verse eid="PSA 65:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 65:8" />Zɔhane ati bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛde azɛlɛ ne ako abo nehane la, nwu ɛ sa anloa sɛkɛlɛndeɛ ne mɔ, na ɛzulolɛ ka bɛ. Ɛmaa alehyenlɛ nee aledwolɛ fa fɛlɛko teɛdea nu, wɔ bɛ ɛhɔlɛ nee bɛ ɛrale nu. <verse eid="PSA 65:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 65:9" />Ɛtɔ nzule ɛgua azɛlɛ ye azo, na ɛmaa ɔkye aleɛ; ɛmaa azundenle muala yiyi na ɛmaa aleɛ ba; ɔluakɛ kɛ wɔ ngyehyɛleɛ ne de la ɛne. <verse eid="PSA 65:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 65:10" />Ɛmaa ezuzeane kpokpoti yiyi, na ehinlima ne mɔ azo yeye bɛ nwo ali; ɛfa kyɛngyɛ nzule ɛdo azɛlɛ ne, na ɛmaa mbaka kpokpoti so ma. <verse eid="PSA 65:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 65:11" />Ɛmaa aleɛ bu wɔ ɛvolɛ ne anu; na ɛleka biala mɔɔ ɛkɛva la le aleɛ ngome. <verse eid="PSA 65:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 65:12" />Ndile muala yɛ amunli, na awoka nye anwo amuala yɛ anyelielɛ. <verse eid="PSA 65:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 65:13" />Nyɛmoa kpolane fa azɛlɛ ne kpokpoti azo; mbɔnza ne mɔ amuala wula aleɛ kɛ asɛɛ bɛhedɛheda ndanlɛ la. Bɛ muala bɛbɔ nu, bɛteɛdea nu, bɛto edwɛne wɔ fɛlɛkolilɛ nu.<verse eid="PSA 65:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 65" />
  <chapter number="66" style="c" sid="PSA 66" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 66</para>
  <para style="s1">Nana Nyamenle ye Ayɛlɛyelɛ Edwɛnedolɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 66:1" />Aleɛabo amra, bɛ muala bɛva fɛlɛkolilɛ nee anyelielɛ bɛye Nyamenle ayɛlɛ. <verse eid="PSA 66:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 66:2" />Bɛdo ye anyunlunyia ne anwo edwɛne; na bɛva anyunlunyia bɛye ye ayɛlɛ!<verse eid="PSA 66:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 66:3" />Bɛze Awulae Nyamenle kɛ: “Nea nwanwane ninyɛne mɔɔ ɛyɛ a! Wɔ tumi ne le totohyia la ati, wɔ kpɔvolɛma fa ɛzulolɛ a koto ɛ nyunlu a. <verse eid="PSA 66:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 66:4" />Ewiade amra kpokpoti sonle wɔ; bɛto ayɛlɛyelɛ edwɛne bɛmaa wɔ. Bɛto ayɛlɛyelɛ edwɛne bɛkanvo wɔ duma.” <verse eid="PSA 66:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 66:5" />Bɛrɛla bɛranlea mɔɔ Nyamenle ɛyɛ: nwanwane nyɛleɛ mɔɔ yeyɛ yemaa menli la. <verse eid="PSA 66:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 66:6" />Ɔhakyile nyevile tɛtɛtɛlɛlɛ ne azɛlɛ ne ɔyɛle ye azɛlɛ reserese; na yɛ mgbanyima pɛle azule ne wɔ bɛ gyakɛ anu. Ɛkɛ ne yɛɛ yɛlile fɛlɛko wɔ mɔɔ yeyɛ la anwo a.<verse eid="PSA 66:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 66:7" />Yemɔ mɔɔ ɔlua ye tumi nu ɔsie ewiade wɔ melɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ, na ɔ nye wɔ maanle maanle nwo zo, mmamaa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛko bɛtia ye la dwazo.<verse eid="PSA 66:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 66:8" />Maanle maanle kpokpoti, bɛhanvo yɛ Nyamenle; bɛmaa bɛde bɛ nganvolɛ ne wɔ ɛleka biala. <verse eid="PSA 66:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 66:9" />Yemɔ mɔɔ yemaa yɛtɛte ngoane nu, na yɛtɛnwunle ewule ɛlɛ a. <verse eid="PSA 66:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 66:10" />O wɔmɔ Nyamenle, wɔzɔ yɛ wɔnlea! Kɛmɔ dwinvolɛ kolo ye dwɛtɛ fufule wɔ senle zo la, zɔhane ala yɛɛ wɔzɔ yɛ wɔnlea a. <verse eid="PSA 66:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 66:11" />Ɛmaa yɛtɔ ɛhane nu, na ɛfa adesoa mgbole mgbole ɛsoɔzoa yɛ. <verse eid="PSA 66:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 66:12" />Ɛmaa yɛ kpɔvolɛma tietia yɛ nwo zo. Ɛvale yɛ ɛluale senle nee azuyilɛ nu; na kɛkala, wɔye yɛ wɔvi munzule nu, ɛ nee yɛ ɛra file zo.<verse eid="PSA 66:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 66:13" />Mebava ɛyelalɛ azubɔdeɛ meara wɔ aako nu; na mearadua me ɛwɔkɛ ne mɔɔ membɔle wɔ la meamaa wɔ. <verse eid="PSA 66:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 66:14" />Mebava mɔɔ mengɔle ɛmianlɛ nu la menganle la meamaa wɔ. <verse eid="PSA 66:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 66:15" />Mebava mboane ɛyelalɛ azubɔdeɛ meamaa wɔ; mebava nlankɛ nee mbɔnkye azubɔdeɛ meamaa wɔ; na nyɛmoa ne mɔ bɛ esike ne adwu ɛ nwo lɔ wɔ anwuma nehane.<verse eid="PSA 66:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 66:16" />Bɛrɛla bɛradie, bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛdi Nana Nyamenle eni la amuala; mebabɔ mɔɔ yeyɛ yemaa me la nolo meahile bɛ. <verse eid="PSA 66:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 66:17" />Menzunle menvɛlɛle ye moalɛ, na me tafinlima yele ye ayɛlɛ. <verse eid="PSA 66:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 66:18" />Saa menvale ɛtane menziele me ahonle nu a, anrɛɛ Awulae andie me. <verse eid="PSA 66:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 66:19" />Nɔhalɛ nu, Nana Nyamenle ɛdie me; yedie me nzɛlɛlɛ.<verse eid="PSA 66:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 66:20" />Nyilalɛ ɛha Nana Nyamenle, ɔluakɛ yeamkpo kɛ ɔkɛdie me nzɛlɛlɛ, anzɛɛ kɛ ɔkɛye ye ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne ɔkɛvi me nwo zo!<verse eid="PSA 66:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 66" />
  <chapter number="67" style="c" sid="PSA 67" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 67</para>
  <para style="s1">Nyamegyimayɛlɛ nwo Edwɛndolɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 67:1" />Nana Nyamenle, nwu yɛ anwunvɔne na yila yɛ; fa atiakunlukɛnlɛmayɛlɛ nea yɛ nwo zo; <verse eid="PSA 67:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 67:2" />amaa ewiade amra amuala anwu wɔ ndenle ne, na bɛanwu wɔ ngoanelielɛ tumi ne. <verse eid="PSA 67:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 67:3" />Maa ewiade amra kpokpoti ɛhanvo wɔ, O Nana Nyamenle; maa aleɛabo amra ɛye wɔ ayɛlɛ! <verse eid="PSA 67:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 67:4" />Maa ewiade amra amuala ɛva anyelielɛ ɛdo fɛlɛko edwɛne; ɔluakɛ wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛfa pɛpɛlilɛ ɛbua menli ndɛne, na ɛsinza maanle biala mɔɔ wɔ azɛlɛ ye azo la a. <verse eid="PSA 67:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 67:5" />Maa azɛlɛ ye azo amra kpokpoti ɛhanvo wɔ, O Nana Nyamenle; maa ewiade amra ɛye wɔ ayɛlɛ! <verse eid="PSA 67:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 67:6" />Azɛlɛ ɛye aleɛ molozo; Nana Nyamenle, mɔɔ le yɛ Nyamenle la ɛyila yɛ. <verse eid="PSA 67:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 67:7" />Nana Nyamenle ɛyila yɛ; ɔti maa aleɛabo amra kpokpoti ɛli ye eni!<verse eid="PSA 67:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 67" />
  <chapter number="68" style="c" sid="PSA 68" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 68</para>
  <para style="s1">Nana Nyamenle mɔɔ bɔle Anwomanyunlu la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 68:1" />O Nana Nyamenle, dwazo, bɔ wɔ kpɔvolɛma asande; maa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkpɔ ye la ɛnriandi ɛvi ɔ nyunlu. <verse eid="PSA 68:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 68:2" />Kɛmɔ bɛwuda esike bɛmaa ɔkɔ la, zɔhane ala yɛɛ wuda bɛ maa bɛhɔ a. Kɛmɔ ehuaba kolo wɔ senle nu la, zɔhane ala a maa kpɔvolɛma ɛholo wɔ Nyamenle nyunlu a!<verse eid="PSA 68:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 68:3" />Emomu, maa tenlenema anye ɛlie, na bɛli fɛlɛko wɔ Awulae anyunlu; maa bɛva anyelielɛ bɛli fɛlɛko! <verse eid="PSA 68:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 68:4" />Bɛdo edwɛne bɛmaa Nana Nyamenle; bɛdo ayɛlɛyelɛ edwɛne bɛmaa ye duma ne. Bɛdo edwɛne bɛmaa ahenle ne mɔɔ lua amungu nu la, ye duma a le Awulae; bɛli fɛlɛko wɔ ɔ nyunlu! <verse eid="PSA 68:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 68:5" />Nrisa mralɛ bɛ ze, ɔ nee ahunlavolɛ bɛ sinzavolɛ, kɛ Nana Nyamenle de wɔ ye tɛnlabelɛ nwuanzanwuanza ne anu la ɛne. <verse eid="PSA 68:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 68:6" />Nana Nyamenle maa baholɛ nyia abusua; ɔmaa efiadedavolɛma nyia fanwodi; na emomu nzakatovoma ɛdeɛ, ɔmaa bɛtɛnla alɔbɔlɛ nu.<verse eid="PSA 68:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 68:7" />O Nana Nyamenle, mekɛ mɔɔ ɛlile wɔ menli ne mɔ anyunlu, ɛvale bɛ ɛpɛle ɛsɛlɛ ne la, <verse eid="PSA 68:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 68:8" />azɛlɛ wozole, na ezule dɔle totohyia wɔ Nyamenle nyunlu. Boka Saenae wozole wɔ ɛ nyunlu, wɔmɔ Yizilayɛ Nyamenle. <verse eid="PSA 68:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 68:9" />Ɛmaanle ezule dɔle bilididi, O Nana Nyamenle; na ɛmaanle azɛlɛ mɔɔ ɛhete la nyianle nzule. <verse eid="PSA 68:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 68:10" />Wɔ menli nyianle azɛlɛ kpalɛ dɛnlanle zolɛ. Wɔ wɔ ahunlunyele nu, O Nana Nyamenle, yɛɛ ɛmaanle ehyiavolɛma nyianle bɛ ngyianlɛndeɛ a.<verse eid="PSA 68:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 68:11" />Awulae fa mɛla ne ɔmaa, na menli bɔ ye nolo. <verse eid="PSA 68:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 68:12" />Arelemgbunli nee bɛ ɛlɔnema nriandi gyakyi bɛ konle ninyɛne wɔ bɛ nzi; na mraalɛ mɔɔ wɔ sua nu la kyɛ konle nwo nvasoɛ ne fa. <verse eid="PSA 68:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 68:13" />Bɔbɔ bɛboka mboane ekpunli nwo ɛdeɛ, noko akee bɛle kɛ abubule ndɛba mɔɔ bɛholo dwɛtɛ fufule bɛgua nwo la. Bɛ ndɛba ne mɔ ta kɛ nvutuke. <verse eid="PSA 68:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 68:14" />Mɔɔ Nana Nyamenle Bedevinli ne zandele arelemgbunli ne mɔ wɔ Zalemɔn azo la, ɔmaanle asukɔntweaba dɔle wɔ ɛkɛ ne.<verse eid="PSA 68:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 68:15" />O Beeshyan, boka bedevinli! Duzu boka a le wɔ, mɔɔ ɛ sa zo zonle zɛhae a? <verse eid="PSA 68:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 68:16" />Duzu ati a ɛmaa ɛ nye bolo Boka bedevinli ne, Boka ne mɔɔ Nana Nyamenle ɛva ɛyɛ ye tɛnlabelɛ, ɛleka ne mɔɔ Nana Nyamenle badɛnla wɔ melɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ la ɛ? <verse eid="PSA 68:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 68:17" />Mɔɔ bɛlɛ konlendeɛ ehwili mɔɔ kɛyɛ kɛ apenle bulu, mɔɔ bo mgbe mgbe bɔbɔ la, Awulae vi Saenae rale nwuanzanwuanzaleka ne. <verse eid="PSA 68:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 68:18" />Ɔfo ɔkɔ anwuma anwuma, ɔ nee menli mɔɔ yehye bɛ nuokɛ la dɔɔnwo a kɔ a. Ɔnyia ahyɛlɛndeɛ dɔɔnwo ɔfi menli mɔɔ ko tia ye la ɛkɛ; Awulae Nyamenle baboa ɛkɛ.<verse eid="PSA 68:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 68:19" />Bɛye Awulae ayɛlɛ, yemɔ mɔɔ alehyenlɛ dahuu ɔzo yɛ adesoa la; yemɔ a le Nyamenle ne mɔɔ die yɛ ngoane la a.<verse eid="PSA 68:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 68:20" />Yɛ Nyamenle ne le Nyamenle mɔɔ die ngoane a; ɔle yɛ Awulae, mɔɔ le yɛ mu yɛ Awulae, mɔɔ ye yɛ fi ewule nu a. <verse eid="PSA 68:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 68:21" />Nana Nyamenle bagelegele yɛ kpɔvolɛma ati, bɔbɔ bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛse bɛnrɛgyakyi ɛtanelilɛ la. <verse eid="PSA 68:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 68:22" />Awulae ɛha ye kɛ, “Mebava bɛ kpɔvolɛma meazia meavi Beeshyan meara; me nee bɛ bazia avi nyevile ne akɔme zo hwehwe nehane ara, <verse eid="PSA 68:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 68:23" />amaa bɛatietia bɛ mogya nu, na bɛ ahwea anyia bɛ mogya ne bie dɔɔnwo atafetafe.”<verse eid="PSA 68:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 68:24" />O Nana Nyamenle, menli kpokpoti ɛnwu wɔ konimlilɛ ɛlɔnwɔne ne mɔ, ɛlɔnwɔne ne mɔ mɔɔ kile Nana Nyamenle, me Belemgbunli ne sua nwuanzanwuanza ne anu ɛhɔlɛ la. <verse eid="PSA 68:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 68:25" />Edwɛndovolɛma lumua, yɛɛ aweɛnebɔvolɛma li amozi; wɔ ekpunli nwiɔ ɛhye avinli, mbɛlɛra ɛlɛwozo awa. <verse eid="PSA 68:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 68:26" />“Bɛye Nyamenle ayɛlɛ wɔ ayiaku kpole ne anu! Bɛye Nana Nyamenle ayɛlɛ, O Gyekɔbo amra kpokpoti!” <verse eid="PSA 68:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 68:27" />Bɛngyaman eku ɛdeɛ ne, mɔɔ le bɛ nuhua ekyi kpalɛ la yɛɛ lumua a; mɔɔ doa ye la a le Dwuda ekpunli ɛdeɛ ne, yɛɛ Zɛbulɛn nee Nafetalae eku ɛdeɛ ne mɔ a li amozi a. <verse eid="PSA 68:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 68:28" />Kile wɔ tumi, O Nana Nyamenle, wɔ anwosesebɛ ne mɔɔ wɔva wɔho wɔ yɛ ti la.<verse eid="PSA 68:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 68:29" />Kɛmɔ asɔne sua nwuanzanwuanza ne wɔ Gyɛlusalɛm la ati, arelemgbunli fa ahyɛlɛndeɛ bɛlɛ wɔ. <verse eid="PSA 68:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 68:30" />Twi nyɛmoa mɔɔ wɔ ndile nu la anyunlu! Twi maanle maanle mɔɔ le kɛ nlankɛ nyinli nee mbɛda la anyunlu! Tietia bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkulo ayɛlɛyelɛ la anwo zo, na bɔ menli mɔɔ kulo konle la asande. <verse eid="PSA 68:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 68:31" />Katakyiema vi Yigyibiti bara; na ndɛndɛ zo ala, Yiteɔpea badɛlɛ ɔ sa nu azɛlɛ Nana Nyamenle moalɛ. <verse eid="PSA 68:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 68:32" />O ewiade arelemgbunli, bɛdo ayɛlɛyelɛ edwɛne bɛhanvo Awulae. <verse eid="PSA 68:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 68:33" />Yemɔ mɔɔ ɔlua anwomanyunlu, tete anwomanyunlu, tie ye kɛ ɔlɛ ɛnelɛ kpole ɔlɛtea nu a!<verse eid="PSA 68:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 68:34" />Bɛva tumi kpole ne bɛmaa Nyamenle, yemɔ mɔɔ ye belemgbunlililɛ komo Yizilayɛ amuala anwo zo a; ye tumi keda anwomanyunlu amuala anwo zo. <verse eid="PSA 68:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 68:35" />Nana Nyamenle, Yizilayɛ Nyamenle ne anwo yɛ ɛzulolɛ wɔ ye nwuanzanwuanzaleka ne. Ɔfa tumi nee anwosesebɛ ɔmaa ye menli. Nyilalɛ ɛha Awulae.<verse eid="PSA 68:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 68" />
  <chapter number="69" style="c" sid="PSA 69" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 69</para>
  <para style="s1">Anyelazo Ngoanedievolɛ ne Edwɛndolɛ: Sonvolɛ Amaneɛnwuvolɛ ne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 69:1" />Die me ngoane, O Nana Nyamenle! Ɔluakɛ azule ɛlɛyi ava me. <verse eid="PSA 69:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 69:2" />Melɛmi meahɔ azia ne abo, ɔluakɛ menlɛ agyinlagyakɛ. Medɔ azukuma nu, na azɛlɛkye ne mɔ ɛlɛfa me ahɔ. <verse eid="PSA 69:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 69:3" />Mezu mevɛlɛ moalɛ mevɛ; akee me kominza ɛwe. Me nye ɛla me Nyamenle ade ɛvɛ, kɛ menwɔnyia moalɛ. <verse eid="PSA 69:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 69:4" />Bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkpɔ me ɛkpɔlɛ gyɛne la, zonle tɛla me ti zo enrinli bɔbɔ: me kpɔvolɛma mɔɔ kpondɛ kɛ bɛsɛkye me la kɛha me nwo edwɛkɛ ɛtane ɛtane. Mɔɔ metɛwuale bɔbɔ la, ɛnee bɛse mendua ye kakɛ.<verse eid="PSA 69:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 69:5" />O me Nyamenle, ɛze ngoaseade mɔɔ meyɛ la; ɛtane mɔɔ meyɛ la ɛnvea wɔ. <verse eid="PSA 69:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 69:6" />Mmamaa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛ anyelazo a le wɔ la anyunlu nyiane gua aze, O Awulae ɛlɔne Nyamenle; mmadua me nwo zo ɛmaa anyiemgba ka bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkpondɛ wɔ la, O Yizilayɛ Nyamenle. <verse eid="PSA 69:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 69:7" />Ɔlua wɔmɔ ti yɛɛ melɛsɔ anwubɛnyunlu ɛhye, na me nyunlu nyiane ɛgua aze a. <verse eid="PSA 69:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 69:8" />Meyɛ ɛyɛvolɛ wɔ me mediema anyunlu; yɛɛ meyɛ sonlagyɛne wɔ me abusua nu. <verse eid="PSA 69:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 69:9" />Wɔ asɔne ne anwo mɔdenlebɔlɛ ɛyɛ me adesoa, yɛɛ wɔ ndeanlɛ muala mɔɔ ɔwɔ kɛ ɛdie la amuala ɛhakyi ɛragua me nwo zo. <verse eid="PSA 69:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 69:10" />Saa melua ɛhɔnehyelɛ nu mebɛlɛ me nwo aze a, ɛnee menli ɛlɛbɔ me aholoba. <verse eid="PSA 69:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 69:11" />Saa mekeda ɛzɛne ɛdanlɛ a, ɛnee bɛlɛsi me amgbu. <verse eid="PSA 69:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 69:12" />Bɛkeha me nwo edwɛkɛ ɛtane ɛtane wɔ gua bile ne mɔ azo; yɛɛ nza bo a bɛto edwɛne bɛsa me a. <verse eid="PSA 69:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 69:13" />Na mame ɛdeɛ, ɛ sa nu yɛɛ me nzɛlɛlɛ wɔ a, O Nana Nyamenle. Saa mekɛ kpalɛ ne dwu a, O me Nyamenle, dua wɔ ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne azo tie me. <verse eid="PSA 69:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 69:14" />Dua wɔ nɔhalɛ moalɛ ne azo ye me fi ɛminlɛ mɔɔ melɛmi wɔ ndɛtɛlɛ ne anu la; maa bɛlie me bɛvi me kpɔvolɛma asa anu, na menvi azukuma ne anu.<verse eid="PSA 69:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 69:15" />Mmamaa azule yi fa me, mmamaa mewu wɔ azule bo, anzɛɛ mmamaa bɛkeda me nwo zo wɔ ewule kuma nu. <verse eid="PSA 69:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 69:16" />Nana Nyamenle tie me, ɔluakɛ wɔ ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne le kpalɛ; wɔ wɔ anwunvɔnezelɛ kpole ne anu, kakyi ɛ nye nea me. <verse eid="PSA 69:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 69:17" />Mmaye ɛ nye ɛfea wɔ akɛlɛ; ɔluakɛ mewɔ ɛmianlɛ nu, na ka ɛ nwo balie me. <verse eid="PSA 69:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 69:18" />Twe bikye me na ye me fi munzule nu, pepɛ die me fi me kpɔvolɛma asa anu. <verse eid="PSA 69:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 69:19" />Wɔmɔ a ɛze me ahwibɛnyunlu, yɛɛ me anyiemgba nee me anyunluguase a; wɔmɔ ɛze me kpɔvolɛma amuala kpokpoti.<verse eid="PSA 69:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 69:20" />Aholobabɔlɛ ɛbubu me ahonle bɔkɔɔ, ɔlua zo nyane ngome ɛyi me tɛkɛɛ. Me nye lale kɛ bɛkɛze me anwunvɔne, noko akee yeamba ye zɔ. Me nye lale kɛ menwɔnwu arɛlekyekyevolɛma, noko akee meannwu bie. <verse eid="PSA 69:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 69:21" />Ɛhɔne hunle me, na bɛmaanle me bɔnyema; nzuhɔne hunle me, na bɛmaanle me nza kasokaso. <verse eid="PSA 69:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 69:22" />Maa bɛ aleɛ mɔɔ bɛziezie mɔɔ bɛbali la ɛdo bɛ; maa bɛ ɛvoyia azubɔlɛ aleɛ ɛbɔ bɛ nloa nu. <verse eid="PSA 69:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 69:23" />Maa bɛ nye ɛyɛ minzinlaminzinla mɔɔ bɛnnwu debie kpalɛ a; maa bɛ nzi mbowule dahuu ɛyɛ gɔhɔlɔɔ. <verse eid="PSA 69:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 69:24" />Maa wɔ ɛyavalɛ ne ɛrɛla bɛ nwo zo, na maa wɔ ahwibɛnyunlu kpole ne ɛrɛla bɛ nwo zo. <verse eid="PSA 69:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 69:25" />Maa bɛ bo zo tɛnlabelɛ ɛhakyi suadu, na mmamaa sonla ɛdwoba ko bɔbɔ ka bɛ aako nu. <verse eid="PSA 69:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 69:26" />Ɔluakɛ bɛ nee mɔɔ wɔmɔ wɔdea ye la di ye ɛnwonlenwonle, na bɛsia bɛkondɔ bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛbodɛboda la bɛ nganlɛ ne mɔ bieko. <verse eid="PSA 69:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 69:27" />Fa ndeanlɛ sɔ bɛ ndeanlɛ ne mɔ azo; na mmamaa bɛnyia anzondwolɛ biala bɛfi wɔ ngoanelielɛ ne anu. <verse eid="PSA 69:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 69:28" />Kyikyi bɛ anluma fi filezo amra anluma buluku ne anu bɔkɔɔ; mmamaa bɛ anluma finde tenlenema anluma buluku ne anu hweledede.<verse eid="PSA 69:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 69:29" />Nyane nee alɔbɔlɛ ɛlɛku me; fa wɔ ngoanelielɛ ne, O Nana Nyamenle, ye me fi munzule nu! <verse eid="PSA 69:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 69:30" />Mebava edwɛnedolɛ meaye Awulae Nana Nyamenle duma ne ayɛlɛ; mebava moyɛlɛ meahanvo ye duma kpole ne. <verse eid="PSA 69:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 69:31" />Ɛhye bazɔ Nana Nyamenle anye adɛla kɛ menwɔva ɛnlankɛ menwɔbɔ azu menwɔmaa ye; anzɛɛ kɛ menwɔva ɛnlankɛ nyinli menwɔbɔ azu menwɔmaa ye. <verse eid="PSA 69:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 69:32" />Maa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛsisi bɛ la ɛnwu ɛhye, na bɛ nye ɛlie; maa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛsu bɛfɛlɛ Nana Nyamenle la arɛle ɛkyekye. <verse eid="PSA 69:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 69:33" />Ɔluakɛ Awulae tie bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛwɔ ɛmianlɛ nu la, na ɔmmaa ɔ rɛle ɛnvi ye menli mɔɔ gua efiade la.<verse eid="PSA 69:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 69:34" />Bɛmaa anwuma nee aze kpokpoti ɛye Nyamenle ayɛlɛ, Nyevile ɔ nee debie biala mɔɔ wɔ nuhua la. <verse eid="PSA 69:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 69:35" />Ɔluakɛ Nana Nyamenle baho alie Gyɛlusalɛm, na yeazia yeasisi Dwuda azua ne mɔ bieko; na ye menli badɛnla ɛkɛ, na azua ne mɔ ayɛ bɛ deɛ. <verse eid="PSA 69:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 69:36" />Ye azonvolɛ abo zo amra bava azɛlɛ ne; na bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkulo ye la badɛnla ɛkɛ ne.<verse eid="PSA 69:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 69" />
  <chapter number="70" style="c" sid="PSA 70" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 70</para>
  <para style="s1">Nzɛlɛlɛ mɔɔ bɛfa bɛsɛlɛ moalɛ bɛfi Gyegyeravolɛma asa anu la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 70:1" />Maa ɛ nye ɛlie, O Nana Nyamenle, kɛ ɛkɛdie me! Bɛla ndɛndɛ baboa me, O Awulae! <verse eid="PSA 70:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 70:2" />Maa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkpondɛ kɛ bɛku me la adwenle ɛyɛ sesakaa, na bɛ kpɔvolɛma ɛli bɛ nwo zo konim. Maa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ ɔlua me nyanelilɛ ti bɛlɛdi fɛlɛko la, ɛzia bɛ nzi wɔ anyiemgba nu! <verse eid="PSA 70:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 70:3" />Maa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ besi me amgbu la, bɛ adwenlenzuzulɛ ɛtane ne ɛbu ɛzia bɛ. Bɛmɛ mɔɔ dahuu bɛse kɛ “Aha, Aha! a”. <verse eid="PSA 70:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 70:4" />Maa menli mɔɔ kpondɛ ɛ bo zo la ɛnyia anyelielɛ na bɛli fɛlɛko. Maa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛ nye sɔ wɔ ngoanelielɛ ne la, dahuu ɛha ye kɛ, “Nyamenle le Tumivolɛ!” <verse eid="PSA 70:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 70:5" />Mele ehyianli, yɛɛ me nwo ɛhyele me. Bɛla ndɛndɛ, O Nana Nyamenle, na balie me. Wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛle me boavolɛ nee me ngoanedievolɛ a, O Awulae! Bɛla ndɛndɛ baboa me. Mmakyɛ fee zɛ, O Awulae!<verse eid="PSA 70:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 70" />
  <chapter number="71" style="c" sid="PSA 71" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 71</para>
  <para style="s1">Anwodelɛnli Akpanyima bie ye Edwɛne nee ye Nzɛlɛlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 71:1" />O Nana Nyamenle, wɔmɔ yɛɛ mefa me rɛle mewula wɔ nu a; mmamaa me nyunlu nyiane gua aze kenlebie maanle nu ɛlɛ. <verse eid="PSA 71:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 71:2" />Wɔ wɔ tenleneyɛlɛ ne anu, boa me na die me; yɛ ɛnzolɛ maa me, na die me ngoane. <verse eid="PSA 71:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 71:3" />Yɛ Bodane maa me, na bɔ me nwo bane; ɔluakɛ wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛle me sinzavolɛ, ɔ nee me nriandifeabelɛ a. <verse eid="PSA 71:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 71:4" />Pepɛ die me, O me Nyamenle, fi me kpɔvolɛma asa anu; ye me fi amumuyɛvoma ɔ nee atisesebɛvoma bɛ tumi nu. <verse eid="PSA 71:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 71:5" />Ɔluakɛ O Awulae, wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛle me anyelazo a; wɔ nu yɛɛ meva me rɛle mewula sumunli me mgbavolɛ nu a. <verse eid="PSA 71:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 71:6" />Wɔmɔ yɛɛ mehisa wɔ vi me mbɛda nu a; wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛyele me ɛvile ɔmɔ akunlu a; dahuu me ayɛlɛyelɛ dwu ɛ nwo zo. <verse eid="PSA 71:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 71:7" />Mehakyi nwanwane debie wɔ menli nye zo; noko akee wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛle me feabelɛ ɛsesebɛ ɛsesebɛ a. <verse eid="PSA 71:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 71:8" />Wɔ ayɛlɛyelɛ ɛyi me nloa tɛkɛɛ; alehyenlɛ biala mebɔ wɔ anyunlunyia ne anwo nolo.<verse eid="PSA 71:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 71:9" />Mmaye me rɛle ɛto me sa nu wɔ me mgbanyinliyɛlɛ mekɛ nu; mmamaa ɛ rɛle fi me wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ me anwosesebɛ kɛwie la. <verse eid="PSA 71:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 71:10" />Ɔluakɛ me kpɔvolɛma fa me ɛhunlɛ nwo akpame; bɛkeha me nwo edwɛke ɛtane ɛtane. <verse eid="PSA 71:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 71:11" />Bɛka kɛ, “Nyamenle ɛkpo ye; bɛdu ye ako kɛ bɛkɛhye ye; ɔluakɛ awie biala ɛnle ɛkɛ mɔɔ ɔkɛlie ye a.” <verse eid="PSA 71:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 71:12" />O Nana Nyamenle, mmate ɛ nwo ɛkɔ moa ɛfi me nwo; O me Awulae, bɛla ndɛndɛ na balie me! <verse eid="PSA 71:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 71:13" />Maa me kpɔvolɛma anwo ɛdo na bɛyela dwɛɛ; maa anyunluguase nee anyiemgba ɛha bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkpondɛ bɛazɛkye me la. <verse eid="PSA 71:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 71:14" />Noko akee mame ɛdeɛ, mebava me rɛle meawula wɔ nu; na meaye wɔ ayɛlɛ dahuu dahuu. <verse eid="PSA 71:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 71:15" />Mebabɔ wɔ tenlene nyɛleɛ ne anwo ɛlawule, mɔɔ fale wɔ ngoanelielɛ ne anwo la dahuu; ɔluakɛ bɛ dɔɔnwo bo me adwenle zo. <verse eid="PSA 71:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 71:16" />Mebalua Awulae Nyamenle nyɛleɛ mgbole mgbole ne mɔ anu meara ɛ nwo; na meaye ye tenleneyɛlɛ ne mɔɔ le ɛ ngomekye wɔ deɛ la ayɛlɛ. <verse eid="PSA 71:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 71:17" />O Nana Nyamenle, wɔhilehile me sumunli me ngakula nu; yɛɛ kɛkala bɔbɔ, metɛbɔ wɔ nwanwane ninyɛne ne anwo ɛlawule. <verse eid="PSA 71:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 71:18" />Zɔhane ati, bɔbɔ wɔ me mgbanyiyɛlɛ, ɔ nee me mbelerayɛlɛ nu, mmakpo me, O Nana Nyamenle, kɔkpula kɛ menwɔbɔ wɔ anwosesebɛ ne anwo nolo menwɔhile angabɛnzoma mɔɔ ɛlɛba la. <verse eid="PSA 71:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 71:19" />Wɔ tumi nee wɔ tenleneyɛlɛ, O Nana Nyamenle, dwu anwuma moamoa nehane. Wɔmɔ yɛɛ wɔyɛ ninyɛne mgbole mgbole a. O Nana Nyamenle, nwane yɛɛ nee wɔ sɛ a? <verse eid="PSA 71:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 71:20" />Ɛdawɔ mɔɔ wɔmaa menwu anwubɛnyunlu dɔɔnwo la, yɛɛ ɛbamaa meadwazo bieko a. Ɛbaye me wɔavi azɛlɛ ne abo nehane wɔara ngoane nu bieko. <verse eid="PSA 71:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 71:21" />Ɛbado me anyunlunyia nu, na wɔakyekye me rɛle bieko.<verse eid="PSA 71:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 71:22" />Medame noko mebava sanwunle meahanvo wɔ diedi kpundii ne, O me Nyamenle; mebava getae meaye wɔ ayɛlɛ, O Yizilayɛ Nyamenle Nwuanzanwuanza. <verse eid="PSA 71:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 71:23" />Mebali fɛlɛko wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ meto ayɛlɛyelɛ edwɛne meamaa wɔ la; me ɛkɛla ne mɔɔ wɔlie ye ngoane la noko baye wɔ ayɛlɛ zɔhane ala. <verse eid="PSA 71:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 71:24" />Akee me tafinlima noko baha wɔ tenlene moalɛ ne anwo edwɛkɛ dahuu; ɔluakɛ wɔmaa nyiane nee anyiemgba ɛha bɛdabɛ mɔɔ anrɛɛ kpondɛ azɛkye me la.<verse eid="PSA 71:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 71" />
  <chapter number="72" style="c" sid="PSA 72" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 72</para>
  <para style="s1">Nzɛlɛlɛ mɔɔ bɛyɛ bɛmaa Arelemgbunli Sɔlɔmɔn nee Gyisɛse la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 72:1" />O Awulae Nyamenle, fa wɔ pɛpɛlilɛ ne maa wɔ Belemgbunli ne; fa wɔ tenleneyɛlɛ ne maa belemgbunli ara ne! <verse eid="PSA 72:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 72:2" />Maa ɔva pepɛlilɛ ɔbua wɔ menli ndɛne, na ɔva tenleneyɛlɛ ɔmaa menli mɔɔ wɔ ngyianlɛ nu la. <verse eid="PSA 72:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 72:3" />Maa awoka ne mɔ amuala ɛzo anzondwolɛ ma ɛmaa maanle ne anu amra; maa tenleneyɛlɛ noko ɛrɛla! <verse eid="PSA 72:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 72:4" />Maa ɔho ɔlie ehyiavolɛma, na akee ɔpepɛ ɔlie menli mɔɔ wɔ ngyianlɛ nu la, na ɔbɔ amumuyɛvo ne abo zo bɔkɔɔ. <verse eid="PSA 72:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 72:5" />Maa ɔdɛnla ngoane nu, wɔ mekɛ ala mɔɔ sɛnzɛne nee siane tɛbɔ anwomanyunlu la wɔ ɛlɔnwɔne kpokpoti mɔɔ bara la anu.<verse eid="PSA 72:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 72:6" />Maa ɔyɛ kɛ fɔsɛlɛ ezule mɔɔ tɔ gua azɛlɛ zo, ɔ nee nyenyensuo mɔɔ tɔ gua azɛlɛ mɔɔ ɛhete la azo la. <verse eid="PSA 72:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 72:7" />Wɔ ye belemgbunlililɛ mekɛ nu, maa tenleneyɛlɛ ɛrɛla azɛlɛ ye azo; na anzondwolɛ ɛbu zo kɔkpula kɛ siane ɛnrɛda bieko a! <verse eid="PSA 72:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 72:8" />Maa ye belemgbunli maanle ne ɛdɛlɛ ɛhɔ maanle ti nee maanle bo; maa ɔvi Azule ne anu, ɔva ewiade ye amuala kpokpoti. <verse eid="PSA 72:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 72:9" />Maa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛde ɛsɛlɛ ne azo la ɛbɔ bɛ ti aze ɛmaa ye; na maa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkyi ye la ɛtafetafe azeva ne! <verse eid="PSA 72:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 72:10" />Maa arelemgbunli mɔɔ vi Tahyehye, ɔ nee bɛdabɛ mɔɔ gua bɔra ne azo la ɛzonle ye; yɛɛ arelemgbunli noko mɔɔ vi Sheba ɔ nee Seba la ɛva bɛ ahyɛlɛndeɛ ɛrɛlɛ ye. <verse eid="PSA 72:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 72:11" />Maa arelemgbunli kpokpoti ɛbɔ bɛ ti aze ɛmaa ye; maanle maanle muala ɛzonle ye!<verse eid="PSA 72:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 72:12" />Ɔluakɛ ɔpepɛ ɔdie bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛsu bɛfɛlɛ ye wɔ bɛ anwongyelelɛ nu la, ɔ nee ehyiavolɛma nee bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛnlɛ boavolɛma la. <verse eid="PSA 72:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 72:13" />Ɔse bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛnlɛ anwosesebɛ la ɔ nee ehyiavolɛma anwunvɔne, na ɔdie ehyiavolɛma ngoane. <verse eid="PSA 72:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 72:14" />Ɔpepɛ ɔdie bɛdabɛ mɔɔ menli ɛnva bɛ ɛnyɛ ɛhwee na bɛtietia bɛ nwo zo la ngoane; na ɛhye mɔ noko a bɛ ngoane sonle bolɛ maa ye a.<verse eid="PSA 72:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 72:15" />Maa ɔnyi ɔhyɛ, na bɛva nvutuke bɛvi Sheba bɛrɛle ye! Bɛhɔ zo bɛyɛ nzɛlɛlɛ bɛmaa ye, na bɛzɛlɛ Nana Nyamenle ye nyilalɛ bɛmaa ye dahuu! <verse eid="PSA 72:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 72:16" />Maa aleɛ ɛrɛla dɔɔnwo wɔ azɛlɛ ne azo; maa awoka ne mɔ kpokpoti ɛla aleɛ ne ali. Maa azɛlɛ ne ɛye ye mbakama kɛ Lɛbanɔn mbakama la; maa menli dɔɔnwo ɛrɛla azua mgbole ne mɔ azo, na bɛyɛ manyamanya kɛ ɛbɔ nu nvusinra la! <verse eid="PSA 72:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 72:17" />Mmamaa menli arɛle fi belemgbunli ne duma ɛlɛ; ye nganeɛ ɛwa azɛlɛ ye azo wɔ mekɛ ala mɔɔ ewia tɛfi la! Maa menli ɛlua ɔ nwo zo ɛnyia nyilalɛ, na maanle maanle kpokpoti ɛvɛlɛ ye ɛha kɛ: “Nyilalɛ ɛha ye!”<verse eid="PSA 72:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 72:18" />Nyilalɛ ɛha Awulae, mɔɔ le Yizilayɛ Nyamenle ne, mɔɔ ɔ ngomekye a ɔyɛ nwanwane ninyɛne ɛhye mɔ la! <verse eid="PSA 72:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 72:19" />Nyilalɛ ɛha ye anyunlunyia duma ne wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ! Ye anyunlunyia ɛyi ewiade amuala tɛkɛɛ! Ɔyɛ ɛkɛ! Na eza Ɔyɛ ɛkɛ!<verse eid="PSA 72:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 72:20" />Gyɛsi ara Devidi, ye nzɛlɛlɛ ne awieleɛ ne ɛne.<verse eid="PSA 72:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 72" />
  <chapter number="73" style="c" sid="PSA 73" />
  <para style="ms">Buluku Mɔɔ Tɔ Zo Nsa</para>
  <para style="mr">
    <ref loc="PSA 73-89">Edw. 73–89</ref></para>
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 73</para>
  <para style="s1">Amumuyɛvoma bɛ Ngɔzo ɔ nee bɛ Awieleɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 73:1" />Nɔhalɛ nu, Nana Nyamenle ati akunlu le kpalɛ maa Yizilayɛ; ɔle kpalɛ ɔmaa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛ ahonle nu te la. <verse eid="PSA 73:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 73:2" />Na mame ɛdeɛ, asɛɛ me gyakɛ ɛhoati bɔbɔ! Ɔhale ekyii na meatele meadɔ aze. <verse eid="PSA 73:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 73:3" />Ɔluakɛ me nye bolole bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛbu bɛ nwo la, wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ menwunle kɛ atisesebɛvoma ɛyɛ boɛ la. <verse eid="PSA 73:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 73:4" />Nɔhalɛ nu, bɛmɛ bɛnli nyane wɔ ɛbɛlabɔlɛ nu; bɛte kpɔkɛ, yɛɛ bɛlɛ anwosesebɛ wɔ bɛ nwo nane nu. <verse eid="PSA 73:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 73:5" />Bɛnle ɛmianlɛ nu kɛmɔ bɛ gɔnwo mɔ wɔ ye la; bɛnnwu amaneɛ kɛmɔ bɛ gɔnwo mɔ nwu ye la. <verse eid="PSA 73:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 73:6" />Ɛhye ati amemaabɛnwozo le bɛ ndweabane mɔɔ la bɛ kɔme nu a; yɛɛ basabasayɛlɛ ɛwula bɛ tɛladeɛ. <verse eid="PSA 73:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 73:7" />Ninyɛndane ngome a vi bɛ ahonle ne mɔ anu finde a; yɛɛ amumuyɛ ngyehyɛleɛ ngome ɛyi bɛ adwenle kpa. <verse eid="PSA 73:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 73:8" />Bɛsi awie mɔ gyɛne amgbu, na akee bɛsuzu adwenle ɛtane bɛmaa bɛ gɔnwo mɔ; bɛfa nzisi bɛnwunlonwunla bɛ gɔnwo mɔ nrɛlɛbɛ nu ala. <verse eid="PSA 73:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 73:9" />Bɛtendɛ bɛtia anwuma, na azɛlɛ ye ɛdeɛ, yemɔ bɛmbu ye bie hweledede.<verse eid="PSA 73:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 73:10" />Zɔhane ati menli ye bɛ ayɛlɛ; ɔluakɛ bɛnnwu ɛtane biala wɔ bɛ nwo. <verse eid="PSA 73:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 73:11" />Bɛ edwɛkɛ mɔɔ bɛka la a le kɛ: “Kɛ ɔkɛyɛ na Nana Nyamenle anwu ye ɛ? Anzɛɛ adwenle bie wɔ Nyamenle Bedevinli ne ati anu ɔ?” <verse eid="PSA 73:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 73:12" />Ɛhɛe! Ɛhye mɔ a le atiakunlutanevolɛma ne mɔ. Dahuu bɛ nwo tɔ bɛ, yɛɛ bɛ anwonyia noko yɛ mbɔnwo mbɔnwo.<verse eid="PSA 73:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 73:13" />Ɛnee akee duzu nvasoɛ yɛɛ menyianle ye wɔ nɔhalɛlilɛ nwo a? Duzu debie kpalɛ yɛɛ menyianle ye wɔ pɛpɛlilɛ nwo a? <verse eid="PSA 73:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 73:14" />Alehyenlɛ biala medi nyane, na bɛtietia me nwo zo. <verse eid="PSA 73:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 73:15" />Saa menganle kɛ, “Menwɔha zɛhae bɔbɔ” a, anrɛɛ me angabɛnzo mralɛ bule me kɛ menli nɔhalɛ. <verse eid="PSA 73:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 73:16" />Noko akee mɔɔ mendwenlenle, kɛ ɔkɛyɛ na meahola meade ɛhye mɔ abo la, ɔyɛle me kɛ ɔle ateetee gyima bie la. <verse eid="PSA 73:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 73:17" />Na mɔɔ mengɔle Nana Nyamenle Asɔne Sua ne anu la, akee menwunle ɛhye mɔ amuala awieleɛ. <verse eid="PSA 73:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 73:18" />Nɔhalɛ nu, wɔmɔ ɛfa bɛ ɛsie nzenzemile nu; ɛmaa bɛtele bɛgua ɛzɛkyelɛ nu. <verse eid="PSA 73:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 73:19" />Bɛsɛkye wɔ mekɛ ekyii bie anu; ɔngyɛ ɛnee bɛ bo zo ɛminli bɔkɔɔ. <verse eid="PSA 73:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 73:20" />Bɛle kɛ ɛlalɛ mɔɔ yɛka ye nla nu la; yɛdwazo a ɛnee yɛ rɛle ɛvi; yɛnva yɛnyɛ ɛhwee.<verse eid="PSA 73:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 73:21" />Mekɛ mɔɔ me ɛkɛla lile nyane, na me ahonle nu wowɔle me la, <verse eid="PSA 73:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 73:22" />menyɛle koasea kɛ menze nwolɛ bie la; menyɛle kɛ ɛbɔ nu nane wɔ ɛ nyunlu. <verse eid="PSA 73:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 73:23" />Suzuamgba ala mɔɔ mewɔ ɛ sa nu dahuu la, wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛ nee me lua a. <verse eid="PSA 73:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 73:24" />Wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛfa wɔ folɛdulɛ ɛwowa me, na akee ɛdie me ɛkɔ anyunlunyia nu a. <verse eid="PSA 73:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 73:25" />Nwane bieko yɛɛ melɛ ye wɔ anwuma maanle ne anu boka ɛ nwo a? Debie biala ɛnle azɛlɛ ye azo mɔɔ mekulo boka ɛ nwo a. <verse eid="PSA 73:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 73:26" />Me sonlabaka ne nee me ahonle ne bakpa, noko akee Nana Nyamenle a le me ɛkɛla ne anwosesebɛmaavo, ɔ nee me afoa nu deɛ wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ a.<verse eid="PSA 73:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 73:27" />Bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛde bɛ nwo bɛhɔ moamoa la abo zo baminli; yɛɛ bɛdabɛ noko mɔɔ bɛnli nɔhalɛ la, ɛpɛ bɛ mekɛ zo.<verse eid="PSA 73:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 73:28" />Na mame ɛdeɛ, ɔle kpalɛ ɔmaa me kɛ menwɔhwe menwɔbikye Nana Nyamenle. Meva Awulae Nyamenle ne meyɛ me nriandifeabelɛ, amaa meabɔ wɔ nwanwane gyima ne anwo ɛlawule.<verse eid="PSA 73:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 73" />
  <chapter number="74" style="c" sid="PSA 74" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 74</para>
  <para style="s1">Boka Zayɔn ye ɛzɛkyelɛ ne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 74:1" />O Awulae Nana Nyamenle, duzu ati a wɔvuandi yɛ wɔgua wɔvi ɛ nyunlu wɔ melɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ a? Duzu ati a wɔ ɛyavalɛ ɛyɛ kpole ɛtia wɔ mboane mɔɔ wɔ wɔ adidileka la a? <verse eid="PSA 74:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 74:2" />Kakye wɔ menli mɔɔ ɛvale bɛ ɛyɛle wɔ deɛ mekɛ dɛbadɛba bie mɔɔ ɛraze ɛhɔ, menli mɔɔ ɛlielɛ bɛ ngoane kɛ bɛrayɛ wɔ koliagya mralɛ la! Kakye Boka Zayɔn, ɛleka ne mɔɔ ɛdɛnlanle mekɛ bie la.<verse eid="PSA 74:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 74:3" />Tudu agyakɛ kɔ wɔ maanle ne mɔɔ ɛzɛkye la azo; kpɔvolɛma ɛzɛkye debie biala mɔɔ wɔ Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu la! <verse eid="PSA 74:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 74:4" />Wɔ kpɔvolɛma ne mɔ teɛdea nu kpo wowo wowo wɔ ayialeka ne mɔ; bɛfa bɛ sɛkɛlɛneɛ avɛlɛnra bɛsiezie ɛkɛ ne kɛ asɛɛ bɛli konim la. <verse eid="PSA 74:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 74:5" />Bɛvale akuma bɛbubule nlenkɛ ne mɔ mɔɔ di kɔ anwuma nehane la; <verse eid="PSA 74:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 74:6" />na bɛvale hamenle mɔ nee nrɛlande bɛzɛkyele ngakyelɛ sɛkɛlɛndeɛ mɔɔ wɔ sua ne anu la amuala. <verse eid="PSA 74:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 74:7" />Bɛvale senle bɛdole wɔ Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu bɛyelale ye dwɛɛ; na bɛguale wɔ nwuanzanwuanzaleka ne anwo evinli. <verse eid="PSA 74:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 74:8" />Akee bɛhanle ye wɔ bɛ ahonle nu kɛ: “Bɛmaa yɛzɛkye bɛ bɔkɔɔ!” Bɛyelale Nana Nyamenle ayiasua ne mɔ mɔɔ wɔ maanle ne anu la kpokpoti.<verse eid="PSA 74:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 74:9" />Yɛnnwu ye sɛkɛleneɛ biala; ngapezoma biala ɛnle ɛkɛ ne bieko; yɛɛ awie biala noko ɛnle yɛ nu mɔɔ ɔze mekɛ mɔɔ ɛhye mɔ kɛwie a. <verse eid="PSA 74:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 74:10" />O Nana Nyamenle, wɔ kpɔvolɛma ɛha wɔ ahyi ɛhɔkpula kenle nzu? Bɛbahɔ zo bɛabɔ wɔ duma ne aholoba, wɔ melɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ la ɔ? <verse eid="PSA 74:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 74:11" />Duzu ati a wɔgyakyi kɛ ɛkɛboa yɛ ɛ? Duzu ati a wɔva ɛ sa fema ne wɔgua ɛ nzi, kɛ asɛɛ ɛnnwu mɔɔ bɛlɛyɛ la ɛ?<verse eid="PSA 74:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 74:12" />Noko akee Nana Nyamenle mɔɔ le me Belemgbunli la, vi tete mekɛ zo ɛlɛyɛ ngoanelielɛ gyima ne wɔ ewiade amuala. <verse eid="PSA 74:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 74:13" />Wɔmɔ a ɛlua wɔ anwosesebɛ nu ɛkpakyele nyevile nu nwiɔ a; wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛgelegelele awozonle ne mɔ ati wɔ nzule bo a. <verse eid="PSA 74:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 74:14" />Wɔmɔ a ɛgelegelele nyevizonle ti ɛhunle ye, na ɛmaanle ɔyɛle aleɛ ɔmaanle ɛbɔ nu nyɛmoa a. <verse eid="PSA 74:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 74:15" />Wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛkpakyekpakyele azɛlɛ nu ɛmaanle nzule vi nu vindele a; wɔmɔ a ɛmaanle azule mɔɔ se la sesanle a. <verse eid="PSA 74:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 74:16" />Alehyenlɛ le wɔ deɛ, yɛɛ aledwolɛ noko le wɔ deɛ. Wɔmɔ a ɛvale sɛnzɛne ne nee ewia ne mɔ ɛhendɛhendanle anwomanyunlu a. <verse eid="PSA 74:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 74:17" />Wɔmɔ a ɛze azɛlɛ ti nee ɔ bo a; ɛdawɔ a ɛyɛle fɔsɛlɛ nee bokile a. <verse eid="PSA 74:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 74:18" />Kakye ɛhye, O Nana Nyamenle, kɛ wɔ kpɔvolɛma zile zile wɔ amgbu, na menli mɔɔ anwo ɛnde la gua wɔ duma ne anwo evinli la.<verse eid="PSA 74:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 74:19" />Mmakpo wɔ menli mɔɔ bɛnlɛ kamaavolɛ la ɛmaa bɛ kpɔvolɛma; mmamaa ɛ rɛle fi wɔ ehyiavolɛma bɛ ngoane wɔ melɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ. <verse eid="PSA 74:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 74:20" />Kakye wɔ ngyehyɛlɛ ne mɔɔ ɛ nee yɛ yɛle la; ɔluakɛ nzakatovoma ɛva aleɛabo awozileka ne mɔ kpokpoti ɛhakyi bɛ tɛnlabelɛ. <verse eid="PSA 74:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 74:21" />Mmamaa anyiemgba ka bɛdabɛ mɔɔ menli sisi bɛ la; emomu maa ehyiavolɛma, ɔ nee bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛnlɛ moalɛ biala la, ɛye wɔ duma ayɛlɛ dahuu. <verse eid="PSA 74:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 74:22" />Dwazo, O Nana Nyamenle, na ko die wɔ duma! Kakye kɛ menli mɔɔ ɛnle tenlene la si dahuu si wɔ amgbu la. <verse eid="PSA 74:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 74:23" />Mmamaa ɛ rɛle fi wɔ kpɔvolɛma ane, bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛdwazo bɛtia wɔ dahuu la bɛ alɛrayɛlɛ.<verse eid="PSA 74:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 74" />
  <chapter number="75" style="c" sid="PSA 75" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 75</para>
  <para style="s1">Nyamenle ne mɔɔ bua Maanlesievoma ndɛne la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 75:1" />Yɛyɛ wɔ mo, O Nana Nyamenle, yɛyɛ wɔ mo. Yɛbɔ wɔ duma, na yɛka wɔ nwanwane ninyɛne ne mɔ mɔɔ wɔyɛ la.<verse eid="PSA 75:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 75:2" />Nana Nyamenle se, “Saa menyia mekɛ kpalɛ a, menwɔbua ndɛne pɛlepɛle. <verse eid="PSA 75:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 75:3" />Saa azɛlɛ wozo, ɔ nee ye nuhua menli kpokpoti a, mame yɛɛ memaa ɔgyinla kpundii a.<verse eid="PSA 75:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 75:4" />“Meka mekile bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛtu bɛ nwo la kɛ, Bɛmmatu bɛ nwo; yɛɛ mese amumuyɛvoma noko kɛ, ‘Bɛmmamemaa bɛ nwo zo; <verse eid="PSA 75:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 75:5" />bɛmmayɛ bɛ mbati ngengɛndɛɛnye, anzɛɛ bɛmmakyengye bɛ nwo bɛtendɛ.’ ” <verse eid="PSA 75:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 75:6" />Ɔluakɛ ndɛnebualɛ ɛnvi sɛnzɛne aduduleɛ anzɛɛ ye adɔleɛ; ɔnvi fiemgbole zo anzɛɛ boka zo; <verse eid="PSA 75:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 75:7" />na emomu Nana Nyamenle yɛɛ bua ndɛne a. Ɔbu bie mɔ fɔlɛ, yɛɛ ɔbu bie mɔ benle. <verse eid="PSA 75:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 75:8" />Nana Nyamenle lɛ kɔpo wɔ ɔ sa nu, mɔɔ ye ɛyavalɛ ɛyi ye tɛkɛɛ kɛ nza ɛsesebɛ a. Ɔbawola yeagua azɛlɛ ye azo, na ɛtanevolɛma anlo ye kpokpoti adu ɔ bo. <verse eid="PSA 75:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 75:9" />Na mame ɛdeɛ, mebali fɛlɛko mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ. Mebado edwɛne meaye Gyekɔbo Nyamenle ne ayɛlɛ. <verse eid="PSA 75:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 75:10" />Mebapepɛ ɛtanevolɛma mɛne ne mɔ meagua bɛ lɔ, na tenlenema mɛne ɛdeɛ ne mɔ, yemɔ bɛbakpogya zolɛ anwuma anwuma.<verse eid="PSA 75:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 75" />
  <chapter number="76" style="c" sid="PSA 76" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 76</para>
  <para style="s1">Moyɛlɛ Edwɛne mɔɔ bɛfa bɛsɛlɛ Ɛpepɛlielɛ la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 76:1" />Dwuda amra ze Nyamenle; yɛɛ ye duma le kpole wɔ Yizilayɛ maanle nu. <verse eid="PSA 76:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 76:2" />Ye tɛnlabelɛ wɔ Gyɛlusalɛm; yɛɛ Boka Zayɔn azo a ɔde a. <verse eid="PSA 76:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 76:3" />Ɛkɛ ne yɛɛ ɔbubule kpɔvolɛma ɛda mbaka ne mɔ, ɔ nee bɛ konle wowadeɛ ne mɔ, ɔ nee bɛ nrɛlande ne mɔ nee bɛ konlendeɛ muala anu a.<verse eid="PSA 76:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 76:4" />Anyunlunyia a le wɔmɔ, O Nana Nyamenle! Wɔ belemgbunlililɛ ne le kpole tɛla awoka ne mɔ ɛleka ne mɔɔ ɛhomonle wɔ kpɔvolɛma anwo zo la. <verse eid="PSA 76:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 76:5" />Bɛzale anwosesebɛvoma bɛliele bɛ konle anwonyia; bɛ muala bɛdedale botoo; ɛlɔne ne mɔ kpokpoti anwosesebɛ wiele; bɛangola bɛanyɛ debie biala. <verse eid="PSA 76:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 76:6" />O Gyekɔbo Nyamenle, mekɛ mɔɔ ɛbukele ɛ nloa ala la, ɛkpɔnwɔ nee ɔ menle mɔɔ de zolɛ la dele guale, kɛ asɛɛ nrɛlabɔlɛ ɛbobɔ bɛ la. <verse eid="PSA 76:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 76:7" />Na wɔmɔ mɔɔ ɛ nwo yɛ ɛzulolɛ zɛhae la, O Awulae! Nwane yɛɛ kɛhola kɛgyinla ɛ nyunlu, wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ wɔ ɛyavalɛ ne ɛdwazo la a? <verse eid="PSA 76:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 76:8" />Ɛvi anwuma maanle nu yɛɛ ɛbuale ndɛne a; na ɛzulolɛ hanle azɛlɛ ye azo amra ɔmaanle bɛyɛle dii, <verse eid="PSA 76:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 76:9" />Wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ wɔmɔ Nana Nyamenle ɛdwazole kɛ ɛbua ndɛne, kɛ ɛdie bɛdabɛ mɔɔ menli sisi bɛ wɔ azɛlɛ ye azo la ngoane la. <verse eid="PSA 76:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 76:10" />Nɔhalɛ nu, saa menli fa ɛya a, yɛɛ bɛye wɔ ayɛlɛ molozo kpalɛ a; na ɛyavalɛ mɔɔ ɛha noko la, ɛbava wɔahye ɛ bo kɛ falɛ la.<verse eid="PSA 76:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 76:11" />Bɛbɔ bɛ ɛwɔkɛ ne mɔ bɛmaa bɛ Nana Nyamenle bɛ Nyamenle, na bɛli zo; bɛmaa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛbɔ ɔ nwo mgbɔlɛka bɛyia la ɛva bɛ ahyɛlɛndeɛ ɛrɛlɛ ahenle ne mɔɔ ɔwɔ kɛ bɛsulo ye la. <verse eid="PSA 76:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 76:12" />Yemɔ yɛɛ ɔbɛlɛ arelemgbunli mra mɔɔ memaa bɛ nwo zo la aze, na ɔmaa ɛzulolɛ ka arelemgbunli mɔɔ wɔ azɛlɛ ye azo la a.<verse eid="PSA 76:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 76" />
  <chapter number="77" style="c" sid="PSA 77" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 77</para>
  <para style="s1">Nana Nyamenle ye Dɛbadɛba Anwunvɔnezelɛ ne mɔ Ngakyelɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 77:1" />Meteɛdea nu mefɛlɛ Nana Nyamenle; meteɛdea nu mefɛlɛ ye, amaa yeadie me. <verse eid="PSA 77:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 77:2" />Wɔ me ɛmianlɛ mekɛ nu, mekpondɛ Awulae abo zo; nɔɔzo biala metɛlɛdɛlɛ me sa nu mesɛlɛ Awulae; noko akee me ɛkɛla ɛmmaa adenle ɛmmaa bɛnkyekye ɔ rɛle ɛlɛ. <verse eid="PSA 77:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 77:3" />Saa medwenle Awulae anwo a, hoo hoo ala a meyɛ a; saa meyɛ ahonle nu nzɛlɛlɛ a, me ɛkɛla di nyane somaa ne ala. <verse eid="PSA 77:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 77:4" />Ngɔsɔkɛ ala a mebɔ aledwolɛ biala a; medi nyane somaa ne ala, ɔlua zo mengola tendɛ.<verse eid="PSA 77:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 77:5" />Medwenledwenle mekɛ mɔɔ ɛraze la anwo; mekakyehakye ɛvolɛ bie mɔɔ ɛpɛ nu ɛhɔ dɛbadɛba la. <verse eid="PSA 77:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 77:6" />Medwenledwenle nwolɛ wɔ me ahonle nu nɔɔzo biala; mesie me adwenle koonwu na meneɛnlea me ahonle nu. <verse eid="PSA 77:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 77:7" />“Asoo Nyamenle bakpo me dahuu ɔ? Asoo ɔnrɛze me anwunvɔne bieko ɔ? <verse eid="PSA 77:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 77:8" />Ɛnee ye ɛhulolɛ nwanwane ne mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ la ɛbɔ aze anzɛɛ? Anzɛɛ ɛnee ye ɛwɔkɛ ne mɔ anwo ɛnlɛ nvasoɛ bieko ɔ? <verse eid="PSA 77:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 77:9" />Anzɛɛ ɛnee Nyamenle arɛle ɛvi kɛ ɔkɛmaa yɛ ɛlolɛ ɔ? Ɔlua ɛyavalɛ nu yedo ye adwenle nu wɔ anwunvɔnezelɛ nu anzɛɛ?” <verse eid="PSA 77:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 77:10" />Na akee menganle kɛ, “Ɔlua me nyanelilɛ somaa ne ati, yɛɛ Awulae Nyamenle asa fema ne ɛhakyi a.” <verse eid="PSA 77:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 77:11" />Mebahakye wɔ nwanwanendeɛ ne mɔ dahuu, O Awulae. Ɛhɛe, mebahakye wɔ nwanwane ninyɛne ne mɔ mɔɔ ɛyɛle bɛ dɛbadɛba ne la. <verse eid="PSA 77:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 77:12" />Mebazie me adwenle koonwu wɔ wɔ gyimalilɛ kpokpoti anwo; mebamaa me nye alie wɔ wɔ ninyɛne mgbole mgbole ne mɔ anwo.<verse eid="PSA 77:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 77:13" />O Nana Nyamenle, debie biala mɔɔ ɛyɛ la le nwuanzanwuanza. Nyamenle boni a le kpole kɛ yɛ Nyamenle ye a? <verse eid="PSA 77:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 77:14" />Wɔmɔ a ɛle Nyamenle mɔɔ ɛyɛ nwanwanendeɛ a; wɔmɔ a wɔla wɔ tumi ali wɔ menli nyunlu a.<verse eid="PSA 77:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 77:15" />Wɔmɔ yɛɛ wɔva ɛ sa wɔho wɔlie wɔ menli, Gyekɔbo ɔ nee Dwosefi abo zo amra a. <verse eid="PSA 77:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 77:16" />O Nana Nyamenle, mekɛ mɔɔ azule ne mɔ nwunle kɛ wɔmɔ a ɛle Nyamenle ne la, ɛzulolɛ kpole hanle bɛ. Nɔhalɛ nu, azumgbole ne mɔ anwo wozole bɛ. <verse eid="PSA 77:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 77:17" />Amungu dɔle nzule; ɛsɛlɛmanye kpakyekpakyele wɔ anwuma; na ɛda mbaka dudule bɔle asande wɔ ɛleka biala. <verse eid="PSA 77:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 77:18" />Anwuma deɛdeanle nu; yɛɛ akee ɛsɛlɛmanye ne zɔle senle zandele ewiade; na azɛlɛ wozole na ɔkpusule.<verse eid="PSA 77:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 77:19" />Ɛluale azɛlɛkye ne mɔ avinli; ɛpɛle nyevile tandane ne, noko akee bɛannwu ɛ gyakɛ abo zo ɛlɛ. <verse eid="PSA 77:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 77:20" />Ɛlile wɔ menli ne mɔ anyunlu kɛ Boaneneavolɛ, na ɛvale bɛ ɛwulale Mosisi ɔ nee ɔ diema Aalɔn asa.<verse eid="PSA 77:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 77" />
  <chapter number="78" style="c" sid="PSA 78" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 78</para>
  <para style="s1">Kɛ Nana Nyamenle zile nee ye menli Yizilayɛ lile la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 78:1" />O me menli, bɛyɛ ɛnzolɛ bɛdie me ngilehilɛ; bɛmaa bɛ nzo ɛrɛla edwɛkɛ mɔɔ melɛka la azo! <verse eid="PSA 78:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 78:2" />Melua mrɛlɛbulɛ nu mebadendɛ; mebahilehile tete awozinli nu edwɛkɛ muala abo, <verse eid="PSA 78:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 78:3" />ninyɛne mɔɔ yɛnwu ye, na yɛde nwolɛ edwɛkɛ, mɔɔ egya mɔ hanle hilele yɛ la. <verse eid="PSA 78:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 78:4" />Yɛnrɛva yɛnrɛvea bɛ mra ne mɔ; na emomu yɛbaha yɛahile bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛli yɛ nzi la, amaa bɛanwu Nana Nyamenle anyunlunyia ninyɛne ne mɔ, ɔ nee ye anwosesebɛ ne ɔ nee ye nwanwanendeɛ mɔɔ yeyɛ la. <verse eid="PSA 78:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 78:5" />Ɔlile ɔ nwo daselɛ wɔ Gyekɔbo mɔ anu, na ɔhyehyɛle mɛla ɔmaanle Yizilayɛma; ɔzele yɛ ze mɔ ndinli zo kɛ bɛva bɛhilehile bɛ mra ne mɔ; <verse eid="PSA 78:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 78:6" />amaa ɛlɔnwɔne fofolɛ mɔɔ bara la anwu bɛ, ngakula mɔɔ bɛtɛwole bɛ bɔbɔ la, na bɛadwazo bɛaha bɛahile bɛdabɛ noko bɛ mra. <verse eid="PSA 78:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 78:7" />Ɔlua zɛhae adenle ye azo, bɛdabɛ noko bɛbava bɛ anyelazo bɛawula Nana Nyamenle anu, ammaa bɛ rɛle anvi Nana Nyamenle ye gyima mɔɔ yeyɛ la, na emomu bɛali ye mɛla ne mɔ azo dahuu. <verse eid="PSA 78:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 78:8" />Bɛnrɛyɛ kɛ bɛ ze mɔ, menli anzosesebɛvoma ɔ nee bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛhonle bɛtiale maanle, menli mɔɔ bɛ ahonle angyinla ye kpundii, na bɛanlie Awulae Nana Nyamenle bɛanli la.<verse eid="PSA 78:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 78:9" />Yifilaemma mɔɔ dedɛ bɛ konle adu la ziale bɛ nzi, na bɛnriandinle wɔ konle mekɛ ne anu. <verse eid="PSA 78:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 78:10" />Bɛanli Nana Nyamenle ngyehyɛlɛ ne mɔɔ ɔ nee bɛ yɛle la azo; na bɛkpole kɛ bɛkɛli ye mɛla ne azo. <verse eid="PSA 78:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 78:11" />Bɛ rɛle vile mɔɔ yeyɛ la amuala, ɔ nee nwanwanendeɛ mɔɔ ɔlale bɛ ali ɔhilele bɛ la amuala. <verse eid="PSA 78:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 78:12" />Wɔ bɛ ze mɔ anyunlu yɛɛ ɔyɛle nwanwanendeɛ ne mɔ a, wɔ Yigyibiti azɛlɛ zo, wɔ Zowan ɛsɛlɛ zo. <verse eid="PSA 78:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 78:13" />Ɔkpakyele nyevile ne anu nwiɔ, na ɔmaanle bɛluale nu bɛzenle; ɔmaanle azule ne mɔ yɛle kɛ mbane nwiɔ wɔ foa nee foa. <verse eid="PSA 78:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 78:14" />Wɔ alehyenlɛ nu, ɔvale amungu ɔlile bɛ nyunlu; na wɔ aledwolɛ nu, ɔzɔle senle kɛ tɛkɛ la ɔlile bɛ nyunlu. <verse eid="PSA 78:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 78:15" />Wɔ ɛsɛlɛ ne azo, ɔkpukekpukele awolɛ nu; ɔmaanle nzule vi nuhua rale; na bɛnlonle bɛmaanle ɔbole bɛ nwo zo, kɛ asɛɛ nzule ne vi azɛlɛ bo la. <verse eid="PSA 78:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 78:16" />Ɔmaanle azudenle vi awolɛ ne anu vindele; na ɔmaanle nzule zenle kɛ azule mɔɔ se la. <verse eid="PSA 78:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 78:17" />Noko akee bɛyɛle ɛtane dɔɔnwo bɛtiale Nana Nyamenle bɔbɔ; na wɔ fiemgbole ne azo, bɛhonle bɛtiale Anwuma Bedevinlinli ne. <verse eid="PSA 78:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 78:18" />Bɛzɔle Nana Nyamenle bɛnleanle wɔ bɛ ahonle nu, wɔ ɛbizalɛ mɔɔ bɛbizale aleɛ bɛvile ye ɛkɛ la. <verse eid="PSA 78:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 78:19" />Bɛdendɛle bɛtiale Nana Nyamenle na bɛhanle kɛ: “Asoo Nana Nyamenle kɛhola kɛdo yɛ ɛkponle wɔ fiemgbole ɛhye azo ɔ? <verse eid="PSA 78:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 78:20" />Ɔbɔle bolɛ ɔmaanle nzule vi nu vindele, na ɔyɛle azudenle ɔdenrɛle ɔzenle. Ɔkɛhola ɔkɛmaa yɛ aleɛ; anzɛɛ ɔkɛhola ɔkɛva fɛlɛ noko ɔkɛmaa ye menli ɔ?” <verse eid="PSA 78:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 78:21" />Zɔhane ati mekɛ mɔɔ Nana Nyamenle dele ɛhye la, ɔvale ɛya totohyia; ɔdele senle ɔguale Gyekɔbo anwo zo, na ye ɛyavalɛ ne dwazole rale Yizilayɛ anwo zo. <verse eid="PSA 78:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 78:22" />Ɔluakɛ bɛannyia diedi wɔ Nana Nyamenle anu, eza bɛanlie ye ngoanelielɛ tumi ne bɛanli. <verse eid="PSA 78:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 78:23" />Ɔdendɛle ɔhilele anwomanyunlu, na ɔbukele anwuma maanle nlenkɛ ne mɔ. <verse eid="PSA 78:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 78:24" />Ɔdɔle mana ɔguale bɛ nwo zo kɛ bɛli, na ɔmaanle bɛ anwuma maanle ne anu aleɛ. <verse eid="PSA 78:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 78:25" />Akee sonla lile anwumabɔvolɛma ne mɔ aleɛ ne bie; na Nana Nyamenle maanle bɛ debie biala mɔɔ bɛhyianle nwo la.<verse eid="PSA 78:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 78:26" />Ɔmaanle sɛnzɛne aduduleɛ anwoma dule wɔ anwuma maanle ne anu; na ɔluale ye tumi nu ɔmaanle nyiakɛ anwoma ne razenle. <verse eid="PSA 78:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 78:27" />Ɔmaanle fɛlɛ dɔle guale aze kɛ munlutu la, yɛɛ nloma noko rale kɛ ɛnweazo ɛnwea. <verse eid="PSA 78:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 78:28" />Ɔmaanle ninyɛne ɛhye mɔ tetele guale bɛ azua ne mɔ azo, ɔ nee bɛ aako ne mɔ kpokpoti anu. <verse eid="PSA 78:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 78:29" />Ɔti bɛlile na bɛ ko yile; ɔluakɛ Nana Nyamenle maanle bɛ mɔɔ bɛbizale ye biala la. <verse eid="PSA 78:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 78:30" />Noko akee bɛ kunlu andwo, bɔbɔ wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ aleɛ ne wɔ bɛ nloa nu la. <verse eid="PSA 78:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 78:31" />Zɔhane ati Nana Nyamenle ye ɛya ne dwazole bɛ nwo zo; na ɔhunle bɛ nuhua anwosesebɛvolɛma ne mɔ, ɔ nee bɛ mgbanyima mɔɔ gyigyi bɛ ti la kpokpoti. <verse eid="PSA 78:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 78:32" />Wɔ ɛhye mɔ bɔbɔ amuala anzi, bɛhɔle zolɛ bɛyɛle ɛtane; wɔ Nana Nyamenle nwanwanendeɛ ne mɔ anzi bɛanlie ye bɛanli. <verse eid="PSA 78:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 78:33" />Ɔti ɔmaanle bɛ mekɛ pɛle nuhua, kɛ ɛnwomenle mɔɔ bɛgu la; yɛɛ bɛ ngoane noko hɔle munzule kpole nu.<verse eid="PSA 78:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 78:34" />Mɔɔ ɔhunle bɛ nuhua bie mɔ la, bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛhale la kpole ɔ bo zo; bɛnlunle bɛ nwo na bɛkpondɛle Nana Nyamenle anyebololɛ nu. <verse eid="PSA 78:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 78:35" />Bɛhakyele kɛ Nana Nyamenle a le bɛ sinzavolɛ a, yɛɛ Nyamenle Bedevinli ne mɔɔ wɔ anwuma la a le bɛ ngoanedievolɛ a. <verse eid="PSA 78:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 78:36" />Noko akee bɛvale bɛ nloa mgbane a bɛyele ye ayɛlɛ a; edwɛkɛ biala ɛnle ɛkɛ mɔɔ bɛhanle mɔɔ nɔhalɛ kɔpɛlɛ ko bɔbɔ wɔ nu a. <verse eid="PSA 78:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 78:37" />Bɛ ahonle anzi pi ammaa ye; bɛanli nɔhalɛ bɛammaa ye ngyehyɛlɛ ne mɔ. <verse eid="PSA 78:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 78:38" />Noko akee, yemɔ ɔle anwunvɔnesevolɛ la, ɔvale bɛ ɛtane ɔhyɛle bɛ, na yeanzɛkye bɛ; yeanli ye ɛya nzi; ɔziele ɔ nwo nane dii wɔ ye ɛyavalɛ ne anu. <verse eid="PSA 78:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 78:39" />Ɔhakyele kɛ bɛle menli mɔɔ bɛbawu bɛazɛkye ala; bɛle kɛ anwoma mɔɔ bɔ pɛ nu, na ɔnzia ɔmba bieko la.<verse eid="PSA 78:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 78:40" />Bɛdwazole bɛtiale ye fane dɔɔnwo ne ala wɔ fiemgbole ne azo; bɛmaanle ɔlile nyane somaa wɔ ɛsɛlɛ ne azo! <verse eid="PSA 78:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 78:41" />Bɛzɔle Nana Nyamenle bɛnleanle bieko ɔ nee bieko, na bɛhanle Yizilayɛ Nyamenle Nwuanzanwuanza ne ɛya. <verse eid="PSA 78:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 78:42" />Bɛ rɛle vile yi tumi kpole ne, ɔ nee kenle ne mɔɔ ɔliele bɛ ngoane ɔvile bɛ kpɔvolɛma asa anu la, <verse eid="PSA 78:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 78:43" />mekɛ mɔɔ ɔyɛle ye sɛkɛlɛndeɛ dɔɔnwo ne mɔ wɔ Yigyibiti, ɔ nee ye nwanwanendeɛ ne mɔ mɔɔ ɔyɛle bɛ wɔ Zowan ɛsɛlɛ ne azo la. <verse eid="PSA 78:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 78:44" />Ɔmaanle bɛ azule ne mɔ hakyile mogya, ɔlua zo bɛangola bɛanlo nzule bɛanvi bɛ azundenle ne mɔ anu. <verse eid="PSA 78:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 78:45" />Ɔdele nrɛzenra kpolane ɔguale bɛ nwo zo ɔmaanle bɛhunle bɛ; na ɔzoanle ahɛlɛne ɔmaanle bɛrazɛkyele bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 78:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 78:46" />Ɔmaanle aabɛ kpolane razɛkyele bɛ aleɛ ɔ nee bɛ mbakama ne mɔ; ɔzɛkyele bɛ ɛya ne mɔ kpokpoti. <verse eid="PSA 78:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 78:47" />Ɔmaanle asukɔntweaba rale razɛkyele bɛ nwanye tola ne mɔ; ɔmaanle azule sesanle, ɔ bo zo azɛlɛ ne hetele na ɔzɛkyele bɛ sekamɔ mbaka ne mɔ. <verse eid="PSA 78:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 78:48" />Ɔmaanle asukɔntweaba rahunle bɛ nlankɛ ne mɔ, na ɛsɛlɛmanye rahuhunle bɛ nyɛmoa ne mɔ. <verse eid="PSA 78:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 78:49" />Ɔmaanle adenle ɔmaanle ye ɛya totohyia ne rale bɛ nwo zo, na anwumabɔvolɛma mɔɔ sɛkye deɛ la rale razɛkyele ninyɛne ɔmaanle nyane, arɛlebɔlɛ nee anwubɛnyunlu rale. <verse eid="PSA 78:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 78:50" />Ɔmaanle ye ɛya nwo adenle, yeanlie bɛ yeanvi ewule sa nu. Emomu ɔgyakyile bɛ ɔwulale ewule ewule gyɛne gyɛne sa nu. <verse eid="PSA 78:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 78:51" />Ɔhunle belamunli mralɛ mɔɔ wɔ Yigyibiti la amuala, bɛ anwosesebɛ nu anwonyia wɔ Ham azɛlɛ zo.<verse eid="PSA 78:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 78:52" />Akee ɔlile ye menli ne mɔ anyunlu kɛ Boaneneavolɛ la, na ɔwowale bɛ wɔ fiemgbole ne azo kɛ mboane kpolane la. <verse eid="PSA 78:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="PSA 78:53" />Ɔlile bɛ nyunlu ɔmaanle bɛrale file zo mɔɔ bɛanzulo bieko a; na ɔmaanle nyevile nlomanle ye kpɔvolɛma amuala. <verse eid="PSA 78:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="PSA 78:54" />Ɔvale bɛ ɔrale ye azɛlɛ nwuanzanwuanza ne azo; wɔ awoka ne mɔɔ ɔhonle ɔliele ɔmaanle bɛ la azo. <verse eid="PSA 78:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="PSA 78:55" />Ɔvoanle maanle maanle ɔvile azɛlɛ ne azo; ɔhyɛle ɔmaanle bɛ bɛvale bɛyɛle bɛ agyapadeɛ, na Yizilayɛ abusua eku eku ne mɔ vale azɛlɛ ne dɛnlanle zolɛ.<verse eid="PSA 78:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="PSA 78:56" />Noko akee bɛzɔle bɛnleanle, na bɛdwazole bɛtiale Anwuma Nyamenle Bedevinli ne; na bɛanli ye ngyehyɛlɛ ne mɔ azo. <verse eid="PSA 78:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="PSA 78:57" />Bɛhakyile bɛ nzi bɛzile ye, na bɛyɛle ninyɛne mgbane mgbane kɛmɔ bɛ ze mɔ yɛle ala la. Bɛhyeɛhyeale ninyɛne kɛ kyɛnze mɔɔ ɛnyenya la. <verse eid="PSA 78:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="PSA 78:58" />Bɛwudule ye ahonle wɔ bɛ awozonle ɛzonlenlɛ ɛleka ne mɔ; na bɛmaanle ɔhwenle bɛ ninyɛne ne mɔ mɔɔ bɛ ze mɔ sonle bɛ la anwo nungule.<verse eid="PSA 78:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="PSA 78:59" />Mekɛ mɔɔ Nana Nyamenle dele la, ɔvale ɛya totohyia; ɔti ɔkpole Yizilayɛ bɔkɔɔ. <verse eid="PSA 78:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="PSA 78:60" />Ɔdule ɔvile ye tɛnlabelɛ ne mɔɔ wɔ Hyaelo, ye sua ne mɔɔ ɔdɛnlanle zo wɔ menli ne mɔ avinli la azo. <verse eid="PSA 78:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="PSA 78:61" />Ɔmaanle ye kpɔvolɛma asa hanle Ngyehyɛlɛ Ɛlɛka ne, mɔɔ le ye tumi ne nee ye anyunlunyia ne anwo sɛkɛleneɛ la. <verse eid="PSA 78:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="PSA 78:62" />Ɔmaanle ɔdaye ye menli wule wɔ nrɛlande nloa wɔ bɛ kpɔvolɛma asa anu; na ɔvale ye agyapadeɛ ne anwo ɛya. <verse eid="PSA 78:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="PSA 78:63" />Ɔmaanle senle zɛkyele bɛ mgbavolɛ mgbavolɛ; na bɛ mbɛlɛra ne mɔ annyia atɔfolɛ edwɛne ando. <verse eid="PSA 78:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="PSA 78:64" />Bɛ azɛlɛvolɛ wuwule wɔ nrɛlande nloa; na bɛ ahunlavolɛ ne mɔ anzu ammaa bɛ. <verse eid="PSA 78:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="PSA 78:65" />Nzinlii Awulae dwazole kɛ asɛɛ ɔvi nla nu la; ɔyɛle kɛ sonla katakyie mɔɔ ɛnlo nza ɛbo la. <verse eid="PSA 78:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="PSA 78:66" />Ɔbɔle ye kpɔvolɛma ne mɔ ɔzandele; na ɔvale bɛ ɔhɔle anyiemgba mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ la anu. <verse eid="PSA 78:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="PSA 78:67" />Ɔkpole Dwosefi abo zo amra bɔkɔɔ; yɛɛ yeanva Yifilaem abusua eku ne bɔbɔ. <verse eid="PSA 78:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="PSA 78:68" />Emomu, ɔnleanle nu ɔyele Dwuda abusua eku ne, ɔ nee Boka Zayɔn mɔɔ ye ahonle wɔ ye nu la. <verse eid="PSA 78:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="PSA 78:69" />Ɛkɛ ne yɛɛ ɔzile ye Asɔne Sua Kpole ne, kɛ ye anwuma maanle tɛnlabelɛ ne la a. Ɔmaanle ɔgyinlanle kpundii kɛ azɛlɛ ye mɔɔ ɔdaye yebɔ, mɔɔ ɔnlɛ ye awieleɛ la. <verse eid="PSA 78:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="PSA 78:70" />Ɔnleanle nu ɔyele ye sonvolɛ, Devidi; ɔyele ye ɔvile mboane bane nu; <verse eid="PSA 78:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="PSA 78:71" />ɛleka ne mɔɔ ɔnleanle ye ayɛmoa nwo zo la, kɛ ɔrayɛ mboaneneavolɛ wɔ Gyekɔbo abo zo amra anwo zo, wɔ Yizilayɛ mɔɔ le ye agyapadeɛ la. <verse eid="PSA 78:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="PSA 78:72" />Devidi yeyele ye ahonle nu nleanle bɛ gyɛlɛɛnye, na ɔvale ye nrɛlɛbɛ ɛsalɛ ne ɔwowale bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 78:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 78" />
  <chapter number="79" style="c" sid="PSA 79" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 79</para>
  <para style="s1">Gyɛlusalɛm ye Ɛzekyele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 79:1" />O Nana Nyamenle, menli mɔɔ ɛnzonle wɔ la ɛrava wɔ azɛlɛ ne; bɛgua wɔ Asɔne Sua Nwuanzanwuanza ne anwo evinli; na bɛmaa Gyɛlusalɛm ɛdɔ nzonle bɔkɔɔ. <verse eid="PSA 79:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 79:2" />Bɛhu wɔ sonvolɛma ne mɔ, na bɛmaa bɛ avunli ne mɔ ɛyɛ aleɛ ɛmaa mgbɔtɛ. Bɛvuandi wɔ anwodelɛma ne mɔ noko bɛ avunli bɛmaa ɛbɔ nu nane nane kɛ bɛli. <verse eid="PSA 79:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 79:3" />Bɛhwi wɔ menli ne mɔ mogya bɛgua kɛ nzule la; bɛbɔ Gyɛlusalɛm anwo mgbɔlɛka bɛyia; na awie biala ɛnle ɛkɛ mɔɔ kɛzie avunli ne mɔ a. <verse eid="PSA 79:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 79:4" />Yɛyɛ amgbuzilɛ baka yɛmaa menli mɔɔ yɛ nee bɛ de la; menli mɔɔ ɛbɔ ɛyia yɛ la si yɛ amgbu, na bɛyelɛyela yɛ nwo.<verse eid="PSA 79:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 79:5" />Ɛbava yɛ nwo ɛya wɔahɔdwu kenle nzu, O Nana Nyamenle? Asoo wɔ nungulehwenlɛ ne bahɔ zo ayela yɛ kɛ senle ɔ? <verse eid="PSA 79:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 79:6" />Wola wɔ ɛya ne gua maanle maanle mɔɔ ɛnzonle wɔ la anwo zo; ɔ nee arelemgbunli maanle ne mɔ mɔɔ bɛmbɔ wɔ duma wɔ nu la! <verse eid="PSA 79:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 79:7" />Ɔluakɛ bɛhu Gyekɔbo abo zo amra ne mɔ kpokpoti; na bɛmaa bɛ bo zo ɛdɔ nzonle. <verse eid="PSA 79:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 79:8" />Mmadua egya mɔ ɛtane ne mɔ mɔɔ bɛyɛle la azo ɛtua yɛ kakɛ; maa wɔ anwunvɔnezelɛ ne ɛrɛla yɛ nwo zo ndɛndɛ; ɔluakɛ bɛbɛlɛ yɛ aze somaa, yɛnlɛ anyelazo biala. <verse eid="PSA 79:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 79:9" />Boa yɛ, O Nana Nyamenle, wɔmɔ mɔɔ ɛle yɛ ngoanedievolɛ la; wɔ wɔ duma ne anyunlunyia ne ati, ye yɛ fi munzule nu, na fa yɛ ɛtane kyɛ yɛ. <verse eid="PSA 79:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 79:10" />Duzu ati a ɔwɔ kɛ maanle maanle ka kɛ: “Bɛ Nyamenle ne wɔ nienwu a?” Maa kakɛ ne mɔɔ ɛtua menli mɔɔ wolale wɔ sonvolɛma mogya ne guale la ɛla ali wɔ maanle maanle nyunlu! <verse eid="PSA 79:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 79:11" />Maa efiadedavolɛma ɛzunlɛ nee bɛ nyanelilɛ ɛdwu ɛ nyunlu. Kɛmɔ wɔ tumi kpole ne de la, fa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛziezie bɛ bɛmaa ewule la sie! <verse eid="PSA 79:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 79:12" />O Awulae, sia ɛ nzi fane nsuu bɛla yɛ gɔnwo mɔ mɔɔ yɛ nee bɛ de la avinli, wɔ amgbu mɔɔ bɛsi wɔ la anwo.<verse eid="PSA 79:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 79:13" />Na akee yɛdayɛ wɔ menli, wɔ mboane kpolane ne yɛbava moyɛlɛ yɛamaa wɔ wɔ melɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ. Ɔvi awolɛndoazo kɔdwu awolɛndoazo, yɛbaye wɔ ayɛlɛ dahuu.<verse eid="PSA 79:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 79" />
  <chapter number="80" style="c" sid="PSA 80" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 80</para>
  <para style="s1">Nzɛlɛlc mɔɔ bɛyɛ bɛmaa Yizilayɛ maanle ne ye Ngoanelielɛ la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 80:1" />Yɛ ɛnzolɛ tie yɛ, O Yizilayɛ Boaneneavolɛ; wɔmɔ mɔɔ ɛdedɛ Gyekɔbo kɛmɔ bɛdedɛ adɔma bɛ sa zo la! Wɔmɔ mɔɔ bɛmaa wɔ zo bɛdɛnla anwumabɔvolɛma tɛnlabelɛ a. <verse eid="PSA 80:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 80:2" />Da ɛ nwo ali kile Yifelaem, ɔ nee Bɛngyaman, ɔ nee Manasɛ abusua eku eku ne mɔ! Maa ɛ nwo zo wɔ wɔ anwosesebɛ ne anu; na bɛla balie yɛ!<verse eid="PSA 80:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 80:3" />O Nana Nyamenle, maa yɛzia yɛhɔ yɛ gyinlabelɛ dɛba ne anu. Maa wɔ anwunvɔnezelɛ ne ɛrɛla yɛ nwo zo, amaa ɔlua zo bɛalie yɛ ngoane! <verse eid="PSA 80:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 80:4" />O Nana Nyamenle mɔɔ ɛle Ɛlɔne Nyamenle a, kɔkpula mekɛ boni yɛɛ ɛkɛva ɛya kɛ ɛkɛdie wɔ menli nzɛlɛlɛ a? <verse eid="PSA 80:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 80:5" />Wɔmaa nyane ɛyɛ bɛ aleɛ mɔɔ bɛdi a; wɔmaa monle ɛhakyi bɛ nzule mɔɔ bɛno a. <verse eid="PSA 80:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 80:6" />Wɔmɔ ɛmaa yɛyɛ amgbuzilɛ baka yɛmaa yɛ gɔnwo mɔ; na yɛ kpɔvolɛma tɔ aholoba gua yɛ nwo zo.<verse eid="PSA 80:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 80:7" />O Awulae mɔɔ ɛle Ɛlɔne Nyamenle a, maa yɛzia yɛhɔ yɛ gyinlabelɛ dɛba ne anu. Maa wɔ anwunvɔnezelɛ ne ɛrɛla yɛ nwo zo, amaa ɔlua zo bɛalie yɛ ngoane! <verse eid="PSA 80:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 80:8" />Wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛvale nwanye baka ɛvile Yigyibiti ɛrale a; ɛvoanle maanle gyɛne gyɛne na ɛluale baka ne wɔ azɛlɛ ne azo. <verse eid="PSA 80:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 80:9" />Ɛzieziele azɛlɛ ne gyɛlɛɛnye ɛmaanle baka ne; ɔti ɔzɔle ndinli na ɔnyinli ɔvale ɛkɛ ne azɛlɛ ne amuala. <verse eid="PSA 80:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 80:10" />Ɔyɛle alubo ɔmaanle awoka kpokpoti; na ye ngane ne mɔ hedale sida mbaka mgbole mgbole ne mɔ amuala anwo zo. <verse eid="PSA 80:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 80:11" />Ye ngane ngane ne mɔ bie denrɛdenrɛle hɔle Mɛdetɛlenia Nyevile tandane ne anu, yɛɛ ye ndinli ne mɔ noko hɔle moa kɛ Azule Yufileti la. <verse eid="PSA 80:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 80:12" />Duzu ati a akee wɔbubu ye mbane ne mɔ wɔgua azɛlɛ nwo, na menli mɔɔ pɛ nuhua la amuala tete ye ma ne mɔ a? <verse eid="PSA 80:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 80:13" />Ɛbɔ nu nyɛmoa mgbole mgbole tietia zo sɛkye bɛ, na abɔdeɛ kpokpoti mɔɔ wɔ ɛbɔ nu la fa ye bɛ aleɛ di.<verse eid="PSA 80:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 80:14" />Sia bɛla, O Ɛlɔne Nyamenle! To ɛ nye fi anwuma maanle ne anu nea; na fa ɛbulɛ maa nwanye baka ye. <verse eid="PSA 80:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 80:15" />Bɛla na balie nwanye baka ɛhye, mɔɔ ɛdawɔ ɛluale la ngoane; baka adɔma ɛhye mɔɔ ɛmaanle ɔnyinle anwosesebɛ nu la! <verse eid="PSA 80:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 80:16" />Bɛva senle bɛyela ye, na bɛpɛ ye bɛdo aze. Twi bɛ nyunlu wɔ ɛyavalɛ nu, na maa bɛ bo zo ɛminli bɔkɔɔ. <verse eid="PSA 80:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 80:17" />Emomu maa ɛ sa ɛnlomboɛ ne ɛwa sonla ne mɔɔ de ɛ sa fema zo la anwo zo. Sonla Ra ne mɔɔ ɛdawɔ wɔwula ye anwosesebɛ wɔmaa ɛdawɔ ɛ nwo la. <verse eid="PSA 80:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 80:18" />Zɔhane yɛɛ yɛnrɛhakyi yɛ nzi yɛnrɛzi wɔ bieko a; maa yɛnyia ngoane, na yɛbabɔ wɔ duma dahuu!<verse eid="PSA 80:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 80:19" />O Nana Nyamenle mɔɔ ɛle Ɛlɔne Nyamenle a, maa yɛzia yɛhɔ yɛ gyinlabelɛ dɛba ne anu. Maa yɛzia yɛhɔ yɛ gyinlabelɛ dɛba ne anu, amaa ɔlua zo bɛalie yɛ ngoane.<verse eid="PSA 80:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 80" />
  <chapter number="81" style="c" sid="PSA 81" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 81</para>
  <para style="s1">Siane fofolɛ ɛvindelɛ Edwɛndolɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 81:1" />Bɛdo edwɛne bɛmaa Nana Nyamenle mɔɔ le yɛ wowavolɛ la; bɛva fɛlɛkolilɛ bɛvɛlɛ Gyekɔbo Nyamenle! <verse eid="PSA 81:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 81:2" />Bɛmaa edwɛne zo, na bɛha agole bɛgua nu; bɛva getae ɔ nee bɛ sa nu sanwunle ɔ nee awa bɛdo anyelielɛ edwɛne. <verse eid="PSA 81:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 81:3" />Bɛbɔ aweɛne ne anu wɔ ɛvoyialilɛ mekɛ ne anu; wɔ siane ɛdalɛ mekɛ ne anu. <verse eid="PSA 81:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 81:4" />Ɔluakɛ ɛhye le Yizilayɛ azɛlɛ zo amaamuo ngyehyɛlɛ mɔɔ vi Gyekɔbo Nyamenle ɛkɛ a. <verse eid="PSA 81:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 81:5" />Ɔvale mɛla ɛhye ɔmaanle Dwosefi abo zo amra, wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɔyele bɛ ɔvile Yigyibiti azɛlɛ zo la. Ɛnelɛ bie mɔɔ metɛtele ye ɛlɛ la ɛlɛka kɛ: <verse eid="PSA 81:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 81:6" />“Mame yɛɛ menyele ɛ bati adesoa ne, na menyele ɛ sa menvile kɛndɛne ne anu a. <verse eid="PSA 81:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 81:7" />Ɛvɛlɛle me wɔ wɔ nyanelilɛ nu, na menliele wɔ zo, na menyele wɔ. Mɔɔ ɛvɛlɛle me wɔ ahumu kpole ne anu bɔbɔ la, menliele wɔ zo; menzɔle wɔ meneanle wɔ Mɛleba nzule ne anwo. <verse eid="PSA 81:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 81:8" />Bɛdie me folɛ mɔɔ mebadu bɛ la, O me menli! O Yizilayɛma, kɛkala angome a, anrɛɛ bɛyɛ ɛnzolɛ bɛdie me! <verse eid="PSA 81:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 81:9" />Bɛmmadie nyamenle gyɛne biala bɛto nu; bɛmmabɔ bɛ ti aze bɛmaa nyamenle fofolɛ biala. <verse eid="PSA 81:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 81:10" />Mame a le bɛ Awulae Nyamenle ne a; mame a menyele bɛ menvile Yigyibiti azɛlɛ zo a. Bɛbukebuke bɛ nloa ne mɔ wanaanwo, na mebagua nu meamaa bɛayi tɛkɛɛ. <verse eid="PSA 81:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 81:11" />Noko akee me menli ne mɔ andie me ne; Yizilayɛ angulo kɛ ɔkɛde me nwo edwɛkɛ bɔbɔ. <verse eid="PSA 81:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 81:12" />Ɛhye ati mengyakyile bɛ memaanle bɛhɔlile bɛ anzosesebɛ ne anzi; na bɛdabɛ bɛlile bɛ adwenle ngyehyɛleɛ zo.<verse eid="PSA 81:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 81:13" />“O kɛkala angome a, anrɛɛ me menli ɛhye mɔ ɛdie me ne; me kunlu anu a anrɛɛ Yizilayɛma ɛva me adenle ne anu! <verse eid="PSA 81:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 81:14" />Ɔnrɛhyɛ biala mebahomo bɛ kpɔvolɛma anwo zo; na meahakyi me nzi meazi bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkyi bɛ la amuala. <verse eid="PSA 81:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 81:15" />Bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkyi Nana Nyamenle la bahakyi ahɔ ye ɛkɛ, na bɛ mekɛ ɛnrera awieleɛ ɛlɛ. <verse eid="PSA 81:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 81:16" />Mebava atoko mɔɔ yɛ fɛ kpalɛ la meamaa wɔali; na meamaa wɔ wolɛ mɔɔ vi bolɛ nu la meamaa wɔatafe ɛ kunlu adwo ɛ nwo.”<verse eid="PSA 81:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 81" />
  <chapter number="82" style="c" sid="PSA 82" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 82</para>
  <para style="s1">Ndɛnebuavoma mɔɔ bɛnli nɔhalɛ la anyunlu ɛhwilɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 82:1" />Nana Nyamenle ɛradɛnla aze wɔ ye ayia nwuanzanwuanza ne anu. Awozonle ne mɔ bɛ avinli yɛɛ ɔde mɔɔ ɔbua ndɛne a: <verse eid="PSA 82:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 82:2" />Bɛbabua ndɛne mɔɔ ɛnle nɔhalɛ la bɛahɔkpula kenle nzu bieko? Bɛbabua ndɛne bɛahɔ amumuyɛvoma afoa nu yeahɔkpula kenle nzu? <verse eid="PSA 82:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 82:3" />Bɛbua ndɛne mɔɔ anwo te la bɛmaa ehyiavolɛma ɔ nee nrisa mralɛ; na bɛho bɛmaa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ menli sisi bɛ, na bɛmbu bɛ bie la. <verse eid="PSA 82:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 82:4" />Bɛpepɛ bɛlie bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛnlɛ anwosesebɛ na bɛle ehyiavolɛma la. Bɛlie bɛ ngoane bɛvi atisesebɛvoma asa anu. <verse eid="PSA 82:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 82:5" />Bɛnlɛ adwenle, yɛɛ bɛnlɛ ndelebɛbo; dahuu bɛde awozinli nu. Pɛpɛlilɛ ɛminli ɛvi azɛlɛ ye azo bɔkɔɔ. <verse eid="PSA 82:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 82:6" />Mese bɛ kɛ, “Bɛle awozonle; bɛ muala bɛle Anwuma Nyamenle Bedevinli ne amra.” <verse eid="PSA 82:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 82:7" />Noko akee bɛ muala bɛbawu kɛ menli ala la; bɛ ngoane awieleɛ bayɛ kɛ arelemgbunli mra la pɛpɛ pɛpɛ.<verse eid="PSA 82:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 82:8" />Dwazo, O Nana Nyamenle, na bua azɛlɛ ye azo amra ndɛne; ɔluakɛ wɔmɔ ɛ sa nu yɛɛ ewiade amuala wɔ a.<verse eid="PSA 82:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 82" />
  <chapter number="83" style="c" sid="PSA 83" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 83</para>
  <para style="s1">Edwɛndolɛ mɔɔ fale Yizilayɛ ye kpɔvolɛma anwo la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 83:1" />O Nana Nyamenle, mmayɛ koonwu! Keha ɛ nwo, mmayɛ dii, O Nana Nyamenle!<verse eid="PSA 83:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 83:2" />Nea! Wɔ kpɔvolɛma ne mɔ ɛlɛtu fonyia; bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkyi wɔ la ɛmemaa bɛ ti zo. <verse eid="PSA 83:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 83:3" />Bɛlɛyɛ awozinli nu ngyehyɛleɛ bɛatia wɔ menli; bɛlɛfa akpame bɛatia menli mɔɔ ɛdawɔ ɛsinza bɛ la. <verse eid="PSA 83:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 83:4" />Bɛka kɛ: “Bɛrɛla bɛmaa yɛminli bɛ bo zo kɛ maanle bie mɔɔ bɛtɛtɛnlanle zolɛ ɛlɛ la. Mmamaa bɛkakye Yizilayɛ duma bɔbɔ kenlebie maanle nu ɛlɛ!” <verse eid="PSA 83:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 83:5" />Bɛbɔ nu bɛfa akpame ko; na bɛyɛ ngyehyɛleɛ bɛtia wɔ: <verse eid="PSA 83:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 83:6" />Yidɔmma ɔ nee Yehyemeeyɛlema abo zo amra, Mowabema ɔ nee Hagelaema abo zo amra; <verse eid="PSA 83:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 83:7" />Gebalema, Amɔnoma nee Amalɛkema amra, Filisitiama ɔ nee bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛvi Taya la. <verse eid="PSA 83:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 83:8" />Aseleama noko ɛhɔboka bɛ nwo; bɛmɛ a bɛle Lɔɔto abo zo amra anwosesebɛvoma ne mɔ a.<verse eid="PSA 83:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 83:9" />Yɛ bɛ kpasakpasa kɛmɔ ɛyɛle Medianema ne mɔ ɔ nee Sesɛla nee Gyeeben wɔ Azule Kaehyɔn anloa la. <verse eid="PSA 83:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 83:10" />Ɛbɔle bɛ bo zo wɔ Ɛndɔ; na ɛmaanle bɛ avunli ne mɔ kpɔlɔle guale azɛlɛ ne mɔ azo. <verse eid="PSA 83:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 83:11" />Yɛ bɛ titilima ne mɔ kɛmɔ ɛyɛle Ɔlɛbe nee Ziibi la; komo bɛ aholiagya ne mɔ anwo zo kɛmɔ homonle Ziba nee Zalemɛna anwo zo la; <verse eid="PSA 83:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 83:12" />bɛmɛ mɔɔ bɛhanle kɛ: “Bɛmaa yɛhɔva Nana Nyamenle menli ne mɔ tɛnlabelɛ yɛyɛ yɛ deɛ la.”<verse eid="PSA 83:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 83:13" />Bɔ bɛ kponde kɛ munlutu, O Nana Nyamenle; maa bɛyɛ kɛ abɛlɛ ndɛkɛ mɔɔ anwoma ɛlɛbɔ kponde la. <verse eid="PSA 83:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 83:14" />Kɛmɔ senle sɔ gɔhyee yela kpɔkɛmile, na ɔtɛlɛ ɔkɔyela awoka ne mɔ la, <verse eid="PSA 83:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 83:15" />zɔhane ala a maa wɔ ɛya ne ɛdu bɛ ako, na maa wɔ ahumu totohyia ne ɛha bɛ ɛgua a. <verse eid="PSA 83:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 83:16" />Maa anyiemgba ɛha bɛ, O Nana Nyamenle, amaa bɛakpondɛ wɔ duma ne abo zo. <verse eid="PSA 83:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 83:17" />Maa nyiane nee ɛzulolɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ la ɛha bɛ; maa bɛ bo zo ɛminli bɔkɔɔ wɔ anyunluguase nu. <verse eid="PSA 83:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 83:18" />Maa bɛnwu ye kɛ ɛ ngomekye, mɔɔ wɔ duma a le Awulae la, yɛɛ ɛle Nyamenle Tumivolɛ mɔɔ bo ewiade amuala anwo zo a.<verse eid="PSA 83:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 83" />
  <chapter number="84" style="c" sid="PSA 84" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 84</para>
  <para style="s1">Tease Nyamenle ne ye Aako ne anwo Edwɛndolɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 84:1" />O Ɛlɔne Nyamenle, nea kɛ mesi mɔɔ mekulo wɔ tɛnlabelɛ kɛnlɛma ne bie a!<verse eid="PSA 84:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 84:2" />Nea kɛ me ɛkɛla ɛlɛdi nyane, na ɔ nwo ɛlɛdɔ wɔ tɛnlabelɛ ne bie a! Me nwo nane nee me ɛkɛla muala to edwɛne anyelielɛ nu maa Tease Nyamenle ne. <verse eid="PSA 84:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 84:3" />Kɛsanloma bɔbɔ lɛ bɛ nloma sane, yɛɛ Nyamenleakatiba mɔ lɛ bɛ adunli. Noko akee wɔ azukponle ne anwo foa ko yɛɛ bɛsie bɛ mra ngyikyi ne mɔ a, O Ɛlɔne bɛ Awulae, me belemgbunli nee me Nyamenle. <verse eid="PSA 84:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 84:4" />Nyilalɛ ɛha bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛtɛnla wɔ Aako ne anu; na dahuu bɛto edwɛne bɛye wɔ ayɛlɛ la.<verse eid="PSA 84:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 84:5" />Nyilalɛ ɛha bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛ anwosesebɛ vi wɔ lɔ; na dahuu adenle kpolomgbolo ne mɔɔ bɛfa zo bɛkɔ Zayɔn la anwo ɛhulolɛ wɔ bɛ ahonle nu la. <verse eid="PSA 84:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 84:6" />Mekɛ mɔɔ bɛlua Ɛzunlɛ nee Nyane Bɔnza ne anu la, bɛmaa ɛkɛ ne kakyi nzulebula ɛleka; na nyilalɛ ezule tɔ, gua azɛlɛ ne azo. <verse eid="PSA 84:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 84:7" />Bɛvi anwosesebɛ nu bɛkɔ anwosesebɛ nu; na ɔnrɛhyɛ biala, bɛbavinde wɔ Nyamenle ne mɔɔ vi nyamenle nu mɔɔ wɔ Zayɔn la anyunlu.<verse eid="PSA 84:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 84:8" />O Awulae Nyamenle Bedevinli, tie me nzɛlɛlɛ; yɛ ɛnzolɛ maa me, O Gyekɔbo Nyamenle! <verse eid="PSA 84:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 84:9" />O Nana Nyamenle, yɛ Wowadeɛ, ɔ nee yɛ Sinzavolɛ, yila yɛ belemgbunli ne, belemgbunli ne mɔɔ ɛdawɔ wɔva nwole wɔkpokpa ye la!<verse eid="PSA 84:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 84:10" />Ɔluakɛ kenle ko bɔbɔ mɔɔ yɛkɛli ye wɔ wɔ Aako ne anu la, sɔ yɛ nye tɛla apenle apenle mɔɔ yɛkɛli ye wɔ ɛleka bie la. Ɔle kpalɛ kɛ menwɔzinza me Nyamenle Sua ne anlenkɛ ne, tɛla kɛ menwɔdɛnla amumuyɛvoma aako nu la. <verse eid="PSA 84:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 84:11" />Awulae Nana Nyamenle le ye Sinzavolɛ, ɔ nee ye Anyunlunyia Belemgbunli. Ɔwola ye atiakunlukɛnlɛma ne nee ye enililɛ ne ɔgua ye menli nwo zo; ɔmmaa debie kpalɛ biala ɛngyia ye menli mɔɔ lua tenlene adenle zo la ɛlɛ.<verse eid="PSA 84:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 84:12" />O Ɛlɔne bɛ Awulae, nyilalɛ ɛha bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛfa bɛ rɛle bɛwula wɔ nu la!<verse eid="PSA 84:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 84" />
  <chapter number="85" style="c" sid="PSA 85" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 85</para>
  <para style="s1">Edwɛndolɛ mɔɔ bɛfa bɛyɛ nzɛlɛlɛ amaa bɛavi Akɛlɛyɛlɛ bo la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 85:1" />O Awulae, wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛhilele atiakunlukɛnlɛma ɛmaanle wɔ maanle a; na eza ɛvale Yizilayɛ agyapadeɛ ɛziale ɛmaanle ye a. <verse eid="PSA 85:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 85:2" />Ɛvale wɔ menli amumuyɛ nyɛleɛ ɛhyɛle bɛ, na ɛzele bɛ ɛtane noko anwo anwunvɔne. <verse eid="PSA 85:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 85:3" />Ɛyele wɔ ɛya ne amuala ɛvile bɛ nwo zo; yɛɛ ɛhakyile wɔ adwenle wɔ wɔ ɛyavalɛ wuluwulu ne anwo.<verse eid="PSA 85:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 85:4" />Fa yɛ sie yɛ dibilɛ dɛba ne, O Nana Nyamenle yɛ Ngoanedievolɛ; na ye wɔ ɛyavalɛ ne fi yɛ nwo zo! <verse eid="PSA 85:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 85:5" />Kɔkpula mekɛ ne boni yɛɛ ɛkɛva yɛ nwo ɛya a? Ɛbamaa wɔ ɛya ne awa yɛ nwo zo kɔdwu yɛ angabɛnzoma anwo zo ɔ? <verse eid="PSA 85:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 85:6" />Asoo ɛnrɛmaa yɛ ngoane bieko, amaa wɔ menli yɛ nye alie wɔ wɔ nu ɔ? <verse eid="PSA 85:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 85:7" />Maa yɛnwu wɔ ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne, O Awulae; na fa wɔ ngoanelielɛ moalɛ ne maa yɛ.<verse eid="PSA 85:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 85:8" />Maa mendie mɔɔ Awulae Nyamenle ne ɛlɛka la; ɔluakɛ yemɔ ɔka ahunludwolɛ edwɛkɛ ɔkile ye menli; ye anwodelɛma ne mɔ noko bɛdabɛ bɛkakyi bɛ nwo bɛba ye ɛkɛ ne wɔ bɛ ahonle nu. <verse eid="PSA 85:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 85:9" />Nɔhalɛ nu, yɛ ngoanelielɛ ne ɛhwe ɛbikye bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛsulo ye la; na ye anyunlunyia ne badɛnla azɛlɛ ye azo dahuu.<verse eid="PSA 85:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 85:10" />Ɛhulolɛ kpundii ɔ nee diedi bayia nu; na tenleneyɛlɛ nee anzondwolɛ baye bɛ nwo awawaatuu. <verse eid="PSA 85:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 85:11" />Diedi badwazo avi azɛlɛ ye abo; na Nana Nyamenle ye tenleneyɛlɛ bado ɔ nye avi anwuma maanle nu yeanlea azɛlɛ nwo.<verse eid="PSA 85:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 85:12" />Nɔhalɛ nu, Nana Nyamenle bava mɔɔ le kpalɛ la yeamaa; na yɛ azɛlɛ ye aye ye ma molozo. <verse eid="PSA 85:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 85:13" />Tenleneyɛlɛ bali Awulae anyunlu, na ɔ gyakɛ abo zo bayɛ adenle amaa bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 85:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 85" />
  <chapter number="86" style="c" sid="PSA 86" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 86</para>
  <para style="s1">Nzɛlɛlɛ nee Anlubɛnwo Edwɛndolɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 86:1" />Gua ɛ nzo aze na tie me, O Nana Nyamenle; ɔluakɛ mele ehyianli, menlɛ boavolɛ biala.<verse eid="PSA 86:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 86:2" />Die me ngoane, ɔluakɛ medu me nwo mewula ɛ sa nu; pepɛ die wɔ sonvolɛ ne mɔɔ fa ɔ rɛle wula wɔ nu la. <verse eid="PSA 86:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 86:3" />Wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛle me Nyamenle a; nwu me anwunvɔne, O Awulae, ɔluakɛ wɔmɔ yɛɛ mesu mefɛlɛ wɔ alehyenlɛ muala a. <verse eid="PSA 86:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 86:4" />Maa wɔ sonvolɛ ne ye ɛkɛla anye ɛlie, O Awulae; ɔluakɛ wɔmɔ yɛɛ memaa me ahonle kpokpoti zo memaa wɔ a. <verse eid="PSA 86:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 86:5" />O Awulae, wɔmɔ ɛle kpalɛ, yɛɛ ɛfa ɛtane ɛkyɛ; wɔ ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne bu gua zo maa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛsu bɛfɛlɛ wɔ la.<verse eid="PSA 86:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 86:6" />Gua ɛ nzo aze maa me nzɛlɛlɛ, O Nana Nyamenle; tie me ɛzunlɛ mɔɔ mesu wɔ me ɛmianlɛ mekɛ ye anu la. <verse eid="PSA 86:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 86:7" />Wɔ me anwongyelelɛ mekɛ nu, mefɛlɛ wɔ; na ɛdawɔ noko ɛdie me zo.<verse eid="PSA 86:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 86:8" />Nyamenle biala ɛnle ɛkɛ ne mɔɔ le kɛ wɔmɔ a, O Awulae; anzɛɛ gyima biala ɛnle ɛkɛ ne mɔɔ le kɛ wɔmɔ ɛ sa anloa gyima a. <verse eid="PSA 86:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 86:9" />Maanle maanle mɔɔ wɔhyehyɛ la amuala bazia ara wɔ ɛkɛ arazonle wɔ, O Awulae; bɛbarabɔ bɛ ti aze bɛamaa wɔ, na bɛawula wɔ duma ne anyunlunyia. <verse eid="PSA 86:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 86:10" />Ɔluakɛ wɔmɔ ɛle Bedevinli, na ɛyɛ nwanwanedeɛ; ɛdawɔ ɛ ngomekye ala yɛɛ ɛle Nyamenle a.<verse eid="PSA 86:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 86:11" />Kilehile me wɔ ndenle ne mɔ, O Nana Nyamenle; amaa mealua wɔ nɔhalɛ adenle ne anu. Si me ahonle pi, maa menzulo wɔ duma ne. <verse eid="PSA 86:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 86:12" />Mefa me ahonle kpokpoti meyɛ wɔ mo, O Awulae me Nyamenle; mebawula wɔ duma me anyunlunyia wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ. <verse eid="PSA 86:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 86:13" />Ɔluakɛ wɔ ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne le kpole wɔ me nwo zo; na wɔlie me ɛkɛla wɔvi ewule kuma kpolomgbolo ne anu.<verse eid="PSA 86:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 86:14" />O Nana Nyamenle, bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛmbu debie la ɛdwazo ɛtia me; basabasayɛvoma kpondɛ apɛ me ngoane zo, bɛmɛ mɔɔ bɛmbu wɔ bie la. <verse eid="PSA 86:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 86:15" />Noko akee wɔmɔ Awulae, ɛle anwunvɔnezelɛ ɔ nee ɛlolɛ Nyamenle; ɛkyɛ wɔ ɛyavalɛ nu; na wɔ ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne ɔ nee wɔ diedi ne ɛyi ɛbu zo tɛkɛɛ. <verse eid="PSA 86:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 86:16" />Kakyi ɛ nye bɛla me nwo zo, na se me anwunvɔne. Fa wɔ anwosesebɛ ne maa wɔ sonvolɛ ye; na die wɔ fɔɔnwonli ne ara ne ngoane. <verse eid="PSA 86:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 86:17" />Maa menwu wɔ ahunlunyele ne anwo sɛkɛlɛneɛ, O Nana Nyamenle, amaa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkyi me la anwu ye, na bɛ nyunlu nyiane agua aze. Ɔluakɛ wɔmɔ Awulae yɛɛ wɔboa me, na wɔkyekye me rɛle a.<verse eid="PSA 86:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 86" />
  <chapter number="87" style="c" sid="PSA 87" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 87</para>
  <para style="s1">Ayɛlɛyelɛ Edwɛne mɔɔ bɛfa bɛye Gyɛlusalɛm (Zayɔn) ayɛlɛ la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 87:1" />Nyamenle maanle ne mɔɔ ɔkyekyele la wɔ Boka Nwuanzanwuanza ne azo. <verse eid="PSA 87:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 87:2" />Nana Nyamenle kulo anlenkɛ ne mɔɔ kɔ Zayɔn la tɛla aako biala mɔɔ wɔ Gyekɔbo sua zo la.<verse eid="PSA 87:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 87:3" />Anyunlunyia edwɛkɛ ngome yɛɛ bɛka ye wɔ ɛ nwo a. O Nana Nyamenle sua mɔɔ yekyekye la. <verse eid="PSA 87:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 87:4" />Wɔ bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛze me la avinli, Yigyibiti ɔ nee Babelɔn yɛɛ mekakye bɛ a. Nea Filisitia, ɔ nee Taya ɔ nee Yiteɔpea, bɛka kɛ: “Sonla ɛhye, bɛwole ye wɔ ɛke.” <verse eid="PSA 87:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 87:5" />Na bɛbaha ɛhye noko wɔ Zayɔn anwo kɛ: “Ɛhye ɔ nee ɛhye, bɛwole bɛ wɔ ye nu.” Ɔluakɛ Anwuma Nyamenle Bedevinli mumua ne bakyekye sua ne. <verse eid="PSA 87:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 87:6" />Nana Nyamenle bahakye wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɔbadia menli ne mɔ la kɛ: “Ɛhye, bɛwole ye wɔ ɛke.” <verse eid="PSA 87:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 87:7" />Edwɛndovoma ɔ nee agolesivoma bɔ nuhua ka kɛ: “Yɛ muala kpokpoti yɛ bo vi Zayɔn.”<verse eid="PSA 87:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 87" />
  <chapter number="88" style="c" sid="PSA 88" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 88</para>
  <para style="s1">Wuliravolɛma bɛ Edwɛndolɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 88:1" />O Nana Nyamenle, me Nyamenle, alehyenlɛ muala mesu mefɛlɛ moalɛ mefi wɔ lɔ; aledwolɛ noko mesu mefɛlɛ wɔ. <verse eid="PSA 88:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 88:2" />Maa me nzɛlɛlɛ ɛdwu ɛ nyunlu, na yɛ ɛnzolɛ maa me ɛzunlɛ! <verse eid="PSA 88:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 88:3" />Ɔluakɛ ateetee ɛyi me ahonle tɛkɛɛ; na me ɛkɛla ɛlɛdi nyane ahɔ ewule nu. <verse eid="PSA 88:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 88:4" />Bɛdia me bɛboka bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛlɛkɔ ewule kuma ne anu la anwo; menlɛ anwosesebɛ biala. <verse eid="PSA 88:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 88:5" />Mele kɛ sonla mɔɔ bɛkpo ye bɛvi mɔwuamra anu, kɛ sonla mɔɔ bɛpepɛ ye bɛgua ewule kuma nu, kɛ bɛdabɛ mɔɔ ɛ rɛle ɛvi bɛ la. Ɔluakɛ wɔye wɔ ɛwowale ɛsalɛ ne wɔvi bɛ nwo zo.<verse eid="PSA 88:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 88:6" />Wɔvuandi me wɔdo kuma kpolomgbolo ne ye awozinli kabikabi ne anu. <verse eid="PSA 88:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 88:7" />Wɔ ɛya totohyia ne de me nwo zo, na wɔ azɛlɛkye ɛva me aze kɛ sonla mɔɔ ɛnloma azule bo la. <verse eid="PSA 88:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 88:8" />Wɔmaa me gɔnwo mɔ ɛkpo me kɛ bɛ nee me kɛlua; wɔyɛ me amgbuzilɛ baka wɔmaa bɛ. Bɛbɔ me nwo mgbɔlɛka bɛyia, mɔɔ mengola menlie me nwo a. <verse eid="PSA 88:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 88:9" />Nyane ɛbia me kɛ monle la; alehyenlɛ biala mesu mefɛle wɔ, O Nana Nyamenle, na metɛlɛdɛlɛ me sa nu mekile wɔ.<verse eid="PSA 88:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 88:10" />Asoo wɔmɔ ɛyɛ wɔ nwanwanendeɛ ne mɔ ɛmaa mɔwuamra ɔ? <verse eid="PSA 88:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 88:11" />Asoo bɛda wɔ ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne ali wɔ azɛka ne anu ɔ? Anzɛɛ wɔ diedi ne gyi kpundii wɔ ɛzɛkyelɛ nu ɔ? <verse eid="PSA 88:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 88:12" />Asoo wɔ nwanwane sɛkɛlɛndeɛ ne mɔ da ali wɔ awozileka ne mɔ ɔ? Anzɛɛ wɔ ngoanelielɛ moalɛ ne wɔ arɛlevilɛ azɛlɛ zo ɔ?<verse eid="PSA 88:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 88:13" />O Nana Nyamenle, mame mesu mefɛlɛ wɔ; wɔ nwonlomɔ mekɛ nu, me nzɛlɛlɛ dwu ɛ nyunlu. <verse eid="PSA 88:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 88:14" />O Nana Nyamenle, duzu ati a wɔye me rɛle wɔdo me sa nu a? Duzu ati a wɔye ɛ nyunlu wɔvea me a? <verse eid="PSA 88:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 88:15" />Sumunli me mgbavolɛ nu, yɛɛ membɔle ɔ bo kɛ mewu meahɔ ewule nu a; akee mevɛ nee wɔ ateetee; menlɛ boavolɛ biala. <verse eid="PSA 88:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 88:16" />Wɔ ɛya totohyia ne ɛva me aze, na ɛ nwo ɛzulolɛ ɛzɛkye me. <verse eid="PSA 88:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 88:17" />Mekɛ muala, bɛbɔ bɛyia me kɛ azule mɔɔ ɛyi la; bɛlɛba bɛarava me nwo zo. <verse eid="PSA 88:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 88:18" />Wɔmaa me gɔnwo mɔ nee me kulovolɛma ɛkpo me bɔkɔɔ; awozinli nu amra yɛɛ ale me gɔnwo mɔ a.<verse eid="PSA 88:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 88" />
  <chapter number="89" style="c" sid="PSA 89" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 89</para>
  <para style="s1">Nana Nyamenle ye Ngyehyɛlɛ mɔɔ ɔvale ɔluale Devidi anwo zo la; Ngoanelielɛ ɛwɔkɛbɔlɛ ne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 89:1" />O Nana Nyamenle, mebado wɔ ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ la anwo edwɛne dahuu; mebava me nloa babonle ne meabɔ wɔ diedi ne anwo nolo meahile ewiade amra. <verse eid="PSA 89:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 89:2" />Ɔluakɛ wɔ ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne le ɛhulolɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ a; yɛɛ wɔ diedi ne noko gyi ye kpundii kɛ anwuma maanle ne la.<verse eid="PSA 89:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 89:3" />Wɔmɔ yɛɛ wɔha kɛ: “Meye menli mɔɔ me nee bɛ ɛyɛ ngyehyɛlɛ la: Meha ndane mehile me sonvolɛ Devidi kɛ: <verse eid="PSA 89:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 89:4" />‘Mebamaa ɛ bo zo amra adɛnla aze wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ; yɛɛ wɔ belemgbunli ebia ne noko badɛnla ɛkɛ ne dahuu amaa wɔ angabɛnzo amra.’ ”<verse eid="PSA 89:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 89:5" />O Nana Nyamenle, maa anwuma maanle ne ɛye wɔ nwanwane ninyɛne ne mɔ ayɛlɛ; na wɔ diedi ne ɛla ali wɔ nwuanzanwuanzama ayia ne abo. <verse eid="PSA 89:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 89:6" />Nwane a wɔ anwuma mɔɔ nee wɔ sɛ a, O Nana Nyamenle? Nwane a wɔ anwuma maanle ne amra avinli mɔɔ le kɛ wɔmɔ a? <verse eid="PSA 89:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 89:7" />Wɔmɔ mɔɔ nwuanzanwuanzama ayia bo amra sulo wɔ a; wɔmɔ mɔɔ ɛle totohyia na ɛ nwo yɛ ɛzulolɛ tɛla bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛbɔ bɛyia wɔ la a. <verse eid="PSA 89:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 89:8" />O Awulae, Ɛlɔne Nyamenle, nwane a le kpole kɛ ɛdawɔ, mɔɔ wɔ diedima ne mɔ ɛbɔ ɛ nwo mgbɔlɛka ɛyia a?<verse eid="PSA 89:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 89:9" />Wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛdi nyevile mɔɔ ɛzɛkye bɔbɔ la azo belemgbunli a; saa ye azɛlɛkye ne mɔ dwazo a, ɛbɛlɛ bɛ aze fɛɛnye. <verse eid="PSA 89:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 89:10" />Wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛhomonle Yigyibitima anwo zo kɛ boane funli; na ɛvale ɛ sa ɛnlomboɛ ne ɛbɔle wɔ kpɔvolɛma ne mɔ ɛzandele a. <verse eid="PSA 89:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 89:11" />Anwuma maanle ne le wɔ deɛ; zɔhane ala noko yɛɛ azɛlɛ ye le wɔ deɛ a. Ewiade ye, ɔ nee ninyɛne mɔɔ wɔ nuhua la kpokpoti, wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛyɛle bɛ a. <verse eid="PSA 89:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 89:12" />Wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛyɛle Sɔlɔ ɔ nee Nyiakɛ amuala a. Boka Teebɔ ɔ nee Boka Hɛmɔn lua fɛlɛkolilɛ nu ye wɔ duma ne ayɛlɛ. <verse eid="PSA 89:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 89:13" />Wɔmɔ ɛlɛ ɛsalɛ ɛnlomboɛ! Ɛ sa nu yɛ ɛsesebɛ, yɛɛ ɔto ɔkɔ moa!<verse eid="PSA 89:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 89:14" />Tenleneyɛlɛ nee pɛpɛlilɛ yɛɛ ɛfa ɛdi wɔ belemgbunli ne a; yɛɛ ɛhulolɛ kpundii ɔ nee diedi di ɛ nyunlu dahuu. <verse eid="PSA 89:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 89:15" />Nyilalɛ ɛha bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛze ɛvoyia edwɛne ne to; na dahuu bɛtudu agyakɛ bɛba Nana Nyamenle anyunlu, <verse eid="PSA 89:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 89:16" />na alehyenlɛ muala bɛye wɔ duma ne ayɛlɛ, na bɛbɔ wɔ tenleneyɛlɛ ne anwo ɛlawule la. <verse eid="PSA 89:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 89:17" />Ɔluakɛ wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛle bɛ anwosesebɛ ne anwo anyunlunyia a; wɔ wɔ anwunvɔnezelɛ ne anu yɛɛ bɛkpogya ye zo anwuma a. <verse eid="PSA 89:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 89:18" />Wɔmɔ, O Nana Nyamenle, yɛɛ ɛdule ɛ nwo ɛziele ɛkɛ kɛ ɛkɛyɛ yɛ sinzavolɛ a; wɔmɔ Yizilayɛ Nwuanzanwuanza Nyamenle ne yɛɛ ɛyɛle belemgbunli ɛmaanle yɛ a.<verse eid="PSA 89:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 89:19" />Mɔmoane bie, ɛluale yekile zo ɛdendɛle ɛhilele wɔ diedinli ne ɛzele kɛ: “Meva belemgbunli kyɛlɛ ne mezoa ahenle ne mɔɔ le bedevinli la; mekpogya ahenle ne mɔɔ menyele ye menvile menli ne mɔ anu la zo. <verse eid="PSA 89:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 89:20" />Yemɔ a le Devidi, mɔɔ le me sonvolɛ la; meva me nwole nwuanzanwuanza ne mekpokpa ye. <verse eid="PSA 89:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 89:21" />Me sa ɛnlomboɛ ne bapepɛ alie ye dahuu; na me anwosesebɛ noko bawa ɔ nwo zo mekɛ muala. <verse eid="PSA 89:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 89:22" />Kpɔvolɛma ɛnrɛli ɔ nwo zo konim ɛlɛ; yɛɛ atisesebɛvoma noko ɛnrɛhola ɛnrɛbɛlɛ ye aze. <verse eid="PSA 89:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 89:23" />Mebahomo ye kpɔvolɛma anwo zo; na meabɔ bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkyi ye la asande meagua bɛ lɔ. <verse eid="PSA 89:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 89:24" />Me ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne nee me diedi ne bara ɔ nwo zo; na ɔlua me duma nu, bɛbamaa ye zo anwuma anwuma. <verse eid="PSA 89:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 89:25" />Mebamaa ye tumi adɛlɛ, wɔ nyevile tandane ne nee azule muala anwo zo. <verse eid="PSA 89:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 89:26" />Ɔbazu yeavɛlɛ me yeaha kɛ: ‘Wɔmɔ a le Egya, me Nyamenle ɔ nee me Bodane wɔ ngoanelielɛ nu a.’<verse eid="PSA 89:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 89:27" />“Mebayɛ ye me belamunli ralɛ; arelemgbunli kpokpoti mɔɔ wɔ aleɛabo amuala bɛ kpanyinli. <verse eid="PSA 89:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 89:28" />Mebali me ɛhulolɛ kpundii ɛwɔkɛ ne azo meamaa ye wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ; na mebali me ngyehyɛlɛ mɔɔ me nee ye ɛyɛ la azo dahuu. <verse eid="PSA 89:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 89:29" />Menrɛmaa ye koliagyama abo zo ɛnrɛdu ɛlɛ; na wɔ mekɛ ala mɔɔ anwuma maanle ne wɔ ɛkɛ ne la, ye belemgbunlililɛ ne abo ɛnrɛpɛ ɛlɛ. <verse eid="PSA 89:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 89:30" />Emomu saa ɔ bo zo amra arɛle fi me mɛla me mɔ, na bɛanlua me ngyehyɛlɛ adenle ne azo, bɛambɔ bɛ ɛbɛla; <verse eid="PSA 89:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 89:31" />saa bɛbu bɛ nye bɛgua me mɛla ne mɔ azo, na bɛanli me ngyehyɛlɛ ne mɔ azo ɛdeɛ a, <verse eid="PSA 89:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 89:32" />yemɔ mebadea bɛ wɔ bɛ ɛtane ne mɔ ati. Mebabila bɛ empele, na meamaa bɛanwu bɛ nyunlu wɔ bɛ ninyɛndane ne mɔ ati. <verse eid="PSA 89:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 89:33" />Noko akee menrɛye me ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne menrɛvi Devidi anwo zo; anzɛɛ menrɛgyakyi kɛ menwɔli me ɛwɔkɛ zo menwɔmaa ye. <verse eid="PSA 89:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 89:34" />Menrɛbu me ngyehyɛlɛ ne azo; anzɛɛ menrɛhakyi edwɛkɛ biala mɔɔ vi me nloa anu ɛvinde la. <verse eid="PSA 89:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 89:35" />Kotokokye yɛɛ meha ndane zɛhae a, kɛ: Menrɛbɔ adalɛ menrɛhile Devidi. <verse eid="PSA 89:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 89:36" />Ye abusua ɛlɔnwɔne ne bawa ɛkɛ ne wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ; ye belemgbunli ebia ne abo ɛnrɛdu ɛlɛ, wɔ mekɛ ala mɔɔ sɛnzɛne tɛbɔ anwomanyunlu la. <verse eid="PSA 89:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 89:37" />Ɔbayɛ damɛnlangoate kɛ siane ne la; ɔbagyinla kpundii wɔ mekɛ ala mɔɔ anwuma maanle ne wɔ ɛkɛ la.”<verse eid="PSA 89:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 89:38" />Noko akee kɛkala ɛdeɛ, wɔkpo ye na wɔvuandi ye wɔgua; wɔ ɛya ne ɛdwazo ɛtia wɔ belemgbunli ne. <verse eid="PSA 89:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 89:39" />Wɔza ɛne wɔvi wɔ ngyehyɛlɛ ne mɔɔ ɛ nee wɔ sonvolɛ ne yɛle la anwo; na wɔgua ye belemgbunli kyɛlɛ ne anwo evinli. <verse eid="PSA 89:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 89:40" />Wɔfitifiti ye mbane ne mɔ anu; na wɔzɛkye ye konlendeɛ muala. <verse eid="PSA 89:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 89:41" />Menli mɔɔ pɛ nu se la kpokpoti fe ye agyapadeɛ ne; ɛnɛ yeyɛ amgbuzilɛ baka yemaa ɔ gɔnwo mɔ. <verse eid="PSA 89:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 89:42" />Wɔmaa ye kpɔvolɛma ɛli ɔ nwo zo konim; na wɔmaa bɛlɛdi fɛlɛko wɔ ye azedɔlɛ nwo. <verse eid="PSA 89:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 89:43" />Wɔmaa ye konlendeɛ muala ɛyɛ ninyɛne mgbane; wɔmaa ɔngola gyinla konle nyunlu bieko. <verse eid="PSA 89:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 89:44" />Wɔlie ye belemgbunli sɛkɛlɛneɛ ne wɔvi ɔ sa nu; na wɔvuandi ye belemgbunli ebia ne wɔdo ye aze. <verse eid="PSA 89:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 89:45" />Wɔpɛ ye ngoane zo; na wɔmaa anyunluguase ɛwula ye tɛladeɛ.<verse eid="PSA 89:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 89:46" />Kɔkpula kenle nzu, O Nana Nyamenle, yɛɛ ɛbava ɛ nwo wɔavea dahuu a? Kɔkpula kenle nzu, yɛɛ ɛbamaa wɔ ɛyavalɛ ne azɔ hulenyi kɛ senle a? <verse eid="PSA 89:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 89:47" />Kakye, O Awulae, kɛ yɛ ngoane tendenle si de la; nwu ye kɛ wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛbɔle yɛ muala, yɛdayɛ menli mɔɔ ewule la ɛkɛ ne maa yɛ la a! <verse eid="PSA 89:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 89:48" />Sonla ne boni yɛɛ badɛnla ngoane nu, mɔɔ yemɔ ɔnrɛnwu ewule ɛlɛ a? Nwane ala yɛɛ ɔbahola yealie ɔdaye ye ɛkɛla yeavi ewule tumi sa nu a?<verse eid="PSA 89:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 89:49" />O Awulae, deɛ mɔɔ kile wɔ tete ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne la wɔ nienwu? Wɔ ɛwɔkɛ ne mɔ mɔɔ ɛbɔle ɛmaanle Devidi la amuala hale nienwu? <verse eid="PSA 89:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 89:50" />Kakye, O Awulae, kɛ bɛsi bɛsi wɔ sonvolɛ ye amgbu; ɔ nee kɛ mesi mesɔ anwubɛnyunlu ɔ nee amowalɛ mɔɔ menli wola gua me nwo zo la anu la. <verse eid="PSA 89:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 89:51" />Wɔ kpɔvolɛma ne mɔ bɔ wɔ belemgbunli ne mɔɔ wɔye ye la aholoba, O Nana Nyamenle; bɛsi wɔ belemgbunli ne agyakɛ ɛdudulɛ mgbane ne bɔbɔ amgbu. <verse eid="PSA 89:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 89:52" />Nyilalɛ ɛha Nana Nyamenle wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɔnle awieleɛ! Ɔyɛ ɛkɛ! Na ɔyɛ ɛkɛ!<verse eid="PSA 89:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 89" />
  <chapter number="90" style="c" sid="PSA 90" />
  <para style="ms">Buluku Mɔɔ Tɔ Zo Nna</para>
  <para style="mr">
    <ref loc="PSA 90-106">Edw. 90–106</ref></para>
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 90</para>
  <para style="s1">Nana Nyamenle ye Damɛnlangoateyɛlɛ; Dasanli mɔɔ ɛnde aze dahuu la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 90:1" />O Awulae, ɛvolɛ pemgbenlamgbe mɔɔ ɛraze ɛhɔ la, wɔmɔ yɛɛ wɔyɛ yɛ nriandifeabelɛ a. <verse eid="PSA 90:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 90:2" />Kolaa na bɛabɔ awoka, anzɛɛ kolaa na wɔabɔ ewiade amuala, ɔvi ngoane mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ kɔkpula ngoane mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ la, ɛnee wɔmɔ ɛle Nyamenle.<verse eid="PSA 90:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 90:3" />Wɔmɔ ɛkeha menli ɛkɔ ɛzɛkyelɛ nu, na ɛse kɛ: “Bɛzia bɛ nzi bɛhɔ bɛ ɛva ne anu!” <verse eid="PSA 90:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 90:4" />Ɛvolɛ apenle le ɛ nye zo kɛ anoma mɔɔ ɛraze ɛhɔ, anzɛɛ aledwolɛ mɔɔ ɛraze ɛpɛ nu hwi la. <verse eid="PSA 90:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 90:5" />Wɔmɔ ɛkpoɔkpoa menli ɛgua bɛ lɔ: bɛle kɛ ɛlalɛ mɔɔ yɛka ye nɔɔzo la. Bɛle kɛ ndile mɔɔ ɛdwazo nwolomɔ mangyee la. <verse eid="PSA 90:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 90:6" />Nwonlomɔ ne ɛnee bɛdwazo kɛnlaanwu bɛgyigyi ɛkɛ ne, ɔkadwu nɔsolɛ la ɛnee bɛnwosonwoso. <verse eid="PSA 90:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 90:7" />O Awulae, yɛlɛwu wɔ wɔ ɛyavalɛ ne abo; wɔ ndeanlɛ ne akee ɛbo yɛ nwo zo. <verse eid="PSA 90:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 90:8" />Yɛ ɛtane ɔ nee yɛ amumuyɛ kpokpoti ɛvinde ɛ nyunlu; ɛtane mɔɔ yɛyɛ ye fealera nu la anwo ɛdanlɛ ɛkpa ɛgua wɔ ɛ nyunlu. <verse eid="PSA 90:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 90:9" />Yɛ mekɛ zo ɛde wɔ wɔ ɛyavalɛ ne abo; yɛ ɛvolɛ pɛ nu se kɛ ɛnyelɛ mɔɔ bɛbɔ ye kpolɛkpolɛ la.<verse eid="PSA 90:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 90:10" />Yɛ ngoane mekɛ wɔ azɛlɛ ye azo le ɛvolɛ abulasuu ala, bie a ɛnee ɔlua anwosesebɛ ti yedwu abulatwɛ; na ɛhye bɔbɔ, nuhua ɛvɛlɛ nee nuhua amaneɛnwunlɛ, ɔngyɛ ɛnee bɛpɛ nu bɛze, ɛnee yɛdu kɛ anloma la yɛhɔ teatea mɔɔ bɛnnwu yɛ bo zo bieko a. <verse eid="PSA 90:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 90:11" />Nwane yɛɛ ɛzɔ wɔ ɛya tumi ne ɛnlomboɛ ɛnlea ɛlɛ, na yenlea ɛ nwo ɛzulolɛ mɔɔ ɔyɛ wɔ ɛyavalɛ nu a?<verse eid="PSA 90:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 90:12" />Ɔlua zɔhane ati, kilehile yɛ maa yɛdia yɛ mekɛ ne, amaa yɛanyia nrɛlɛbɛ nwo adwenle wɔ yɛ ahonle nu.<verse eid="PSA 90:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 90:13" />O Nana Nyamenle, kɔkpula kenle nzu yɛɛ ɛkɛzia ɛ nzi ɛkɛra a? Nwu wɔ sonvolɛma anwunvɔne, O Awulae! <verse eid="PSA 90:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 90:14" />Maa wɔ ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne ɛmaa yɛ ahonle ɛdɔ azule nu nwonlomɔ biala; amaa yɛ nye alie, na yɛali fɛlɛko wɔ yɛ tɛnlabelɛ nu. <verse eid="PSA 90:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 90:15" />Maa yɛ nye ɛlie wɔ melɛ mɔɔ wɔ yɛ nyunlu kɛmɔ yɛnwunle nyane wɔ mekɛ bie mɔɔ ɛze ɛhɔ, anzɛɛ kɛ ɛvolɛ dodo mɔɔ yɛnwunle yɛ nyunlu la. <verse eid="PSA 90:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 90:16" />Maa ɛ sa anloa gyima ne mɔ ɛla ali wɔ wɔ sonvolɛma anyunlu; maa ɛ bo zo amra ɛnwu wɔ anyunlunyia tumi ne. <verse eid="PSA 90:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 90:17" />Maa Awulae yɛ Nyamenle anwunvɔnezelɛ ne ɛrɛla yɛ nwo zo; maa yɛ sa anloa gyima ɛhɔ ye boɛ ɛmaa yɛ. Nɔhalɛ nu, maa yɛho yɛdɔ zo wɔ debie biala mɔɔ yɛyɛ la anu.<verse eid="PSA 90:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 90" />
  <chapter number="91" style="c" sid="PSA 91" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 91</para>
  <para style="s1">Mɔɔ bɛmaa ye feabelɛ wɔ Nyamenle Bedevinli ne ye Alubo ne abo la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 91:1" />Ahenle mɔɔ twe bikye Awulae Nyamenle kpondɛ feabelɛ, na Nyamenle Bedevinli ne yɛ ɛlawolɛ keda ɔ nwo zo la, <verse eid="PSA 91:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 91:2" />yemɔ yɛɛ baze Nana Nyamenle kɛ, “Ɛle me feabelɛ ɔ nee me bodane; ɛle me Nyamenle, wɔmɔ a me rɛle wɔ wɔ nu a.” <verse eid="PSA 91:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 91:3" />Ɔbalie wɔ yeavi kpɔvolɛma ngane mɔɔ bɛzuozua kɛ bɛfa bɛazɛkye wɔ, ɔ nee ewule ewule mɔɔ fa bɛ kɔ ewule nu la anu. <verse eid="PSA 91:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 91:4" />Ɔbava ɔ ndɛba ne mɔ yeaheda ɛ nwo zo; na wɔ ye boɛnleanlɛ bo yɛɛ ɛbanyia wɔ feabelɛ a; ye diedi kpundii ne bayɛ wɔ sinzavolɛ nee wɔ wowadeɛ. <verse eid="PSA 91:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 91:5" />Ɔnrɛmaa ɛnrɛzulo debie biala mɔɔ ka ɛzulolɛ wɔ nɔɔzo, anzɛɛ ɛda mbaka mɔɔ bɛtoto ye alehyenlɛ nu, <verse eid="PSA 91:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 91:6" />anzɛɛ ewule ngakyile ngakyile mɔɔ ye bɛ nwo ali wɔ awozinli nu, anzɛɛ munzudeɛ biala mɔɔ ku ɛkɛla ne ewia henlema la.<verse eid="PSA 91:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 91:7" />Apenle bapɛ afi wɔ wɔ foa ko, na apenle bulu agua ɛ sa fema zo; noko akee ɛhye mɔ ɛnrɛkputi wɔ ahonle bɔbɔ. <verse eid="PSA 91:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 91:8" />Ɛ nye ala yɛɛ ɛbava wɔanlea na wɔanwu kɛ ɛtanevolɛma bɛ ndeanlɛ si de la a. <verse eid="PSA 91:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 91:9" />Kɛmɔ wɔva Nana Nyamenle wɔyɛ wɔ feabelɛ, na Nyamenle Bedevinli ne mɔɔ wɔ Anwuma la le wɔ sinzavolɛ la ati, <verse eid="PSA 91:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 91:10" />munzule biala ɛnrɛra ɛ nwo zo; yɛɛ ewule biala noko ɛnrɛvinde wɔ aako nu. <verse eid="PSA 91:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 91:11" />Ɔluakɛ Awulae Nyamenle bamaa ye anwumabɔvolɛma ne mɔ anlea ɛ nwo zo, na bɛawowa wɔ wɔ adenle biala anu. <verse eid="PSA 91:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 91:12" />Bɛbadedɛ wɔ anwuma wɔ bɛ sa nu, ammaa ɛ gyakɛ amkpula bolɛ biala. <verse eid="PSA 91:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 91:13" />Ɛbatietia awenade ɔ nee nwɔlɛ nwo zo; awenade ngakula ɔ nee nwɔlɛ ayidane nwo zo yɛɛ ɛbava ɛ gyakɛ wɔatietia a.<verse eid="PSA 91:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 91:14" />Nana Nyamenle se, “Mebalie bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkulo me la ngoane, na meazinza bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛze me kɛ mame a le Awulae la. <verse eid="PSA 91:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 91:15" />Saa bɛsu bɛfɛlɛ me a, mebalie bɛ zo; saa bɛkɔ ɛmianlɛ nu a, mebara bɛ afoa. Mebalie bɛ ngoane, na meawula bɛ anyunlunyia. <verse eid="PSA 91:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 91:16" />Mebamaa bɛ ngoane tendenle ahyɛlɛdeɛ mɔɔ bɛ kunlu badwo nwo a; mebamaa bɛanwu me ngoanelielɛ tumi ne.”<verse eid="PSA 91:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 91" />
  <chapter number="92" style="c" sid="PSA 92" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 92</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle ne Edwɛne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 92:1" />Ɔle kpalɛ kɛ menwɔva moyɛlɛ menwɔmaa Awulae, na menwɔdo ayɛlɛyelɛ edwɛne menwɔmaa wɔ duma ne, O Anwuma Nyamenle Bedevinli; <verse eid="PSA 92:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 92:2" />na menwɔbɔ wɔ ɛhulolɛ nwanwane ne anwo nolo wɔ alehyenlɛ nu, ɔ nee wɔ diedi kpundii ne noko wɔ aledwolɛ nu. <verse eid="PSA 92:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 92:3" />Mebava getae, ɔ nee bɛ sa nu sanwunle nee ahenle, meaye wɔ ayɛlɛ wɔ edwɛnedolɛ nu. <verse eid="PSA 92:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 92:4" />Ɔluakɛ wɔmɔ; O Nana Nyamenle, yɛɛ wɔmaa me nye ɛlie wɔ wɔ nyɛleɛ nwo a; ɔlua ɛ sa anloa gyima ne mɔ ati meto edwɛne na medi fɛlɛko.<verse eid="PSA 92:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 92:5" />Nea kɛ ɛ sa anloa gyima yɛ nwanwane bie a, O Nana Nyamenle! Nea kɛ wɔ adwenle nu pi bie a! <verse eid="PSA 92:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 92:6" />Sonla mɔɔ le gyigyilii la ɛnnwu bolɛ mɔɔ ɛhye sonle a; koasea ɛngola ɛnde ɛhye abo: <verse eid="PSA 92:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 92:7" />kɛ, bɔbɔ saa amumuyɛvoma nyi yɛ dwoloonwu kɛ ndile, na ɛtanevolɛma amuala bɛ ɛbɛla kɔ ye boɛ maa bɛ bɔbɔ a, bɛ muala bɛbahɔ ɛzɛkyelɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ la anu. <verse eid="PSA 92:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 92:8" />Na wɔmɔ, O Nana Nyamenle, ɛwɔ ɛkɛ ne wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ. <verse eid="PSA 92:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 92:9" />Nea wɔ kpɔvolɛma, O Nana Nyamenle; nea, wɔ kpɔvolɛma bapɛ nu aze; na bɛbabɔ ɛtanevolɛma amuala asande.<verse eid="PSA 92:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 92:10" />Noko akee wɔmɔ wɔkpogya me zo, wɔmaa me nwo ɛyɛ se kɛ ɛnlankɛ nyinli; wɔva fɛlɛkolilɛ ngome wɔyila me. <verse eid="PSA 92:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 92:11" />Menwu me kpɔvolɛma bɛ azedɔlɛ, na mede atisesebɛvoma bɛ ɛzunlɛ. <verse eid="PSA 92:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 92:12" />Tenlenema kɔ zolɛ boɛ kɛ arɛlɛ mbaka la; na bɛnyi ndendenle ndendenle kɛ Lɛbanɔn sida mbaka la. <verse eid="PSA 92:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 92:13" />Ɔluakɛ bɛle kɛ mbaka mɔɔ bɛlua bɛ wɔ Awulae aako nu, na bɛso ma kposekpose wɔ ye Awulae Nana Nyamenle Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu la. <verse eid="PSA 92:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 92:14" />Bɛ mrelera mekɛ nu bɔbɔ ɛnee bɛtɛso ma; dahuu nzule kpalɛ vi bɛ nu kpu ba. <verse eid="PSA 92:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 92:15" />Ɛhye ɛla ye ali kɛ Nana Nyamenle le tenlene; ɔle me bodane, na ɛtane biala ɛnle ɔ nwo.<verse eid="PSA 92:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 92" />
  <chapter number="93" style="c" sid="PSA 93" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 93</para>
  <para style="s1">Gyihova, mɔɔ le Nyevile Azɛlɛkye Belemgbunli la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 93:1" />Nana Nyamenle di belemgbunli! Yeva tumi nee anwosesebɛ yeheda; ɔwula ye belemgbunli tɛladeɛ, na ye tumi ne hye ɔ bo kɛ falɛ la. Nɔhalɛ nu, ewiade le ye belemgbunli ebia; awie biala ɛnrɛhola ɛnrɛdu ɔ bo ɛlɛ. <verse eid="PSA 93:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 93:2" />Wɔ belemgbunli ebia ne le tete ebia, O Awulae; ɔluakɛ ɛdawɔ mumua ne ɛle damɛnlangoate.<verse eid="PSA 93:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 93:3" />Azule kpokpoti memaa bɛ ne zo, O Nana Nyamenle; bɛdwazo bɛmemaa bɛ ne zo na bɛkulu kɛ awenade la. <verse eid="PSA 93:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 93:4" />Nana Nyamenle mɔɔ di belemgbunli wɔ anwuma la le tumivolɛ! Ɔle bedevinli ɔtɛla azule muala bɛ alɛra mɔɔ bɛyɛ la; ɔle kpole ɔtɛla nyevile azɛlɛkye mgbole ne mɔ mɔɔ bu la. <verse eid="PSA 93:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 93:5" />Wɔ mɛla kpokpoti le damɛnlangoate, O Nana Nyamenle; na wɔ nwuanzanwuanzayɛlɛ ne da wɔ Aako ne ali wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ.<verse eid="PSA 93:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 93" />
  <chapter number="94" style="c" sid="PSA 94" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 94</para>
  <para style="s1">Edwɛndolɛ mɔɔ fale Nzisivolɛma anwo la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 94:1" />O Awulae, wɔmɔ Nana Nyamenle mɔɔ ɛtea dasanli a; da wɔ ɛya ne mɔɔ wɔva la ali! <verse eid="PSA 94:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 94:2" />Maa ɛ nwo zo, O aleɛabo ndɛnebuavolɛ; tea mgbanyizonleyɛvoma kɛmɔ ɔfɛta la! <verse eid="PSA 94:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 94:3" />Kɔkpula kenle nzu, O Nana Nyamenle, mekɛ ne boni, yɛɛ amumuyɛvoma kɛhɔ zo kɛli fɛlɛko a? <verse eid="PSA 94:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 94:4" />Kɔkpula kenle nzu, yɛɛ deɛmunliyɛvoma kɛhɔ zo kɛmemaa bɛ nwo zo, na bɛkɛva bɛ ninyɛmunli ne mɔ bɛkɛdu bɛ nwo a? <verse eid="PSA 94:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 94:5" />Bɛtietia wɔ menli ne mɔ anwo zo, O Nana Nyamenle; na bɛteetee bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛle wɔ deɛ la. <verse eid="PSA 94:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 94:6" />Bɛku ahunlavolɛ ɔ nee nrisa mralɛ, na bɛbɔ nyɛvolɛ mɔɔ wɔ azɛlɛ ne azo la abo zo bɔkɔɔ; <verse eid="PSA 94:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 94:7" />na akee bɛka kɛ, “Awulae ɛnnwu ɛhye mɔ; Gyekɔbo Nyamenle ne ɛmbu ɛhye mɔ anwo mgbonda.”<verse eid="PSA 94:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 94:8" />Bɛnwu ɛhye, O bɛmɛ mɔɔ bɛnlɛ ndelebɛbo a! Ahoasea, kenle nzu yɛɛ bɛkɛnwu nrɛlɛbɛ a? <verse eid="PSA 94:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 94:9" />Asoo ahenle ne mɔɔ yɛle ɛnzolɛ la, ɛnlɛ ɛnzolɛ ɔnde edwɛkɛ ɔ? Asoo ahenle ne mɔɔ yɛle ɛnyelɛ la, ɛnlɛ ɛnyelɛ ɔnnwu debie ɔ? <verse eid="PSA 94:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 94:10" />Asoo ahenle ne mɔɔ tea maanle maanle la ɛnrɛhola ɛnrɛdea sonla ɔ? Ahenle ne mɔɔ maa menli adwenle, <verse eid="PSA 94:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 94:11" />Nana Nyamenle ne, ze sonla biala ye adwenle; na ɔze bɛ kɛ bɛle kɛ ɛnwomenle gyɛne la.<verse eid="PSA 94:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 94:12" />Nyilalɛ ɛha sonla ne mɔɔ wɔmɔ ɛtea ye, O Awulae, na ɛdua wɔ mɛla ne azo ɛkakyihakyi ye, <verse eid="PSA 94:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 94:13" />amaa wɔamaa ye ɛnwomenlelielɛ wɔ ye ɛmianlɛ mekɛ nu, kɔkpula mekɛ mɔɔ bɛkɛpɛ kuma bɛkɛmaa atisesebɛvoma la. <verse eid="PSA 94:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 94:14" />Nana Nyamenle ɛnrɛkpo ye menli; ɔnrɛye bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛle ye deɛ la bɛ rɛle ɔnrɛdo bɛ sa nu. <verse eid="PSA 94:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 94:15" />Ɔluakɛ pɛpɛlilɛ bazia ara tenlenema anwo zo, na menli mɔɔ bɛ ahonle nu te la bali ɔ nzi. <verse eid="PSA 94:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 94:16" />Nwane a dwazo ko tia atisesebɛvoma maa me a? Nwane a ko me ti tia ɛtanevolɛma a? <verse eid="PSA 94:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 94:17" />Saa Nana Nyamenle anyɛ me boavolɛ a, anrɛɛ me ɛkɛla ɛhɔ mɔwuamra ewiade ne anu dɛbadɛba. <verse eid="PSA 94:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 94:18" />Melɛ mɔɔ menzele kɛ, “Melɛtele” la, wɔ ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne zɔle me nu gyinlanle, O Nana Nyamenle. <verse eid="PSA 94:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 94:19" />Saa me ahonle nu adwenledwenle ne so a, wɔ arɛlekyekyelɛ ne a maa me anyelielɛ a.<verse eid="PSA 94:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 94:20" />Asoo arelemgbunli atisesebɛvoma kɛhola kɛva bɛ nwo kɛbeta ɛ nwo ɔ? Bɛmɛ mɔɔ bɛhyehyɛ ngunzi mɛla la. <verse eid="PSA 94:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 94:21" />Bɛkye bɛ nwo file, na bɛko bɛtia tenlenema ngoane, na bɛbua menli mɔɔ ɛnze nwolɛ bie la ndɛne fɔle bɛkɔ ewule nu. <verse eid="PSA 94:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 94:22" />Noko akee Nana Nyamenle bɔ me nwo bane; yɛɛ me Nyamenle, mɔɔ le me feabelɛ la sinza me. <verse eid="PSA 94:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 94:23" />Ɔbadea bɛ wɔ bɛ ninyɛndane ne mɔ anwo, na yeaminli bɛ bo zo wɔ bɛ amumuyɛ nyɛleɛ ne mɔ ati. Yɛ Awulae Nyamenle ne baminliminli bɛ bo zo bɔkɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 94:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 94" />
  <chapter number="95" style="c" sid="PSA 95" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 95</para>
  <para style="s1">Nana Nyamenle le yɛ Bodane nee Boaneneavolɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 95:1" />O bɛrɛla bɛmaa yɛdo edwɛne yɛmaa Awulae; bɛmaa yɛva fɛlɛkolilɛ yɛdo edwɛne yɛmaa Nana Nyamenle, mɔɔ le yɛ Ngoanedievolɛ la!<verse eid="PSA 95:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 95:2" />Bɛmaa yɛva moyɛlɛ yɛrɛla ɔ nyunlu; bɛmaa yɛva fɛlɛkolilɛ yɛyɛ alɛra na yɛdo ayɛlɛyelɛ edwɛne yɛmaa ye! <verse eid="PSA 95:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 95:3" />Ɔluakɛ Awulae le Nyamenle Bedevinli, na ɔle Belemgbunli kpole, ɔbo awozonle kpokpoti anwo zo. <verse eid="PSA 95:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 95:4" />Yemɔ a sie aleɛabo kpokpoti, ɔbɔ ye tokule nu kɔkpula awoka ne mɔ azo a. <verse eid="PSA 95:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 95:5" />Nyevile ne le ye deɛ, ɔluakɛ ɔdaye a ɔbɔle ye a; yɛɛ ɔ sa noko a ɔvale ɔyɛle azɛlɛ resee ye a. <verse eid="PSA 95:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 95:6" />Bɛrɛla bɛmaa yɛbɔ yɛ ti aze na yɛzonle ye; bɛmaa yɛhoto Nana Nyamenle, mɔɔ le yɛ Bɔvolɛ la anyunlu! <verse eid="PSA 95:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 95:7" />Ɔluakɛ yemɔ a le yɛ Nyamenle a; na yɛmɛ mɔ, yɛle ye adidileka ne nee ɔ sa nu mboane. O kɛkala angome a, anrɛɛ ɛnɛ demua ye yɛyɛ ɛnzolɛ yɛdie ye! <verse eid="PSA 95:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 95:8" />Mmamaa bɛkpunli bɛ ahonle ne mɔ, kɛmɔ bɛ ze mɔ yɛle ye wɔ Mɛleba, anzɛɛ kɛmɔ bɛyɛle ye mekɛ ne anu wɔ Masa, wɔ fienemgbole ne azo la. <verse eid="PSA 95:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 95:9" />Ɛkɛ ne a bɛ ze mɔ gyegyele me na bɛzɔle me bɛnleanle a, wɔ mekɛ bɔbɔ mɔɔ ɛnee bɛnwu mɔɔ menyɛle memaanle bɛ la. <verse eid="PSA 95:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 95:10" />Wɔ ɛvolɛ abulanla anu, mengyile bɛ, na menganle kɛ, “Menli ɛhye mɔ ɛnli nɔhalɛ wɔ bɛ ahonle nu! Bɛkpo kɛ bɛkɛli me mɛla ne mɔ azo.” <verse eid="PSA 95:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 95:11" />Zɔhane ati melua me ɛyavalɛ nu menganle ndane kɛ: “Bɛnrɛhɔ me anzondwolɛ azɛlɛ ne azo kenlebie maanle nu ɛlɛ, ɛleka ne mɔɔ anrɛɛ menwɔmaa bɛ ɛnwomenlelielɛ la.”<verse eid="PSA 95:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 95" />
  <chapter number="96" style="c" sid="PSA 96" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 96</para>
  <para style="s1">Edwɛne Fofolɛ ne mɔɔ bɛto bɛmaa Awulae, mɔɔ le Belemgbunli la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 96:1" />O bɛdo edwɛne fofolɛ bɛmaa Nana Nyamenle; bɛdo edwɛne bɛmaa Awulae, ewiade amra amuala! <verse eid="PSA 96:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 96:2" />Bɛdo edwɛne bɛmaa Nana Nyamenle, bɛhanvo ye duma ne! Bɛbɔ ye ngoanelielɛ ne anwo ɛlawule alehyenlɛ biala. <verse eid="PSA 96:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 96:3" />Bɛla ye anyunlunyia ne ali wɔ maanle maanle avinli, ɔ nee ye nwanwane gyima ne mɔ wɔ menli muala anu!<verse eid="PSA 96:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 96:4" />Nana Nyamenle le bedevinli, na ɔfɛta ayɛlɛyelɛ kpole; ɔwɔ kɛ bɛsulo ye bɛtɛla awozonle muala. <verse eid="PSA 96:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 96:5" />Ɔluakɛ awozonle kpokpoti le sonla sa anloa gyima; na emomu, Nana Nyamenle yɛɛ abɔle anwuma maanle ne, ɔ nee nuhua ninyɛne kpokpoti a. <verse eid="PSA 96:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 96:6" />Anyunlunyia nee enililɛ le ye deɛ; tumi nee anwosesebɛ muala vi ye Aako nu.<verse eid="PSA 96:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 96:7" />Bɛye Nana Nyamenle ayɛlɛ, O bɛmɛ aleɛabo abusua eku eku, bɛhanvo ye anyunlunyia ne ɔ nee ye anwosesebɛ ne. <verse eid="PSA 96:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 96:8" />Bɛva anyunlunyia mɔɔ fɛta Nana Nyamenle duma ne la bɛmaa ye; bɛva bɛ ahyɛlɛndeɛ bɛrɛla, na bɛrawolo ye Asɔne Sua Nwuanzanwuanza ne anu! <verse eid="PSA 96:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 96:9" />Bɛva nwuanzanwuanzayɛlɛ bɛzonle Nana Nyamenle; bɛmaa ewiade amra kpokpoti ɛva ɛzulolɛ ɛrɛla ɔ nyunlu! <verse eid="PSA 96:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 96:10" />Bɛha ye wɔ maanle maanle muala azo kɛ, “Nana Nyamenle di belemgbunli! Ɛhɛe! Ɔdaye yɛɛ ɔbɔle ewiade kpundii a; ɔti debie biala ɛnle ɛkɛ mɔɔ kɛhola kɛkpusu ye a; ɔbava pɛpɛlilɛ yeabua menli ne mɔ ndɛne.”<verse eid="PSA 96:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 96:11" />Bɛmaa anwuma maanle ne ɛnyia ahomeka; na bɛmaa azɛlɛ ye azo amra ɛli fɛlɛko. Bɛmaa nyevile ɛkpudwu, ɔ nee ninyɛne mɔɔ wɔ ye nuhua la kpokpoti. <verse eid="PSA 96:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 96:12" />Bɛmaa ɛya ɛli fɛlɛko, ɔ nee ninyɛne mɔɔ wɔ nuhua la amuala! Ɛhye yɛɛ bamaa ɛbɔ nu mbaka muala ado edwɛne wɔ anyelielɛ nu, <verse eid="PSA 96:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 96:13" />wɔ Nana Nyamenle anyunlu a. Ɔluakɛ ɔlɛba; ɔlɛba yearabua aleɛabo amra amuala ndɛne. Ɔbava tenleneyɛlɛ yeabua ewiade amra ndɛne, na yeava ye nɔhalɛlilɛ ne yeabua menli mɔɔ wɔ nuhua la ndɛne.<verse eid="PSA 96:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 96" />
  <chapter number="97" style="c" sid="PSA 97" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 97</para>
  <para style="s1">Gyihova le Belemgbunli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 97:1" />Nana Nyamenle di belemgbunli! Bɛmaa aleɛabo amra amuala ɛli fɛlɛko! Bɛmaa ɛnweazo amra amuala anye ɛlie!<verse eid="PSA 97:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 97:2" />Amungu ɔ nee awozinli kabii ɛbɔ ye mgbɔlɛka ɛyia; ɔfa tenleneyɛlɛ nee pɛpɛlilɛ yɛɛ ɔdi ye belemgbunli ne a. <verse eid="PSA 97:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 97:3" />Senle li ɔ nyunlu dahuu, mɔɔ ɔyela ye kpɔvolɛma mɔɔ ɛbɔ ye mgbɔlɛka ɛyia la a. <verse eid="PSA 97:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 97:4" />Ye wienyi ne ta wɔ ewiade amuala; na aleɛabo amra nwu ye a bɛ nwo wozo bɛ. <verse eid="PSA 97:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 97:5" />Awoka muala kolo kɛ kyɛnɛlɛ la wɔ Nana Nyamenle anyunlu, Awulae ne mɔɔ le ewiade amuala amenle la. <verse eid="PSA 97:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 97:6" />Anwuma maanle ne bɔ ye tenleneyɛlɛ ne anwo nolo; na menli kpokpoti nwu ye anyunlunyia ne.<verse eid="PSA 97:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 97:7" />Ɔgua awozosonvolɛma kpokpoti anyunlu nyiane aze, bɛmɛ mɔɔ bɛtu bɛ nwo wɔ ninyɛne mɔɔ ɛnlɛ ngoane la anu la; awozonle kpokpoti bɔ bɛ ti aze wɔ ɔ nyunlu. <verse eid="PSA 97:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 97:8" />Zayɔn te ɛhye a, ɔ nye die, na Dwuda mbɛlɛra di nwolɛ fɛlɛko, ɔlua wɔmɔ Nyamenle, wɔ ndɛnebualɛ ne mɔ ati. <verse eid="PSA 97:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 97:9" />Ɔluakɛ wɔmɔ, O Nana Nyamenle, ɛbo ewiade amuala kpokpoti anwo zo; bɛmaa wɔ zo anwuma anwuma wɔ awozonle kpokpoti anwo zo.<verse eid="PSA 97:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 97:10" />Nana Nyamenle kulo bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkyi ɛtane la; ɔbɔ tenlenema anwo bane; na ɔpepɛ ɔdie bɛ ɔfi amumuyɛvoma tumi sa nu. <verse eid="PSA 97:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 97:11" />Wienyi ta gua tenlenema anwo zo; yɛɛ fɛlɛkolilɛ wɔ ɛkɛ maa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛdi nɔhalɛ wɔ bɛ ahonle nu la. <verse eid="PSA 97:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 97:12" />Bɛli fɛlɛko wɔ Nana Nyamenle anu, O bɛmɛ tenlenema; na bɛva moyɛlɛ bɛmaa ye duma nwuanzanwuanza ne!<verse eid="PSA 97:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 97" />
  <chapter number="98" style="c" sid="PSA 98" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 98</para>
  <para style="s1">Bɛmaa Azɛlɛ ye ɛli fɛlɛko; Awulae le Belemgbunli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 98:1" />Bɛdo edwɛne fofolɛ bɛmaa Nana Nyamenle, ɔluakɛ yeyɛ nwanwane ninyɛne dɔɔnwo! Ɔlua ɔdaye ye tumi ɔ nee ye nwuanzanwuanza anwosesebɛ zo yeli konim. <verse eid="PSA 98:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 98:2" />Nana Nyamenle da ye konimlilɛ ne ali, yemaa maanle maanle ɛnwu ye ngoanelielɛ tumi ne. <verse eid="PSA 98:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 98:3" />Yehakye ye ɛhulolɛ kpundii, ɔ nee ye nɔhalɛlilɛ ne, mɔɔ ɔlɛ ye ɔmaa Yizilayɛ la. Aleɛabo amra amuala ɛnwu yɛ Nyamenle ye konimlilɛ ne. <verse eid="PSA 98:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 98:4" />Aleɛabo amra, bɛdo edwɛne bɛva bɛlielie bɛ nye, bɛdo edwɛne bɛmaa Nana Nyamenle; bɛva fɛlɛkolilɛ bɛyeyɛ ye, na bɛdo ayɛlɛyelɛ edwɛne! <verse eid="PSA 98:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 98:5" />Bɛva sanwunle bɛdo ayɛlɛyelɛ edwɛne bɛmaa Nana Nyamenle! Bɛva getae ɔ nee ɛnelɛ fɛlɛko bɛhanvo ye. <verse eid="PSA 98:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 98:6" />Bɛva aweɛne ɔ nee mɛne aweɛne ne mɔ bɛyɛ alɛra anyelielɛ nu, wɔ Belemgbunli ne mɔɔ le Nana Nyamenle la anyunlu!<verse eid="PSA 98:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 98:7" />Bɛmaa nyevile, ɔ nee ninyɛne mɔɔ wɔ nuhua la kpokpoti ɛhuluhulu; ewiade, ɔ nee bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛde nuhua la amuala, bɛdo edwɛne! <verse eid="PSA 98:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 98:8" />Bɛmaa azule muala ɛbɔ bɛ sa nu; na awoka kpokpoti ɛva fɛlɛkolilɛ ɛbɔ nu ɛdo edwɛne, <verse eid="PSA 98:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 98:9" />wɔ Nana Nyamenle anyunlu. Ɔluakɛ yera kɛ ɔbazie ewiade ye. Ɔbava tenleneyɛlɛ yeabua aleɛabo amra ndɛne, na yeava pɛpɛlilɛ yeabua menli mɔɔ de zolɛ la ndɛne.<verse eid="PSA 98:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 98" />
  <chapter number="99" style="c" sid="PSA 99" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 99</para>
  <para style="s1">Anyunlunyia Belemgbunli ne mɔɔ bɛkpogya ye zo la ye Ayɛlɛyelɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 99:1" />Nana Nyamenle di belemgbunli; bɛmaa maanle maanle muala ɛzulo. Ɔde ye belemgbunli ebia ne azo, ɔde abɔndeɛ kpokpoti mɔɔ lɛ ndɛbalɛ la anwo zo; bɛmaa azɛlɛ ɛkpusu.<verse eid="PSA 99:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 99:2" />Nana Nyamenle le bedevinli wɔ Zayɔn; bɛkpogya ye zo wɔ maanle maanle muala anwo zo. <verse eid="PSA 99:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 99:3" />Awie biala ɛye ye kpoleyɛlɛ ne ɔ nee ye anyunlunyia duma ne ayɛlɛ! Ɔle Nwuanzanwuanza!<verse eid="PSA 99:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 99:4" />Belemgbunli katakyie, wɔmɔ mɔɔ ɛkulo pɛpɛlilɛ a; wɔmaa nɔhalɛlilɛ ɛzɔ ndinli; wɔbua nɔhalɛ ɔ nee tenlene ndɛne wɔ Yizilayɛ maanle nu. <verse eid="PSA 99:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 99:5" />Bɛkpogya Nana Nyamenle, yɛ Nyamenle ne zo; bɛbutu ɔ gyakɛ abo bɛzonle ye! Ɔle Nwuanzanwuanza!<verse eid="PSA 99:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 99:6" />Mosisi nee Aalɔn anrɛɛ boka ye azɛlɛvolɛ ne mɔ anwo, Samoɛle noko bokale bɛdabɛ mɔɔ ɛnee bɛbɔ ye duma la anwo. Bɛzunle bɛvɛlɛle Nana Nyamenle, na ɔdaye noko ɔdiele bɛ. <verse eid="PSA 99:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 99:7" />Ɔluale amungu totohyia ne anu ɔdendɛle ɔhilele bɛ; na bɛlile ye mɛla ne mɔ ɔ nee ye ngyehyɛlɛ ne mɔ mɔɔ ɔvale ɔmaanle bɛ la azo. <verse eid="PSA 99:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 99:8" />O Awulae, yɛ Nyamenle, wɔmɔ ɛyɛle ɛnzolɛ ɛmaanle wɔ menli. Bɔbɔ ɛdeanle bɛ wɔ bɛ ɛtane ne mɔ anwo ɛdeɛ, noko akee ɛhilele bɛ kɛ, ɛle Nyamenle mɔɔ ɛfa ɛtane ɛkyɛ a.<verse eid="PSA 99:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 99:9" />Bɛkpogya Nana Nyamenle, yɛ Nyamenle ne zo, na bɛzonle ye wɔ ye Boka Nwuanzanwuanza ne azo! Ɔluakɛ Awulae, yɛ Nyamenle ne le Nwuanzanwuanza.<verse eid="PSA 99:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 99" />
  <chapter number="100" style="c" sid="PSA 100" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 100</para>
  <para style="s1">Modolɛ mɔɔ la menli kpokpoti anyunlu amaa bɛaye Awulae ayɛlɛ la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 100:1" />O aleɛabo amra amuala, bɛva fɛlɛkolilɛ bɛdo edwɛne bɛmaa Awulae! <verse eid="PSA 100:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 100:2" />Bɛva anyelielɛ bɛzonle Nana Nyamenle! Bɛva edwɛnedolɛ bɛrɛla Ɔ nyunlu!<verse eid="PSA 100:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 100:3" />Bɛnwu ye wienyi kɛ Awulae le Nyamenle! Yemɔ yɛɛ ɔbɔle yɛ a, na yɛ kpokpoti yɛle ye deɛ; yɛle ye menli, yɛle ye adidileka mboane.<verse eid="PSA 100:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 100:4" />Bɛva moyɛlɛ bɛwolo ye nlenkɛ ne mɔ anu, bɛva ayɛlɛyelɛ bɛhɔ ye aako ne anu! Bɛva moyɛlɛ bɛmaa ye, na bɛhanvo ye duma ne. <verse eid="PSA 100:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 100:5" />Ɔluakɛ Awulae le kpalɛ; ye ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne le damɛnlangoate; yɛɛ ye nɔhalɛlilɛ ne noko wɔ ɛkɛ ne maa ɛlɔnwɔne kpokpoti.<verse eid="PSA 100:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 100" />
  <chapter number="101" style="c" sid="PSA 101" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 101</para>
  <para style="s1">Belemgbunli ne mɔɔ evinli ɛnle ye Maamulɛ nwo la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 101:1" />Me edwɛne ne fale nɔhalɛlilɛ nee pɛpɛlilɛ nwo, na wɔmɔ Nana Nyamenle, yɛɛ mebado edwɛne ne meamaa wɔ a.<verse eid="PSA 101:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 101:2" />Mebaye tieyɛ meamaa ngyehyɛleɛ mɔɔ di munli a. Kenle nzu yɛɛ ɛbara me ɛkɛ a? Mebabɔ tenlene ɛbɛla wɔ me ahonle nu wɔ me tɛnlabelɛ nu.<verse eid="PSA 101:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 101:3" />Menrɛva debie biala mɔɔ fa anyunluguase ba la menrɛzie me nyunlu; mekyi bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkakyi bɛ nzi bɛsi Awulae la nyɛleɛ; me nee bɛ ɛnrɛdu ɛlɛ. <verse eid="PSA 101:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 101:4" />Menrɛsisi awie mɔ, menrɛbɛlɛbɛla me gɔnwo mɔ; yɛɛ bɛdabɛ noko mɔɔ bɛyɛ ɛhye mɔ la, me nee bɛ ɛnlɛ debie biala ɛnyɛ. <verse eid="PSA 101:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 101:5" />Me nee bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛtɛ ɛtane bɛgua bɛ gɔnwo mɔ anzo nu la ɛnrɛli; mgbanyizonleyɛvoma ɔ nee bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛka mgbole wɔ bɛ ahonle nu la, me nee bɛ ɛnrɛdu. <verse eid="PSA 101:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 101:6" />Bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛdi nɔhalɛ bɛmaa Nyamenle, na bɛse anwunvɔne wɔ maanle ne anu la, yɛɛ mebakpondɛ bɛ me nee bɛ adɛnla a. Bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛ nyɛleɛ le fɔɔnwo la yɛɛ me nee bɛ balua a. <verse eid="PSA 101:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 101:7" />Awie biala mɔɔ ɛnli nɔhalɛ la ɛnrɛdɛnla me aako nu; yɛɛ adalɛ nabalabanli biala ɛnrɛhola ɛnrɛgyinla me nyunlu. <verse eid="PSA 101:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 101:8" />Alehyenlɛ kɔkpula alehyenlɛ muala, mebazɛkye amumuyɛvoma mɔɔ wɔ azɛlɛ ne azo la; mebavoa ɛtanevolɛma kpokpoti meavi Nana Nyamenle suakpole ne azo.<verse eid="PSA 101:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 101" />
  <chapter number="102" style="c" sid="PSA 102" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 102</para>
  <para style="s1">Sonla mɔɔ bɛva ye bɛhɔ amanvoa la ye Nzɛlɛlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 102:1" />Tie me nzɛlɛlɛ, O Nana Nyamenle, maa me modolɛ ɛdwu ɛ nyunlu! <verse eid="PSA 102:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 102:2" />Mmaye ɛ nyunlu ɛfea me wɔ me ɛmianlɛ mekɛ nu, gua ɛ nzo aze maa me, na tie me ndɛndɛ zo wɔ mekɛ biala mɔɔ menwɔvɛlɛ wɔ la.<verse eid="PSA 102:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 102:3" />Ɔluakɛ me ngoane mekɛ ɛlɛpɛ nu aze kɛ esike mɔɔ ɛlɛkpu la; me mbowule noko ɛlɛyela kɛ fovolɛ zo senle la. <verse eid="PSA 102:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 102:4" />Meyɛ kɛ ndile mɔɔ bɛtietia zolɛ la, na menwoso bɔkɔɔ; me rɛle bɔbɔ ɛvi me nwo kɛ menwɔli debie. <verse eid="PSA 102:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 102:5" />Ɔlua me nyanelilɛ ɛkponlenlɛ ne ati, menwa meyɛ kamgbaanwo zɛhae; menzɔho ɛhwee. <verse eid="PSA 102:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 102:6" />Meyɛ kɛ ɛkpɔtɛ mɔɔ la fienemgbole zo, kɛ kpadule mɔɔ wɔ suadu zo la. <verse eid="PSA 102:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 102:7" />Meda a ɔnla; meyɛ kɛ anloma mɔɔ gyi sua ti avinli mɔɔ ɔ nwo yɛ anwunvɔne la. <verse eid="PSA 102:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 102:8" />Alehyenlɛ kpokpoti me kpɔvolɛma si me amgbu; bɛdabɛ mɔɔ anrɛɛ bɛye me ayɛlɛ la, ɛnɛ fa me duma ka ndane wa amonle.<verse eid="PSA 102:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 102:9" />Me aleɛ a le ɛva, yɛɛ me nzule mɔɔ meno la a le monle. <verse eid="PSA 102:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 102:10" />Ɔlua wɔ ɛyavalɛ totohyia ne ati, wɔye me, wɔvuandi me wɔdo me lɔ bɔkɔɔ. <verse eid="PSA 102:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 102:11" />Me ngoane mekɛ le kɛ aledwolɛ ɛlawolɛ; mele kɛ ndile mɔɔ ɛnwoso la.<verse eid="PSA 102:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 102:12" />Noko akee wɔmɔ, O Nana Nyamenle, ɛle belemgbunli wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ. Ɛlɔnwɔne kpokpoti bahakye wɔ duma ne. <verse eid="PSA 102:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 102:13" />Ɛbadwazo na wɔaze Zayɔn anwunvɔne; mekɛ ne ɛdwu mɔɔ ɔwɔ kɛ ɛkile wɔ ahunlunyele a; mekɛ ne mɔɔ ɛhyehyɛle la ɛdwu. <verse eid="PSA 102:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 102:14" />Ɔluakɛ awolɛ ne mɔ sonle bolɛ maa wɔ sonvolɛma ne la ati, se ye ɛva ne anwunvɔne.<verse eid="PSA 102:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 102:15" />Maanle maanle bazulo Nana Nyamenle duma ne; arelemgbunli mɔɔ wɔ azɛlɛ ye azo la amuala bazulo ye tumi ne. <verse eid="PSA 102:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 102:16" />Ɔluakɛ saa Nana Nyamenle kyekye Zayɔn bieko a, ɔbala ye anyunlunyia ne ali. <verse eid="PSA 102:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 102:17" />Ɔbadie ye menli mɔɔ bɛye bɛ rɛle bɛdo bɛ sa nu la nzɛlɛlɛ, na ɔnrɛbu ɔ nye ɔnrɛgua bɛ ɛbizalɛndeɛ zo. <verse eid="PSA 102:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 102:18" />Maa bɛhɛlɛ ninyɛne ɛhye mɔ mɔɔ ɛzi la bɛdo ɛkɛ bɛmaa ɛlɔnwɔne mɔɔ bara la; amaa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛtɛnyianle bɛtɛwole bɛ la anwu ye, na bɛaye Awulae ayɛlɛ. <verse eid="PSA 102:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 102:19" />Nana Nyamenle vi ye nwuanzanwuanzaleka ne dole ɔ nye nleanle aze; ɔdole ɔ nye ɔnleanle aleɛabo ɔvile anwuma maanle nu moamoa lɔ. <verse eid="PSA 102:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 102:20" />Ɔdele bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛgua efiade la bɛ nyanenwunlɛ, na ɔyele bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛbua bɛ mgbɔvodɛne la ɔvile ewule nu. <verse eid="PSA 102:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 102:21" />Ɛhye ati menli babɔ Nana Nyamenle duma ne anwo ɛlawule wɔ Zayɔn, na bɛaye ye ayɛlɛ wɔ Gyɛlusalɛm, <verse eid="PSA 102:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 102:22" />wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ maanle maanle nee bɛ arelemgbunli kɛyia nu, kɛ bɛsonle Nana Nyamenle la.<verse eid="PSA 102:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 102:23" />Awulae ɛmaa me anwosesebɛ ɛwie wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ metɛde kpavolɛ la; yede me ngoane mekɛ zo. <verse eid="PSA 102:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 102:24" />O Nana Nyamenle, mɛsɛlɛ wɔ, mmaye me ɛfi ɛkɛ ne wɔ melɛ ala mɔɔ ngoane wɔ ɛkɛ ne maa me la. O Awulae, wɔmɔ wɔ ngoane mekɛ ɛnlɛ ye awieleɛ. <verse eid="PSA 102:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 102:25" />Mɔmoane yɛɛ ɛdole azɛlɛ ye abo a, yɛɛ anwuma ninyɛne muala le ɛ sa anloa gyima. <verse eid="PSA 102:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 102:26" />Bɛ muala bɛbapɛ nu bɛaze, na wɔmɔ ɛwɔ ɛkɛ ne mekɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ. Bɛbatete kɛ ɛdanlɛ la, na wɔmɔ ɛbahakyihakyi bɛ kɛ adɛladeɛ la, na bɛapɛ nu bɛaze hwi kokye. <verse eid="PSA 102:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 102:27" />Na wɔmɔ kɛ ɛde ye ala la yɛɛ ɛde a, wɔ ngoane mekɛ ɛnlɛ ye awieleɛ.<verse eid="PSA 102:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 102:28" />Wɔ azonvolɛ amra badɛnla ɛkɛ ne dahuu wɔ anzondwolɛ nu wɔ wɔ ɛzinzalɛ bo; na bɛ bo zo amra abo ɛnrɛdu ɛlɛ.<verse eid="PSA 102:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 102" />
  <chapter number="103" style="c" sid="PSA 103" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 103</para>
  <para style="s1">Tumi mɔɔ bɛnyia ye bɛava bɛayila Awulae la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 103:1" />O, me ɛkɛla ye Awulae ayɛlɛ! Me sonlabaka ne kpokpoti kanvo ye duma nwuanzanwuanza ne! <verse eid="PSA 103:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 103:2" />O me ɛkɛla, ye Nana Nyamenle ayɛlɛ; mmamaa ɛ rɛle fi ye nyele ɛwolaa ne. <verse eid="PSA 103:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 103:3" />Yemɔ yɛɛ ɔfa me ɛtane kpokpoti ɔkyɛ me, na ɔyɛ me ewule kpokpoti ayile a. <verse eid="PSA 103:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 103:4" />Yemɔ yɛɛ ɔye me ɔfi ewule kuma nu, na ɔfa ye ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne nee ye anwunvɔnezelɛ ne ɔyila me a. <verse eid="PSA 103:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 103:5" />Ɔmaa menyia ninyɛne kpalɛ mɔɔ me ngoane hyia nwolɛ la, amaa meanyia anwosesebɛ fofolɛ kɛ kɔleɛ ɛdeɛ ne la.<verse eid="PSA 103:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 103:6" />Nana Nyamenle bua tenlene ndɛne, na ɔdi ɔmaa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛsisi bɛ la. <verse eid="PSA 103:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 103:7" />Ɔlale ye ngyehyɛleɛ ne mɔ ali ɔhilele Mosisi, na ɔmaanle Yisilayɛma nwunle ye nwanwane nyɛleɛ ne mɔ. <verse eid="PSA 103:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 103:8" />Nana Nyamenle se anwunvɔne na ɔda ye nyele ali; ɔkyɛ na yeava ɛya, na ye ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne yi bulubulu zolɛ. <verse eid="PSA 103:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 103:9" />Ɔngɔ zo ɔndea dahuu; yɛɛ ɔmmaa ye ɛya ɛndɛnla ɛkɛ ne mekɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ; <verse eid="PSA 103:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 103:10" />Ɔ nee yɛ ɛnli ye kɛmɔ yɛ ɛtane ne mɔ si de la, yɛɛ ɔndea yɛ kɛmɔ ɔfɛta yɛ nvonleɛ ne mɔ la. <verse eid="PSA 103:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 103:11" />Kɛmɔ anwuma maanle ne ɔ nee azɛlɛ ye azo bɛ avinli te la, zɔhane ala yɛɛ ye ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne wɔ ɛkɛ ne maa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛsulo ye, na bɛbu ye la a. <verse eid="PSA 103:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 103:12" />Kɛmɔ aduduleɛ nee adɔleɛ bɛ avinli wale la, zɔhane ala yɛɛ Awulae ɛmaa yɛ nee ɛtane avinli ɛwa a. <verse eid="PSA 103:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 103:13" />Kɛmɔ selɛ se ɔ ra anwunvɔne la, zɔhane ala yɛɛ Nana Nyamenle se bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛdi ye eni la anwunvɔne a. <verse eid="PSA 103:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 103:14" />Ɔze kɛ bɛzile bɛbɔle yɛ la; ɔ rɛle ɛnvi kɛ yɛle ɛva nee nzonle.<verse eid="PSA 103:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 103:15" />Sonla ɛdeɛ, yɛ ngoane le kɛ ndile, yɛnyi ndɛndɛ zo kɛ ɛbɔ nu ndotolo la, <verse eid="PSA 103:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 103:16" />na akee anwoma bɔ fa zo; na ɔngyɛ, ɛnee yɛminli minlimɛnla, ɔ bo zo amra ɛngakye ye bieko. <verse eid="PSA 103:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 103:17" />Na emomu Nana Nyamenle ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne, wɔ ɛkɛ mekɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ maa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛwula ye anyunlunyia la; na ye tenleneyɛlɛ ne tenrɛ kɔdwu bɛ mra nee bɛ mra anwo zo, <verse eid="PSA 103:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 103:18" />wɔ bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛdi ye ɛwɔkɛ ne azo na bɛkakye kɛ bɛkɛli ye mɛla ne mɔ azo la.<verse eid="PSA 103:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 103:19" />Nana Nyamenle ɛzie ye belemgbunli ebia ne wɔ anwuma maanle ne anu; ɔle belemgbunli wɔ abɔdeɛ biala anwo zo. <verse eid="PSA 103:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 103:20" />Bɛye Nana Nyamenle ayɛlɛ, bɛmɛ anwumabɔvolɛma amuala, bɛmɛ tumivolɛma mɔɔ bɛdi ye mɛla zo, na bɛtie ye edwɛkɛ biala mɔɔ ɔkɛha la. <verse eid="PSA 103:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 103:21" />Bɛhanvo Nana Nyamenle, bɛmɛ anwuma maanle nu tumi kpokpoti, bɛmɛ mɔɔ bɛle ye sonvolɛma, mɔɔ bɛyɛ ye ɛhulolɛdeɛ la!<verse eid="PSA 103:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 103:22" />Bɛyila Nana Nyamenle, bɛmɛ mɔɔ bɛle ye abɔndeɛ wɔ ɛleka biala mɔɔ ye tumi ne wɔ la. Me ɛkɛla, ye Awulae ayɛlɛ!<verse eid="PSA 103:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 103" />
  <chapter number="104" style="c" sid="PSA 104" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 104</para>
  <para style="s1">Edwɛndolɛ mɔɔ bɛfa bɛmaa Gyihova, Abɔdeɛ Nyamenle ne la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 104:1" />Me ɛkɛla, ye Nana Nyamenle ayɛlɛ! O Awulae, me Nyamenle, nea kɛ ɛle bedevinli bie a! Enililɛ nee anyunlunyia ɛheda wɔ ɛdanlɛ. <verse eid="PSA 104:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 104:2" />Wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛfa wienyi ɛkeda ɛ nwo zo kɛ ɛdanlɛ a. Wɔrɛlɛ ewiade amuala kɛ asawu, <verse eid="PSA 104:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 104:3" />na wɔva wɔ azua ne mɔ ɛlawolɛ wɔheda azule zo. Wɔmɔ ɛfa amungu ɛyɛ wɔ konle ehwili, na ɛtɛnla zolɛ wɔ ahumu nu ɛfa ɛtu wɔ adenle.<verse eid="PSA 104:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 104:4" />Wɔmɔ ɛfa anwoma ne mɔ ɛyɛ wɔ ɛzoavolɛma, yɛɛ senle nee sendɔlɛra le wɔ azonvolɛ, <verse eid="PSA 104:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 104:5" />Wɔdo azɛlɛ ye abo kpundii, ammaa debie biala angola amkpusu ye. <verse eid="PSA 104:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 104:6" />Ɛvale nyevile ɛhedale ye kɛ ɛdanlɛ la, na azule ne mɔ yiyile hedale awoka ne mɔ azo. <verse eid="PSA 104:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 104:7" />Ɛhwile azule ne mɔ anyunlu wɔ ɛyavalɛ nu la, bɛ muala bɛnriandinle; ɛdeanle nu na bɛdele ɛ ne la, bɛ muala bɛguale ɛbɔ nu. <verse eid="PSA 104:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 104:8" />Awoka ne mɔ dwazole memaanle bɛ nwo zo, yɛɛ mbɔnza ne mɔ noko hɔle azɛlɛ nwo kɛmɔ ɛhyehyɛle bɛ ala la. <verse eid="PSA 104:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 104:9" />Ɛmaanle bɛ ɛweɛne mɔɔ ɔnle kɛ bɛtɛla ye a, ammaa bɛandɛlɛ bɛanva azɛlɛ ne amuala bieko.<verse eid="PSA 104:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 104:10" />Ɛmaa nzule vi azɛlɛ bo finde wɔ mbɔnza ne mɔ anu, na azundenle tenrɛ se wɔ awoka ne mɔ avinli. <verse eid="PSA 104:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 104:11" />Ɛhye maa nyɛmoa mɔɔ wɔ ɛbɔ nu la nyia nzule; na ɛkɛ ne yɛɛ nane nane mɔɔ nzuhɔne ku bɛ la bɛdabɛ bɛbano nzule a. <verse eid="PSA 104:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 104:12" />Wɔ mbaka mɔɔ gyigyi bɛ nwo la azo, yɛɛ nloma yɛ bɛ adunli nee bɛ sane, na bɛto bɛ edwɛne wɔ ngane ne mɔ anu a. <verse eid="PSA 104:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 104:13" />Ɛvi wɔ anwuma tɛnlabelɛ ne ɛtɔ nzule ɛgua awoka ne mɔ azo, na azɛlɛ ye akunlu dwo wɔ gyima gyima mɔɔ ɛdi la anwo. <verse eid="PSA 104:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 104:14" />Ɛmaa ndile fifi ɛmaa nlankɛ nyia bie di, yɛɛ ɛmaa sonla so ɛya, amaa yeahola yealua ye aleɛ aleɛ wɔ nu, <verse eid="PSA 104:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 104:15" />yeanyia nza mɔɔ ɔbava yealielie ɔ nye, ɔlivi nwole mɔɔ ɔbava yeakpokpa ɔ nwo abɔ evuanlɛ mukumuku, ɔ nee aleɛ mɔɔ ɔbali yeanyia anwosesebɛ la. <verse eid="PSA 104:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 104:16" />Nana Nyamenle tɔ nzule gua mbaka muala anwo zo, bɔbɔ Lɛbanɔn sida, mɔɔ ɔdaye Awulae ɔluoluale la. <verse eid="PSA 104:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 104:17" />Bɛ nu yɛɛ nloma ne mɔ yɛ bɛ sane a; yɛɛ nloma mgbole noko bɛyɛ bɛ adunli a. <verse eid="PSA 104:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 104:18" />Awoka ndendenle ne mɔ azo le adidileka maa mboane ne mɔ; yɛɛ awolɛ ne mɔ le fealeka maa bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 104:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 104:19" />Wɔbɔ siane mɔɔ kile mekɛ a; ewia noko ze ye mekɛ mɔɔ ɔfa ɔtɔ a. <verse eid="PSA 104:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 104:20" />Wɔbɔ awozinli, noko akee ɔle aledwolɛ; nɔɔzo yɛɛ nyɛmoa anwo ɛzulolɛ kpokpoti finde a. <verse eid="PSA 104:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 104:21" />Awenade ngakula su ɛhɔne, bɛkulu bɛkpondɛ bɛ aleɛ bɛfi Nyamenle ɛkɛ. <verse eid="PSA 104:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 104:22" />Saa ewia ne tudu a, bɛsia bɛ nzi bɛkɔ na bɛkɔgua bɛ adunli nu. <verse eid="PSA 104:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 104:23" />Akee dasanli noko finde kɔyɛ ye gyima, na ɔkɔ zo ɔyɛ ye gyima kɔkpula nɔsolɛ.<verse eid="PSA 104:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 104:24" />O Nana Nyamenle, nea ɛ sa anloa gyima dɔɔnwo bie! Nrɛlɛbɛ zo yɛɛ ɛlua wɔyɛ ɛhye mɔ amuala a! Wɔ abɔndeɛ ɛyi aleɛabo amuala. <verse eid="PSA 104:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 104:25" />Nyevile totohyia, tɛtɛtɛlɛlɛ ne a la nehane, mɔɔ ninyɛne mɔɔ ɛtia a ɛnnwu ɔ nloa la ɛyi ye tɛkɛɛ la, anyewɔzo ninyɛne mgbole nee ngyikyi. <verse eid="PSA 104:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 104:26" />Meli ne mɔ di zolɛ akɔneaba, na nuhua yɛɛ Lɛveatan di ye agole a, nyevizonle ne mɔɔ ɛdawɔ ɛbɔle la. <verse eid="PSA 104:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 104:27" />Ɛhye mɔ amuala maa bɛ nye zo nea wɔ, kɛ ɛkɛmaa bɛ aleɛ wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ fɛta la anu. <verse eid="PSA 104:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 104:28" />Ɛfa ɛmaa bɛ, na bɛdabɛ noko bɛdi; ɛmaa bɛ aleɛ, na bɛ kunlu dwo nwolɛ. <verse eid="PSA 104:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 104:29" />Saa ɛye ɛ nyunlu ɛfea bɛ a, ɛnee bɛ rɛle ɛbɔ zɛhae; saa ɛye wɔ ɛnwomenle ne ɛfi bɛ nu a, ɛnee bɛwuwu; na bɛsia bɛkɔ bɛ ɛva nu. <verse eid="PSA 104:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 104:30" />Noko akee saa ɛsoa wɔ sunsum ne ɛmaa ɔba bɛ nu a, ɛnee bɛyɛ abɔndeɛ fofolɛ; na ɛkakyi azɛlɛ nye ɛyɛ ye fofolɛ.<verse eid="PSA 104:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 104:31" />Maa Nana Nyamenle anyunlunyia ne ɛdɛnla ɛkɛ ne wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ! Maa Awulae ɛli fɛlɛko wɔ ɔ sa anloa gyima nwo! <verse eid="PSA 104:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 104:32" />Ɔto ɔ nye ɔnea ewiade, na azɛlɛ kpusu; ɔtenrɛ ɔ sa ɔsɔ awoka ne mɔ anu, na bɛkpu esike.<verse eid="PSA 104:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 104:33" />Mebado edwɛne meahanvo Nana Nyamenle, wɔ melɛ ala mɔɔ mede ngoane nu la; mebado edwɛne meaye me Nyamenle ayɛlɛ, wɔ mekɛ ala mɔɔ mede aze la. <verse eid="PSA 104:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 104:34" />Maa me ahonle nu nzɛlɛlɛ ɛzɔ ɔ nye, ɔluakɛ me anyelielɛ vi Awulae ɛkɛ. <verse eid="PSA 104:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 104:35" />Maa bɛyela ɛtanevolɛma bɛvi azɛlɛ ye azo; na maa atisesebɛvoma abo zo ɛminli bɔkɔɔ. O me ɛkɛla, ye Awulae ayɛlɛ! Ye Nana Nyamenle ayɛlɛ!<verse eid="PSA 104:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 104" />
  <chapter number="105" style="c" sid="PSA 105" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 105</para>
  <para style="s1">Edwɛndolɛ mɔɔ bɛfa bɛkanvo Yizilayɛ Nyamenle, Mɛlahyehyɛleɛvo ne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 105:1" />Bɛva moyɛlɛ bɛmaa Nana Nyamenle, na bɛzu bɛvɛlɛ ye; bɛla ye nyɛleɛ ne mɔ ali wɔ maanle maanle avinli. <verse eid="PSA 105:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 105:2" />Bɛdo edwɛne bɛmaa ye, bɛdo ayɛlɛyelɛ edwɛne bɛmaa Awulae; bɛbɔ nwanwane gyima ne mɔ mɔɔ yeyɛ la nolo. <verse eid="PSA 105:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 105:3" />Anyunlunyia ɛha ye duma nwuanzanwuanza ne, bɛmaa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkpondɛ Nana Nyamenle abo zo la, ɛli fɛlɛko wɔ bɛ ahonle nu.<verse eid="PSA 105:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 105:4" />Bɛkpondɛ Nana Nyamenle ɔ nee ye anwosesebɛ ne; bɛzonle ye dahuu.<verse eid="PSA 105:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 105:5" />Bɛmɛ, Ebileham, ye sonvolɛ, abo zo amra; bɛmɛ, Gyekɔbo, sonla ne mɔɔ ɔyele ye la, abo zo amra; <verse eid="PSA 105:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 105:6" />bɛhakye nwanwanendeɛ ne mɔ mɔɔ Nana Nyamenle yɛle, ɔ nee ndɛnebualɛ ne mɔ mɔɔ ɔvale ɔmaanle la. <verse eid="PSA 105:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 105:7" />Awulae le yɛ Nyamenle, ye ndɛnebualɛ ne mɔ wɔ ɛkɛ maa ewiade amuala. <verse eid="PSA 105:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 105:8" />Ye adwenle wɔ ye ngyehyɛlɛ ne mɔ azo dahuu; ye ɛwɔkɛ ne mɔ noko wɔ ɛkɛ ne dahuu maa ɛlɔnwɔne kpokpoti. <verse eid="PSA 105:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 105:9" />Ɔdi ngyehyɛlɛ ne mɔɔ ɔ nee Egya Ebileham yɛle, ɔ nee ye ɛwɔkɛ mɔɔ ɔbɔle Ayezeke la azo. <verse eid="PSA 105:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 105:10" />Awulae zile ye pi wɔ mɛla nu maanle Gyekɔbo, ɔvale ɔmaanle Yizilayɛma, kɛ ɔle ngyehyɛlɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ la. <verse eid="PSA 105:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 105:11" />Ɔhanle kɛ, “Bɛmɛ yɛɛ mebava Keena azɛlɛ ne meamaa bɛ a; na ɔbayɛ bɛ agyapadeɛ.” <verse eid="PSA 105:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 105:12" />Mekɛ ne anu, ɛnee Nana Nyamenle ye menli ne mɔ anwo anzo; ɛnee bɛle nyɛvolɛ wɔ Keena azɛlɛ ne azo, na awie biala ambu bɛ nwo mgbonda. <verse eid="PSA 105:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 105:13" />Bɛluoluale nuhua bɛvi maanle ko azo bɛhɔle maanle ko azo; bɛvi belemgbunli maanle ko anu bɛhɔle fofolɛ nu. <verse eid="PSA 105:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 105:14" />Noko akee Nana Nyamenle ammaa adenle yeammaa awie biala ansisi bɛ. Amaa yeazinza bɛ la, ɔbɔle arelemgbunli ne mɔ kɔkɔ; <verse eid="PSA 105:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 105:15" />na ɔzele kɛ; “Bɛmmafa bɛ sa bɛka me azonvolɛ ne mɔ mɔɔ meyila bɛ la; bɛmmayɛ me ngapezoma ne mɔ ɛtane biala.”<verse eid="PSA 105:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 105:16" />Awulae maanle ɛhɔne rale bɛ azɛlɛ ne azo, na ɔzɛkyele bonwole muala ɔmaanle bɛ aleɛ yɛle gyɛne. <verse eid="PSA 105:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 105:17" />Ɛnee yezoa sonla yemaa yelumua bɛ nyunlu dɛbadɛba, Dwosefi, mɔɔ bɛdɔnenle ye kɛ kanranli la. <verse eid="PSA 105:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 105:18" />Bɛguale ɔ gyakɛ amu nwiɔ nwɔnzɔnwɔnzɔ, na bɛvale bulalɛ ngɛba bɛdole ɔ kɔme, <verse eid="PSA 105:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 105:19" />kɔkpula kɛ mɔɔ ɔhanle la yɛle zɔhane la. Nana Nyamenle anloa edwɛkɛ maanle ye nɔhalɛ ne lale ali wienyi. <verse eid="PSA 105:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 105:20" />Akee belemgbunli ne zoanle maanle bɛhɔyele ye bɛvile efiade; maanle maanle neazovolɛ ne gyakyile ye maanle ɔvale ɔ nwo ɔlile. <verse eid="PSA 105:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 105:21" />Ɔyɛle ye ye Arane ne azo neazovolɛ, na ɔvale azɛlɛ ne azo ninyɛne kpokpoti ɔwulale ɔ sa. <verse eid="PSA 105:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 105:22" />Ɔmaanle ye tumi wɔ belemgbunli ne ye suakunlu mgbanyima ne mɔ anwo zo, na ɔhilehilele ye folɛtuvoma ne mɔ deɛ mɔɔ ɔwɔ kɛ bɛyɛ la.<verse eid="PSA 105:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 105:23" />Akee Yizilayɛma rale Yigyibiti, na Gyekɔbo rayɛle ɛyɛvolɛ wɔ Ham azɛlɛ zo. <verse eid="PSA 105:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 105:24" />Awulae maanle Yizilayɛma wole dɔɔnwo, na ɔmaanle bɛ nwo yɛle ɛsesebɛ dɛlale bɛ kpɔvolɛma ne mɔ. <verse eid="PSA 105:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 105:25" />Awulae hakyile Yigyibitima adwenle ɔmaanle bɛtiale ɔdaye ye menli Yizilayɛma; bɛhyile bɛ, na bɛvale bɛ bɛwulale akɛlɛyɛlɛ bo.<verse eid="PSA 105:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 105:26" />Akee ɔzoanle ye sonvolɛ Mosisi, yɛɛ Aalɔn, mɔɔ ɔzale nuhua ɔyele ye la. <verse eid="PSA 105:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 105:27" />Bɛyɛle ninyɛne ɛzulolɛ ɛzulolɛ dɔɔnwo, bɛyɛle nwanwanendeɛ mgbole mgbole wɔ Yigyibiti azɛlɛ zo. <verse eid="PSA 105:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 105:28" />Nana Nyamenle maanle awozinli kabii rale ravale azɛlɛ ne, noko akee Yigyibitima anli ye mɛla ne mɔ azo. <verse eid="PSA 105:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 105:29" />Ɔhakyile bɛ azule ne mɔ ɔmaanle bɛyɛle mogya, na ɔmaanle nuhua fɛlɛ kpokpoti wuwule. <verse eid="PSA 105:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 105:30" />Ɔmaanle ahɛlɛne vale bɛ maanle ne; bɔbɔ arelemgbunli ne mɔ dabelɛ ne mɔ amuala yiyile fefetee. <verse eid="PSA 105:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 105:31" />Nana Nyamenle luale Mosisi anwo zo dendɛle, na nrɛzenra kpolane nee ngɛkɛba ngakyile ngakyile ravale bɛ. <verse eid="PSA 105:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 105:32" />Ɔmaanle asukɔntweaba dɔle, na anwuma kpakyekpakyele memeamemea wɔ maanle ne anu amuala. <verse eid="PSA 105:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 105:33" />Ɔzɛkyele bɛ nwanye nee dɔma mbaka kpokpoti, na ɔbubule mbaka mɔɔ wɔ maanle ne anu la amuala. <verse eid="PSA 105:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 105:34" />Ɔdendɛle, na aabɛ kpolane rale, aabɛ ngakula ngyikyi ngyikyi mɔɔ ɛtia a ɛnnwu bɛ nloa a. <verse eid="PSA 105:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 105:35" />Bɛlile nya nya mɔɔ wɔ azɛlɛ ne azo la amuala; bɛzɛkyele mbakama nee aleɛ mɔɔ wɔ azɛlɛ ne azo la kpokpoti. <verse eid="PSA 105:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 105:36" />Akee ɔhunle belamunli mralɛ mɔɔ wɔ azɛlɛ ne azo la amuala, abusua eku eku mɔɔ wɔ Yigyibiti la bɛ mra mɔɔ lumua. <verse eid="PSA 105:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 105:37" />Ɔlile Yizilayɛma anyunlu ɔmaanle bɛvile Yigyibiti; bɛ muala bɛvale dwɛtɛ fufule nee nvutuke wɔ bɛ nwo. Bɛ muala bɛnyianle anwosesebɛ; bɛ nuhua biala anwo ando ye. <verse eid="PSA 105:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 105:38" />Yigyibitima anye liele wɔ melɛ mɔɔ bɛhɔle la, ɔluakɛ ɛnee bɛ nwo yɛ ɛzulolɛ somaa.<verse eid="PSA 105:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 105:39" />Nana Nyamenle maanle amungu hedale bɛ nwo zo, na ɔyele senle nɔɔzo mɔɔ bamaa bɛ wienyi a. <verse eid="PSA 105:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 105:40" />Bɛzɛlɛle bɛliele fɛlɛ, na ɔmaanle nloma dule rale; ɔmaanle bɛ aleɛ ɔvile anwuma maanle nu lɔ bɛlile bɛ ko yile. <verse eid="PSA 105:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 105:41" />Ɔkpukele bolɛ nu, na nzule vi nuhua rale; ɔzenle ɔvale fienemgbole ne azo kɛ azudenle la; <verse eid="PSA 105:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 105:42" />ɔluakɛ ɔhakyele ye ɛwɔkɛ nwuanzanwuanza ne mɔɔ ɔbɔle ye sonvolɛ, Ebileham la.<verse eid="PSA 105:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 105:43" />Zɔhane ati ɔlile ye menli ne mɔ anyunlu, ɔ nee bɛ rale Azɛlɛ ne mɔɔ bɛvale bɛbɔle bɛ Ɛwɔkɛ la azo, bɛlua edwɛnedolɛ nee anyelielɛ nu. <verse eid="PSA 105:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 105:44" />Ɔvale maanle maanle gyɛne bɛ azɛlɛ ne mɔ ɔmaanle bɛ, na ɔmaanle bɛvale bɛ anwonyiandeɛ mɔɔ bɛkpondɛ la bɛyɛle bɛ deɛ, <verse eid="PSA 105:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 105:45" />amaa ɔlua ɛhye azo bɛazie ye mɛla ne mɔ, na bɛali ye ngyehyɛlɛ ne mɔ azo. Bɛye Awulae ayɛlɛ!<verse eid="PSA 105:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 105" />
  <chapter number="106" style="c" sid="PSA 106" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 106</para>
  <para style="s1">Nana Nyamenle ye Anwunvɔnezelɛ mɔɔ ɔlɛ ye wɔ ye ɛtanevolɛma anwo la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 106:1" />Bɛye Awulae ayɛlɛ! Bɛva moyɛlɛ bɛmaa Awulae, ɔluakɛ ɔ ti akunlu le kpalɛ; ye ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne wɔ ɛkɛ ne dahuu. <verse eid="PSA 106:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 106:2" />Nwane yɛɛ kɛhola kɛha Nana Nyamenle nyɛleɛ mgbole mgbole ne mɔ mɔɔ yeyɛ la a? Anzɛɛ nwane a kɛhola kɛye ye ayɛlɛ molozo a?<verse eid="PSA 106:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 106:3" />Nyilalɛ ɛha bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛdi ye mɛla ne mɔ azo, na bɛbɔ tenlene ɛbɛla mekɛ muala la.<verse eid="PSA 106:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 106:4" />O Nana Nyamenle, kakye me wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɛkɛdo wɔ anwunvɔnezelɛ ne ɛkɛkponde wɔ menli ne mɔ anwo la; fa me boka bɛ nwo mekɛ mɔɔ ɛkɛlie bɛ ngoane la. <verse eid="PSA 106:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 106:5" />Maa menwu menli mɔɔ ɛdawɔ wɔkpa nu wɔye bɛ la bɛ boɛyɛlɛ, amaa bɛ fɛlɛkolilɛ ne bie adwu medame noko me nwo zo, na meanyia anyunlunyia ne mɔɔ wɔ menli banyia ye la bie.<verse eid="PSA 106:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 106:6" />Yɛdayɛ nee yɛ ze mɔ kpokpoti ɛyɛ ɛtane; yɛbɔ munzule, yɛyɛ ninyɛne atisesebɛ nu. <verse eid="PSA 106:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 106:7" />Mekɛ mɔɔ yɛ ze mɔ wɔ Yigyibiti azɛlɛ zo la, bɛandwenle Nana Nyamenle ye nwanwane ninyɛne ne mɔ anwo. Bɛangakye ye ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne mɔɔ mekɛ dɔɔnwo ne ala ɔhilele ɔhilele bɛ la; na emomu bɛdwazole bɛtiale Anwuma Nyamenle Bedevinli ne wɔ Nyevile Kɔkɔlɛ ne anloa. <verse eid="PSA 106:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 106:8" />Noko akee ɔliele bɛ ngoane, kɛmɔ ɔbɔle bɛ ɛwɔkɛ la, amaa yeala ye tumi totohyia ne ali. <verse eid="PSA 106:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 106:9" />Ɔdendɛle ɔhilele Nyevile Kɔkɔlɛ ne, na ɔhakyile azɛlɛ resee; na akee ɔvale bɛ ɔluale kuma ne anu ɔpɛle bɛ kɛ asɛɛ bɛlua fiemgbole zo la. <verse eid="PSA 106:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 106:10" />Ɛhye ati ɔyele bɛ ɔvile bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkyi bɛ la asa anu; ɔliele bɛ ngoane ɔvile bɛ kpɔvolɛma ne mɔ tumi bo. <verse eid="PSA 106:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 106:11" />Ɔmaanle nyevile azɛlɛkye ne mɔ nlomanle kpɔvolɛma ne mɔ; bɛ nuhua kokye bɔbɔ anga.<verse eid="PSA 106:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 106:12" />Akee ye menli ne mɔ liele ye ɛwɔkɛ ne mɔ mɔɔ ɔbɔle bɛ la lile, na bɛdole ayɛlɛyelɛ edwɛne bɛmaanle ye.<verse eid="PSA 106:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 106:13" />Noko akee yeangyɛ biala, bɛ rɛle vile ye nyɛleɛ ne mɔ, bɛangendɛ ye folɛdulɛ ne; bɛyɛle mɔɔ bɛdabɛ bɛ kunlu dwo nwolɛ la. <verse eid="PSA 106:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 106:14" />Bɛ nye bolole ninyɛne dɔɔnwo wɔ fiemgbole ne azo, na bɛzɔle Awulae Nana Nyamenle bɛnleanle. <verse eid="PSA 106:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 106:15" />Ɛhye ati ɔvale mɔɔ bɛbizale la amuala ɔmaanle bɛ, na eza noko ɔdele ewule ɔguale bɛ nwo zo: <verse eid="PSA 106:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 106:16" />Mekɛ zɔhane wɔ fiemgbole ne azo, bɛhwenle Mosisi ɔ nee Aalɔn, Nana Nyamenle ye sonvolɛ nwuanzanwuanzanli ne anwo nungule. <verse eid="PSA 106:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 106:17" />Akee azɛlɛ kpakyele nwiɔ, na ɔmenle Deetan, na ɔhedale Abaelam nee ye abusua kpokpoti anwo zo. <verse eid="PSA 106:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 106:18" />Senle dele guale bɛ nwo zo, na ɔyelale amumuyɛvoma ne mɔ dwɛɛ. <verse eid="PSA 106:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 106:19" />Bɛvale baka bɛzele ɛnlankɛ ralɛ wɔ Saenae, na bɛholole nvutuke bɛguale nwolɛ na bɛzonlenle ye. <verse eid="PSA 106:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 106:20" />Bɛvale Nana Nyamenle ye anyunlunyia ne bɛhakyile ɛnlankɛ mɔɔ di ndile, mɔɔ bɛze ye abaaba la ɛdeɛ. <verse eid="PSA 106:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 106:21" />Bɛ rɛle vile Nyamenle mɔɔ le bɛ Ngoanedievolɛ, mɔɔ yɛle nwanwanendeɛ mgbole mgbole wɔ Yigyibiti azɛlɛ zo la. <verse eid="PSA 106:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 106:22" />Bɛnlea nwanwanendeɛ mɔɔ ɔyɛle ye wɔ Ham azɛlɛ zo a! Bɛnlea ninyɛne ɛzulolɛ ɛzulolɛ mɔɔ ɔyɛle ye wɔ Nyevile Kɔkɔlɛ ne anloa a! <verse eid="PSA 106:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 106:23" />Zɔhane ati Awulae hanle kɛ ɔbazɛkye bɛ. Ɛhye ati Mosisi, mɔɔ ɔdaye ɔyele ye la, dwazole gyinlanle bɛ nee Nyamenle avinli; ɔzile ye ɛya totohyia ne mɔɔ yeva la aze, ammaa yeanzɛkye bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 106:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 106:24" />Akee bɛkpole Azɛlɛ Kpalɛ ne bɔbɔ, wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ bɛ diedi vile ye ɛwɔkɛ ne anu la. <verse eid="PSA 106:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 106:25" />Bɛdendɛle bɛ nzo abo wɔ bɛ kpɔda ne mɔ abo; na bɛangulo bɔbɔ kɛ bɛkɛdie Nana Nyamenle ane. <verse eid="PSA 106:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 106:26" />Zɔhane ati ɔhanle ndane ɔguale bɛ nwo zo, kɛ ɔbamaa bɛawuwu wɔ fiemgbole ne azo, <verse eid="PSA 106:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 106:27" />na yeakpo bɛ bɔkɔɔ wɔ maanle maanle nyunlu yeabɔ bɛ bo zo amra asande wɔ ɛsɛlɛ ne azo. <verse eid="PSA 106:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 106:28" />Akee bɛvale bɛ nwo bɛhɔbɔnenle Piyɔ awozosonvolɛma ne mɔ anwo na bɛzonlenle Baale; bɛlile aleɛ ne mɔɔ bɛfa bɛmaa bɛ awozonle ne mɔ la bie. <verse eid="PSA 106:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 106:29" />Bɛ nyɛleɛ ɛhye mɔ yɛle Awulae ɛya; ɔti ɔdele ewule ɔguale bɛ nwo zo. <verse eid="PSA 106:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 106:30" />Fenɛhase dwazole deanle bɛdabɛ mɔɔ ɔlua bɛ ɛtane ti a ɛhye zile la, na ewule ne abo pɛle ndɛndɛ zo ala. <verse eid="PSA 106:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 106:31" />Ɔlua ɛhye ati a bɛfɛlɛ ye tenlenenli la; na ɔvi ɛlɔnwɔne nwo zo kɔdwu ɛlɔnwɔne nwo zo, bɛbahakye ye melɛ mɔɔ ɔnle awieleɛ.<verse eid="PSA 106:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 106:32" />Menli ne mɔ hanle Awulae ɛya wɔ Mɛleba mbula ne mɔ anwo; na ɔlua ɛhye ati, Mosisi nwunle nwolɛ amaneɛ. <verse eid="PSA 106:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 106:33" />Bɛmaanle ɔnwunle ɔ kunlu nyane somaa, ɔlua zo ɔhehanle edwɛkɛ mɔɔ anrɛɛ ɔnle kɛ ɔka a. <verse eid="PSA 106:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 106:34" />Bɛanzɛkye menli ne mɔ, kɛmɔ Nana Nyamenle zele bɛ la. <verse eid="PSA 106:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 106:35" />Emomu, bɛ nee maanle maanle ne mɔ lile afonla bɛvale bɛ gyakɛ wɔ bɛ awozozonlenlɛ ne anu. <verse eid="PSA 106:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 106:36" />Bɛzonlenle bɛ awozonle ne mɔ bie, na ɛhye a yɛle dwɔwɔlɛ maanle bɛ a. <verse eid="PSA 106:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 106:37" />Bɛvale bɛ mra mrenyia nee mraalɛ bɛbɔle azu bɛmaanle Keena awozonle ne mɔ. <verse eid="PSA 106:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 106:38" />Bɛhanle ngakula ngyikyi ngyikyi mɔɔ bɛnze nwolɛ bie la mogya bɛguale; na ɛhye maanle evinli hanle azɛlɛ ne ɔlua mogya ne ati. <verse eid="PSA 106:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 106:39" />Bɛ nyɛleɛ ne guale bɛdabɛ bɛ nwo evinli; na bɛanli nɔhalɛ bɛammaa Nana Nyamenle. <verse eid="PSA 106:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 106:40" />Ɛhye ati Nana Nyamenle ɛya dwazole wɔ ye menli ne mɔ anwo zo, na ɔmaanle ɔkpole ye agyapadeɛ. <verse eid="PSA 106:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 106:41" />Ɔvale bɛ ɔwulale maanle maanle ne mɔ asa, na bɛ kpɔvolɛma lile bɛ nwo zo konim. <verse eid="PSA 106:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 106:42" />Bɛ kpɔvolɛma ne mɔ homonle bɛ nwo zo, na bɛvale bɛ bɛrawulale bɛ tumi bo.<verse eid="PSA 106:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 106:43" />Mekɛ dɔɔnwo ne ala yɛɛ Awulae honle liele ye menli a. Noko akee bɛdwazole bɛtiale ye, na bɛ ninyɛndane ne mɔ yɛle molozo. <verse eid="PSA 106:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 106:44" />Ɛhye mɔ bɔbɔ anzi, Awulae zele bɛ anwunvɔne, wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɔdele bɛ ɛzunlɛ la. <verse eid="PSA 106:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 106:45" />Ɔhakyele kɛ bɛmɛ ti yɛɛ ɔbɔle ɛwɔkɛ ne a. Yemɔti ɔgole ɔ sa wɔ ye ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne mɔɔ ɛbu ɛgua zolɛ la anwo. <verse eid="PSA 106:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 106:46" />Ɔmaanle bɛzele bɛ anwunvɔne, bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛ nee bɛ hɔle ɛzonlenlɛ bo la amuala.<verse eid="PSA 106:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 106:47" />Ko die yɛ, O Awulae yɛ Nyamenle, na kuohua yɛ nloa fi maanle maanle mɔɔ bɛva yɛ bɛhɔ bɛ ɛzonlenlɛ bo la asa anu; amaa yeava moyɛlɛ yeamaa wɔ duma nwuanzanwuanza ne, ɔ nee wɔ anyunlunyia ne, wɔ ayɛlɛyelɛ nu.<verse eid="PSA 106:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 106:48" />Nyilalɛ ɛha Nana Nyamenle, Yizilayɛ Nyamenle ne! Ɔvi ɛnɛ kɔdwu mekɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ, bɛye ye ayɛlɛ! Bɛmaa menli kpokpoti ɛha ye kɛ: Ɔyɛ Ɛkɛ! Bɛye Awulae ayɛlɛ!<verse eid="PSA 106:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 106" />
  <chapter number="107" style="c" sid="PSA 107" />
  <para style="ms">Buluku Mɔɔ Tɔ Zo Nnu</para>
  <para style="mr">
    <ref loc="PSA 107-150">Edw. 107–150</ref></para>
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 107</para>
  <para style="s1">Ayɛlɛyelɛ edwɛne mɔɔ bɛfa bɛmaa Nana Nyamenle, Pepɛdievolɛ ne la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 107:1" />Bɛmaa “yɛyɛ Nana Nyamenle mo, ɔluakɛ ɔ ti akunlu le kpalɛ; ye ɛhulolɛ nwanwane ne wɔ ɛkɛ mekɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ!” <verse eid="PSA 107:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 107:2" />Bɛmaa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ yelie bɛ ngoane, ɔ nee bɛdabɛ mɔɔ yepepɛ yelie bɛ yevi bɛ kpɔvolɛma asa anu la kpokpoti ɛha zɔ.<verse eid="PSA 107:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 107:3" />Ɔ nee menli mɔɔ bɛvale bɛ bɛhɔle amanvoa la ɛzia ɛra, ɔvi aduduleɛ kɔdwu adɔleɛ, ɔvi sɔlɔ kɔdwu nyiakɛ. <verse eid="PSA 107:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 107:4" />Bie mɔ luoluale nuhua gyɛne wɔ fiemgbole ne azo kpondɛle tɛnlabelɛ kpalɛ, noko akee bɛannyia bie. <verse eid="PSA 107:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 107:5" />Ɛhɔne nee nzuhɔne hunle bɛ ɔmaanle bɛ nwo golole bɛ, na ɔlua zo ɛnee akee bɛnlɛ anyelazo bieko. <verse eid="PSA 107:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 107:6" />Akee bɛzunle bɛvɛlɛle Nana Nyamenle wɔ bɛ anwongyelelɛ mekɛ ne anu, na ɔyele bɛ ɔvile bɛ amaneɛnwunlɛ nu. <verse eid="PSA 107:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 107:7" />Ɔvale bɛ ɔluale adenle kpolomgbolo nu, kɔkpula kɛ bɛhɔdwule sua mɔɔ bɛtɛnla zo la azo la. <verse eid="PSA 107:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 107:8" />Bɛmaa bɛva moyɛlɛ bɛmaa Nana Nyamenle wɔ ye ahunlunyele ne ati, ɔ nee ye nwanwane gyima ne mɔ mɔɔ ɔyɛle ɔmaanle menli amra la. <verse eid="PSA 107:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 107:9" />Ɔluakɛ ɔmaa ɛkɛla ne mɔɔ nzuhɔne ku ye la nzule, yɛɛ mɔɔ ɛhɔne ku ye la, ɔmaa ye debie kpalɛ ɔdi.<verse eid="PSA 107:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 107:10" />Bie mɔ dɛnlanle awozinli kabii nu; bie mɔ noko lale efiade, na bɛvale nwɔnzɔnwɔnzɔ bɛguale bɛ sa nee bɛ gyakɛ. <verse eid="PSA 107:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 107:11" />Ɔluakɛ bɛdwazole bɛtiale Nyamenle edwɛkɛ ne, na bɛambu Anwuma Bedevinlinli ne ye folɛdulɛ. <verse eid="PSA 107:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 107:12" />Gyimayɛlɛ ɛsesebɛ maanle bɛ ahonle yɛle kpalikpali zɛhae; ɛhye ati bɛpepɛle bɛfifinle, mɔɔ awie biala ɛnle ɛkɛ mɔɔ baboa bɛ bɛadwazo a. <verse eid="PSA 107:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 107:13" />Akee bɛzunle bɛvɛlɛle Nana Nyamenle wɔ bɛ anwongyelelɛ mekɛ ne anu, na ɔliele bɛ ɔvile bɛ nyanewunlɛ nu. <verse eid="PSA 107:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 107:14" />Ɔliele bɛ ɔvile awozinli kabii nee ewule nu, na ɔtetele bɛ nwɔnzɔnwɔnzɔ ne mɔ anu nzokɛnzoka ɔguale bɛ lɔ. <verse eid="PSA 107:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 107:15" />Bɛmaa bɛva moyɛlɛ bɛmaa Awulae wɔ ye ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne ati; ɔ nee ye nwanwane gyima ne mɔ mɔɔ ɔyɛle ɔmaanle menli amra la. <verse eid="PSA 107:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 107:16" />Ɔluakɛ ɔbubule mbulalɛ nlenkɛ ne mɔ, na ɔpepɛle mbulalɛ mɔɔ deda bɛ nzi la amuala anu.<verse eid="PSA 107:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 107:17" />Ahoasea mɔɔ wɔ nu la anwo dole bɛ, wɔ bɛ ninyɛndane ne mɔ ati, na ɔlua bɛ ɛtane ne ati bɛnwunle nyane kpole. <verse eid="PSA 107:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 107:18" />Bɛkpole aleɛ biala mɔɔ bɛdi la, na bɛhwenle bɛbikyele ewule. <verse eid="PSA 107:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 107:19" />Akee bɛzunle bɛvɛlɛle Nana Nyamenle wɔ bɛ anwongyelelɛ mekɛ ne anu, na ɔliele bɛ ɔvile bɛ nyanenwunlɛ nu. <verse eid="PSA 107:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 107:20" />Ɔdendɛle wɔ ye tumi nu, na bɛ nwo zale; ɔliele bɛ ɔvile ɛzɛkyelɛ nu. <verse eid="PSA 107:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 107:21" />Bɛmaa bɛva moyɛlɛ bɛmaa Nana Nyamenle, wɔ ye ɛhulolɛ nwanwane ne ati; ɔ nee ye nwanwane gyima ne mɔ mɔɔ ɔyɛle ɔmaanle menli amra la. <verse eid="PSA 107:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 107:22" />Maa bɛbɔ moyɛlɛ azu bɛmaa ye, na bɛva anyelielɛ edwɛne bɛla ye nyɛleɛ ne mɔ mɔɔ yeyɛ la ali.<verse eid="PSA 107:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 107:23" />Bie mɔ vale meli hɔle nyevile ne mɔ azo; bɛhɔlile gyima wɔ azumgbole ne mɔ azo. <verse eid="PSA 107:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 107:24" />Bɛdabɛ noko bɛnwunle Nana Nyamenle nyɛleɛ ne mɔ mɔɔ yeyɛ la, ye nwanwane gyima ne wɔ nyevile kunlu nehane. <verse eid="PSA 107:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 107:25" />Ɔdendɛle wɔ tumi nu, na ahumu dule, mɔɔ maanle nyevile azɛlɛkye mgbole mgbole dwazole a. <verse eid="PSA 107:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 107:26" />Meli ne mɔ kpogyale bɛ nwo zo hɔle anwuma anwuma, na bɛnlomanle nyevikuma ne abo. Ɛhye maanle bɛ akɛnrazilɛ ne hakyile bɛ ahonledulɛ. <verse eid="PSA 107:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 107:27" />Bɛdudule bɛ gyakɛ kɛ nzanobovolɛma la; bɛ adwenle yɛle bɛ tindaanwu. <verse eid="PSA 107:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 107:28" />Akee bɛzunle bɛvɛlɛle Nana Nyamenle wɔ bɛ anwongyelelɛ mekɛ ne anu, na ɔliele bɛ ɔvile bɛ nyanenwunlɛ nu. <verse eid="PSA 107:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 107:29" />Ɔbɛlɛle ahumu ne mɔ aze fɛɛnye, na ɔmaanle nyevile azɛlɛkye guale dii. <verse eid="PSA 107:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 107:30" />Akee bɛ nye liele, ɔluakɛ debie biala lale fɔɔnwo, na ɔvale bɛ ɔdwule ɛleka mɔɔ bɛkɔ la anzondwolɛ nu ala. <verse eid="PSA 107:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 107:31" />Bɛmaa bɛva moyɛlɛ bɛmaa Nana Nyamenle wɔ ye ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne ati, ɔ nee ye nwanwane gyima ne mɔ mɔɔ ɔyɛle ɔmaanle menli amra la. <verse eid="PSA 107:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 107:32" />Maa bɛla ye bedevinliyɛlɛ ne ali wɔ menli ne mɔ ayiaku ne anu, na bɛye ye ayɛlɛ wɔ mgbanyinli ne mɔ ayia bo.<verse eid="PSA 107:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 107:33" />Awulae maa azule azule sesa bɔkɔɔ, na ɔmaa amumuyɛvoma bɛ azɛlɛ kpalɛ ne mɔ kakyi fiemgbole. <verse eid="PSA 107:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 107:34" />Ɔmaa azɛlɛ kpalɛ zo ɛva kakyi ngyenle, ɔlua menli mɔɔ de zolɛ la bɛ amumuyɛ nyɛleɛ ti. <verse eid="PSA 107:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 107:35" />Eza ɔmaa fiemgbole kakyi azɛlɛ kpalɛ mɔɔ bɛdua aleɛ zo a; ɔmaa nzule vi azɛlɛ mɔɔ kpakyekpakye la anu ba maa ɔyɛ azɛlɛ kpalɛ. <verse eid="PSA 107:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 107:36" />Ɛkɛ ne yɛɛ ɔmaa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ ɛhɔne ku bɛ la tɛnla, na bɛkyekye bɛ azua kɛ bɛtɛnla nu a. <verse eid="PSA 107:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 107:37" />Bɛso bɛ egyinli na bɛduolua aleɛ aleɛ wɔ nu, na bɛbu aleɛ dɔɔnwo bɛfi nu. <verse eid="PSA 107:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 107:38" />Bɛlua ye nyilalɛ ne azo bɛwo, na ɔmmaa bɛ nlankɛ bo ɛndu ɛlɛ.<verse eid="PSA 107:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 107:39" />Saa bɛkomo Nana Nyamenle ye menli nwo zo na bɛbɛlɛ bɛ aze wɔ nzisi, anwongyelelɛ ɔ nee alɔbɔlɛ nu a, <verse eid="PSA 107:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 107:40" />ɔwola ye ɛyavalɛ ne ɔgua arelemgbunli nwo zo, na ɔmaa bɛduolua nuhua mgbane mgbane wɔ fiemgbole ne mɔ azo. <verse eid="PSA 107:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 107:41" />Emomu, ɔyɛ ehyiavolɛma ɔfi bɛ anwongyelelɛ nu, na ɔmaa bɛ nwo so kɛ nyɛmoa ekpunli ekpunli la. <verse eid="PSA 107:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 107:42" />Nɔhalɛdivoma nwu ɛhye, na bɛdi nwolɛ fɛlɛko; na amumuyɛvoma ɛdeɛ, bɛnwu ɛhye a ɛnee bɛdɔ mumule.<verse eid="PSA 107:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 107:43" />Mɔɔ le nrɛlɛbɛvolɛ la, bɛmaa ɔyɛ ɛnzolɛ ɔmaa ninyɛne ɛhye mɔ; bɛmaa ɔnwu Awulae ye ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne bolɛ mɔɔ ɔsonle a.<verse eid="PSA 107:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 107" />
  <chapter number="108" style="c" sid="PSA 108" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 108</para>
  <para style="s1">Edwɛndolɛ mɔɔ bɛfa bɛsɛlɛ Diedi wɔ Nana Nyamenle anu la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 108:1" />O Nana Nyamenle, me ahonle ɛyɛ anwomoalɛ; meyɛ anwomoalɛ kɛ mebayeyɛ wɔ! Mebado edwɛne meaye wɔ ayɛlɛ! Me ɛkɛla, dwazo! <verse eid="PSA 108:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 108:2" />Sanwunle nee getae, bɛdwazo! Mebadunwue alehyenlɛ ne. <verse eid="PSA 108:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 108:3" />Mebava moyɛlɛ meamaa wɔ, wɔ menli avinli, O Awulae; mebado nganvolɛ edwɛne meamaa wɔ wɔ maanle maanle avinli. <verse eid="PSA 108:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 108:4" />Ɔluakɛ wɔ ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne le totohyia bo anwuma debie biala anwo zo, na wɔ nɔhalɛlilɛ noko dwu Nyamenle ne ako abo nehane. <verse eid="PSA 108:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 108:5" />Kpogya ɛ nwo zo, wɔ anwomanyunlu debie biala anwo zo, O Nana Nyamenle. Maa wɔ anyunlunyia ne ɛbo aleɛabo amuala anwo zo!<verse eid="PSA 108:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 108:6" />Amaa ɔlua zo bɛalie wɔ kulovolɛma ngoane; fa ɛ sa ɛnlomboɛ ne pepɛ die me, na tie me nzɛlɛlɛ. <verse eid="PSA 108:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 108:7" />Nana Nyamenle ɛbɔ ɛwɔkɛ ɛvi ye nwuanzanwuanzaleka ne kɛ: wɔ konimlilɛ nu, mebahyɛ Hyikɛm anu nwiɔ, na meahyɛ Sɛko Bɔnza ne meamaa me menli. <verse eid="PSA 108:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 108:8" />Geleade le me deɛ; Manasɛ noko le me deɛ; Yifelaem me ti zo abotile, Dwuda le me belemgbunli maanle. <verse eid="PSA 108:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 108:9" />Mowabe le me kyɛnze mɔɔ mewowo me sa wɔ nu a; Yidɔm anwo zo yɛɛ mefuandi me gyakɛ abo mgbɔlaboa megua a; mefa mekile kɛ medame a melɛ ye a. Wɔ Filisitiama anwo zo, meteɛdea nu wɔ konimlilɛ nu.<verse eid="PSA 108:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 108:10" />Nwane a baye me ara suakpole ne, mɔɔ bɛbɔ bane bɛbɔ nwolɛ bɛyia la azo a? Nwane a bali me nyunlu nee me ahɔ Yidɔm a?<verse eid="PSA 108:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 108:11" />O Nana Nyamenle, asoo ɛtɛkpole yɛ ɔ? Ɛnrɛli yɛ ɛlɔne ne anyunlu ɛnrɛvinde ɛnrɛmaa bɛnrɛhɔ konle ɔ, O Nana Nyamenle? <verse eid="PSA 108:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 108:12" />O boa yɛ maa yɛvi yɛ kpɔvolɛma asa anu; ɔluakɛ sonla dasanli ye moalɛ ɛdeɛ le gyɛne! <verse eid="PSA 108:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 108:13" />Wɔ melɛ ala mɔɔ Nana Nyamenle wɔ yɛ afoa la, yɛbaho yɛadɔ zolɛ; ɔluakɛ yemɔ yɛɛ ɔbahomo yɛ kpɔvolɛma anwo zo a.<verse eid="PSA 108:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 108" />
  <chapter number="109" style="c" sid="PSA 109" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 109</para>
  <para style="s1">Kpɔvolɛma bɛ Ndeanlɛ Edwɛndolɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 109:1" />O Nana Nyamenle mɔɔ fɛta me nganvolɛ a, mmaye ɛ nye ɛto ye ɛbɔ nu! <verse eid="PSA 109:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 109:2" />Ɔluakɛ amumuyɛvoma nee nzekubɔvoma, ɛdu bɛ nwo ɛgua me nwo zo. Bɛdi ahua na bɛka adalɛ edwɛkɛ wɔ me nwo. <verse eid="PSA 109:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 109:3" />Bɛtendɛ bɛtia me, na bɛteta me gyɛne nu ala wɔ melɛ mɔɔ metɛsele bɛ ɛhwee a. <verse eid="PSA 109:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 109:4" />Bɛtende bɛ sa wɔ me nwo zo, wɔ me ɛhulolɛ mɔɔ melɛ ye wɔ bɛ nwo, ɔ nee nzɛlɛlɛ mɔɔ mɛsɛlɛ memaa bɛ la ati, <verse eid="PSA 109:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 109:5" />Ɛhye ati bɛfa ɛtane bɛtua me kpalɛyɛlɛ kakɛ, na bɛkyi me wɔ me ɛhulolɛ mɔɔ melɛ ye la ati.<verse eid="PSA 109:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 109:6" />Tu ndɛnebuavolɛ atisesebɛvo maa ɔbua bɛ ndɛne, na maa kpɔvolɛma ɛva ye ɛrɛla ndɛneleka. <verse eid="PSA 109:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 109:7" />Saa bɛdi ye edwɛkɛ a, maa bɛbua ye fɔlɛ; maa bɛva ye nzɛlɛlɛ bɔbɔ kɛ asɛɛ ɛtaneyɛlɛ! <verse eid="PSA 109:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 109:8" />Pɛ ye ngoane mekɛ zo; na maa bɛve ɔ nwo ninyɛne. <verse eid="PSA 109:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 109:9" />Maa ɔ mra ɛyɛ nrisa mralɛ, na ɔ ye ɛyɛ kunlavolɛ. <verse eid="PSA 109:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 109:10" />Maa ɔ mra ne mɔ ɛluolua nu ɛzɛlɛzɛlɛ aleɛ, na maa bɛvoa bɛ bɛvi bɛ aako ne mɔ mɔɔ ɛtotɔ, mgbane la anu. <verse eid="PSA 109:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 109:11" />Maa menli mɔɔ ɔtua bɛ kakɛ la ɛva ɔ nwo ninyɛne kpokpoti, na maa nyɛvolɛ ɛve ye egyinli nu aleɛ. <verse eid="PSA 109:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 109:12" />Mmamaa awie biala yɛ ye nyele, anzɛɛ mmamaa awie se ye nrisa mralɛ ne mɔ anwunvɔne. <verse eid="PSA 109:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 109:13" />Maa ɔ bo zo amra abo zo ɛbɔ bɔkɔɔ, na maa ye duma ɛminli wɔ ɛlɔnwɔne mɔɔ badia ye nwiɔ ne la anu la. <verse eid="PSA 109:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 109:14" />Maa bɛhakye ɔ ze mɔ bɛ ɛtane mɔɔ bɛyɛle la wɔ Nana Nyamenle anyunlu, na mmamaa ɔ nli ɛtane mɔɔ ɔyɛle la abo zo minli. <verse eid="PSA 109:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 109:15" />Maa Nana Nyamenle ɛhakye bɛ ɛtane ne mɔ dahuu, na maa bɛ rɛle ɛvi bɛ bo zo bɔkɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 109:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 109:16" />Ɔluakɛ yeangakye kɛ ɔkɛze anwunvɔne; emomu ɔdule ehyiavolɛma, ɔ nee bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛnlɛ anyelazo biala la ako, na ɔhwenle bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛlɛdi nyane la ɔhɔle ewule nu. <verse eid="PSA 109:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 109:17" />Ɔhulole amowalɛ; maa amowalɛ ne ɛzia ɛrɛla ɔ nwo zo! Yeangulo nyilalɛ, yemɔti mmamaa ɔnyia nyilalɛ ɛlɛ! <verse eid="PSA 109:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 109:18" />Ɔvale amowalɛ ɔbule tɛladeɛ ɔwulale; maa ye amowalɛ ne mɔ ɛloa ye tɔfɔɔ kɛ nzule, na ɔzonyi ɔhɔ ye mbowule ne mɔ anu kɛ nwole la!<verse eid="PSA 109:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 109:19" />Maa ɔyɛ kɛ tɛladeɛ mɔɔ yeva yekyekye ɔ nwo la, na ɔhye ɔ bo kɛ akyeso alehyenlɛ biala! <verse eid="PSA 109:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 109:20" />Nana Nyamenle, maa ɛhye ɛyɛ me kpɔvolɛma bɛ ahatualɛ, bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛtendɛ ɛtane bɛtia me ngoane la!<verse eid="PSA 109:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 109:21" />Na emomu, wɔmɔ Nana Nyamenle, me Nyamenle, ko maa me kɛmɔ ɛdawɔ wɔbɔ me ɛwɔkɛ la, na ɔlua wɔ ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne ye kpalɛyɛlɛ zo, die me ngoane.<verse eid="PSA 109:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 109:22" />Mele ehyianli, menlɛ anyelazo biala; me ɛkɛla di nyane somaa. <verse eid="PSA 109:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 109:23" />Mɛledie adenle meaminli minlimɛnla kɛ nɔsolɛ ɛlawolɛ la; bɛkpɔla me bɛdo kɛ kɛkɛba bie la. <verse eid="PSA 109:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 109:24" />Me gyakɛ agbɔkɛ ɛyɛ gugologugolo ɔlua ɛhɔnehyelɛ ti. Menwa meyɛ kamgbaanwo, menzɔho ɛhwee. <verse eid="PSA 109:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 109:25" />Saa me kpɔvolɛma nwu me a, bɛsele me ala; na bɛkɔsɔhɔsɔ bɛ ti wɔ amgbuzilɛ nu.<verse eid="PSA 109:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 109:26" />O Nana Nyamenle, me Nyamenle, boa me; ɔlua wɔ ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne ati die me ngoane! <verse eid="PSA 109:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 109:27" />Maa me kpɔvolɛma ɛnwu ye kɛ, ɛhye le wɔ nyɛleɛ, O Nana Nyamenle; wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛpepɛ ɛdie me a. <verse eid="PSA 109:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 109:28" />Maa bɛwa me amonle, na emomu wɔmɔ yila me. Maa anyiemgba ɛha me kpɔvolɛma, na maa mame, wɔ sonvolɛ ne anye ɛlie.<verse eid="PSA 109:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 109:29" />Maa anyiemgba ɛheda me kpɔvolɛma anwo zo; maa anyunluguase ɛwula bɛ tɛladeɛ. <verse eid="PSA 109:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 109:30" />Mebava me nloa babonle ne meayɛ Nana Nyamenle mo totohyia; mebaye ye ayɛlɛ wɔ menli ayiaku ne anu, <verse eid="PSA 109:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 109:31" />ɔluakɛ ɔpepɛ ɔdie ehyiavolɛma mɔɔ bɛnlɛ anyelazo biala la, na ɔdie bɛ ngoane ɔfi bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛbua bɛ ewule fɔlɛ la asa anu.<verse eid="PSA 109:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 109" />
  <chapter number="110" style="c" sid="PSA 110" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 110</para>
  <para style="s1">Edwɛndolɛ mɔɔ fale Devidi Ara Nrenyia ne anwo la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 110:1" />Awulae hanle hilele me menle, Ngoanedievolɛ ne kɛ, “Tɛnla me sa fema ye azo, kɔkpula mekɛ mɔɔ menwɔva wɔ kpɔvolɛma menwɔwula ɛ gyakɛ abo la.”<verse eid="PSA 110:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 110:2" />Nana Nyamenle zoanle ye belemgbunli tumi ne vile Zayɔn. Ɔse, “Sie wɔ kpɔvolɛma ne mɔ.” <verse eid="PSA 110:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 110:3" />Wɔ kenle ne mɔɔ ɛ nee wɔ kpɔvolɛma baho la, wɔ menli ne mɔ badu bɛ nwo azie ɛkɛ bɛazua ɛ nzi. Wɔ mgbavolɛ mgbavolɛ ne mɔ bara wɔ ɛkɛ wɔ wɔ Boka Nwuanzanwuanza ne azo, kɛ aleɛbahye ɛbɔlɛ mɔɔ tɔ la.<verse eid="PSA 110:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 110:4" />Nana Nyamenle ɛbɔ ɛwɔkɛ, na ɔnrɛhakyi ye amonle ne mɔɔ yeli la: kɛ, “Wɔmɔ ɛle sɛlɛvolɛ wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ mɔɔ di Mɛlekezidɛke anzi a.”<verse eid="PSA 110:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 110:5" />Awulae wɔ ɛ sa fema zo; na ɔbabɔ arelemgbunli asande wɔ ye ɛyavalɛ kenle ne anu. <verse eid="PSA 110:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 110:6" />Ɔbabua maanle maanle ndɛne fɔlɛ, na yeamaa bɛ avunli ayi bɛ azɛlɛ ne mɔ tɔ; ɔbaha adile dɔɔnwo yeagua wɔ aleɛabo ɛleka biala. <verse eid="PSA 110:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 110:7" />Na ɔdaye mumua ne ɔbanlo nzule yeavi azundenle mɔɔ wɔ ye adenle nloa la, na akee ɔnyia anwosesebɛ a, ɔbadwazo yeagyinla wɔ konimlilɛ nu.<verse eid="PSA 110:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 110" />
  <chapter number="111" style="c" sid="PSA 111" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 111</para>
  <para style="s1">Ayɛlɛyelɛ mɔɔ bɛfa bɛmaa Awulae la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 111:1" />Bɛye Nana Nyamenle ayɛlɛ! Mebava me ahonle kpokpoti meayɛ Awulae mo, wɔ ye tenlenema ayiaku ne anu. <verse eid="PSA 111:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 111:2" />Nea kɛ Nana Nyamenle asa anloa gyima ne mɔ le nwanwane bie a! Menli mɔɔ anye die nwolɛ la kulo kɛ bɛkɛzukoa na bɛkɛde ɔ bo. <verse eid="PSA 111:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 111:3" />Enililɛ nee belemgbunlililɛ kpalɛ da ɔ sa anloa gyima ne mɔ ali; na ye tenleneyɛlɛ ne wɔ ɛkɛ kɔdwu mekɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ.<verse eid="PSA 111:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 111:4" />Nana Nyamenle ɛmmaa yɛ rɛle ɛnvi ye nwanwane gyima ne mɔ; Awulae maa ɛlolɛ, na ɔse anwunvɔne. <verse eid="PSA 111:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 111:5" />Ɔmaa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛdi ye eni la asa kɔ bɛ nloa; ɔ rɛle ɛnvi ye ɛwɔkɛ ne mɔɔ ɔbɔle la ɛlɛ. <verse eid="PSA 111:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 111:6" />Yemaa ye menli ɛnwu tumi mɔɔ wɔ ye gyima ne anu la, wɔ Yizilayɛ agyapandeɛ ne mɔ mɔɔ yeva yemaa bɛ la anu. <verse eid="PSA 111:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 111:7" />Ɔ sa anloa gyima biala le nɔhalɛ nee pɛlɛpɛle; na ye ngyehyɛlɛ muala di munli bɔkɔɔ. <verse eid="PSA 111:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 111:8" />Ye mɛla ne mɔ wɔ ɛkɛ ne mekɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ; ɔluakɛ bɛyɛle bɛ wɔ nɔhalɛlilɛ nee tenleneyɛlɛ nu. <verse eid="PSA 111:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 111:9" />Ɔkpɔnenle ye menli ɔvile ɛzonlenlɛ bo; ɔ nee bɛ yɛle damɛnlangoate ngyehyɛlɛ. Nea kɛ ɔle Nwuanzanwuanza na ye duma yɛ ɛzulolɛ bie a!<verse eid="PSA 111:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 111:10" />Kɛ ɔkɛyɛ na sonla dasanli anwu nrɛlɛbɛ ɛ? Adenle kokye mɔɔ bɛdua zo la a le kɛ, bɛkɛli Nana Nyamenle eni; ɔluakɛ ɔbua ndɛne fɔɔnwo ɔkɔ bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛdi ye mɛla ne mɔ azo la afoa. Bɛye ye duma ne ayɛlɛ wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ.<verse eid="PSA 111:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 111" />
  <chapter number="112" style="c" sid="PSA 112" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 112</para>
  <para style="s1">Nana Nyamenle ye Nyilalɛ mɔɔ wɔ bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛdi ye Mɛla zo la anwo zo la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 112:1" />Bɛye Nana Nyamenle ayɛlɛ! Nyilalɛ a le sonla ne mɔɔ sulo Awulae na ɔdi ye eni; na ɔlɛ anyelielɛ molozo wɔ Awulae mɛla ne mɔ azo ɛlilɛ nu la.<verse eid="PSA 112:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 112:2" />Ɔ mra bayɛ menli mgbole mgbole wɔ azɛlɛ ne azo, ɔ bo zo amra banyia nyilalɛ. <verse eid="PSA 112:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 112:3" />Agyapadeɛ nee anwonyia badɛnla ye aako nu, na ye tenleneyɛlɛ ne wɔ ɛkɛ ne dahuu. <verse eid="PSA 112:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 112:4" />Wienyi ta wɔ awozinli nu maa tenlenema, bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛse anwunvɔne, bɛle atiakunlukpalɛ, na bɛdi nɔhalɛ la. <verse eid="PSA 112:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 112:5" />Awie mɔɔ yɛ awie mɔ moalɛ na ɔbɔ ehyiavolɛma bosea, na eza ɔdi pɛlepɛle wɔ ye gyimayɛlɛ nu la wie ye boɛ.<verse eid="PSA 112:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 112:6" />Ɔluakɛ tenlenema abo ɛnrɛdu ɛlɛ, bɛbahakye ye dahuu. <verse eid="PSA 112:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 112:7" />Ye ahonle ɛndu wɔ adawu ɛtane ɛtane nwo; ye diedi gyi ye kpundii, na ɔ rɛle wɔ Nana Nyamenle nu. <verse eid="PSA 112:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 112:8" />Dahuu ɔsi pi anzɛɛ ɔnzulo debie biala; ɔze ɔsie kɛ ɔbanwu ye kpɔvolɛma awieleɛ. <verse eid="PSA 112:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 112:9" />Ɔgo ɔ sa atiakunlukɛnlɛma nu ala ɔmaa ehyiavolɛma, yɛɛ ye tenleneyɛlɛ ne wɔ ɛkɛ ne mekɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ; menli arɛle ɛnrɛvi ye nyɛleɛ ɛlɛ, na bɛbamaa ye zo wɔ anyunlunyia nu.<verse eid="PSA 112:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 112:10" />Ninyɛndaneyɛvoma nwu ɛhye na bɛfa nwolɛ ɛya; bɛtwi bɛ gye, na bɛnwa nwolɛ; bɛ anyelazo kpokpoti te minli wɔ melɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ.<verse eid="PSA 112:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 112" />
  <chapter number="113" style="c" sid="PSA 113" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 113</para>
  <para style="s1">Edwɛndolɛ mɔɔ bɛfa bɛye Awulae, yɛ Nyamenle ne ayɛlɛ la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 113:1" />Bɛye Awulae ayɛlɛ! O bɛmɛ Awulae azonvolɛ, bɛye ye ayɛlɛ; bɛye ye duma ne ayɛlɛ! <verse eid="PSA 113:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 113:2" />Nyilalɛ ɛha Nana Nyamenle duma ne ɔvi ɛnɛ kɔdwu mekɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ. <verse eid="PSA 113:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 113:3" />Ɔvi sɛnzɛne aduduleɛ kɔdwu sɛnzɛne adɔleɛ, bɛye ye duma ne ayɛlɛ! <verse eid="PSA 113:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 113:4" />Ɔluakɛ Awulae tumi bo maanle maanle muala anwo zo, ye anyunlunyia ne bo anwuma maanle debie biala anwo zo.<verse eid="PSA 113:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 113:5" />Nwane a le kɛ Nana Nyamenle yɛ Nyamenle ne a? Yemɔ mɔɔ ɔde anwuma anwuma <verse eid="PSA 113:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 113:6" />na ɔ nye nwu debie biala mɔɔ wɔ azɛlɛ ye azo vi anwuma moamoa nehane la a! <verse eid="PSA 113:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 113:7" />Ɔkpogya ehyiavolɛma zo ɔfi azeva nu; ɔmaa mɔɔ ɛnlɛ bie la zo ɔfi fovolɛ zo, <verse eid="PSA 113:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 113:8" />na ɔfa bɛ ɔsie arelemgbunli bɛ avinli, arelemgbunli mɔɔ nea ye menli nwo zo la. <verse eid="PSA 113:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 113:9" />Ɔfa enililɛ ɔmaa motavolɛ wɔ ye aako nu; na ɔmaa ɔnyia mralɛ mɔɔ maa ye anyelielɛ a.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PSA 113:9">Aleluya! Bɛye Awulae Ayɛlɛ.<verse eid="PSA 113:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 113" />
  <chapter number="114" style="c" sid="PSA 114" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 114</para>
  <para style="s1">Edwɛndolɛ mɔɔ fale Maanle ye awolɛ fofolɛ nwo la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 114:1" />Bɛye Awulae ayɛlɛ! Mekɛ mɔɔ Yizilayɛma vile Yigyibiti, mekɛ mɔɔ Gyekɔbo abo zo amra vile aneɛ fofolɛ maanle ne anu la, <verse eid="PSA 114:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 114:2" />Dwuda rayɛle Awulae ye nwuanzanwuanza menli, Yizilayɛ rayɛle ye belemgbunli maanle.<verse eid="PSA 114:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 114:3" />Nyevile Kɔkɔlɛ ne nwunle bɛ kɛ bɛlɛba, na ɔnriandinle ndɛndɛ zo; Azule Dwɔdan gyakyile ɛzenlɛ ɔmaanle bɛpɛle ye. <verse eid="PSA 114:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 114:4" />Awoka mgbole ne mɔ wuluwulule kɛ mboane nyinli la, yɛɛ awoka ngyikyi ne mɔ wuluwulule kɛ mboane mralɛ la. <verse eid="PSA 114:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 114:5" />O Nyevile Kɔkɔlɛ, duzu edwɛkɛ a zile, mɔɔ ɔlua zo ɛkpakyele ɛ nwo nu nwiɔ a? Na wɔmɔ, O Dwɔdan, duzu ati a ɛgyakyile ɛzenlɛ a? <verse eid="PSA 114:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 114:6" />O bɛmɛ Awoka, duzu ati a bɛwuluwulule kyelakyela kɛ mboane nyinli la a? Bɛmɛ awoka ngyikyi ngyikyi, duzu ati a bɛwuluwulule kɛ mboane mralɛ a?<verse eid="PSA 114:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 114:7" />O Azɛlɛ, fa anwowozolɛ sulo wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ Awulae kɛra la, wɔ Gyekɔbo ye Nyamenle ne anyunlu; <verse eid="PSA 114:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 114:8" />yemɔ mɔɔ ɔmaa awolɛ kakyi nzulebula, na bolɛ ɛsesebɛ kakyi azudenle la.<verse eid="PSA 114:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 114" />
  <chapter number="115" style="c" sid="PSA 115" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 115</para>
  <para style="s1">Ayɛlɛyelɛ mɔɔ bɛfa bɛmaa Nana Nyamenle ye Anyunlunyia ne la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 115:1" />Ɛ ngomekye, O Nana Nyamenle, ɛ ngomekye wɔ duma ne ala, na emomu tɛ yɛmɛ yɛ deɛ ne, yɛɛ anyunlunyia ɛha ye a. Ɔlua wɔ ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne nee wɔ nɔhalɛlilɛ ne ati, maa awie biala ɛye wɔ ayɛlɛ. <verse eid="PSA 115:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 115:2" />Duzu ati a ɔwɔ kɛ maanle maanle biza kɛ, “Bɛ Nyamenle ne wɔ nienwu a?”<verse eid="PSA 115:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 115:3" />Yɛ Nyamenle ne wɔ Anwuma maanle ne anu; na mɔɔ ɔkulo la yɛɛ ɔyɛ a. <verse eid="PSA 115:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 115:4" />Bɛ awozonle ne mɔ le sonla sa anloa ninyɛne, mɔɔ bɛva dwɛtɛ fufule nee nvutuke bɛyɛ a. <verse eid="PSA 115:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 115:5" />Bɛlɛ ɛnloanlɛ, noko akee bɛndendɛ; bɛlɛ ɛnyelɛ, na bɛnnwu ɛhwee! <verse eid="PSA 115:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 115:6" />Bɛlɛ ɛnzolɛ, noko akee bɛnde edwɛkɛ; bɛlɛ ebonyile, na bɛnde nvoanle! <verse eid="PSA 115:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 115:7" />Bɛlɛ ɛsalɛ, noko akee ɛti bɛ a bɛnde; bɛlɛ egyakɛ, na bɛngola tia; bɛngola bɛnva bɛ kominza bɛnyɛ alɛra biala. <verse eid="PSA 115:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 115:8" />Menli mɔɔ yɛle zɔhane awozonle ne mɔ la, le kɛ bɛdabɛ ala la pɛ; zɔhane ala yɛɛ bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛva bɛ rɛle bɛwula bɛ nuhua la de a.<verse eid="PSA 115:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 115:9" />O bɛmɛ Yizilayɛma, bɛva bɛ rɛle bɛwula Nana Nyamenle anu! Ɔle bɛ boavolɛ; ɔle bɛ wowadeɛ. <verse eid="PSA 115:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 115:10" />O bɛmɛ Aalɔn azɛlɛvolɛ, bɛva bɛ rɛle bɛwula Nana Nyamenle anu, ɔle bɛ boavolɛ; ɔle bɛ wowadeɛ. <verse eid="PSA 115:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 115:11" />Bɛmɛ mɔɔ bɛdi Nana Nyamenle eni la, bɛva bɛ rɛle bɛwula ye nu; ɔle bɛ boavolɛ; ɔle bɛ sinzavolɛ.<verse eid="PSA 115:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 115:12" />Awulae adwenle wɔ yɛ nwo zo alehyenlɛ biala, na amgba ala ɔbayila yɛ; ɔbayila Yizilayɛma, ɔ nee Aalɔn aako nu amra kpokpoti. <verse eid="PSA 115:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 115:13" />Ɔbayila bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛdi ye eni la kpokpoti, ngakula nee mgbanyinli muala.<verse eid="PSA 115:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 115:14" />Nana Nyamenle ɛmaa bɛlɔ, bɛmɛ nee bɛ mra! <verse eid="PSA 115:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 115:15" />Nana Nyamenle mɔɔ bɔle anwuma nɛ aze la ɛyila bɛ. <verse eid="PSA 115:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 115:16" />Anwuma maanle ne le Nana Nyamenle angomekye deɛ, na emomu yeva azɛlɛ nwo maanle ne yemaa sonla dasanli.<verse eid="PSA 115:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 115:17" />Mɔwuamra ɛngola ɛnye Awulae ayɛlɛ, anzɛɛ bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛhɔ ewule kuma nu la. <verse eid="PSA 115:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 115:18" />Na emomu, yɛmɛ anyewɔzo amra yɛbava moyɛlɛ yɛamaa ye, ɔvi ɛnɛ kɔdwu mekɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PSA 115:18">Haleluya! Bɛye Awulae Ayɛlɛ!<verse eid="PSA 115:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 115" />
  <chapter number="116" style="c" sid="PSA 116" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 116</para>
  <para style="s1">Bɛ ti anwo Moyɛlɛ mɔɔ bɛfa bɛsɛlɛ Nyamenle ye Ngoanelielɛ la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 116:1" />Mekulo Awulae, ɔluakɛ ɔtie me; ɔtie me nzɛlɛlɛ. <verse eid="PSA 116:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 116:2" />Ɔgua ɔ nzo aze na ɔtie me; zɔhane ati mekɛ dodo mɔɔ mede ngoane nu la, saa mesu mefɛlɛ ye!<verse eid="PSA 116:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 116:3" />Ewule ngane bɔle me nwo mgbɔlɛka yiale; funli kuma nu ninyɛne ɛzulolɛ ɛzulolɛ mundunle me nwo zo; na menwunle me nyunlu, na menlile nyane somaa. <verse eid="PSA 116:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 116:4" />Akee menzunle menvɛlɛle Awulae menzele kɛ, “O Nana Nyamenle, mesɛlɛ wɔ, die me ngoane!” <verse eid="PSA 116:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 116:5" />Nana Nyamenle le kpalɛ! Ɔle anwunvɔnesevolɛ! Yɛ Nyamenle ne le alɔbɔlɛnwuvolɛ! <verse eid="PSA 116:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 116:6" />Nana Nyamenle sinza bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛbɛlɛ bɛ nwo aze la; mekɛ mɔɔ membikyele ewule la, ɔliele me ngoane. <verse eid="PSA 116:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 116:7" />O me ɛkɛla, sia bɛla wɔ ɛnwomenlelielɛ nu; ɔluakɛ Nana Nyamenle nee wɔ ɛli ye boɛ totohyia. <verse eid="PSA 116:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 116:8" />Awulae liele me ngoane vile ewule nu; ɔyele me nye ɔvile monle nu, na ɔyele me gyakɛ ɔvile ɛtelelɛ nu. <verse eid="PSA 116:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 116:9" />Ɛhye ati mede ngoane nu wɔ Nana Nyamenle anyunlu, wɔ anyewɔzo amra azɛlɛ ne azo.<verse eid="PSA 116:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 116:10" />Me diedi gyinlanle ye kpundii, bɔbɔ wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ menganle kɛ: “Melɛnwu nyane totohyia” la. <verse eid="PSA 116:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 116:11" />Menganle ye wɔ me ɛzulolɛ nu kɛ: “Diedi wɔ sonla nu le gyɛne.” <verse eid="PSA 116:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 116:12" />Duzu a menwɔva menwɔmaa Nana Nyamenle, wɔ ye ahunlunyele mɔɔ wɔ me nwo zo la ɛ? <verse eid="PSA 116:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 116:13" />Mebava nwanye ahyɛlɛdeɛ mearɛlɛ Nana Nyamenle, na meayɛ ye mo kɛ yelie me ngoane a. <verse eid="PSA 116:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 116:14" />Mebadua me ɛwɔkɛ ne mɔɔ membɔle Nana Nyamenle la meamaa ye, wɔ ye menli ayiaku ne anyunlu. <verse eid="PSA 116:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 116:15" />Nea kɛ Nana Nyamenle akunlu yelɛyela ye bie, wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ye menli ne mɔ anu ko kɛvi nu la ɛ!<verse eid="PSA 116:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 116:16" />O Nana Nyamenle, mele wɔ sonvolɛ; mebazonle wɔ, kɛmɔ ɔmɔ zonlenle wɔ ala la; ɔluakɛ wɔmɔ wɔzanyizanyi nyɛma mɔɔ kyekye me la amuala. <verse eid="PSA 116:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 116:17" />Mebabɔ moyɛlɛ azu meamaa wɔ, na meava me nzɛlɛlɛ kpokpoti meado ɛ nyunlu. <verse eid="PSA 116:17" /><verse number="18-19" style="v" sid="PSA 116:18-19" />Wɔ Gyɛlusalɛm Asɔne Sua Kpole ne ye nwɔhoalilɛleka ne mɔ anu, wɔ wɔ menli ayiaku ne anyunlu, yɛɛ mebava ɛwɔkɛ biala mɔɔ membɔle wɔ la meamaa wɔ a. Bɛye Nana Nyamenle Ayɛlɛ!<verse eid="PSA 116:18-19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 116" />
  <chapter number="117" style="c" sid="PSA 117" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 117</para>
  <para style="s1">Maanle maanle kpokpoti ɔwɔ kɛ ye Awulae ayɛlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 117:1" />Bɛye Nana Nyamenle ayɛlɛ, maanle maanle kpokpoti! Aleɛabo amra kpokpoti, bɛye ye ayɛlɛ! <verse eid="PSA 117:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 117:2" />Ɔluakɛ ye ɛhulolɛ nwanwane ne mɔɔ ɔlɛ ɔmaa yɛ la le totohyia, na ye nɔhalɛlilɛ ne wɔ ɛkɛ ne dahuu. Bɛye Nana Nyamenle Ayɛlɛ!<verse eid="PSA 117:2" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 117" />
  <chapter number="118" style="c" sid="PSA 118" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 118</para>
  <para style="s1">Konimlilɛ Edwɛndolɛ mɔɔ maa bɛnyia Damɛnlangoate Anwunvɔnezelɛ la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 118:1" />Bɛva moyɛlɛ bɛmaa Nana Nyamenle, ɔluakɛ ɔle kpalɛ, ye ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne wɔ ɛkɛ ne dahuu. <verse eid="PSA 118:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 118:2" />Bɛmaa Yizilayɛma ɛha kɛ, “Ye ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne wɔ ɛkɛ ne dahuu.” <verse eid="PSA 118:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 118:3" />Bɛmaa Aalɔn azɛlɛvolɛ ɛha kɛ, “Ye ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne wɔ ɛkɛ ne dahuu.” <verse eid="PSA 118:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 118:4" />Bɛmaa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛdi Nana Nyamenle eni la ɛha kɛ, “Ye ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne wɔ ɛkɛ ne dahuu.”<verse eid="PSA 118:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 118:5" />Wɔ me nyanelilɛ nu, menvɛlɛle Awulae; ɔliele me zo, na ɔmaanle me nwo dɔle me. <verse eid="PSA 118:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 118:6" />Mekɛ dodo ala mɔɔ Nana Nyamenle wɔ me afoa la, menrɛzulo. Duzu a sonla dasanli kɛhola kɛva kɛyɛ me a? <verse eid="PSA 118:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 118:7" />Nana Nyamenle wɔ me afoa kɛ ɔkɛboa me, ɛhye ati wɔ konimlilɛ nu, yɛɛ mebanlea bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkyi me la a.<verse eid="PSA 118:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 118:8" />Ɔle kpalɛ kɛ ɛkɛva ɛ rɛle ɛkɛwula Nana Nyamenle anu, tɛla kɛ ɛkɛva wɔ adwenle ɛkɛzɔ sonla dasanli la. <verse eid="PSA 118:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 118:9" />Ɔle kpalɛ kɛ ɛkɛkpondɛ feabelɛ wɔ Nana Nyamenle anu, tɛla kɛ ɛkɛva ɛ rɛle ɛkɛwula arelemgbunli nu la.<verse eid="PSA 118:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 118:10" />Bɔbɔ kpɔvolɛma ɛbɔ ɛyia me ɛdeɛ, noko akee melua Nana Nyamenle duma nu, mebapɛ bɛ muala meagua bɛ lɔ. <verse eid="PSA 118:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 118:11" />Nɔhalɛ nu, bɛbɔ bɛyia me foa nee foa; noko akee melua Nana Nyamenle tumi nu, mebazɛkye bɛ muala. <verse eid="PSA 118:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 118:12" />Bɛbɔ bɛyia me fii kɛ wolɛ, bɛsɔ wulenyi wulenyi kɛ ɛyɛzinli dɛba senle la; noko akee ɔlua Nana Nyamenle asa ɛnlomboɛ ne tumi zo, mebabɔ bɛ muala bɛ bo zo bɔkɔɔ. <verse eid="PSA 118:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 118:13" />Bɛtetale me atisesebɛ nu ala, na bɛhulole kɛ bɛkɛli me nwo zo konim, noko akee Nana Nyamenle boale me. <verse eid="PSA 118:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 118:14" />Awulae maa menyia tumi nee anwosesebɛ wɔ konle nu; yelie me ngoane. <verse eid="PSA 118:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 118:15" />Bɛdie anyelielɛ edwɛne wɔ konimlilɛ nu wɔ Nana Nyamenle ye menli bɛ kpɔda ne mɔ abo; “Awulae nwanwane tumi ne di gyima ne bɔkɔɔ! <verse eid="PSA 118:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 118:16" />Ye tumi, ye nwanwane tumi wɔ konle nu, ɛva konimlilɛ ɛrɛlɛ yɛ!” <verse eid="PSA 118:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 118:17" />Menrɛwu; emomu mebadɛnla ngoane nu, na meadia Awulae nyele mɔɔ yeyɛ yemaa me la. <verse eid="PSA 118:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 118:18" />Awulae ɛhwi me nyunlu kpole kpalɛ, noko akee ɔtɛyele me ɔtɛmaanle ewule.<verse eid="PSA 118:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 118:19" />Bɛbukebuke tenlenema nlenkɛ ne mɔ bɛmaa me; mebava nuhua meadoa bɛ, na meava moyɛlɛ meamaa Awulae! <verse eid="PSA 118:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 118:20" />Nana Nyamenle anlenkɛ ne ɛne; tenlenema angomekye yɛɛ bava nu ahɔ a. <verse eid="PSA 118:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 118:21" />Meyɛ wɔ mo kɛ ɛdiele me, O Awulae, na wɔrayɛ me ngoanedievolɛ a.<verse eid="PSA 118:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 118:22" />Bolɛ ne mɔɔ suasivolɛma ne mɔ ambu ye bie la, yemɔ yɛɛ ɛrayɛ bolɛ ne mɔɔ sua ne gyi zo la a! <verse eid="PSA 118:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 118:23" />Ɛhye le Nana Nyamenle nyɛleɛ; na ɔle nwanwanedeɛ wɔ yɛ nye zo! <verse eid="PSA 118:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 118:24" />Ɛhye a le kenle ne mɔɔ Nana Nyamenle ɛhyehyɛ la; bɛmaa yɛli fɛlɛko, na yɛ nye ɛlie wɔ nuhua! <verse eid="PSA 118:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 118:25" />Die yɛ ngoane; Nana Nyamenle, die yɛ ngoane! Maa yɛ konimlilɛ, O Nana Nyamenle! <verse eid="PSA 118:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 118:26" />Nyilalɛ ɛha ahenle ne mɔɔ lua Nana Nyamenle duma nu ɛlɛba la! Yɛyila wɔ yɛfi Awulae Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu.<verse eid="PSA 118:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 118:27" />Nana Nyamenle le Nyamenle; yemaa yɛ wienyi. Bɛva mrɛlakɛ bɛdedɛ bɛ sa nu, bɛbɔ ɛvoyialilɛ ne abo, na bɛva anyelielɛ bɛbɔ azukponle ne anwo mgbɔlɛka. <verse eid="PSA 118:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 118:28" />Wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛle me Nyamenle a, mebava moyɛlɛ meamaa wɔ; wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛle me Nyamenle a, mebakpogya wɔ zo. <verse eid="PSA 118:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 118:29" />Bɛva moyɛlɛ bɛmaa Nana Nyamenle, ɔluakɛ ɔle kpalɛ; ye ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne wɔ ɛkɛ dahuu.<verse eid="PSA 118:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 118" />
  <chapter number="119" style="c" sid="PSA 119" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 119</para>
  <para style="s1">Mɛla Nwuanzanwuanza ne ye ayɛlɛyelɛ edwɛne mɔɔ bɛhɛlɛ la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 119:1" />Nyilalɛ a le bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛ nyɛleɛ le tenlene, bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛdua Nana Nyamenle mɛla ne adenle zo bɛdi bɛ gyima wɔ bɛ ɛbɛlabɔlɛ nu la. <verse eid="PSA 119:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 119:2" />Nyilalɛ a le bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛdi Awulae ngyehyɛlɛ ne mɔ anwo daselɛ, na bɛfa bɛ ahonle kpokpoti bɛkpondɛ ɔ nzi adenle la. <verse eid="PSA 119:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 119:3" />Bɛnyɛ ɛtane biala; na emomu, bɛdua Awulae ye ndenle ne mɔ azo. <verse eid="PSA 119:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 119:4" />Awulae, wɔmɔ wɔva wɔ mɛla ne mɔ wɔmaa yɛ, na wɔze yɛ kɛ yɛli zolɛ wɔ nɔhalɛ nu ala. <verse eid="PSA 119:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 119:5" />O me kunlu anu a anrɛɛ me nyɛleɛ bayɛ tenlene wɔ Awulae mɛla ne azo ɛlilɛ nu. <verse eid="PSA 119:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 119:6" />Saa meyɛ ɛnzolɛ memaa wɔ ngyehyɛlɛ ne mɔ a, yɛɛ akee me nyunlu nyiane ɛnrɛgua aze a.<verse eid="PSA 119:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 119:7" />Mebava ahonle mɔɔ nuhua te la meaye wɔ ayɛlɛ, wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ menwɔzukoa wɔ tenlene ndɛnebualɛ ne mɔ la. <verse eid="PSA 119:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 119:8" />Mebali wɔ mɛla ne mɔ azo! O, mmakpo me; mmamaa ɛ rɛle fi me bɔkɔɔ!<verse eid="PSA 119:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 119:9" />Kɛ ɔkɛyɛ na kpavolɛ ahola amaa ye nyɛleɛ ayɛ nwuanzanwuanza ɛ! Kyesɛ ɔkenga wɔ edwɛkɛ ne, na ɔdi zolɛ. <verse eid="PSA 119:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 119:10" />Mebɔ mɔdenle biala kɛ menwɔva me ahonle kpokpoti menwɔzonle wɔ; mmamaa meduolua nuhua mgbane mgbane, mɔɔ menli wɔ mɛla ne mɔ azo a. <verse eid="PSA 119:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 119:11" />Me ahonle nu yɛɛ mefa wɔ edwɛkɛ ne mesie a, ammaa meanyɛ ɛtane meantia wɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 119:12" />O Nana Nyamenle, nyilalɛ ɛha wɔ; kilehile me wɔ mɛla ne mɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 119:13" />Me nloa yɛɛ mebava meabɔ ɛlawule, wɔ wɔ ngyehyɛlɛ muala mɔɔ vi ɛ nloa anu ɛra la anwo a. <verse eid="PSA 119:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 119:14" />Me nye die kɛ menwɔdoa wɔ ngyehyɛlɛ ne mɔ abo zo, tɛla kɛmɔ me nye die agyapadeɛ nwo la. <verse eid="PSA 119:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 119:15" />Mesie me adwenle koonwu medwenledwenle wɔ mɛla ne mɔ anwo; meneɛnlea wɔ ngilehile ne mɔ anu kpalɛ. <verse eid="PSA 119:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 119:16" />Memaa me nye die wɔ wɔ mɛla ne mɔ anwo; me rɛle ɛnrɛvi wɔ edwɛkɛ ne ɛlɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 119:17" />Kile wɔ nyele ne wɔ mame, wɔ sonvolɛ ne anwo zo, amaa meadɛnla aze, na meali wɔ ngilehile ne mɔ azo. <verse eid="PSA 119:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 119:18" />Buke me nye, amaa meanwu nwanwanendeɛ ne mɔ mɔɔ wɔ wɔ mɛla ne mɔ anu la. <verse eid="PSA 119:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 119:19" />Mele ɛyɛvolɛ wɔ azɛlɛ ye azo, wɔ mekɛ ekyi bie ala; mmafa wɔ mɛla ne mɔ ɛfea me. <verse eid="PSA 119:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 119:20" />Me ɛkɛla ne anwo ɛlɛdɔ wɔ somaa; mekulo kɛ menwu wɔ ndɛnebualɛ ne mɔ mekɛ biala.<verse eid="PSA 119:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 119:21" />Wɔmɔ ɛtwi amemaabɛnwozovoma anyunlu; munzule ɛha bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛmɛ bɛse bɛnrɛli wɔ ngyehyɛlɛ ne mɔ azo la. <verse eid="PSA 119:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 119:22" />Ye me fi bɛ amgbuzilɛ ɔ nee bɛ anyehoanlɛbulɛ ne mɔ anu, ɔluakɛ meli wɔ mɛla ne mɔ azo. <verse eid="PSA 119:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 119:23" />Kanzɛ arelemgbunli di ahua yɛ ngyehyɛleɛ ɛtane tia me bɔbɔ a, mame, wɔ sonvolɛ, mebadɛnla aze koonwu meadwenledwenle wɔ mɛla ne mɔ anwo. <verse eid="PSA 119:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 119:24" />Wɔ mɛla ne mɔ yɛɛ me nye die nwo a; bɛle me folɛtuvolɛma.<verse eid="PSA 119:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 119:25" />Bɛli me nwo zo konim, me ɛkɛla la azeva ne anu; tunwue me, kɛmɔ ɛdawɔ wɔbɔ me ɛwɔkɛ la. <verse eid="PSA 119:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 119:26" />Menganle me ɛtane ne mɔ kpokpoti mengilele wɔ, na ɛdiele me; kilehile me wɔ ndenle ne mɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 119:27" />Boa me maa mende wɔ mɛla ne mɔ abo, na mebadɛnla aze koonwu meadwenledwenle wɔ nwanwane ngilehile ne mɔ anwo.<verse eid="PSA 119:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 119:28" />Me ɛkɛla ɛlɛkolo agua wɔ nyane nu; maa me anwosesebɛ kɛmɔ ɛdawɔ wɔbɔ me ɛwɔkɛ la. <verse eid="PSA 119:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 119:29" />Ye adalɛ nyɛleɛ kɔ moamoa fi me nwo zo, na wɔ wɔ ɛlolɛ nu ala, kilehile me wɔ mɛla ne mɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 119:30" />Mefa nɔhalɛlilɛ adenle ne azo; meva wɔ mɛla ne mɔ mezie me nyunlu. <verse eid="PSA 119:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 119:31" />O Nana Nyamenle; meli ɛ nloa edwɛkɛ biala azo; mmamaa me nyunlu nyiane gua aze. <verse eid="PSA 119:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 119:32" />Mebali wɔ mɛla ne mɔ azo anyebololɛ nu ala; ɔboalekɛ, ɛbamaa me ndelebɛbo nu api.<verse eid="PSA 119:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 119:33" />O Nana Nyamenle, kilehile me wɔ mɛla ne mɔ abo, na mebali zolɛ meahɔ awieleɛ. <verse eid="PSA 119:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 119:34" />Maa me ndelebɛbo, amaa meazie wɔ mɛla ne; na meava me ahonle muala meali zolɛ. <verse eid="PSA 119:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 119:35" />Maa menyɛ tieyɛ wɔ wɔ mɛla ne mɔ anwo, ɔboalekɛ, wɔ bɛ nu yɛɛ menyia fɛlɛkolilɛ a.<verse eid="PSA 119:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 119:36" />Maa me ahonle ɛhwe ɛbikye wɔ daselɛlilɛ ne mɔ, tɛla kɛ menwɔnyia me nwo a. <verse eid="PSA 119:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 119:37" />Ye me nye fi ninyɛne mɔɔ nvasoɛ ɛnle zo la azo; kakyi me ahonle, kɛmɔ ɛdawɔ wɔbɔ me ɛwɔkɛ la. <verse eid="PSA 119:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 119:38" />Si wɔ ɛwɔkɛ ne pi maa me, mame wɔ sonvolɛ, ɛwɔkɛ ne mɔɔ ɛfa ɛmaa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛdi wɔ eni la.<verse eid="PSA 119:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 119:39" />Ye me fi amgbuzilɛ nee anyehoanlɛbulɛ ne mɔ mɔɔ mesulo bɛ la anu; ɔluakɛ wɔ ndɛnebualɛ ne mɔ yɛ nwanwane. <verse eid="PSA 119:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 119:40" />Nea kɛ me nwo dɔ wɔ mɛla ne mɔ bie a! Maa menyia ngoane fofolɛ, wɔ wɔ tenleneyɛlɛ ne anu. <verse eid="PSA 119:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 119:41" />O Nana Nyamenle, maa menwu ɛhulolɛ mɔɔ ɛkulo me la ye bolɛ mɔɔ ɔsonle a; na die me ngoane kɛmɔ wɔ ɛwɔkɛ ne de la. <verse eid="PSA 119:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 119:42" />Yemɔ yɛɛ mebanyia mualɛ meamaa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛsi me amgbu la a; ɔluakɛ wɔ edwɛkɛ ne anu yɛɛ meva me rɛle mewula a.<verse eid="PSA 119:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 119:43" />Mmamaa me rɛle fi wɔ edwɛkɛ ne mɔ ɛlɛ, maa dahuu menga nɔhalɛ ne; ɔluakɛ me anyelazo kpokpoti wɔ wɔ mɛla ne mɔ anu. <verse eid="PSA 119:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 119:44" />Mebali wɔ mɛla ne azo dahuu, meahɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ la. <verse eid="PSA 119:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 119:45" />Mebadɛnla ngoane nu wɔ fanwodililɛ mɔɔ di munli la anu, ɔboalekɛ, mebɔ mɔdenle kɛ menwɔli wɔ ngilehile ne mɔ azo. <verse eid="PSA 119:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 119:46" />Mebabɔ wɔ daselɛlilɛ ne mɔ anwo nolo wɔ arelemgbunli nyunlu, na me nyunlu nyiane ɛnrɛgua aze.<verse eid="PSA 119:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 119:47" />Menyia anyeliele wɔ wɔ ngyehyɛlɛ ne mɔ azo ɛlilɛ nu, ɔboalekɛ, mekulo bɛ la ati. <verse eid="PSA 119:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 119:48" />Medi wɔ mɛla ne mɔ eni, na mekulo bɛ noko; mebazie me ti koonwu meadwenledwenle wɔ mɛla ne mɔ anwo.<verse eid="PSA 119:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 119:49" />Kakye wɔ ɛwɔkɛ ne mɔ mɔɔ ɛbɔle ɛmaanle mame, wɔ sonvolɛ ne la, ɔluakɛ bɛmɛ a bɛle me anyelazo mɔɔ ɛha la a. <verse eid="PSA 119:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 119:50" />Bɔbɔ, wɔ me anwubɛnyunlu nu, bɛmaanle me arɛlekyekyelɛ, ɔboalekɛ, wɔ ɛwɔkɛ ne maanle me ngoane. <verse eid="PSA 119:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 119:51" />Amemaabɛnwozovoma tietia me nwo zo dahuu, noko akee mengakyi me nzi menzi wɔ mɛla ne mɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 119:52" />Saa mekakye wɔ tete ndɛnebualɛ ne mɔ a, menyia arɛlekyekyelɛ, O Nana Nyamenle.<verse eid="PSA 119:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="PSA 119:53" />Saa menwu kɛ amumuyɛvoma ɛlɛbulu wɔ mɛla ne mɔ azo a, ɛya ku me totohyia. <verse eid="PSA 119:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="PSA 119:54" />Wɔ mɛla ne mɔ yɛɛ ale me edwɛne, wɔ me ɛbɛlabɔlɛ adendulɛ ne mɔ anu a. <verse eid="PSA 119:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="PSA 119:55" />Aledwolɛ nu mekakye wɔ duma, O Nana Nyamenle, na medwenledwenle wɔ mɛla ne mɔ anwo. <verse eid="PSA 119:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="PSA 119:56" />Nyilalɛ ba me nwo zo, ɔlua wɔ mɛla ne mɔ mɔɔ medi zo la ati.<verse eid="PSA 119:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="PSA 119:57" />Wɔmɔ a ɛle debie biala mɔɔ mekpondɛ la a, O Nana Nyamenle; mebɔ ɛwɔkɛ kɛ menwɔli wɔ mɛla ne mɔ azo. <verse eid="PSA 119:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="PSA 119:58" />Mefa me ahonle muala mesɛlɛ wɔ kɛ ɛnwu me anwunvɔne, kɛmɔ ɛdawɔ wɔbɔ me ɛwɔkɛ la. <verse eid="PSA 119:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="PSA 119:59" />Menleɛnlea me nyɛleɛ nu kpalɛ, na mebɔ ɛwɔkɛ kɛ menwɔva wɔ daselɛlilɛ ndenle ne mɔ azo. <verse eid="PSA 119:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="PSA 119:60" />Ndɛndɛ nu, menli nwolɛ nwɔhoa kɛ menwɔli wɔ mɛla ne mɔ azo. <verse eid="PSA 119:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="PSA 119:61" />Bɔbɔ saa kpɔvolɛma fa nyɛma sua me ɛhane a, me rɛle ɛnvi wɔ mɛla ne mɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="PSA 119:62" />Alevinli-mu-nwiɔ avinli medwazo meye wɔ ayɛlɛ, wɔ wɔ tenlene ndɛnebualɛ ne mɔ anwo. <verse eid="PSA 119:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="PSA 119:63" />Me gɔnwo mɔ a le bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛsonle wɔ, bɛmɛ mɔɔ bɛdi wɔ mɛla ne mɔ azo la. <verse eid="PSA 119:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="PSA 119:64" />O Nana Nyamenle, wɔ ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne ɛyi azɛlɛ ye azo tɛkɛɛ; kilehile me maa meni wɔ mɛla ne mɔ azo.<verse eid="PSA 119:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="PSA 119:65" />Wɔli wɔ ɛwɔkɛ ne azo, O Nana Nyamenle, wɔhile atiakunlukɛnlɛma wɔmaa mame, wɔ sonvolɛ. <verse eid="PSA 119:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="PSA 119:66" />Kilehile me ndɛnebualɛ kpalɛ, na maa me adwenle, ɔboalekɛ, medie wɔ mɛla ne mɔ medi. <verse eid="PSA 119:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="PSA 119:67" />Kolaa na wɔadea me la, menvile wɔ adenle ne azo, na emomu kɛkala ɛdeɛ, medi wɔ edwɛkɛ ne azo. <verse eid="PSA 119:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="PSA 119:68" />Nea kɛ ɛ ti akunlu le kpalɛ bie a, ɛle kpalɛ somaa! Kilehile me wɔ mɛla ne mɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:68" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="PSA 119:69" />Menli mɔɔ ɛnzonle Nyamenle la, ɛbɔ adalɛ ɛgua me nwo zo bie ala; noko akee mefa me ahonle muala medi wɔ mɛla ne mɔ amuala azo. <verse eid="PSA 119:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="PSA 119:70" />Menli ɛhye mɔ ɛnlɛ ndelebɛbo, noko akee mame me nye die wɔ wɔ mɛla ne mɔ anu.<verse eid="PSA 119:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="PSA 119:71" />Ɔle kpalɛ ɔmaa me kɛ menwunle amaneɛ a, ɔluakɛ ndeanlɛ ne mɔ maanle menzukoale wɔ mɛla ne mɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="PSA 119:72" />Mɛla ne mɔɔ ɛvale ɛmaanle me la, hyia me ɛsesebɛ ɛsesebɛ tɛla nvutuke nee dwɛtɛ fufule kpokpoti mɔɔ wɔ aleɛabo la. <verse eid="PSA 119:72" /><verse number="73" style="v" sid="PSA 119:73" />Wɔmɔ a ɛbɔle me, O Awulae, na ɛfa me ɛsie kpalɛ a; maa menyia ndelebɛbo amaa meazukoa wɔ mɛla ne mɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:73" /><verse number="74" style="v" sid="PSA 119:74" />Bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛsulo wɔ la banwu me na bɛ nye alie, ɔluakɛ wɔ edwɛkɛ ne azo yɛɛ melua menyianle anyelazo a.<verse eid="PSA 119:74" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="PSA 119:75" />O Nana Nyamenle, meze kɛ wɔ ndɛnebuale ne mɔ le fɔɔnwo, na ɔlua ɛhye ati noko a ɛdeanle me a; ɔluakɛ wɔmɔ ɛle tenlene. <verse eid="PSA 119:75" /><verse number="76" style="v" sid="PSA 119:76" />Maa wɔ ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne ɛyɛ anwomoalɛ kɛ ɔkɛkyekye me rɛle, kɛmɔ wɔ ɛwɔkɛ ne mɔɔ ɛvale ɛbɔle mame, wɔ sonvolɛ ne de la. <verse eid="PSA 119:76" /><verse number="77" style="v" sid="PSA 119:77" />Maa wɔ anwunvɔnezelɛ ne ɛrɛla me nwo zo, na meadɛnla ngoane nu; ɔluakɛ wɔ mɛla ne mɔ anu a me anyelielɛ wɔ a.<verse eid="PSA 119:77" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="PSA 119:78" />Maa mgbanyizonleyɛvoma anyunlu nyiane ɛgua aze, ɔluakɛ bɛlua ɛkpɔlɛ nu bɛpepɛ me gyakɛ anzi; na mame, mebadwenledwenle wɔ mɛla ne mɔ anwo wɔ me ahonle nu. <verse eid="PSA 119:78" /><verse number="79" style="v" sid="PSA 119:79" />Maa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛsulo wɔ la ɛhakyi ɛrɛla me ɛkɛ, amaa bɛanwu wɔ daselɛlilɛ ne mɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:79" /><verse number="80" style="v" sid="PSA 119:80" />Maa me ahonle ɛli munli wɔ wɔ mɛla ne mɔ anwo, ammaa me nyunlu nyiane angua aze.<verse eid="PSA 119:80" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="81" style="v" sid="PSA 119:81" />Me ɛkɛla ɛli nyane ɛvɛ, O Awulae, melɛkendɛ wɔ amaa wɔaralie me ngoane; mefa me rɛle mewula wɔ edwɛkɛ ne mɔ anu. <verse eid="PSA 119:81" /><verse number="82" style="v" sid="PSA 119:82" />Me nye ɛla ɛwɔkɛ ne mɔɔ ɛbɔle la ade dedee ɛvɛ; akee mebiza kɛ: “Kenle nzu yɛɛ ɛkɛva mɔ moalɛ ne ɛkɛrakyekye me rɛle a?” <verse eid="PSA 119:82" /><verse number="83" style="v" sid="PSA 119:83" />Meyɛ sonlamgbane kɛ nwanye kodoku mɔɔ henda senle nzi la; noko akee me rɛle ɛtɛfile wɔ mɛla ne mɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:83" /><verse number="84" style="v" sid="PSA 119:84" />Kɔkpula kenle nzu, yɛɛ ɔwɔ kɛ wɔ sonvolɛ di nyane a? Kenle nzu, yɛɛ ɛkɛbua bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛsisi me la ndɛne fɔle a? <verse eid="PSA 119:84" /><verse number="85" style="v" sid="PSA 119:85" />Menli mɔɔ bɛnzonle Nyamenle, na bɛnli wɔ mɛla ne mɔ azo la ɛpɛ kuma kɛ bɛfa bɛazua me ɛhane. <verse eid="PSA 119:85" /><verse number="86" style="v" sid="PSA 119:86" />Wɔ mɛla ne mɔ kpokpoti di munli; menli bɔ adalɛ tia me na bɛpepɛ me gyakɛ anzi. Boa me ɛ, O Awulae! <verse eid="PSA 119:86" /><verse number="87" style="v" sid="PSA 119:87" />Bɔbɔ asɛɛ bɛye me bɛvi azɛlɛ ye azo ɛdeɛ, noko akee metɛkpole wɔ mɛla ne mɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:87" /><verse number="88" style="v" sid="PSA 119:88" />Ɔlua wɔ ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne ati, fa me ngoane kyɛ me, amaa meali ɛ nloa anu daselɛ ne mɔ azo. <verse eid="PSA 119:88" /><verse number="89" style="v" sid="PSA 119:89" />O Nana Nyamenle, wɔ edwɛkɛ ne wɔ ɛkɛ dahuu; na ɔgyi ye kpundii wɔ anwuma maanle ne anu. <verse eid="PSA 119:89" /><verse number="90" style="v" sid="PSA 119:90" />Wɔ nɔhalɛlilɛ ne wɔ ɛkɛ dahuu maa ɛlɔnwɔne kpokpoti; wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛbɔle azɛlɛ ye a, na ɔgyi ɛkɛ kpundii. <verse eid="PSA 119:90" /><verse number="91" style="v" sid="PSA 119:91" />Ɔlua wɔ ngyehyɛlɛ ne ati, debie biala wɔ ɛkɛ ne bakpula ɛnɛ, ɔluakɛ bɛ muala bɛle wɔ sonvolɛ ne deɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:91" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="92" style="v" sid="PSA 119:92" />Saa wɔ mɛla ne anyɛ me anyelielɛ ne ye abobɔlɛ a, anrɛɛ me bo zo minlinle wɔ me nyanelilɛ nu. <verse eid="PSA 119:92" /><verse number="93" style="v" sid="PSA 119:93" />Me rɛle ɛnrɛvi wɔ mɛla ne mɔ ɛlɛ, ɔluakɛ ɔlua bɛmɛ ti a wɔmaa metɛte ngoane nu a. <verse eid="PSA 119:93" /><verse number="94" style="v" sid="PSA 119:94" />Mele wɔ deɛ, die me ngoane! Ɔluakɛ mekpondɛ mɔ mɛla ne mɔ abo zo. <verse eid="PSA 119:94" /><verse number="95" style="v" sid="PSA 119:95" />Kpɔvolɛma ɛlɛkendɛ kpondɛ kɛ bɛkɛzɛkye me; noko akee mebadwenledwenle wɔ daselɛlilɛ ne mɔ anwo wɔ me ahonle nu nzɛlɛlɛ nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:95" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="96" style="v" sid="PSA 119:96" />Menwu ye wienyi kɛ amuanrɛɛ debie biala lɛ ɔ ti nee ɔ bo; na wɔ mɛla ne mɔ ɛdeɛ, bɛdi munli bɔkɔɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:96" /><verse number="97" style="v" sid="PSA 119:97" />O, nea kɛ me nye ɛlie wɔ mɛla ne mɔ anwo bie a! Ɔle me adwenledwenle alehyenlɛ muala. <verse eid="PSA 119:97" /><verse number="98" style="v" sid="PSA 119:98" />Wɔ mɛla ne mɔ maa meyɛ nrɛlɛbɛvolɛ metɛla me kpɔvolɛma ne mɔ; ɔluakɛ dahuu bɛ nee me a de a. <verse eid="PSA 119:98" /><verse number="99" style="v" sid="PSA 119:99" />Melɛ ndelebɛbo dɔɔnwo metɛla me kilehilevolɛma, ɔluakɛ wɔ daselɛlilɛ ne mɔ yɛɛ medwenledwenle nwolɛ a. <verse eid="PSA 119:99" /><verse number="100" style="v" sid="PSA 119:100" />Melɛ ndelebɛbo nee nrɛlɛbɛ dɔɔnwo metɛla mgbanyinli, ɔluakɛ medi wɔ mɛla ne mɔ azo.<verse eid="PSA 119:100" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="101" style="v" sid="PSA 119:101" />Me gyakɛ sia fi ɛtane adenle biala azo, amaa meali wɔ edwɛkɛ ne azo. <verse eid="PSA 119:101" /><verse number="102" style="v" sid="PSA 119:102" />Memmakyi menvi wɔ mɛla adenle ne mɔ azo, ɔluakɛ ɛdawɔ mumua ne yɛɛ ɛle me kilehilevolɛ a. <verse eid="PSA 119:102" /><verse number="103" style="v" sid="PSA 119:103" />Nea kɛ wɔ edwɛkɛ ne mɔ yɛ me fɛ bie a! Ɔle menlemenle bɔbɔ ɔtɛla dɔdɔ! <verse eid="PSA 119:103" /><verse number="104" style="v" sid="PSA 119:104" />Ɔlua wɔ mɛla ne mɔ azo yɛɛ menyia ndelebɛbo a, zɔhane ati mekyi ngunzi nyɛleɛ biala.<verse eid="PSA 119:104" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="105" style="v" sid="PSA 119:105" />Wɔ edwɛkɛ ne le kɛnlaneɛ mɔɔ sinza me a; ɔta wienyi wɔ me adenle zo. <verse eid="PSA 119:105" /><verse number="106" style="v" sid="PSA 119:106" />Mebali me ɛwɔkɛ nwuanzanwuanza ne mɔɔ membɔle, kɛ mebali wɔ pɛlepɛle ngyehyɛlɛ ne mɔ azo la azo.<verse eid="PSA 119:106" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="107" style="v" sid="PSA 119:107" />Nɔhalɛ nu, me anwubɛnyunlu zonle somaa, O Nana Nyamenle; maa menyia ngoane, kɛmɔ ɛdawɔ wɔbɔ me ɛwɔkɛ la. <verse eid="PSA 119:107" /><verse number="108" style="v" sid="PSA 119:108" />O Nana Nyamenle, die me moyɛlɛ nzɛlɛlɛ ne, na kilehile me wɔ mɛla ne mɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:108" /><verse number="109" style="v" sid="PSA 119:109" />Meyɛ anwomoalɛ kɛ menwɔhwele me ngoane; noko akee me rɛle ɛtɛfile wɔ mɛla ne mɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:109" /><verse number="110" style="v" sid="PSA 119:110" />Kpɔvolɛma suozua me ngane, noko akee mengoati wɔ mɛla ne mɔ anu ko bɔbɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:110" /><verse number="111" style="v" sid="PSA 119:111" />Wɔ daselɛlilɛ ne mɔ le me damɛnlangoate agyapadeɛ; ɛhɛe, bɛle me ahonle ne ye anyelielɛde. <verse eid="PSA 119:111" /><verse number="112" style="v" sid="PSA 119:112" />Meyeye me ahonle nu kɛ menwɔyɛ wɔ ɛhulolɛdeɛ, kɔkpula kenle mɔɔ menwɔwu la.<verse eid="PSA 119:112" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="113" style="v" sid="PSA 119:113" />Mekyi menli mɔɔ bɛ adwenle le nwiɔ nwiɔ la, na mekulo wɔ mɛla ne mɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:113" /><verse number="114" style="v" sid="PSA 119:114" />Wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛle me feabelɛ ɔ nee me wowadeɛ a; me anyelazo muala wɔ wɔ ɛwɔkɛ ne anu. <verse eid="PSA 119:114" /><verse number="115" style="v" sid="PSA 119:115" />Bɛvi me nwo ɛke bɛhɔ, bɛmɛ ɛtanevolɛma! Mebali me Nyamenle ye ngyehyɛlɛ ne mɔ azo. <verse eid="PSA 119:115" /><verse number="116" style="v" sid="PSA 119:116" />Maa me anwosesebɛ kɛmɔ wɔ ɛwɔkɛ ne de la, amaa meanyia ngoane; meamaa me nyunlu nyiane gua aze wɔ me anyelazo nu. <verse eid="PSA 119:116" /><verse number="117" style="v" sid="PSA 119:117" />Sɔ me nu dwaa, amaa meanyia me ngoane, na dahuu mebayɛ ɛnzolɛ meamaa wɔ ngyehyɛlɛ ne mɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:117" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="118" style="v" sid="PSA 119:118" />Wɔmɔ ɛmbu menli mɔɔ koati fi wɔ mɛla ne anwo la. Ɛhɛe, bɛ mɛlɛbɛla ngyehyɛleɛ ne mɔ le gyɛne. <verse eid="PSA 119:118" /><verse number="119" style="v" sid="PSA 119:119" />Ɛtanevolɛma kpokpoti mɔɔ wɔ azɛlɛ ye azo la, wɔmɔ ɛbu bɛ kɛ bɛle ezukoa nye evinli la; zɔhane ati mekulo wɔ daselɛlilɛ ne mɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:119" /><verse number="120" style="v" sid="PSA 119:120" />Ɔlua wɔmɔ ti, me nwo wozo me zɛhae ala; ɛzulolɛ ngome ɛyi me tɛkɛɛ ɔlua wɔ ndɛnebualɛ ne mɔ ati.<verse eid="PSA 119:120" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="121" style="v" sid="PSA 119:121" />Meyɛ mɔɔ le tenlene ɔ nee mɔɔ le fɔɔnwo la; mmagyakyi me adevinli ɛmaa me kpɔvolɛma. <verse eid="PSA 119:121" /><verse number="122" style="v" sid="PSA 119:122" />Di wɔ sonvolɛ ne agyinlanu kɔ kpalɛ nu; mmamaa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛnzonle Nyamenle la komo me nwo zo! <verse eid="PSA 119:122" /><verse number="123" style="v" sid="PSA 119:123" />Me nye ɛla wɔ ngoanelielɛ moalɛ ne ade ɛhyɛ, ɔ nee wɔ ɛkpɔnenlɛ ɛwɔkɛ ne mɔɔ ɛbɔle la. <verse eid="PSA 119:123" /><verse number="124" style="v" sid="PSA 119:124" />Ɛ nee wɔ sonvolɛ ne ɛli ye kɛmɔ wɔ ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne de la, na kilehile me wɔ mɛl ne mɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:124" /><verse number="125" style="v" sid="PSA 119:125" />Mele wɔ sonvolɛ; maa me ndelebɛbo, amaa meanwu wɔ daselɛlilɛ ne mɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:125" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="126" style="v" sid="PSA 119:126" />O Nana Nyamenle, mekɛ ɛdwu mɔɔ ɔwɔ kɛ ɛdi wɔ gyima a, ɔluakɛ menli gua zo ɛlɛbu wɔ mɛla ne mɔ azo. <verse eid="PSA 119:126" /><verse number="127" style="v" sid="PSA 119:127" />Mekulo wɔ mɛla ne mɔ metɛla ezukoa nvutuke, bɔbɔ nvutuke kɛnlɛma mɔɔ sonle bolɛ la. <verse eid="PSA 119:127" /><verse number="128" style="v" sid="PSA 119:128" />Zɔhane ati metudu agyakɛ mefa wɔ mɛla ndenle ne mɔ azo; mekyi adalɛ ndenle biala.<verse eid="PSA 119:128" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="129" style="v" sid="PSA 119:129" />Wɔ ngilehile ne mɔ le nwanwane; zɔhane ati mefa me ahonle kpokpoti medi zolɛ. <verse eid="PSA 119:129" /><verse number="130" style="v" sid="PSA 119:130" />Wɔ ngilehile ne mɔ abo ɛhilelɛ maa wienyi, na ɔmaa koasea nyia ndelebɛbo. <verse eid="PSA 119:130" /><verse number="131" style="v" sid="PSA 119:131" />Me ahonle si pi, na me nloa ka ɛkɛ, ɔluakɛ me nye la wɔ mɛla ne mɔ adenle.<verse eid="PSA 119:131" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="132" style="v" sid="PSA 119:132" />Kakyi ɛ nye bɛla me nwo zo, na nwu me anwunvɔne, kɛmɔ ɛyɛ ɛmaa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkulo wɔ duma ne la. <verse eid="PSA 119:132" /><verse number="133" style="v" sid="PSA 119:133" />Maa menziezie me gyakɛ boɛ wɔ wɔ ɛwɔkɛbɔlɛ ne ati; mmamaa ɛtane di me nwo zo konim. <verse eid="PSA 119:133" /><verse number="134" style="v" sid="PSA 119:134" />Die me fi sonla dasanli ye nzisi bo, amaa meali wɔ mɛla ne mɔ azo. <verse eid="PSA 119:134" /><verse number="135" style="v" sid="PSA 119:135" />Maa ɛ nyunlu ɛda wɔ wɔ sonvolɛ ne anwo zo, na kilehile me wɔ mɛla ne mɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:135" /><verse number="136" style="v" sid="PSA 119:136" />Me nye kpolo monle kɛ azule mɔɔ se la, ɔluakɛ menli ɛnli wɔ mɛla ne mɔ azo.<verse eid="PSA 119:136" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="137" style="v" sid="PSA 119:137" />O Nana Nyamenle, wɔmɔ ɛle tenlene, na wɔ ndɛnebualɛ ne mɔ le fɔɔnwo. <verse eid="PSA 119:137" /><verse number="138" style="v" sid="PSA 119:138" />Daselɛlilɛ ne mɔ mɔɔ wɔzie wɔmaa dasanli la, le fɔɔnwo nee tenlene bɔkɔɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:138" /><verse number="139" style="v" sid="PSA 119:139" />Me ɛhulolɛ wɔ wɔ gyima ne anwo ɛlɛku me, ɔluakɛ me kpɔvolɛma ɛmbu wɔ edwɛkɛ ne mɔ bie hweledede. <verse eid="PSA 119:139" /><verse number="140" style="v" sid="PSA 119:140" />Yɛzɔ wɔ ɛwɔkɛ ne mɔ yɛnlea, na yenwu kɛ bɛdi munli bɔkɔɔ! Nea kɛ wɔ sonvolɛ ne kulo ye bie a! <verse eid="PSA 119:140" /><verse number="141" style="v" sid="PSA 119:141" />Mele ekyi, yɛɛ bɛmbu me bie, noko akee me rɛle ɛnvi wɔ ngilehile ne mɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:141" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="142" style="v" sid="PSA 119:142" />Wɔ tenleneyɛlɛ ne baboa ɛkɛ ne dahuu; na wɔ mɛla ne mɔ noko le nɔhalɛ. <verse eid="PSA 119:142" /><verse number="143" style="v" sid="PSA 119:143" />Ɛvɛlɛ ɔ nee nyane ɛbu me nwo zo, noko akee wɔ mɛla ne mɔ fa anyelielɛ bɛlɛ me. <verse eid="PSA 119:143" /><verse number="144" style="v" sid="PSA 119:144" />Wɔ daselɛlilɛ ne mɔ le fɔɔnwo dahuu; maa me ndelebɛbo amaa meadɛnla ngoane nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:144" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="145" style="v" sid="PSA 119:145" />Mefa me ahonle muala yɛɛ mesu mefɛlɛ wɔ a; O Nana Nyamenle, tie me, na mebali wɔ mɛla ne mɔ azo! <verse eid="PSA 119:145" /><verse number="146" style="v" sid="PSA 119:146" />Mesu mefɛlɛ wɔ; die me ngoane, na mebali wɔ daselɛlilɛ ne mɔ azo! <verse eid="PSA 119:146" /><verse number="147" style="v" sid="PSA 119:147" />Medwazo aleɛbahye, yɛɛ mesu mefɛlɛ moalɛ a, mefa me anyelazo mewula wɔ edwɛkɛ ne mɔ anu. <verse eid="PSA 119:147" /><verse number="148" style="v" sid="PSA 119:148" />Aledwolɛ muala, kɛ me nye gyi zo wɔ me nla nu ala la ɛne, amaa meahola meadwenledwenle wɔ mɛla ne mɔ anwo wɔ me ahonle nu koonwu. <verse eid="PSA 119:148" /><verse number="149" style="v" sid="PSA 119:149" />Tie me ne, wɔ wɔ ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne ati, O Nana Nyamenle; kile wɔ anwunvɔnezelɛ ne, na fa me ngoane sie kpalɛ!<verse eid="PSA 119:149" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="150" style="v" sid="PSA 119:150" />Bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkyi me, na bɛpepɛ me gyakɛ anzi la ɛlɛtwe abikye me, bɛ nee wɔ mɛla ne mɔ avinli wale kɛ. <verse eid="PSA 119:150" /><verse number="151" style="v" sid="PSA 119:151" />Noko akee, O Nana Nyamenle, wɔmɔ ɛbikye me, na wɔ mɛla ne mɔ amuala gyi kpundii. <verse eid="PSA 119:151" /><verse number="152" style="v" sid="PSA 119:152" />Mekɛ tendendenlenle yɛɛ meva menwu wɔ daselɛlilɛ ne mɔ kɛ, wɔmɔ ɛyɛle bɛ ɛmaanle mekɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ la a.<verse eid="PSA 119:152" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="153" style="v" sid="PSA 119:153" />Nea me nyanenwunlɛ, na die me ngoane, ɔluakɛ me nye ɛtɛfonle wɔ mɛla ne mɔ anu biala. <verse eid="PSA 119:153" /><verse number="154" style="v" sid="PSA 119:154" />Di me ti edwɛkɛ maa me, na pepɛ die me; die me ngoane kɛmɔ ɛdawɔ ɛbɔle me ɛwɔkɛ la. <verse eid="PSA 119:154" /><verse number="155" style="v" sid="PSA 119:155" />Ngoanelielɛ wɔ moamoa maa amumuyɛvoma; ɔluakɛ bɛmkpo wɔ mɛla ne mɔ abo zo. <verse eid="PSA 119:155" /><verse number="156" style="v" sid="PSA 119:156" />Noko akee, O Nana Nyamenle, wɔ anwunvɔnezelɛ ne le totohyia; maa me ngoane bieko, kɛmɔ wɔ pɛpɛlilɛ ne de la.<verse eid="PSA 119:156" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="157" style="v" sid="PSA 119:157" />Menli mɔɔ pepɛ me gyakɛ anzi, ɔ nee me kpɔvolɛma ne mɔ ɛzo somaa; noko akee mengyakyi kɛ menwɔli wɔ daselɛlilɛ ne mɔ azo. <verse eid="PSA 119:157" /><verse number="158" style="v" sid="PSA 119:158" />Saa menea menli mɔɔ ɛnlɛ diedi la a, ɛnee bɛ nwo bɔbɔ yɛ me alɔbɔlɛ, ɔluakɛ bɛnli wɔ mɛla ne mɔ azo. <verse eid="PSA 119:158" /><verse number="159" style="v" sid="PSA 119:159" />Nea kɛ mesi mekulo wɔ mɛla ne mɔ bie a, O Nana Nyamenle! Wɔ ɛhulolɛ nwanwane ne ɛngakyi ɛlɛ, ɔti die me ngoane! <verse eid="PSA 119:159" /><verse number="160" style="v" sid="PSA 119:160" />Wɔ edwɛkɛ ne amuala ye ayiazo, yemɔ a le nɔhalɛ ne; yɛɛ wɔ tenlene ndɛnebualɛ ne mɔ amuala le damɛnlangoate.<verse eid="PSA 119:160" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="161" style="v" sid="PSA 119:161" />Arelemgbunli pepɛ me gyakɛ anzi gyɛne, wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ metɛsele bɛ bu, metɛsele bɛ bɛ la; noko akee mefa ɛbulɛ memaa wɔ mɛla ne mɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:161" /><verse number="162" style="v" sid="PSA 119:162" />Nea kɛ medi fɛlɛko wɔ wɔ ɛwɔkɛ ne mɔ anwo bie a! Me nye die kɛ sonla mɔɔ yedu ahu totohyia bie la. <verse eid="PSA 119:162" /><verse number="163" style="v" sid="PSA 119:163" />Mekyi, na mekpo adalɛbɔlɛ kɔkɔkɔkɔ, na emomu mekulo wɔ mɛla ne mɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:163" /><verse number="164" style="v" sid="PSA 119:164" />Meyɛ wɔ mo fane nsuu alehyenlɛ biala wɔ wɔ tenlene ndɛnebualɛ ne mɔ ati.<verse eid="PSA 119:164" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="165" style="v" sid="PSA 119:165" />Anzondwolɛ totohyia wɔ ɛkɛ maa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkulo wɔ mɛla ne mɔ la; na debie biala ɛnle ɛkɛ mɔɔ kɛmaa bɛ gyakɛ kɛkpula a. <verse eid="PSA 119:165" /><verse number="166" style="v" sid="PSA 119:166" />O Nana Nyamenle, me nye la wɔ ngoanelielɛ ne adenle, na medi wɔ mɛla ne mɔ azo. <verse eid="PSA 119:166" /><verse number="167" style="v" sid="PSA 119:167" />Me ɛkɛla di wɔ daselɛlilɛ ne mɔ azo; mefa me ahonle kpokpoti mekulo bɛ totohyia. <verse eid="PSA 119:167" /><verse number="168" style="v" sid="PSA 119:168" />Medi wɔ mɛla ne mɔ ɔ nee wɔ daselɛlilɛ ne mɔ azo; ɔluakɛ ɛnwu debie biala mɔɔ meyɛ la.<verse eid="PSA 119:168" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="169" style="v" sid="PSA 119:169" />O Nana Nyamenle, maa me moalɛ ɛzunlɛ ɛdwu ɛ nyunlu! Maa me ndelebɛbo, kɛmɔ wɔ edwɛkɛ ne de la. <verse eid="PSA 119:169" /><verse number="170" style="v" sid="PSA 119:170" />Maa me nzɛlɛlɛ ɛdwu ɛ nyunlu, na die me ngoane kɛmɔ wɔ ɛwɔkɛ ne de la. <verse eid="PSA 119:170" /><verse number="171" style="v" sid="PSA 119:171" />Me nloa babonle ne baye wɔ ayɛlɛ dahuu, ɔboalekɛ, ɛkilehile me wɔ mɛla ne mɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:171" /><verse number="172" style="v" sid="PSA 119:172" />Me tafinlima bado wɔ edwɛkɛ ne anwo edwɛne, ɔluakɛ wɔ mɛla ne mɔ le fɔɔnwo. <verse eid="PSA 119:172" /><verse number="173" style="v" sid="PSA 119:173" />Yɛ anwomoalɛ kɛ ɛkɛboa me dahuu, ɔluakɛ metoa wɔ mɛla ne mɔ abo zo. <verse eid="PSA 119:173" /><verse number="174" style="v" sid="PSA 119:174" />O Nana Nyamenle, nea kɛ me nye la wɔ ngoanelielɛ ne ade bie a! Menyia anyelielɛ wɔ wɔ mɛla ne mɔ anu. <verse eid="PSA 119:174" /><verse number="175" style="v" sid="PSA 119:175" />Maa mendɛnla ngoane nu, amaa meaye wɔ ayɛlɛ; na maa wɔ ngyehyɛlɛ ne mɔ ɛboa me.<verse eid="PSA 119:175" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="176" style="v" sid="PSA 119:176" />Mevo mevi wɔ adenle ne azo kɛ boane mɔɔ ɛminli la; ɛhye ati bɛla na bakpondɛ me, wɔ sonvolɛ, ɔluakɛ metɛgyakyile wɔ mɛla ne mɔ azo ɛlilɛ metɛsiele ahanle.<verse eid="PSA 119:176" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 119" />
  <chapter number="120" style="c" sid="PSA 120" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 120</para>
  <para style="s1">Nzɛlɛlɛ mɔɔ bɛfa bɛsɛlɛ Moalɛ la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 120:1" />Menvɛlɛle Nana Nyamenle wɔ me nyanelilɛ nu, na ɔdiele me ne.<verse eid="PSA 120:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 120:2" />O Nana Nyamenle, die me ngoane fi adalɛma ɔ nee mɛlɛbɛlavoma asa anu. <verse eid="PSA 120:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 120:3" />Bɛmɛ adalɛ nabalabama, duzu a Nana Nyamenle bava ayɛ bɛ a? Duzu adenle a ɔbava zo yeadea bɛ a? <verse eid="PSA 120:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 120:4" />Ɔbava katakyie ye ɛda mbaka, mɔɔ bɛ nloa ɛzɔ woonwu la yeatoto yeabɔ bɛ; na yeava samɛnlakɛ yeayela bɛ dwɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 120:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 120:5" />Ɛdelɛ mɔɔ me nee bɛ de la le munzule, kɛmɔ Mihyɛke ɛdɛnlanlɛ de, anzɛɛ kɛmɔ mede hawutu bo wɔ Kidaa azɛlɛ zo la. <verse eid="PSA 120:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 120:6" />Mekɛ tendenle yɛɛ me nee menli mɔɔ kyi anzondwolɛ la ɛdɛnla a! <verse eid="PSA 120:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 120:7" />Mekulo anzondwolɛ, noko akee me nloa ne mɔɔ mebuke ala la, ɛnee konle ɛde.<verse eid="PSA 120:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 120" />
  <chapter number="121" style="c" sid="PSA 121" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 121</para>
  <para style="s1">Adenduvolɛ ye Edwɛndolɛ: Awulae le me Neazovolɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 121:1" />Mebamaa me nye zo anwuma meanlea awoka ne mɔ azo; na nienwu a me moalɛ vi bara a? <verse eid="PSA 121:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 121:2" />Nana Nyamenle ɛkɛ ne yɛɛ me moalɛ vi bara a, yemɔ mɔɔ ɔbɔle anwuma nee aze la. <verse eid="PSA 121:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 121:3" />Ɔnrɛmaa bɛnrɛye ɛ gyakɛ bɛnrɛvi ɔ bo zo ne; ɔnrɛmaa ɛnrɛdɔ aze; ɔluakɛ wɔ sinzavolɛ ne anye gyi zo dahuu; ɔnla ɛlɛ. <verse eid="PSA 121:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 121:4" />Nea! Ahenle mɔɔ nea Yizilayɛ anwo zo la ɛmbɔ ngɔsɔkɛ anzɛɛ ɛnla ɛlɛ.<verse eid="PSA 121:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 121:5" />Nana Nyamenle a le wɔ neazovolɛ a; ɔwɔ wɔ foa nee foa kɛ ɔsinza wɔ. <verse eid="PSA 121:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 121:6" />Ewia ne ɛnrɛyela wɔ wɔ alehyenlɛ ne anu, yɛɛ siane noko ɛnrɛgyinla ɛ nwo zo aledwolɛ ne amuala. <verse eid="PSA 121:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 121:7" />Nana Nyamenle bazinza wɔ avi munzule biala anu; ɔbava wɔ ngoane yeazie kpalɛ. <verse eid="PSA 121:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 121:8" />Nana Nyamenle bazinza wɔ, wɔ wɔ alie nwo ɛhɔlɛ ɔ nee wɔ sua nu ɛralɛ nu, ɔvi mekɛ ɛhye anu kɔdwu mekɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ.<verse eid="PSA 121:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 121" />
  <chapter number="122" style="c" sid="PSA 122" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 122</para>
  <para style="s1">Gyɛlusalɛmma bɛ Abotane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 122:1" />Me nye liele wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ bɛhanle bɛhilele me kɛ, “Maa yɛhɔ Nana Nyamenle sua nu” la. <verse eid="PSA 122:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 122:2" />Na kɛkala noko mɔɔ yɛwɔ ɛke la, yɛ gyakɛ ɛlɛdi akɔneaba wɔ Gyɛlusalɛm nlenkɛ mgbole ne mɔ anu! <verse eid="PSA 122:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 122:3" />Gyɛlusalɛm le suakpole, mɔɔ bɛnyia alagye bɛkyekye, na bɛhye bane bɛlie nwo kɛnlɛma bie a. <verse eid="PSA 122:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 122:4" />Ɛkɛ yɛɛ aneɛ eku eku kpokpoti vi ba a, aneɛ mɔɔ le Nana Nyamenle deɛ, mɔɔ bɛhyehyɛle bɛmaanle Yizilayɛ, kɛ bɛva moyɛlɛ bɛmaa Awulae duma la. <verse eid="PSA 122:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 122:5" />Ɛkɛ ne yɛɛ Yizilayɛ arelemgbunli liele bɛ mbia, na bɛbuale bɛ menli ne mɔ ndɛne a.<verse eid="PSA 122:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 122:6" />“Bɛzɛlɛ anzondwolɛ bɛmaa Gyɛlusalɛm. Bɛmaa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛlɛ Gyɛlusalɛm anwo ɛhulolɛ la ɛhɔ ye boɛ dahuu. <verse eid="PSA 122:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 122:7" />Wɔ mbane ne mɔ mɔɔ bɛlie la anu, yɛɛ anzondwolɛ ɛdɛnla a, na boɛyɛlɛ ɛdɛnla wɔ Arane ne mɔ anu.” <verse eid="PSA 122:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 122:8" />Ɔlua me mediema nee me gɔnwo mɔ ati, mese Gyɛlusalɛm kɛ, “Anzondwolɛ ɛdɛnla wɔ nu!” <verse eid="PSA 122:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 122:9" />Ɔlua Awulae yɛ Nyamenle ye Aako ne ati, mebakpondɛ wɔ boɛyɛlɛ nee ngɔzo.<verse eid="PSA 122:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 122" />
  <chapter number="123" style="c" sid="PSA 123" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 123</para>
  <para style="s1">Anwodelɛma ne mɔ bɛ Abotane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 123:1" />O Awulae, wɔmɔ yɛɛ mekpogya me nye zo anwuma menea wɔ a, wɔmɔ mɔɔ ɛde wɔ belemgbunli ebia ne azo wɔ anwuma maanle ne anu la. <verse eid="PSA 123:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 123:2" />Kɛmɔ sonvolɛ nrenyia anye gyi ɔ menle asa anu, kɛmɔ sonvolɛ raalɛ anye gyi ɔ menle raalɛ asa anu la, zɔhane ala yɛɛ yɛ nye gyi wɔmɔ Nana Nyamenle, yɛ Nyamenle ɛ nyunlu, kɔdwu kɛ ɛkɛze yɛ anwunvɔne a.<verse eid="PSA 123:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 123:3" />Nwu yɛ anwunvɔne, O Nana Nyamenle, nwu yɛ anwunvɔne; ɔluakɛ bɛva yɛ nyunlu bɛtwitwi aze bie ala. <verse eid="PSA 123:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 123:4" />Mekɛ tendendenlenle ne ala, yɛɛ azukoavolɛ ɛzi yɛ amgbu, na menli mɔɔ de boɛ la ɛva yɛ nyunlu ɛtwitwi azeva nu a.<verse eid="PSA 123:4" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 123" />
  <chapter number="124" style="c" sid="PSA 124" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 124</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛpepɛlielɛ wɔ Munzule mɔɔ bɛ nye ɛnla la anu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 124:1" />Saa tɛ Nana Nyamenle mɔɔ ɛnee ɔwɔ yɛ afoa la a, bɛmaa Yizilayɛ akee ɛha ye kɛ, <verse eid="PSA 124:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 124:2" />saa tɛ Nana Nyamenle mɔɔ ɛnee ɔwɔ yɛ afoa, wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ yɛ kpɔvolɛma dwazole tiale yɛ la a, <verse eid="PSA 124:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 124:3" />anrɛɛ bɛmemenle yɛ anyewɔzo nu ala, wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ bɛvale yɛ nwo ɛya la; <verse eid="PSA 124:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 124:4" />anrɛɛ azuyilɛ ne ravale yɛ muala hɔle maanle nzule vole yɛ nwo zo; <verse eid="PSA 124:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 124:5" />anrɛɛ azɛlɛkye mgbole ne mɔ noko nlomanle yɛ bɔkɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 124:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 124:6" />Nyilalɛ ɛha Nana Nyamenle, mɔɔ yeanva yɛ yeanyɛ menli gye ati aleɛ yeammaa bɛanli la. <verse eid="PSA 124:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 124:7" />Yɛnriandi yɛvi menli ne mɔ ngane ne mɔ mɔɔ bɛzuozuale yɛ la anu; ɛhane ne ɛvuandi na yɛnriandi yɛvi nu!<verse eid="PSA 124:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 124:8" />Yɛ moalɛ vi Nana Nyamenle duma ne anu, yemɔ mɔɔ ɔbɔle anwuma nee aze la.<verse eid="PSA 124:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 124" />
  <chapter number="125" style="c" sid="PSA 125" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 125</para>
  <para style="s1">Awulae bɔ ye menli nwo bane na ɔsinza bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 125:1" />Bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛfa bɛ rɛle bɛwula Nana Nyamenle anu la, le kɛ Boka Zayɔn, mɔɔ ɛkpusu ye a ɔmkpusu, ɛtu ɔ bo a ɔndu, na ɔwɔ ɛkɛ ne dahuu la.<verse eid="PSA 125:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 125:2" />Kɛmɔ awoka ne mɔ ɛbɔ Gyɛlusalɛm anwo ɛyia la, zɔhane ala noko yɛɛ Nana Nyamenle ɛbɔ ye menli ne mɔ anwo bane ɛyia a, ɔvi ɛnɛ kɔkpula mekɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ. <verse eid="PSA 125:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 125:3" />Ɔluakɛ amumuyɛ kpɔma biala ɛnrɛgyinla wɔ azɛlɛ ne mɔɔ bɛpɛ bɛmaa tenlenema la azo ɛlɛ; ammaa tenlenema anva bɛ sa anga ɛtane. <verse eid="PSA 125:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 125:4" />O Nana Nyamenle, yɛ kpalɛ maa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛyɛ kpalɛ la; fa pɛpɛlilɛ maa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛdi nɔhalɛ wɔ bɛ ahonle nu la. <verse eid="PSA 125:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 125:5" />Na emomu, bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkakyi bɛ nwo bɛkɔ ɛtane adenle zo la ɛdeɛ, Nana Nyamenle bava bɛ aboka ɛtanevolɛma anwo ahɔ. Anzondwolɛ ɛha Yizilayɛ!<verse eid="PSA 125:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 125" />
  <chapter number="126" style="c" sid="PSA 126" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 126</para>
  <para style="s1">Nana Nyamenle ye ɛpepɛlielɛ wɔ Akɛlɛyɛlɛ bo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 126:1" />Mekɛ mɔɔ Nana Nyamenle vale yɛ ziale rale Gyɛlusalɛm la, ɔyɛle yɛ kɛ ɛlalɛ mɔɔ yɛka la! <verse eid="PSA 126:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 126:2" />Ɛzelekɛ yile yɛ nloa tɛkɛɛ, na yɛ tafinlima dole fɛlɛko edwɛne! Akee maanle maanle mɔɔ ɛha la hanle kɛ, “Bɛnlea nwanwane ninyɛne mgbole mgbole mɔɔ Nana Nyamenle ɛyɛ ɛmaa bɛ a!”<verse eid="PSA 126:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 126:3" />Nɔhalɛ nu, Nyamenle ɛyɛ nyɛleɛ mgbole ɛmaa yɛ. Nea kɛ yɛ nye die bie a! <verse eid="PSA 126:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 126:4" />O Nana Nyamenle, fa yɛ sia kɔ yɛ azɛlɛ ne azo, kɛmɔ ezule ne fa nzule sia ba fiemgbole reserese ne mɔ azo la.<verse eid="PSA 126:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 126:5" />Bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛdua monle nu bɛdua ma la balua anyelielɛ nu abu aleɛ ne! <verse eid="PSA 126:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 126:6" />Bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛfa ɛzunlɛ bɛkɔ, wɔ melɛ mɔɔ bɛzo ma ne mɔ mɔɔ bɛkalua la, bazia ara wɔ fɛlɛkolilɛ nu, wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ bɛzozo bɛ aleɛ ne mɔ bɛlɛba sua nu la.<verse eid="PSA 126:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 126" />
  <chapter number="127" style="c" sid="PSA 127" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 127</para>
  <para style="s1">Edwɛndolɛ mɔɔ Abusua fa sɛlɛ ɔ nwo Banebɔlɛ la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 127:1" />Kyesɛ Nana Nyamenle si sua ne, yemɔ gyimayɛvoma ne mɔ mɔɔ ɛlɛsi sua ne la fɛ gyɛne; kyesɛ Awulae sinza suakpole ne, yemɔ bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛsinza la, wɔ ɛkɛ ne gyɛne. <verse eid="PSA 127:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 127:2" />Nvasoɛ biala ɛnle zo, kɛ ɛkɛdwazo aleɛbahye ɛkɛyɛ gyima ɛsesebɛ ɔlua aleɛlilɛ ko ye ala ati, na ɛkɛhɔ nla nu aledwolɛ nu. Ɔluakɛ Awulae maa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkulo ye la aleɛ, bɔbɔ wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ bɛwɔ nla nu la.<verse eid="PSA 127:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 127:3" />Nea, mralɛ le agyapandeɛ mɔɔ vi Nyamenle ɛkɛ a; ma mɔɔ vi ɛkolɛ nu la le nyilalɛ bɔkɔɔ. <verse eid="PSA 127:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 127:4" />Mralɛ mrenyia mɔɔ sonla nrenyia nyia bɛ wɔ ye mgbavolɛ nu la le kɛ ɛda mbaka mɔɔ wɔ sogyanli asa anu la. <verse eid="PSA 127:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 127:5" />Ahomeka sonla a le ahenle ne mɔɔ ɛda mbaka ɛyi ye boa ne tɛkɛɛ la. Saa ɔ nee ye kpɔvolɛma yia nu wɔ ndɛnebualɛ ɛleka ne a, ɔ nyunlu nyiane ɛnrɛgua aze ɛlɛ.<verse eid="PSA 127:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 127" />
  <chapter number="128" style="c" sid="PSA 128" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 128</para>
  <para style="s1">Abusua nu Nyilalɛnyianlɛ Edwɛndolɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 128:1" />Nyilalɛ sonla a le ahenle ne mɔɔ sulo Nana Nyamenle, na ɔfa ye mɛla ne mɔ ɔbɔ ye ɛbɛla la.<verse eid="PSA 128:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 128:2" />Bɛbali ɛ sa anloa gyima ne abo ma ne bie; ɛbanyia ahomeka, na wɔahɔ ye boɛ. <verse eid="PSA 128:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 128:3" />Ɛ ye bayɛ kɛ nwanye baka mɔɔ so ma la wɔ wɔ aako nu; yɛɛ ɛ mra bayɛ kɛ ɔlivi ndinli la, abɔ wɔ ɛkponle ne anwo ayia. <verse eid="PSA 128:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 128:4" />Nɔhalɛ nu, sonla ne mɔɔ tie Nana Nyamenle ane la, yɛɛ nyilalɛ mɔɔ le kɛ ɛhye la bara ɔ nwo zo a.<verse eid="PSA 128:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 128:5" />Nana Nyamenle ɛyila wɔ ɛvi Zayɔn! Ɔmaa ɛnwu Gyɛlusalɛm ye ngɔzo, wɔ wɔ ngoane mekɛ ne amuala anu! <verse eid="PSA 128:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 128:6" />Ɔmaa ɛdɛnla ngoane nu na ɛnwu ɛ ra akunlu ralɛ! Anzondwolɛ ɛha Yizilayɛ!<verse eid="PSA 128:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 128" />
  <chapter number="129" style="c" sid="PSA 129" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 129</para>
  <para style="s1">Nzɛlɛlɛ mɔɔ bɛyɛ bɛfa bɛkomo bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛteetee Yizilayɛ la anwo zo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 129:1" />O Yizilayɛ, ka anwubɛnyunlu, ɔ nee ateetee mɔɔ wɔ kpɔvolɛma vale hilele wɔ sumunli wɔ mgbavolɛ nu la kile ye. <verse eid="PSA 129:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 129:2" />“Nɔhalɛ nu, sumunli me mgbavolɛ nu, me kpɔvolɛma ɛmaa menwu me nyunlu, na bɛteetee me atisesebɛ nu ala, noko akee bɛtɛkolale bɛtɛdile me nwo zo konim.<verse eid="PSA 129:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 129:3" />“Bɛ empele ne mɔ ɛpepɛ me nzi kuma nu relerele, kɛ ɛya mɔɔ bɛzo bɛgua ye aze la. <verse eid="PSA 129:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 129:4" />Noko akee Nana Nyamenle mɔɔ le tenlenenli la, ɛpepɛ ɛlie me ɛvi akɛlɛyɛlɛ bo.”<verse eid="PSA 129:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 129:5" />Bɛmaa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkyi Zayɔn la, anyunlu nyiane ɛgua aze, na bɛhakyi bɛ nzi bɛhɔ. <verse eid="PSA 129:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 129:6" />Maa bɛ muala bɛyɛ kɛ ndile mɔɔ fifi sua ti zo, mɔɔ ɔnnyi bɔbɔ na yeanwoso; <verse eid="PSA 129:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 129:7" />na buvolɛ ne ɛnzɛkye ɔ sa wɔ nwolɛ la, anzɛɛ mɔɔ kuohua ɔ nloa kyekye la ɛnnyia bie ɛngɔ la. <verse eid="PSA 129:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 129:8" />Mmamaa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛpɛ nu wɔ ɛkɛ ne la bɛ nuhua biala se kɛ, “Awulae Nyilalɛ ne ɛha wɔ!” Yɛyila wɔ wɔ Awulae duma ne anu!<verse eid="PSA 129:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 129" />
  <chapter number="130" style="c" sid="PSA 130" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 130</para>
  <para style="s1">Anyelazo wɔ Awulae ye Ɛhendɛlɛ nu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 130:1" />Mevi me anwubɛnyunlu kuma ne anu yɛɛ mesu mefɛlɛ wɔ a, O Nana Nyamenle. <verse eid="PSA 130:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 130:2" />Tie me ɛzunlɛ, O Awulae; yɛ ɛnzolɛ maa me ɛvɛlɛlɛ, na baboa me!<verse eid="PSA 130:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 130:3" />Saa wɔmɔ Awulae, ɛse ɛkɛbu yɛ ɛtane nwo mgbonda a, anrɛɛ nwane a kɛhola kɛgyinla wɔ ndɛnebualɛ ne anyunlu a? <verse eid="PSA 130:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 130:4" />Noko akee wɔmɔ ɛfa yɛ ɛtane ɛkyɛ yɛ, amaa yɛahola yɛagyinla wɔ ɛyavalɛ ne anloa. <verse eid="PSA 130:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 130:5" />Mekendɛ Nana Nyamenle, me ɛkɛla kendɛ Awulae; na wɔ ye edwɛkɛ ne anu, yɛɛ me anyelazo wɔ a. <verse eid="PSA 130:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 130:6" />Me ɛkɛla kendɛ Awulae anyebololɛ nu ala, tɛla sinzavolɛma mɔɔ anye la alehyenlɛ zo tɛla sinzavolɛma mɔɔ kendɛ alehyenlɛ la.<verse eid="PSA 130:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 130:7" />O Yizilayɛ, nyia anyelazo wɔ Nana Nyamenle anu, ɔluakɛ ye ɛhulolɛ ne le kpundii, na yemɔ ɔ sa nu yɛɛ ngoanelielɛ wɔ a. <verse eid="PSA 130:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 130:8" />Ɔbaye ye menli Yizilayɛ yeavi bɛ ɛtane muala anu.<verse eid="PSA 130:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 130" />
  <chapter number="131" style="c" sid="PSA 131" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 131</para>
  <para style="s1">Anwoazehanlɛma bɛ Edwɛndolɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 131:1" />O Nana Nyamenle, megyakyi me mgbanyizonle ne kpokpoti aze, na mehwe me nwo mevi me amemaabɛnwozo nyɛleɛ ne mɔ anu. Metɛfale me nwo metɛdieliele ninyɛne mgbole mgbole anzɛɛ nwanwane nyɛleɛ mɔɔ bo me nwo zo la anu. <verse eid="PSA 131:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 131:2" />Emomu, me nye sɔ ekyi ne mɔɔ melɛ ye la, na eza noko mewɔ anzondwolɛ nu. Kɛmɔ kakula yɛ koonwu da ɔ nli asa zo la, zɔhane ala noko yɛɛ me ahonle ɛyɛ koonwu wɔ me nu a.<verse eid="PSA 131:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 131:3" />O Yizilayɛ, nyia anyelazo wɔ Nana Nyamenle anu, ɔvi ɛnɛ kɔdwu mekɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ la!<verse eid="PSA 131:3" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 131" />
  <chapter number="132" style="c" sid="PSA 132" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 132</para>
  <para style="s1">Devidi nee Ɛlɛne ne ziale rale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 132:1" />O Nana Nyamenle, mmamaa ɛ rɛle fi Devidi, ɔ nee ye anwubɛnyunlu kpokpoti mɔɔ ɔvale nu la. <verse eid="PSA 132:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 132:2" />Kakye, O Nana Nyamenle, ye ɛwɔkɛ ne mɔɔ ɔbɔle, ndane ne mɔɔ ɔhanle ɔmaanle wɔmɔ, Bedevinlinli ne mɔɔ le Gyekɔbo ye Nyamenle ne la: <verse eid="PSA 132:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 132:3" />“Menrɛhɔ me sua nu, anzɛɛ menrɛla. <verse eid="PSA 132:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 132:4" />Menrɛlie me ɛnwomenle bɔbɔ, anzɛɛ menrɛbɔ ngɔsɔkɛ, <verse eid="PSA 132:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 132:5" />kɔkpula kɛ menwɔnyia ɛleka menwɔmaa Nana Nyamenle, tɛnlabelɛ mɔɔ mebava meamaa Bedevinlinli Kpole Ko ne mɔɔ le Gyekɔbo ye Nyamenle ne la.”<verse eid="PSA 132:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 132:6" />Yɛdele Ɛlɛne ne anwo edwɛkɛ wɔ Bɛtelɛhɛm, na yɛnwunle ye noko wɔ Gyaa ɛya ne mɔ anu. <verse eid="PSA 132:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 132:7" />Akee yɛzele kɛ, “Bɛmaa yɛhɔ Awulae Asɔne Sua ne anu; bɛmaa yɛzonle wɔ ɔ gyakɛ abo ebia ne anwo.” <verse eid="PSA 132:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 132:8" />O Nana Nyamenle, dwazo, na fa wɔ Ngyekyeleɛ Ɛlɛka ne mɔɔ le ɛdawɔ wɔ tumi ne ye sɛkɛlɛneɛ la wolo wɔ Nwuanzanwuanzaleka ne, na tɛnla ɛkɛ ne wɔ melɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ la.<verse eid="PSA 132:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 132:9" />Maa wɔ azɛlɛvolɛ dahuu ɛva tenleneyɛlɛ tɛladeɛ ɛwula; maa wɔ nwuanzanwuanzama ne mɔ ɛdeɛdea nu wɔ fɛlɛkolilɛ nu, wɔ wɔ sonvolɛ Devidi ati.<verse eid="PSA 132:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 132:10" />Ɛbɔle wɔ sonvolɛ Devidi ɛwɔkɛ; mmamaa ɛkpo wɔ belemgbunli ne mɔɔ ɛdawɔ wɔva nwole wɔkpokpa ye la, O Awulae. <verse eid="PSA 132:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 132:11" />Ɛhanle ndane mɔɔ di munli la ɛhilele Devidi, ndane mɔɔ ɛnrɛzia ɛnrɛhakyi ɛ nloa wɔ nwo a: “Mebaye ɛ mra mrenyia ne mɔ anu ko belemgbunli, na yemɔ yɛɛ bali wɔ ebia ne agya a. <verse eid="PSA 132:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 132:12" />Saa ɛ mra ne mɔ di me ɛwɔkɛ ne, ɔ nee me daselɛlilɛ ne mɔ mɔɔ meva memaa bɛ la azo a, bɛ mra noko bali wɔ agya wɔ mekɛ biala kɛ arelemgbunli.”<verse eid="PSA 132:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 132:13" />Nana Nyamenle ɛnlea nu ɛye Zayɔn; na ɔkulo kɛ ɔkɛva ɛkɛ ne ɔkɛyɛ ye tɛnlabelɛ: <verse eid="PSA 132:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 132:14" />“Ɛke yɛɛ bayɛ me ɛnwomenlelielɛ tɛnlabelɛ dahuu a; ɛke yɛɛ mebadɛnla na meali me belemgbunli ne a. <verse eid="PSA 132:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 132:15" />Mebava Zayɔn ye ngyianlɛndeɛ kpokpoti meamaa ye; mebamaa ye ehyiavolɛma ne mɔ aleɛ meamaa bɛ kunlu adwo bɛ nwo. <verse eid="PSA 132:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 132:16" />Mebava ngoanelielɛ meaheda ye sɛlɛvolɛma ne mɔ anwo zo kɛ ɛdanlɛ la, na ye menli ne mɔ bado edwɛne bɛali fɛlɛko bɛadeɛdea nu. <verse eid="PSA 132:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 132:17" />Ɛkɛ ne yɛɛ mebayɛ Devidi abo zo amra ne mɔ anu ko belemgbunli kpole a; ɛkɛ ne yɛɛ mebayila me belemgbunli ne mɔɔ meye ye la ye maamulɛ zo a. <verse eid="PSA 132:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 132:18" />Mebava anyunluguase meaheda ye kpɔvolɛma kɛ ɛdanlɛ la; na emomu, ye belemgbunli abotile ne bada hyeleenyi.”<verse eid="PSA 132:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 132" />
  <chapter number="133" style="c" sid="PSA 133" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 133</para>
  <para style="s1">Mediemayɛlɛ ɛdɛnlanlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 133:1" />Nea ahomeka bie mɔɔ ɔyɛ, nea nwanwane bie mɔɔ ɔyɛ, kɛ Nana Nyamenle ye menli kɛbɔ nu kɛdɛnla ɛleka ko wɔ koyɛlɛ nu a! <verse eid="PSA 133:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 133:2" />Ɔle kɛ ɛnluanlɛ nwole ne mɔɔ sonle bolɛ, mɔɔ ɛlɛsonyi gua vi Aalɔn ati avinli, na ɔlua ɔ kɛsa anu, ɔsonyi ɔgua ɔ kɔme nu, na ɔtolo ɔbagua ye tɛladeɛ ne anu la. <verse eid="PSA 133:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 133:3" />Ɔle kɛ ɛbɔlɛ ne mɔɔ tɔ gua Boka Hɛmɔn azo, na ɔbagua Zayɔn awoka ne mɔ azo la. Ɛkɛ ne yɛɛ Nana Nyamenle ɛva ye nyilalɛ ne ɛbɔ ɛwɔkɛ a, ngoane ne mɔɔ ɛnlɛ ye awieleɛ la.<verse eid="PSA 133:3" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 133" />
  <chapter number="134" style="c" sid="PSA 134" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 134</para>
  <para style="s1">Nɔɔzo Sinzavolɛma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 134:1" />Bɛrɛla, bɛraye Nana Nyamenle ayɛlɛ, bɛmɛ mɔɔ bɛsonle Awulae la, bɛmɛ mɔɔ aledwolɛ muala, bɛgyi ye Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu la. <verse eid="PSA 134:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 134:2" />Bɛmaa bɛ sa zo wɔ nzɛlɛlɛ nu wɔ Nwuanzanwuanzaleka ne na bɛye Nana Nyamenle ayɛlɛ!<verse eid="PSA 134:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 134:3" />Maa Nana Nyamenle ɛvi Zayɔn ɛyila wɔ, yemɔ mɔɔ ɔbɔle Anwuma nee Aze la!<verse eid="PSA 134:3" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 134" />
  <chapter number="135" style="c" sid="PSA 135" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 135</para>
  <para style="s1">Ayɛlɛyelɛ mɔɔ Awulae ye Sonvolɛma fa maa ye la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 135:1" />Bɛye Nana Nyamenle ayɛlɛ! Bɛye ye duma ne ayɛlɛ, bɛmɔ mɔɔ bɛle Awulae ye sonvolɛma, <verse eid="PSA 135:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 135:2" />bɛmɔ mɔɔ bɛwɔ Nana Nyamenle ye Asɔne Sua ne anu wɔ yɛ Nyamenle ye Aako ne anu la. <verse eid="PSA 135:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 135:3" />Bɛye Nana Nyamenle ayɛlɛ, ɔluakɛ ɔ ti akunlu le kpalɛ; bɛdo edwɛne bɛhanvo ye duma ne, ɔluakɛ ɔle ahunlunyelenli. <verse eid="PSA 135:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 135:4" />Awulae ɛza nu ɛye Gyekɔbo ɛmaa ɔ nwo, yeva Yizilayɛ yeyɛ ɔdaye ye agyapadeɛ.<verse eid="PSA 135:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 135:5" />Meze ye wienyi kɛ Nana Nyamenle le bedevinli, ɔbo awozonle kpokpoti anwo zo. <verse eid="PSA 135:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 135:6" />Debie biala mɔɔ Nana Nyamenle kulo la yɛɛ ɔyɛ a, wɔ anwuma maanle ne anu, ɔ nee aleɛabo, wɔ nyevile nu, ɔ nee azukunlu amuala. <verse eid="PSA 135:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 135:7" />Ɔmaa ahumu amungu ne mɔ dwazo wɔ aleɛabo; ɔmaa ɛsɛlɛmanye kpakyekpakye wɔ ezuledɔlɛ mekɛ nu, na ɔfɛlɛ anwoma ne ɔfi ye fealera nu. <verse eid="PSA 135:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 135:8" />Yemɔ yɛɛ ɔhunle menli nee nyɛmoa bɛ belamunli mralɛ wɔ Yigyibiti azɛlɛ zo a. <verse eid="PSA 135:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 135:9" />Ɛkɛ ne yɛɛ ɔyɛle sɛkɛlɛndeɛ ɛzulolɛ ɛzulolɛ ɔ nee nwanwanendeɛ, ɔvale ɔdeanle Faro ɔ nee ye maanle mgbanyima a. <verse eid="PSA 135:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 135:10" />Yemɔ yɛɛ ɔbɔle maanle maanle bɛ bo zo, na ɔhunle arelemgbunli katakyie ne mɔ a. <verse eid="PSA 135:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 135:11" />Saehɔn, mɔɔ le Amoritema bɛ belemgbunli ne; Ɔɔg, mɔɔ le Beeshyanema bɛ belemgbunli ne; ɔ nee arelemgbunli mɔɔ wɔ Keena maanle nu la amuala. <verse eid="PSA 135:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 135:12" />Ɔvale bɛ azɛlɛ ne mɔ kɛ damɛnlangoate agyapandeɛ bie la, na ɔvale ɔmaanle ye menli, Yizilayɛ.<verse eid="PSA 135:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 135:13" />O Nana Nyamenle, bɛbala wɔ duma ne ali dahuu kɛ Nyamenle; ɛlɔnwɔne kpokpoti bahakye wɔ. <verse eid="PSA 135:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 135:14" />Nana Nyamenle bapepɛ alie ye menli; ɔbaze ye azonvolɛ ne mɔ anwunvɔne.<verse eid="PSA 135:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 135:15" />Maanle maanle bɛ awozonle ne mɔ le nvutuke nee dwɛtɛ fufule abaaba ngome; sonla dasanli asa anloa gyima ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 135:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 135:16" />Bɛlɛ ɛnloanlɛ, noko akee bɛngola tendɛ; bɛlɛ ɛnyelɛ, noko akee bɛnnwu debie. <verse eid="PSA 135:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 135:17" />Bɛlɛ ɛnzolɛ, noko akee bɛnde edwɛkɛ; bɛngola bɛngu ɛnwomenle bɔbɔ. <verse eid="PSA 135:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 135:18" />Kɛmɔ bɛde la, zɔhane ala a menli mɔɔ yɛle bɛ la noko de a, na bɛfa bɛ rɛle bɛwula bɛ nu noko.<verse eid="PSA 135:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 135:19" />O Yizilayɛma, bɛye Nana Nyamenle ayɛlɛ! O Aalɔn azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyinli, bɛhanvo Nana Nyamenle! <verse eid="PSA 135:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 135:20" />O Livaema azɛlɛvolɛ, bɛye Awulae Gyihova ayɛlɛ! O bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛsonle ye la, bɛhanvo ye duma ne! <verse eid="PSA 135:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 135:21" />Bɛye Nana Nyamenle ayɛlɛ wɔ Zayɔn, wɔ Gyɛlusalɛm, ye Aako ne anu. Bɛye Awulae ayɛlɛ!<verse eid="PSA 135:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 135" />
  <chapter number="136" style="c" sid="PSA 136" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 136</para>
  <para style="s1">Ayɛlɛyelɛ nee Moyɛlɛ mɔɔ bɛfa bɛmaa Gyihova la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 136:1" />O bɛva moyɛlɛ bɛmaa <char style="nd">Nana Nyamenle</char>, ɔluakɛ ɔ ti akunlu le kpalɛ; ye ɛhulolɛ nwanwane ne le damɛnlangoate!<verse eid="PSA 136:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 136:2" />O bɛva moyɛlɛ bɛmaa Nana Nyamenle ne mɔɔ bo nyamenle biala anwo zo la; ɔluakɛ ye ɛhulolɛ nwanwane ne le damɛnlangoate! <verse eid="PSA 136:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 136:3" />O bɛva moyɛlɛ bɛmaa Awulae mɔɔ bo awulae mɔ kpokpoti anwo zo la; ɔluakɛ ye ɛhulolɛ nwanwane ne nee ye atiakunlukpalɛ ne le damɛnlangoate! <verse eid="PSA 136:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 136:4" />Ɔ ngomekye ala yɛɛ ɔyɛ nwanwane ninyɛne mgbole mgbole a; ɔluakɛ ye ɛhulolɛ nwanwane ne le damɛnlangoate! <verse eid="PSA 136:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 136:5" />Ɔlua ɔdaye ye nrɛlɛbɛ nee ye adwenle zo a ɔbɔle anwomanyunlu ninyɛne kpokpoti a; ɔluakɛ ye ɛhulolɛ nwanwane ne le damɛnlangoate! <verse eid="PSA 136:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 136:6" />Ɔdaye yɛɛ ɔbɔle azɛlɛ ɔhendanle azule zo a; ɔluakɛ ye ɛhulolɛ nwanwane ne le damɛnlangoate! <verse eid="PSA 136:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 136:7" />Ɔdaye a ɔbɔle anwuma kɛnlaneɛ mgbole ne mɔ a; ɔluakɛ ye ɛhulolɛ nwanwane ne le damɛnlangoate! <verse eid="PSA 136:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 136:8" />Ɔbɔle ewia ne kɛ ɔnlea alehyenlɛ ne anwo zo; ɔluakɛ ye ɛhulolɛ nwanwane ne le damɛnlangoate! <verse eid="PSA 136:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 136:9" />Ɔbɔle siane nee nwɔlɛra kɛ bɛnlea aledwolɛ nwo zo; ɔluakɛ ye ɛhulolɛ nwanwane ne le damɛnlangoate! <verse eid="PSA 136:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 136:10" />Ɔbɔle Yigyibitima bɛ belamunli mralɛ kpokpoti abo zo bɔkɔɔ; ɔluakɛ ye ɛhulolɛ nwanwane ne le damɛnlangoate!<verse eid="PSA 136:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 136:11" />Na ɔyele Yizilayɛ ɔvile akɛlɛyɛlɛ bo; ɔluakɛ ye ɛhulolɛ nwanwane ne le damɛnlangoate! <verse eid="PSA 136:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 136:12" />Wɔ tumi kpole nu ala, ɔdendenle ɔ sa ɛnlomboɛ ne; ɔluakɛ ye ɛhulolɛ nwanwane ne le damɛnlangoate! <verse eid="PSA 136:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 136:13" />Ɔkpakyele Nyevile Kɔkɔlɛ ne anu nwiɔ; ɔluakɛ ye ɛhulolɛ nwanwane ne le damɛnlangoate! <verse eid="PSA 136:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 136:14" />Na ɔmaanle Yizilayɛma vale nuhua mɔɔ esiane biala ansianle bɛ a; ɔluakɛ ye ɛhulolɛ nwanwane ne le damɛnlangoate! <verse eid="PSA 136:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 136:15" />Na ɔnlomanle Faro ɔ nee ye konle ɛlɔne ne kpokpoti wɔ Nyevile Kɔkɔlɛ ne abo gbodogbodo; ɔluakɛ ye ɛhulolɛ nwanwane ne le damɛnlangoate!<verse eid="PSA 136:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 136:16" />Ɔlile ye menli ne mɔ anyunlu ɔ nee bɛ pɛle fiemgbole ne; ɔluakɛ ye ɛhulolɛ nwanwane ne le damɛnlangoate! <verse eid="PSA 136:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 136:17" />Ɔhunle arelemgbunli katakyie kpokpoti; ɔluakɛ ye ɛhulolɛ nwanwane ne le damɛnlangoate! <verse eid="PSA 136:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 136:18" />Ɔdinle arelemgbunli anyunlunyiama kɛ ɛnwea; ɔluakɛ ye ɛhulolɛ nwanwane ne le damɛnlangoate! <verse eid="PSA 136:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 136:19" />Saehɔn, mɔɔ le Amɔlema bɛ belemgbunli ne; ɔluakɛ ye ɛhulolɛ nwanwane ne le damɛnlangoate! <verse eid="PSA 136:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 136:20" />Ɔ nee Ɔɔg, Beeshyan belemgbunli ne; ɔluakɛ ye ɛhulolɛ nwanwane ne le damɛnlangoate! <verse eid="PSA 136:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 136:21" />Ɔvale bɛ azɛlɛ ne mɔ amuala kɛ agyapadeɛ la; ɔluakɛ ye ɛhulolɛ nwanwane ne le damɛnlangoate! <verse eid="PSA 136:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 136:22" />Agyapadeɛ mɔɔ ɔvale ɔmaanle ye sonvolɛ Yizilayɛ la; ɔluakɛ ye ɛhulolɛ nwanwane ne le damɛnlangoate!<verse eid="PSA 136:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 136:23" />Ɔhakyele yɛ wɔ melɛ mɔɔ kpɔvolɛma lile yɛ nwo zo konim la; ɔluakɛ ye ɛhulolɛ nwanwane ne le damɛnlangoate! <verse eid="PSA 136:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 136:24" />Na ɔyele yɛ ɔvile kpɔvolɛma asa anu; ɔluakɛ ye ɛhulolɛ nwanwane ne le damɛnlangoate!<verse eid="PSA 136:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 136:25" />Ɔmaa abɔdeɛ biala mɔɔ de ngoane nu la aleɛ; ɔluakɛ ye ɛhulolɛ nwanwane ne le damɛnlangoate! <verse eid="PSA 136:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 136:26" />O bɛva moyɛlɛ bɛmaa Nana Nyamenle mɔɔ wɔ Anwuma Maanle ne anu la, ɔluakɛ ye ɛhulolɛ nwanwane ne le damɛnlangoate!<verse eid="PSA 136:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 136" />
  <chapter number="137" style="c" sid="PSA 137" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 137</para>
  <para style="s1">Bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛvale bɛ bɛhɔle Amanvoa wɔ Babelɔn la bɛ Edwɛne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 137:1" />O wɔ Babelɔn azule ne mɔ anwo, yɛdɛnlanle aze; ɛkɛ ne yɛɛ yɛzunle wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ yɛhakyele Zayɔn la a. <verse eid="PSA 137:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 137:2" />Wɔ mbaka mbaka ne mɔ mɔɔ bikye ɛkɛ ne la azo, yɛɛ yɛvale yɛ sanwunle ne mɔ, nee yɛ ahenle ne mɔ yɛhendɛhendanle a. <verse eid="PSA 137:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 137:3" />Ɛkɛ yɛɛ menli mɔɔ vale yɛ kɛ ahanra la hanle kɛ yɛdo edwɛne a; menli ne mɔɔ hilele yɛ ateetee la zele yɛ kɛ yɛlielie bɛ nye. Bɛzele yɛ kɛ: “Bɛdo Zayɔn edwɛne ne mɔ anu ko bɛmaa yɛdie!” <verse eid="PSA 137:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 137:4" />Kɛ ɔkɛyɛ mɔɔ yɛkɛdo Nana Nyamenle edwɛne wɔ maanle gyɛne zo ɛ? <verse eid="PSA 137:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 137:5" />O Gyɛlusalɛm, saa me rɛle fi wɔ a, mmamaa mekola mebɔ getae bieko! Maa me sa fema ne ɛnwenwe! <verse eid="PSA 137:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 137:6" />Maa me tafinlima ɛzɔ ɛbeta wɔ me nloa anu, saa meangakye wɔ a; saa meammaa wɔmɔ Gyɛlusalɛm zo anwuma wɔ me anyelielɛ muala anu a!<verse eid="PSA 137:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 137:7" />O Nana Nyamenle, kakye deɛ mɔɔ Yidɔmma yɛle, wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ Babelɔn azogya homonle Gyɛlusalɛm anwo zo la. Kakye kɛ bɛzile bɛtinlinle zo bɛhanle kɛ, “Bɛdwulu ye bɛgua aze bɔkɔɔ!” la. <verse eid="PSA 137:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 137:8" />O Babelɔn bɛlɛra, bɛbazɛkye wɔ bɔkɔɔ. Nyilalɛ ɛha sonla ne mɔɔ sɛkye wɔ, kɛmɔ ɛdawɔ noko wɔzɛkye yɛ la. <verse eid="PSA 137:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 137:9" />Nyilalɛ ɛha sonla ne mɔɔ kuohua ɛ mra ne mɔ anloa, na ɔfa bɛ ti ɔkpulokpula awolɛ la!<verse eid="PSA 137:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 137" />
  <chapter number="138" style="c" sid="PSA 138" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 138</para>
  <para style="s1">Mɛlahyehyɛleɛvo Nyamenle Nɔhavo ne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 138:1" />O Awulae, wɔmɔ yɛɛ mefa me ahonle kpokpoti meyɛ wɔ mo a; meto ayɛlɛyelɛ edwɛne memaa wɔ wɔ awozonle ne mɔ anyunlu. <verse eid="PSA 138:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 138:2" />Mebɔ me ti aze mekile wɔ Tɛnlabelɛ Nwuanzanwuanza ne, na mefa moyɛlɛ memaa wɔ duma ne, wɔ wɔ ɛhulolɛ kpundii ɔ nee wɔ nɔhalɛlilɛ ne ati; ɔluakɛ wɔmɔ wɔkpogya wɔ duma ne, ɔ nee wɔ edwɛkɛ ne zo wɔ ninyɛne muala anwo zo. <verse eid="PSA 138:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 138:3" />Mekɛ mɔɔ menzunle menvɛlɛle wɔ la, wɔmɔ ɛdiele me; ɔlua wɔ anwosesebɛ ne azo, ɛmaanle medame noko me nwo yɛle se.<verse eid="PSA 138:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 138:4" />O Nana Nyamenle, aleɛabo arelemgbunli kpokpoti bahanvo wɔ, ɔluakɛ bɛde edwɛkɛ ne bɛvi ɛ nloa anu. <verse eid="PSA 138:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 138:5" />Bɛbado wɔ nyɛleɛ ne anwo edwɛne, ɔluakɛ wɔmɔ Nana Nyamenle, wɔ anyunlunyia ne le totohyia. <verse eid="PSA 138:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 138:6" />Saa kanzɛ wɔmɔ Nana Nyamenle, ɛwɔ anwuma bɔbɔ a, ɛbu bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛbutubutu azɛlɛ ye azo la anwo mgbonda, na amemaabɛnwozovoma ne mɔ ɛdeɛ, bɛmɛ ɛnwu bɛ wɔ moamoa nehane. <verse eid="PSA 138:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 138:7" />Kanzɛ melua anwubɛnyunlu azɛlɛ ye azo bɔbɔ a, wɔmɔ ɛfa me ngoane ɛsie kpalɛ. Ɛtende ɛ sa wɔ me kpɔvolɛma mɔɔ bɛhele la anwo zo, na ɛfa wɔ tumi ne ɛdie me ngoane. <verse eid="PSA 138:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 138:8" />Nana Nyamenle, ɛbamaa wɔ ngyehyɛleɛ kpokpoti ali munli; O Awulae, wɔ ɛhulolɛ kpundii ne le damɛnlangoate. Mmamaa ɛ rɛle fi me, ɔluakɛ wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛbɔle me a.<verse eid="PSA 138:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 138" />
  <chapter number="139" style="c" sid="PSA 139" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 139</para>
  <para style="s1">Nyamenle ne mɔɔ nwu debie biala la ye anyunlunyia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 139:1" />O Nana Nyamenle, wɔmɔ wɔnleɛnlea me ahonle nu, na wɔnwu debie biala mɔɔ wɔ me nwo la. <verse eid="PSA 139:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 139:2" />Wɔmɔ ɛze me azedɛnlanlɛ nee me ɛdwazolɛ nu, ɛnwu me adwenle nu ngyehyɛleɛ kpokpoti ɛfi moamoa. <verse eid="PSA 139:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 139:3" />Wɔmɔ ɛnwu me, saa melɛyɛ gyima anzɛɛ melɛdie me ɛnwomenle a; na ɛze me nyɛleɛ kpokpoti. <verse eid="PSA 139:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 139:4" />Bɔbɔ kolaa na edwɛkɛ bavi me nloa anu avinde la, O Nana Nyamenle, ɛnee ɛze mɔɔ mebaha la amuala. <verse eid="PSA 139:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 139:5" />Wɔbɔ wɔyia me wɔ me foa nee foa; ɛfa wɔ tumi totohyia ne ɛsinza me.<verse eid="PSA 139:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 139:6" />Wɔ nrɛlɛbɛ wɔ me nwo le kuloonwu zɛhae; ɔbo me ndelebɛbo zo bɔkɔɔ. <verse eid="PSA 139:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 139:7" />Nienwu bɔbɔ a menwɔhola menwɔva menwɔvi wɔ sunsum ne abo a? Anzɛɛ nienwu bɔbɔ yɛɛ menwɔhola menwɔva menwɔnriandi menwɔvi ɛ nyunlu a? <verse eid="PSA 139:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 139:8" />Saa mefo mekɔ anwuma maanle ne anu a, ɛwɔ ɛkɛ ne; saa medwu ɛbolɔ kuma ne anu a, ɛwɔ ɛkɛ ne. <verse eid="PSA 139:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 139:9" />Saa mefa nwonlomɔ ɛndɛbalɛ na metu mekɔtɛnla nyevile kunlu nehane bɔbɔ a, <verse eid="PSA 139:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 139:10" />ɛkɛ ne yɛɛ ɛ sa ɛnlomboɛ ne kɛyɛ me atuu a, ɛwɔ ɛkɛ ne mɔɔ ɛbaboa me a. <verse eid="PSA 139:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 139:11" />Mekola meka kɛ maa awozinli kabii ɛheda me nwo zo anzɛɛ wienyi ne mɔɔ ɛbɔ ɛyia me la ɛhakyi aledwolɛ, <verse eid="PSA 139:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 139:12" />noko akee awozinli kabii ne wɔmɔ ɔnle awozinli ɔmmaa wɔ, yɛɛ aledwolɛ ne noko ta wienyi kɛ alehyenlɛ la. Awozinli kabii nee wienyi le deɛ ko ne ala maa wɔ.<verse eid="PSA 139:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 139:13" />Wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛbɔle me nwo nane ne ye ɛleka biala a; wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛnwonle me wɔ ɔmɔ ako ɛzɛne ne anu a. <verse eid="PSA 139:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 139:14" />Meye wɔ ayɛlɛ, ɔluakɛ ɛ nwo yɛ ɛzulolɛ nee nwanwane; debie biala mɔɔ ɛyɛ la le nwanwane, na eza ɔyɛ ɛzulolɛ. Meze ɛhye mesie wɔ me ahonle nu. <verse eid="PSA 139:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 139:15" />Me sonlabaka mumua ne anvea wɔ wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɛnee bɛlɛyɛ me fealera nu wɔ ɔmɔ akunlu la. Nwanwane nu ala yɛɛ bɛyɛle me wɔ azɛlɛ ne abo nehane a. <verse eid="PSA 139:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 139:16" />Bɔbɔ mɔɔ ɛnee bɛtɛyɛle me la, ɛnee ɛze ɔmɔ amodinli ne. Wɔ buluku ne anu yɛɛ bɛhɛlɛle me nwo ninyɛne ne amuala wɔ nu wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɛnee bɛtɛnrenzɛle me la a, bɔbɔ wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɛnee bɛtɛyɛle me nwo debie biala la.<verse eid="PSA 139:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 139:17" />O Nana Nyamenle, nea kɛ wɔ adwenle ne mɔ sonle bolɛ maa me bie a! Nea bɛ tɛtɛbonle kɛ ɔde a! <verse eid="PSA 139:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 139:18" />Saa mese kɛ metia bɛ ngoko ngoko a, bɛbazo bɛadɛla ɛnweazo anwea bɔbɔ. Saa mevi nla nu medwazo a, me nee wɔ a wɔ ɛkɛ a.<verse eid="PSA 139:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 139:19" />O Nana Nyamenle, me kunlu anu a anrɛɛ ɛbahu amumuyɛvoma ne mɔ! Saa menli mɔɔ ka mogya gua la kɛgyakyi me bɛkɛmaa menwɔva me nwo kɔlɔɔnwo a, anrɛɛ ɔkɛyɛ me fɛ totohyia. <verse eid="PSA 139:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 139:20" />Bɛfa adwenle ɛtane ɛtane bɛtia wɔ; bɛtendɛ atisesebɛ nu ala bɛtia wɔ, na bɛgua wɔ duma ne anwo evinli. <verse eid="PSA 139:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 139:21" />O Nana Nyamenle, nea kɛ mesi mekyi bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkpɔ wɔ la bie a! Nea kɛ mesi mekpɔ bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛdwazo bɛtia wɔ la bie a! <verse eid="PSA 139:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 139:22" />Mekpɔ bɛ ɛkpɔlɛ mɔɔ di munli a; mebu bɛ kɛ me kpɔvolɛma.<verse eid="PSA 139:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 139:23" />Neɛnlea me ahonle nu nea, O Nana Nyamenle, na nwu me adwenle nu. Sɔ me nea na nwu me adwenle ne mɔ. <verse eid="PSA 139:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 139:24" />Nea kɛ saa ɛkɛnwu ɛtane bie wɔ me nu a, na fa me fa adenle ne mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ la azo.<verse eid="PSA 139:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 139" />
  <chapter number="140" style="c" sid="PSA 140" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 140</para>
  <para style="s1">Sonla ye Kpɔvolɛma asa anu ɛvilɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 140:1" />O Nana Nyamenle, pepɛ die me fi ɛtanevolɛma asa anu; na fa me sie fi amumuyɛvoma asa anu. <verse eid="PSA 140:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 140:2" />Alehyenlɛ muala bɛdwenle adwenle ɛtane wɔ bɛ ahonle nu, na bɛfa butule nee konle bɛba dahuu. <verse eid="PSA 140:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 140:3" />Bɛ tafinlima yɛ nla kɛ tenkɛ; na bɛ nloa edwɛkɛ yɛ ɛnwonle kɛ ayidane. <verse eid="PSA 140:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 140:4" />O Nana Nyamenle, bɔ me nwo bane fi kpɔvolɛma tumi nu; fa me sie fi nzakatovoma asa anu, bɛmɛ mɔɔ bɛfa me azedɔlɛ nwo akpame la. <verse eid="PSA 140:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 140:5" />Mgbanyizonleyɛvoma ɛzua me ɛhane; bɛtoto bɛ adwenle nzuzulɛ ɛtane ne mɔ boɛ bɛwie, na wɔ adenle ne foa nee foa, bɛdɛlɛdɛlɛ bɛ asawu ne mɔ anu kɛ bɛfa bɛahye me.<verse eid="PSA 140:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 140:6" />Mese Nana Nyamenle kɛ, “Wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛle me Nyamenle a.” Yɛ ɛnzolɛ maa me ne nee me nzɛlɛlɛ, O Awulae! <verse eid="PSA 140:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 140:7" />O Nana Nyamenle, me Nyamenle, me sinzavolɛ anwosesebɛvolɛ. Wɔmɔ a ɛhedale me ti zo wɔ konle nu a. <verse eid="PSA 140:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 140:8" />O Nana Nyamenle, mmamaa atisesebɛvoma asa ka bɛ ngyianlɛndeɛ, mmamaa bɛ akpame ɛtane ne mɔ di munli. <verse eid="PSA 140:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 140:9" />Me kpɔvolɛma ɛmemaa bɛ ti zo; noko akee maa bɛ ɛnwunlonwunlanlɛ ne mɔ ɛzia ɛrɛla bɛdabɛ bɛ nwo zo. <verse eid="PSA 140:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 140:10" />Maa samɛnlakɛ gɔhyee ɛdudu ɛgua bɛ nwo zo; na maa bɛzuhu bɛ bɛgua ewule kuma nu mɔɔ bɛndwazo bieko la.<verse eid="PSA 140:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 140:11" />Mmamaa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛtende bɛ sa wɔ awie mɔ anwo zo adalɛ nu ala la nyia ngɔzo; maa ɛtane ɛva amumuyɛvoma aze na ɔbɔ bɛ bo zo bɔkɔɔ. <verse eid="PSA 140:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 140:12" />O Nana Nyamenle, meze kɛ ɛdi ɛboa menli mɔɔ wɔ nyane nu la, na ɛbua ndɛne tenlene ɛmaa ehyiavolɛma. <verse eid="PSA 140:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 140:13" />Nɔhalɛ nu, Nyamezulolɛma bava moyɛlɛ amaa wɔ duma ne; na tenlenema noko akpondɛ tɛnlabelɛ wɔ wɔ nu.<verse eid="PSA 140:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 140" />
  <chapter number="141" style="c" sid="PSA 141" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 141</para>
  <para style="s1">Nzɛlɛlɛ mɔɔ bɛsɛlɛ amaa bɛahwe bɛ nwo bɛavi ɛtane nu la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 141:1" />O Nana Nyamenle, wɔmɔ yɛɛ mebodo mesɛlɛ wɔ a; boa me ndɛndɛ zo! Yɛ ɛnzolɛ maa me wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ menwɔzu menwɔvɛlɛ wɔ la. <verse eid="PSA 141:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 141:2" />Maa me nzɛlɛlɛ ɛdwu ɛ nyulu kɛ ɛyɛlɛ mɔɔ bɛlɛkpu la; die me sa mɔɔ mekpogya ye zo anwuma la kɛ nɔsolɛ azubɔlɛ.<verse eid="PSA 141:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 141:3" />O Nana Nyamenle, bɔ me nloa mɔɔ mendendɛ a; tu sinzavolɛ maa ɔrazinza me nloa babonle ne. <verse eid="PSA 141:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 141:4" />Twe me fi ɛtaneyɛlɛ nwo; mmamaa menyia ɛhulolɛ bie kɛ me nee amumuyɛvoma kɛdu wɔ bɛ ninyɛmunliyɛlɛ nu. Mmamaa me nee bɛ kyɛ bɛ anwonyia mɔɔ bɛanvɛ na bɛanyia ye la. <verse eid="PSA 141:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 141:5" />Sonlakpalɛ bɔbɔ badendɛ me nyunlu wɔ me kpalɛyɛlɛ ti, noko akee menrɛmaa me nye ɛnrɛzɔ ninyɛndaneyɛvoma bɛ ayɛlɛyelɛ biala; ɔluakɛ alehyenlɛ biala mesɛlɛ metia bɛ amumuyɛ nyɛleɛ ne mɔ. <verse eid="PSA 141:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 141:6" />Saa bɛye bɛ arelemgbunli ne mɔ bɛwula Funli Kuma asa anu a, yɛɛ akee bɛkɛnwu kɛ Awulae edwɛkɛ ne mɔ le nɔhalɛ a. <verse eid="PSA 141:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 141:7" />Kɛ ɛyɛne mɔɔ bɛkpakyekpakye nuhua nzokɛnzoka la, zɔhane ala a bɛbubu bɛ mbowule ne mɔ bɛkpondekponde wɔ nla ne mɔ azo a.<verse eid="PSA 141:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 141:8" />Noko akee mekɔ zo mefa me rɛle mewula wɔ nu, O Nana Nyamenle me Nyamenle. Wɔ nu yɛɛ mekpondɛ feabelɛ a; mmamaa bɛku me bɛto me lɔ kpatalakpa. <verse eid="PSA 141:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 141:9" />Bɔ me nwo bane fi ngane mɔɔ bɛzuozua me la anu; ye me fi ɛtanevolɛma bɛ akpame mɔɔ bɛva ye wɔ me nwo la anu. <verse eid="PSA 141:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 141:10" />Maa amumuyɛvoma bɛdabɛ bɛ asawu mɔɔ bɛgua la ɛhye bɛ wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ mame mede me ɛleka bie, me nwo kɔlɔɔnwo la.<verse eid="PSA 141:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 141" />
  <chapter number="142" style="c" sid="PSA 142" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 142</para>
  <para style="s1">Devidi ye Nzɛlɛlɛ wɔ Adulam Bolɛ tokule ne anu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 142:1" />Mefa me ne mesu mefɛlɛ Awulae moalɛ; me ne yɛɛ mefa mesɛlɛ memaa Nana Nyamenle a. <verse eid="PSA 142:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 142:2" />Mefa me ngyianlɛdwɛkɛ muala meto ɔ nyunlu; meka me anwongyelelɛ kpokpoti mekile ye. <verse eid="PSA 142:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 142:3" />Saa me ɛkɛla ne anye zo bulu ye a ɔdaye ɔze deɛ mɔɔ ɔwɔ kɛ meyɛ a. Wɔ adenle kpolomgbolo ne mɔɔ melua nu la anu, me kpɔvolɛma ɛzuozua me ngane ɛveɛvea nu. <verse eid="PSA 142:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 142:4" />Saa meto me nye wɔ me sa fema zo a mennwu boavolɛ biala; awie biala ɛnle ɛkɛ ne mɔɔ bazinza me a. Awie biala ɛmbu me nwo mgbonda bɔbɔ. <verse eid="PSA 142:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 142:5" />O Nana Nyamenle, mesu mefɛlɛ wɔ; wɔmɔ Awulae yɛɛ ɛle me sinzavolɛ a. Wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛle me anyelazo mɔɔ mekpondɛ ye wɔ ewiade anu a.<verse eid="PSA 142:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 142:6" />Yɛ ɛnzolɛ tie me ɛzunlɛ, ɔluakɛ me nye ɛdudu ɛgua zolɛ! Die me ngoane fi me kpɔvolɛma asa anu, ɔluakɛ bɛ anwosesebɛ bo me nwo zo somaa! <verse eid="PSA 142:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 142:7" />Ye me fi nyanelilɛ nu; amaa meava moyɛlɛ meamaa wɔ duma ne wɔ wɔ menli ayiaku ne anu! Tenlenema babɔ me nwo mgbɔlɛka ayia, ɔlua wɔ atiakunlukpalɛ ne mɔɔ wɔ me nwo zo la ati.<verse eid="PSA 142:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 142" />
  <chapter number="143" style="c" sid="PSA 143" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 143</para>
  <para style="s1">Nzɛlɛlɛ wɔ Dɔnehwele ne mɔɔ Awozinli kɛva yɛ aze la anu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 143:1" />Tie me nzɛlɛlɛ, O Nana Nyamenle; wɔ wɔ tenleneyɛlɛ nu, tie me modolɛ! Bua me wɔ wɔ nɔhalɛlilɛ ne anu! <verse eid="PSA 143:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 143:2" />Mmafa mame, wɔ sonvolɛ, ɛkɔ ndɛnebualɛ nu; ɔluakɛ dasanli biala ɛnle tenlene wɔ ɛ nyunlu.<verse eid="PSA 143:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 143:3" />Kpɔvolɛ ne ɛkpo me na yedo me; yetietia me ngoane nwo zo feefee wɔ azeva nu. Yeva me yedo efiade awozinli kisikisi ne anu, na meyɛ kɛ mɔmoane amra ne mɔ mɔɔ wuwule la. <verse eid="PSA 143:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 143:4" />Zɔhane ati me sunsum ne anwo ɛgolo ye; me ahonle mɔɔ la me kunlu la anwo mɔra ɛdu bɔkɔɔ. <verse eid="PSA 143:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 143:5" />Mekakye mekɛ ne mɔɔ ɛraze ɛhɔ la, na medwenledwenle mɔɔ ɛyɛle ɛmaanle me la anwo, wɔ me ahonle nu koonwu; mesie me adwenle dii na mekakyehakye wɔ nyɛleɛ ne mɔ amuala. <verse eid="PSA 143:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 143:6" />Mekpogya me sa zo memaa wɔ wɔ nzɛlɛlɛ nu; kɛmɔ azɛlɛ ngetele anwo dɔ nzule la, zɔhane ala yɛɛ ɛ nwo nzuhɔne ɛlɛku me ɛkɛla ne a. <verse eid="PSA 143:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 143:7" />Maa ɛ nwo ɛyɛ ndɛ kɛ ɛkɛbua me, O Nana Nyamenle! Me anyelazo kpokpoti ɛde ɛminli. Mmafa ɛ nyunlu ɛfea me; anrɛɛ yemɔ menwɔyɛ kɛ bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛwu bɛhɔ ɛbolɔ Kuma ne anu la. <verse eid="PSA 143:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 143:8" />Kakye me nwonlomɔ biala, wɔ wɔ ɛhulolɛ nwanwane ne anwo; ɔluakɛ wɔ nu yɛɛ mefa me rɛle mewula a. Kilehile me adenle mɔɔ ɔwɔ kɛ mefa zo a, ɔluakɛ wɔmɔ ala yɛɛ me nzɛlɛlɛ dwu ɛ nyunlu a. <verse eid="PSA 143:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 143:9" />Pepɛ die me fi me kpɔvolɛma asa anu, O Nana Nyamenle! Menriandi mera wɔ ɛkɛ kɛ mebakpondɛ feabelɛ! <verse eid="PSA 143:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 143:10" />Kilehile me maa menyɛ wɔ ɛhulolɛdeɛ, ɔluakɛ wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛle me Nyamenle a! Maa wɔ sunsum kpalɛ ne ɛli me nyunlu dahuu, na ɔva me ɔva adenle mɔɔ munzule biala ɛnle nu la anu!<verse eid="PSA 143:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 143:11" />Ɔlua wɔ duma ne ati, fa me ngoane sie kpalɛ, O Nana Nyamenle! Wɔ wɔ tenleneyɛlɛ nu, ye me fi anwongyelelɛ nu! <verse eid="PSA 143:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 143:12" />Ɔlua wɔ ɛhulolɛ nwanwane ne mɔɔ ɛlɛ ye ɛmaa me la ati, ku me kpɔvolɛma amuala; na sɛkye bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛteetee me la kpokpoti, ɔluakɛ mele wɔ sonvolɛ.<verse eid="PSA 143:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 143" />
  <chapter number="144" style="c" sid="PSA 144" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 144</para>
  <para style="s1">Sogyanli ye Edwɛndolɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 144:1" />Nyilalɛ ɛha Nana Nyamenle, me Bodane! Yemɔ yɛɛ ɔkilehile me konle nu agyibadolɛ na ɔsiezie me ɔsie ɔmaa konle a. <verse eid="PSA 144:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 144:2" />Ɔle me sinzavolɛ ɔ nee me nwo banebɔvolɛ, me feabelɛ ɔ nee me ngoanedievolɛ; ye nuhua yɛɛ mefa me rɛle mewula amaa yeava me yeazie a. Ɔbɛlɛ maanle maanle muala aze, na ɔfa bɛ ɔwula me bo.<verse eid="PSA 144:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 144:3" />O Nana Nyamenle, sonla dasanli bɔbɔ a le duzu, mɔɔ ɔwɔ kɛ ɛbu ɔ nwo mgbonda; sonla gyɛne ala mɔɔ ɔwɔ kɛ ɛdwenledwenle ɔ nwo a? <verse eid="PSA 144:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 144:4" />Sonla dasanli le kɛ ɛnwomenle mɔɔ yɛgu la; ye mekɛ le kɛ ɛlawolɛ mɔɔ ɛlɛpɛ nu aze la.<verse eid="PSA 144:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 144:5" />O Nana Nyamenle, ɛvi wɔ anwuma maanle ne anu dwu azɛlɛ nwo! Fa ɛ sa ka awoka ne mɔ, na maa bɛkpu esike! <verse eid="PSA 144:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 144:6" />Kpakyekpakye ɛsɛlɛmanye nu, na bɔ wɔ kpɔvolɛma ne mɔ kponde; to wɔ ɛda mbaka ne mɔ na ka bɛ gua ɛbɔ nu.<verse eid="PSA 144:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 144:7" />To ɛ sa fi anwuma nehane bɛla azɛlɛ nwo die me, na ye me fi azukuma ne anu; die me ngoane fi nyɛvolɛ nyɛvolɛ tumi bo, <verse eid="PSA 144:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 144:8" />bɛmɛ mɔɔ bɛnga nɔhalɛ, na bɛbɔ adalɛ wɔ mekɛ bɔbɔ mɔɔ bɛli amonle la.<verse eid="PSA 144:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 144:9" />O Nana Nyamenle, mebado edwɛne fofolɛ meamaa wɔ; mebabɔ getae azo nyɛma bulu na meado edwɛne meamaa wɔ. <verse eid="PSA 144:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 144:10" />Wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛfa konimlilɛ ɛmaa arelemgbunli, na ɛye wɔ sonvolɛ Devidi ɛfi munzule nu a. <verse eid="PSA 144:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 144:11" />Die me fi me agbɔvolɛ atisesebɛvoma asa anu; pepɛ die me fi nyɛvolɛ nyɛvolɛ tumi bo, bɛmɛ mɔɔ bɛnga nɔhalɛ na bɛbɔ adalɛ wɔ mekɛ bɔbɔ mɔɔ bɛli amonle la. <verse eid="PSA 144:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 144:12" />Maa yɛ mra mrenyia anwo ɛyɛ ɛsesebɛ wɔ bɛ mgbavolɛ nu; maa bɛyɛ kɛ mbaka mɔɔ nyi kɔ anwuma la. Maa yɛ mra mraalɛ ɛyɛ ngɛnlɛma ngɛnlɛma kɛ ahanle sika ne mɔ mɔɔ bɛva bɛziezie belemgbunli aako nu la. <verse eid="PSA 144:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 144:13" />Maa aleɛ dɔɔnwo ɛyiyi yɛ bonwolo ne mɔ fefetee zɛhae ala. Maa mboane ne mɔ mɔɔ ɛlɛdidi wɔ ɛya ne mɔ anu la ɛwo mralɛ apenle apenle mɔnwo mɔnwo. <verse eid="PSA 144:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 144:14" />Maa yɛ nlankɛ ne mɔ ɛwo dɔɔnwo, mɔɔ bɛmkpɔne mralɛ anzɛɛ bie ɛmminli a. Mmamaa yɛte nyane ɛzunlɛ biala wɔ yɛ awɔlɔne ne mɔ azo. <verse eid="PSA 144:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 144:15" />Ahomeka a le menli ne mɔ mɔɔ nyilalɛ zɛhae mɔ tɔ gua bɛ nwo zo la! Ahomeka a le menli ne mɔ mɔɔ bɛ Nyamenle a le Nana Nyamenle la!<verse eid="PSA 144:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 144" />
  <chapter number="145" style="c" sid="PSA 145" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 145</para>
  <para style="s1">Gyihova nee Nyamenle Bedevinli ne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 145:1" />Me Nyamenle ɔ nee me belemgbunli, mebado wɔ kpoleyɛlɛ ne anwo edwɛne; mebayɛ wɔ mo wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ. <verse eid="PSA 145:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 145:2" />Alehyenlɛ biala mebayɛ wɔ mo; na meahanvo wɔ duma wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ<verse eid="PSA 145:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 145:3" />Nana Nyamenle le totohyia, na ɔfɛta ayɛlɛyelɛ kpole; ye kpoleyɛlɛ ne bo ndelebɛbo muala anwo azo. <verse eid="PSA 145:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 145:4" />Bɛbaye wɔ ayɛlɛ, ɔvi ɛlɔnwɔne ko anwo zo kɔdwu ɛlɔnwɔne ko anwo zo, na bɛabɔ wɔ nwanwanendeɛ mgbole mgbole ne mɔ anwo nolo. <verse eid="PSA 145:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 145:5" />Bɛbaha wɔ anyunlunyia ne nee wɔ belemgbunlililɛ ne anwo edwɛkɛ; na medame noko mebadwenledwenle wɔ nwanwanendeɛ ne mɔ anwo. <verse eid="PSA 145:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 145:6" />Menli baha wɔ gyima mgbole mgbole ne mɔ anwo edwɛkɛ, na mame mebala wɔ bedevinliyɛlɛ ne ali. <verse eid="PSA 145:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 145:7" />Bɛbaha wɔ kpalɛyɛlɛ ne amuala anwo edwɛkɛ, na bɛado wɔ ahunlunyele ne anwo edwɛne.<verse eid="PSA 145:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 145:8" />Nana Nyamenle le ɛlolɛmaavolɛ ɔ nee anwunvɔnesevolɛ; ɔkyɛ na yeava ɛya; ɛhulolɛ nwanwane ɛyi ye tɛkɛɛ. <verse eid="PSA 145:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 145:9" />Nana Nyamenle ati akunlu le kpalɛ maa awie biala, na ye anwunvɔnezelɛ wɔ debie biala mɔɔ ɔdaye yebɔ ye la anwo zo. <verse eid="PSA 145:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 145:10" />Wɔ abɔndeɛ muala bava moyɛlɛ amaa wɔ, O Nana Nyamenle, na wɔ anwodelɛma kpokpoti bayila wɔ. <verse eid="PSA 145:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 145:11" />Bɛbaha wɔ anyunlunyia ne mɔɔ wɔ wɔ belemgbunlililɛ tumi ne anu la anwo edwɛkɛ, na bɛala wɔ anwosesebɛ ne noko ali; <verse eid="PSA 145:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 145:12" />amaa awie biala anwu wɔ nwanwane gyima mgbole mgbole ne mɔ, ɔ nee wɔ anyunlunyia tumi ne mɔɔ wɔ wɔ belemgbunli maanle ne anu la. <verse eid="PSA 145:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 145:13" />Wɔ belemgbunlililɛ ɛnlɛ ye awieleɛ, yɛɛ ɛle belemgbunli dahuu. Awulae di nɔhalɛ maa ye ɛwɔkɛ kpokpoti yɛɛ debie biala mɔɔ ɔyɛ la le kpalɛ.<verse eid="PSA 145:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 145:14" />Nana Nyamenle boa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛwɔ anwongyelelɛ nu la; na ɔkpogya bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛde aze la zo. <verse eid="PSA 145:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 145:15" />Abɔndeɛ kpokpoti su fɛlɛ wɔ wɔ bɛ anyelazo nu, na ɔmaa bɛ sa ka bɛ ngyianlɛndeɛ wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɔfɛta la anu. <verse eid="PSA 145:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 145:16" />Ɔmaa bɛ mɔɔ sa bɛ di la, na ɔmaa awie biala nyia ye ahunludwolɛdeɛ.<verse eid="PSA 145:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 145:17" />Nana Nyamenle le tenlene wɔ debie biala mɔɔ ɔyɛ la anu; ɔle anwunvɔnesevolɛ wɔ ye nyɛleɛ kpokpoti anu. <verse eid="PSA 145:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 145:18" />Nana Nyamenle twe bikye bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛfɛlɛ ye la; ɔba bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛsu bɛfɛlɛ ye nɔhalɛ nu la ɛkɛ. <verse eid="PSA 145:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 145:19" />Bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛdi ye eni la, ɔmaa bɛ sa ka bɛ ngyianlɛndeɛ kpokpoti; eza ɔtie bɛ nzɛlɛlɛ na ɔdie bɛ ngoane. <verse eid="PSA 145:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 145:20" />Nana Nyamenle bɔ bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛlɛ ɔ nwo ɛhulolɛ la anwo bane na ninyɛndaneyɛvoma ɛdeɛ, bɛmɛ ɔbabɔ bɛ bo zo bɔkɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 145:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 145:21" />Mebaye Nana Nyamenle ayɛlɛ dahuu; bɛmaa abɔndeɛ kpokpoti ɛye ye duma nwuanzanwuanza ne ayɛlɛ wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ.<verse eid="PSA 145:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 145" />
  <chapter number="146" style="c" sid="PSA 146" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 146</para>
  <para style="s1">Awulae Nyamenle, yɛ Sinzavolɛ Kpole ne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 146:1" />Bɛye Nana Nyamenle ayɛlɛ! O me ɛkɛla, ye Awulae ayɛlɛ! <verse eid="PSA 146:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 146:2" />Mebaye Nana Nyamenle ayɛlɛ wɔ melɛ ala mɔɔ mede ngoane nu la. Mebado ayɛlɛyelɛ edwɛne meamaa me Nyamenle wɔ me ngoane mekɛ muala anu.<verse eid="PSA 146:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 146:3" />Bɛmmafa bɛ rɛle bɛwula arelemgbunli tumivolɛma anu; ɔluakɛ dasanli biala ɛnrɛhola ɛnrɛlie bɛ ngoane. <verse eid="PSA 146:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 146:4" />Saa bɛ sunsum fi bɛ nu a, bɛsia bɛkɔ bɛ ɛva nu; na kenle ko demua zɔhane bɛ ngyehyɛleɛ muala ba awieleɛ. <verse eid="PSA 146:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 146:5" />Ahomekanli a le sonla ne mɔɔ ye boavolɛ a le Gyekɔbo ye Nyamenle ne, na ye anyelazo muala wɔ Nana Nyamenle ye Nyamenle ne anu, <verse eid="PSA 146:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 146:6" />yemɔ mɔɔ ɔbɔle anwuma nee aze, nyevile ɔ nee ninyɛne mɔɔ wɔ nuhua la amuala la. Ɔdi ye ɛwɔkɛ ne mɔ azo dahuu. <verse eid="PSA 146:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 146:7" />Ɔbua ndɛnekpa ɔkɔ bɛdabɛ mɔɔ menli sisi bɛ la afoa na ɔmaa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ ɛhɔne ku bɛ la aleɛ. Nana Nyamenle maa efiadedavolɛma nyia bɛ fanwodi <verse eid="PSA 146:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 146:8" />na ɔmaa anyezinliravolɛma nwu debie. Nana Nyamenle kpogya bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛde bɛgua aze la zo anwuma; ɔlɛ ye menli tenlenema anwo ɛhulolɛ. <verse eid="PSA 146:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 146:9" />Nana Nyamenle sinza nyɛvolɛ mɔɔ de yɛ azɛlɛ ne azo la; ɔboa ahunlavolɛ ɔ nee nrisa mralɛ; na emomu ɔbɔ amumuyɛvoma bɛ ngyehyɛleɛ ɔgua; bɛ bo zo minli bɔkɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 146:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 146:10" />Nana Nyamenle le belemgbunli wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ. O Zayɔn, wɔ Nyamenle ne bali belemgbunli wɔ mekɛ muala. Bɛye Awulae Ayɛlɛ!<verse eid="PSA 146:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 146" />
  <chapter number="147" style="c" sid="PSA 147" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 147</para>
  <para style="s1">Nyamenle anye mɔɔ wɔ ye Menli nwo zo la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 147:1" />Bɛye Awulae ayɛlɛ! Ɔle kpalɛ kɛ bɛkɛdo ayɛlɛyelɛ edwɛne bɛkɛmaa yɛ Nyamenle ne a; ɔluakɛ ɔle ɛlolɛmaavolɛ, yemɔti ɔfɛta kɛ bɛkɛye ye ayɛlɛ.<verse eid="PSA 147:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 147:2" />Nana Nyamenle ɛlɛmaa Gyɛlusalɛm zo azie ɔ bo zo dɛba ne; ɔ nee Yizilayɛma mɔɔ bɛvale bɛ bɛhɔle amanvoa la ɛlɛsia ara. <verse eid="PSA 147:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 147:3" />Ɔyɛ bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛgyakyi bɛ arɛlevilɛ nu bɛmaa bɛ ɛbolɛ ɛde la ayile, na ɔkyekye bɛ nganlɛ ne mɔ. <verse eid="PSA 147:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 147:4" />Ɔze nwɔlɛra dodo mɔɔ wɔ anwomanyunlu la, na ɔfa bɛ nuhua ko biala duma ɔfɛlɛ ye. <verse eid="PSA 147:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 147:5" />Yɛ Awulae le bedevinli, na tumi ɛyi ye tɛkɛɛ; ye nrɛlɛbɛ, bɛsuzu a bɛnnwu ɔ bo, yɛɛ bɛtia a bɛnnwu ɔ nloa. <verse eid="PSA 147:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 147:6" />Nana Nyamenle kpogya anwoazehanlɛma zo anwuma; na atisesebɛvoma ɛdeɛ, ɔti bɛ motomoto kɛ munlutu la. <verse eid="PSA 147:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 147:7" />Bɛdo moyɛlɛ edwɛne bɛmaa Nana Nyamenle; bɛbɔ edwɛne wɔ sanwunle ne azo bɛmaa yɛ Nyamenle. <verse eid="PSA 147:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 147:8" />Ɔfa amungu ɔkeda anwomanyunlu, ɔtɔ nzule ɔgua azɛlɛ ye azo, na ɔmaa ndile nee mbaka mbaka fifi wɔ awoka ne mɔ azo. <verse eid="PSA 147:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 147:9" />Ɔfa nyɛmoa muala bɛ aleɛ ɔmaa bɛ na ɔmaa ahɔhɔsɛlɛ ngakula aleɛ, saa bɛsu bɛfɛlɛ ye a. <verse eid="PSA 147:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 147:10" />Ye anyelielɛ ɛnle konlendeɛ bɛ anwosesebɛ nu anzɛɛ ɔ nye ɛnlie azogya katakyiema anwo; <verse eid="PSA 147:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 147:11" />na emomu, Nana Nyamenle anye die bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛdi ye eni la anwo; ɔlɛ bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛfa bɛ rɛle bɛwula ye ɛhulolɛ nwanwane ne anu la anwo ɛhulolɛ.<verse eid="PSA 147:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 147:12" />Ye Nana Nyamenle ayɛlɛ, O Gyɛlusalɛm! Ye wɔ Nyamenle ne ayɛlɛ, O Zayɔn! <verse eid="PSA 147:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 147:13" />Ɔluakɛ yemɔ yɛɛ ɔsinza wɔ nlenkɛ ne mɔ ɛsesebɛ ɛsesebɛ nu a; na ɔyileyila wɔ menli ne mɔ wɔ wɔ mbane ne mɔ anu. <verse eid="PSA 147:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 147:14" />Ɔmaa anzondwolɛ ba wɔ ɛweɛne ne mɔ azo; na ɔmaa wɔ ahunludwolɛ abɛlɛ ma. <verse eid="PSA 147:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 147:15" />Ɔtendɛ wɔ tumi nu ala ɔkile aleɛabo amra; na bɛyɛ debie biala mɔɔ ɔse bɛ la ndɛndɛ zo. <verse eid="PSA 147:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 147:16" />Ɔtɛlɛ asukɔntweaba wɔ azɛlɛ ye azo kɛ kundu la, na ɔbɔ ɛbɔlɛ ɔkponde kɛ nzonle la. <verse eid="PSA 147:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 147:17" />Ɔtɔ ye ayese kɛ ahɔndɔma la; na nwane yɛɛ kɛhola kɛzɔ ɛyɛlɛ ne mɔɔ ɔfa ɔba la a? <verse eid="PSA 147:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 147:18" />Ɔsoa ye edwɛkɛ ne maa ɔba, na ayese ne kolo gua; ɔmaa anwoma ne bɔ, na azule ne mɔ tenrɛ se. <verse eid="PSA 147:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 147:19" />Ɔfa ye edwɛkpa ne ɔmaa Gyekɔbo; ye ngilehile ɔ nee ye mɛla ne mɔ dwu Yizilayɛ anwo zo. <verse eid="PSA 147:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 147:20" />Ɔtɛyɛle ɛhye ɔtɛmaanle maanle gyɛne biala; ɔluakɛ bɛnze ye ngyehyɛlɛ ne mɔ. Bɛye Awulae Ayɛlɛ!<verse eid="PSA 147:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 147" />
  <chapter number="148" style="c" sid="PSA 148" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 148</para>
  <para style="s1">Bɛmaa Anwuma kpokpoti ɛye Awulae Ayɛlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 148:1" />Bɛye Nana Nyamenle ayɛlɛ! Bɛye Awulae ayɛlɛ bɛvi anwuma maanle ne anu, bɛmɛ mɔɔ bɛde anwuma moamoa nehane la! <verse eid="PSA 148:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 148:2" />Bɛye ye ayɛlɛ, bɛmɛ ye anwumabɔvolɛma; bɛye ye ayɛlɛ, bɛmɛ anwumaneamra mɔɔ bɛko bɛmaa ye a! <verse eid="PSA 148:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 148:3" />Bɛye ye ayɛlɛ, sɛnzɛne ɔ nee siane; bɛye ye ayɛlɛ, bɛmɛ nwɔlɛra mɔɔ ta la! <verse eid="PSA 148:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 148:4" />Bɛye ye ayɛlɛ, bɛmɛ anwuma anwuma maanle nu amra, ɔ nee bɛmɛ azule azule mɔɔ bɛwɔ anwuma anwuma ne anye la!<verse eid="PSA 148:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 148:5" />Bɛmaa bɛ kpokpoti bɛye Nana Nyamenle ye duma ne ayɛlɛ! Ɔluakɛ ɔbukele ɔ nloa ɔdendɛle, yɛɛ bɛbɔle bɛ muala a. <verse eid="PSA 148:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 148:6" />Ɔlua ye tumi ɛdendɛlɛ zo yɛɛ bɛraduoduale bɛ bo zo ne mɔ wɔ anwuma ɛkɛ wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ la a; ɛhye ati bɛnrɛhola bɛnrɛha kɛ bɛnrɛli ye mɛla zo.<verse eid="PSA 148:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 148:7" />Bɛye Nana Nyamenle ayɛlɛ bɛvi azɛlɛ ye azo, bɛmɛ nyevizonle ɔ nee ninyɛne mɔɔ wɔ nyevile kunlu la kpokpoti; <verse eid="PSA 148:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 148:8" />ɛsɛlɛmanye ɔ nee ahumu, asukɔntweaba ɔ nee amungu ɔ nee ahumu mgbole mɔɔ bɛtie ye edwɛkɛ la! <verse eid="PSA 148:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 148:9" />Bɛye ye ayɛlɛ, awoka ngyikyi nee awoka mgbole, mbaka mɔɔ so ma, ɔ nee sida mbaka kpokpoti; <verse eid="PSA 148:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 148:10" />nyɛmoa muala, sua nu ɔ nee ɛbɔ nu ɛdeɛ, nyɛmoa mɔɔ twenle bɛ kɛnra aze ɔ nee anwomanyunlu nloma muala! <verse eid="PSA 148:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 148:11" />Bɛye ye ayɛlɛ, aleɛabo arelemgbunli ɔ nee menli kpokpoti, azafohyenle ɔ nee ewiade tumivolɛma kpokpoti! <verse eid="PSA 148:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 148:12" />Mgbavolɛ nee mbɛlɛra, mgbanyinli ɔ nee ngakula bɛdabɛ noko! <verse eid="PSA 148:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 148:13" />Bɛmaa bɛ kpokpoti bɛye Nana Nyamenle duma ne ayɛlɛ! Ɔluakɛ ye duma ne yɛ fɛ ɔtɛla anluma kpokpoti; ye anyunlunyia ne bo ewiade nee anwuma maanle ne mɔ anwo zo. <verse eid="PSA 148:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 148:14" />Ɔmaanle ye maanle ne anwo yɛle ɛsesebɛ, amaa ye menli kpokpoti aye ye ayɛlɛ, Yizilayɛma mɔɔ ye ahonle wɔ bɛ nwo, na bɛsonle bolɛ bɛmaa ye la.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PSA 148:14">Bɛye Awulae Ayɛlɛ!<verse eid="PSA 148:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 148" />
  <chapter number="149" style="c" sid="PSA 149" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 149</para>
  <para style="s1">Yizilayɛ Konimdivolɛ ne ye Edwɛne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 149:1" />Bɛye Nana Nyamenle ayɛlɛ! Bɛdo edwɛne fofolɛ bɛmaa Awulae; bɛye ye ayɛlɛ wɔ ye menli nɔhavoma ayiaku ne anu!<verse eid="PSA 149:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 149:2" />Bɛmaa Yizilayɛ anye ɛlie, wɔ ye Bɔvolɛ ne anu; bɛmaa Zayɔn amra ɛli fɛlɛko wɔ bɛ belemgbunli ne anu! <verse eid="PSA 149:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 149:3" />Bɛmaa bɛva agolezilɛ bɛye ye duma ne ayɛlɛ; bɛmaa bɛbɔ ahenle ɔ nee sanwunle bɛva bɛye ye ayɛlɛ!<verse eid="PSA 149:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 149:4" />Ɔluakɛ Awulae lɛ fɛlɛkolilɛ wɔ ye menli nu; na ɔfa konimlilɛ wɔ enililɛ nu ala ɔbɛlɛ anwoazehanlɛma. <verse eid="PSA 149:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 149:5" />Bɛmaa tenlenema ɛmaa bɛ nwo ɛzande bɛ wɔ anyunlunyia nu; bɛmaa bɛdo fɛlɛkolilɛ edwɛne wɔ nɔe ne amuala wɔ bɛ nwɔhoalilɛleka ne mɔ.<verse eid="PSA 149:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 149:6" />Bɛmaa Nana Nyamenle ye ayɛlɛyelɛ mgbole mgbole ne mɔ ɛwa bɛ kominza abo na bɛva bɛ atwɛ ati-nwiɔ ne mɔ bɛdedɛ bɛ sa nu; <verse eid="PSA 149:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 149:7" />kɛ bɛfa bɛahomo maanle maanle ne mɔ anwo zo, na bɛahwi menli ne mɔ anyunlu; <verse eid="PSA 149:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 149:8" />kɛ bɛfa nwɔnzɔnwɔnzɔ bɛagua bɛ arelemgbunli ne mɔ, na bɛagua bɛ mgbanyima ne mɔ mɔɔ gyigyi bɛ ti la bulalɛ nwɔnzɔnwɔnwɔ; <verse eid="PSA 149:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 149:9" />na bɛadea maanle maanle ne mɔ kɛmɔ Nana Nyamenle ɔdaye yehyehyɛ la!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PSA 149:9">Ɛhye a le Nana Nyamenle ye tenlenema ne mɔ bɛ konimlilɛ nee anyunlunyia a.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PSA 149:9">Bɛye Awulae Ayɛlɛ!<verse eid="PSA 149:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 149" />
  <chapter number="150" style="c" sid="PSA 150" />
  <para style="cl">Edwɛndolɛ 150</para>
  <para style="s1">Awieleɛ ayɛlɛyelɛ edwɛne mɔɔ bɛfa bɛmaa Nana Nyamenle: bɛmaa anyewɔzo debie biala ɛye Awulae ayɛlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 150:1" />Bɛye Awulae ayɛlɛ! Bɛye Nana Nyamenle ayɛlɛ wɔ ye asɔne sua ne anu! Bɛye ye anwosesebɛ ne anwo ayɛlɛ wɔ anwuma maanle ne anu! <verse eid="PSA 150:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 150:2" />Bɛye ye ayɛlɛ wɔ ninyɛne mgbole mgbole mɔɔ yeyɛ la anwo! Bɛye ye ayɛlɛ kɛmɔ ɔfɛta ye bedevinliyɛlɛ ne la. <verse eid="PSA 150:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 150:3" />Bɛva aweɛne ne bɛye ye ayɛlɛ. Bɛva sanwunle ɔ nee bɛ sa nu sanwunle bɛye ye ayɛlɛ! <verse eid="PSA 150:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 150:4" />Bɛva ahenle ɔ nee agolezilɛ bɛye ye ayɛlɛ. Bɛva getae ɔ nee fuutu aweɛne bɛye ye ayɛlɛ! <verse eid="PSA 150:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 150:5" />Bɛva awa mɔɔ bɛwoso la bɛye ye ayɛlɛ. Bɛva awa mɔɔ ane le mgbole la bɛye ye ayɛlɛ.<verse eid="PSA 150:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 150:6" />Bɛmaa abɔdeɛ biala mɔɔ gu ɛnwomenle la ɛye Nana Nyamenle ayɛlɛ!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PSA 150:6">Bɛye Nana Nyamenle ayɛlɛ!<verse eid="PSA 150:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 150" />
</usx>